  <para style="h">Onger Akaba</para>
  <para style="toc3">OA</para>
  <para style="toc2">Onger Akaba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Godɨn Ziam Fer Onger Akabar Akɨnafarim</para>
  <para style="mt">Godɨn Ziam Fer Onger Akabar Akɨnafarim</para>
  <para style="mt2">O</para>
  <para style="mt1">Onger Akaba</para>
  <para style="imt">Akar faragha zuim</para>
  <para style="ip">Akɨnafarir kam, a Israelian Onger Akaba itir akɨnafarim. Onger akar akɨnafarir kamɨn itir maba, me Jerusalemɨn nguibamɨn ikia Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn da bange. Ezɨ onger akar kabar maba, gumazamiziba uari osɨmtɨziba ikia, Godɨn ziam fer dughiamɨn dar gun mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="ip">En ganganimɨn, gumazir avɨriba ti onger akar kaba dughiar vamɨran da osirizir puvatɨ. Me dughiar igharaz igharazibar kamagh ami. Ezɨ gɨn gumazir igharaziba da akuvagha akɨnafarir vamɨra gami.</para>
  <para style="ip">Onger akar kaba ko God ko mɨgeir arazir kaba, dar nɨghnɨzir avɨriba iti. Akɨnafarir kamɨn aven akar kaba iti:</para>
  <para style="ipi">onger akar Godɨn ziam feba,</para>
  <para style="ipi">ko uan arazir kuraba bagh God ko mɨkɨmtɨ a da gɨn amangamin akaba,</para>
  <para style="ipi">ko osɨmtɨziba ko mɨzaziba izir dughiamɨn, akurvazim bagha God ko mɨgeir akaba,</para>
  <para style="ipi">ko atrivim amɨsɨvamimin dughiar ekiabar onger akaba,</para>
  <para style="ipi">ko nɨghnɨzir gavgavimɨn gun Godɨn mɨkɨmamin ighiaba,</para>
  <para style="ipi">ko onger akar God mɨnamamiba,</para>
  <para style="ipi">ko uan navir kuraba ko osɨmtɨziba agɨvsɨ God ko mɨgeir arazim,</para>
  <para style="ipi">ko God ko mɨkɨmtɨ an apanibagh asɨghasɨghamin arazim,</para>
  <para style="ipi">ko onger akar gumazamiziba da baragh dar mɨgɨrɨgɨabar gɨn mangamiba.</para>
  <para style="ip">God ko mɨgeir arazir kaba ko onger akar kaba, da gumazamiziba e itir ikɨrɨmɨrir kam bar ada avaragha dar gun mɨgei. En dughiar e bar akongeziba iti, en dughiar e osɨmtɨziba isiba iti. En dughiar e igiabara itiba iti, en dughiar e ghuramiba iti. E dughiar mabar arei, egha dughiar mabar en naviba dera. Onger Akabar Akɨnafarir kam, a ikɨrɨmɨrir e datɨrɨghɨn itir ikiamin dughiaba ko magh ghu, egha fomɨra iza datɨrɨkɨn onger akar kaba Godɨn gumazamizibar nɨghnɨziba gavgavim dagh anɨga, egha men ikɨrɨmɨrimɨn men akurvasi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1"/>
  <para style="ms">Akɨnafarir namba 1<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hibrun akamɨn aven, me Onger Akabar Akɨnafarimɨn 5plan otevibagh ami, me dar bora ghaze, 5plan akɨnafariba.</char></note></para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 1-41">Onger Akaba 1--41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Godɨn damazimɨn derazir gumazamiziba ko, gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 26:4">Onger Akaba 26:4</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 14:15">Aghuzir Akaba 14:15</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir kamaghɨn amiba, me bar akongegh:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">me gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amibar akaba baragha men gɨn aruir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">tuavir gumazamizir kuraba zuiba, me men gɨn zuir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">Godɨn akaba batogha da dɨpovir gumazamiziba ko, apiaghirir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 1:8">Josua 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:1">Onger Akaba 119:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:35">119:35</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:47">119:47</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:92">119:92</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir kaba, bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Arazibagh ifongegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:2">dɨmagariba ko aruebar dar gara pamtem dagh nɨghnɨghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 3:10">Aisaia 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:8">Jeremaia 17:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 47:12">Esekiel 47:12</ref></char>
    </note>Me mati temem, me dɨpar mɨriamɨn anekara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">A uan dughiamra bava, dafariba mɨdir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 1:3">Kamaghɨra, bizir me amiba bar, da deraghavɨrama otifi.<verse eid="PSA 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4"/>Ezɨ gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba, me kamaghɨn ikian kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:4">Bar puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:4">Amɨnim raizɨn mɨsevibagh ivarazɨ da zui moghɨn, bizir me amiba deragh otivan kogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:4">dagheba dar puvatɨgh pura mangam.<verse eid="PSA 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5"/>Kamaghɨra, gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:5">God uan kotiamɨn me batuegh ivezir kuram me danɨngtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 1:5">me Godɨn damazimɨn derazir gumazamizibar saghon ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 10:14">Jon 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 2:19">2 Timoti 2:19</ref></char>
    </note>Guizbangɨra, gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn damazimɨn deraziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:6">a me geghuv deragh men ganam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:6">Eghtɨ gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:6">me bar ikuvigh ovegham.<verse eid="PSA 1:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2"/>
  <para style="s">God atrivim ginaba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 46:6">Onger Akaba 46:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1-2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 4:25-26">Aposel 4:25-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Manmaghɨram amizɨ, Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba, akaba batozir arazim damuasa uariv gei?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:1">Manmaghɨram amizɨ, ikɨzir igharazibar gumazir dapaniba, arazir kurabar amuasa uari ko akam mɨsoke?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 2:1">Men akar kabar daghetam, otoghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2"/>Nguazir kamɨn itir atriviba, mɨdorozim bagha uari akufi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">Ikiavɨra Itir God ko atrivir a ua bagha inabazim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 2:2">gumazir dapaniba aning dɨkabɨnasa tuaviba buri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">Me kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,<verse eid="PSA 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3"/>“Aning e ikezir senba e da aghorarɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:3">Benir aning e ikezir gavgavir kaba, e da fɨrigham.”<verse eid="PSA 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:13">Onger Akaba 37:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 59:8">59:8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:26">Aghuzir Akaba 1:26</ref></char>
    </note>Ekiam uan Nguibamɨn atrivir dabirabim gaperaghav ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:4">me dɨpova men ingaravati.<verse eid="PSA 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5"/>A me bagha navim bar an ikuvizɨ, an Akar Gavgavim me mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:5">Ezɨ an adarir ekiar kam me gamima, me bar atiatima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 2:5">a me mɨgɨa ghaze,<verse eid="PSA 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6"/>“Kɨ uabɨ gumazir atrivimɨn ikiamin kam amɨsevegha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:6">Kɨ uabɨ a isa Saionɨn Mɨghsɨar ua bagha inabazimra anefazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 2:6">an aperaghav iti.”<verse eid="PSA 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 13:33">Aposel 13:33</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:5">Hibru 1:5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 5:5">5:5</ref></char>
    </note>Ezɨ atrivim kamaghɨn mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:7">“Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn Ikiavɨra Itir God na mɨkemezir bizibar gun mɨkɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:7">A ghaze, ‘Nɨ nan otarim, ezɨ datɨrɨghɨn kɨ nɨn afeziamɨn oto.’<verse eid="PSA 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:8">Onger Akaba 72:8</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:13-14">Daniel 7:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:4-5">Jon 17:4-5</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nan azaraghtɨ kɨ ikɨziba bar nɨ danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:8">Nɨ nguazir kamɨn itir kantriba bar me gativagh men ganam.<verse eid="PSA 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:23">Onger Akaba 89:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:26-27">Akar Mogomem 2:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:5">12:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:15">19:15</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ uan agharir gavgavimɨn men suiragh men ganam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:9">Nɨ me abightɨ, me nguazir mɨneba bɨaghiri moghɨn bɨghiregh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 2:9">mɨzumzuiaribar iregham.”<verse eid="PSA 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10"/>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, ia atriviba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:10">ia kuariba arigh oregh nɨghnɨzir aghuim iniam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:10">Ia nguazimɨn gumazir dapaniba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:10">ia akar kam baregh deravɨra uari bagh ganam.<verse eid="PSA 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 2:12">Filipai 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:28">Hibru 12:28</ref></char>
    </note>Ia uari isɨ God danigh, egh an apengan ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:11">Egh agorogem sara bar atiatingigh.<verse eid="PSA 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:23">Jon 5:23</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6">1 Pita 2:6</ref></char>
    </note>Ia uari amɨragh teviba apɨrigh magɨrɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">an dagarimningɨn tor.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:12">Puvatɨghtɨ, an adarim zuamɨrama otoghtɨ ia arɨmɨghiregham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">Guizbangɨra, an anɨngagheghtɨ an anɨngagharim zuamɨrama otogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:12">Eghtɨ gumazitam God bagh izɨ an aven modogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikɨ bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 2:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir mam mɨzaraghara gavgavim iniasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit uan otarim Apsalomɨn arav ghugha, dughiar kamɨn ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 15:13-17:22">2 Samuel 15:13--17:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan apaniba me bar avɨraseme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:1">Me nan apanim gamua egha pazavɨra na gami.<verse eid="PSA 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2"/>Men avɨriba na mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:2">“God nɨn akuraghan kogham.”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 3:2">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:7">Onger Akaba 62:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ezɨ men akar me mɨgeir kam a guizbangɨra puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:3">Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨrara nan mɨdorozir oramɨn mɨn iti, ezɨ kɨ nɨn uabɨ modi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:3">Nɨrara nan akurvazima kɨ uan apaniba abɨri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:3">Nɨ nan osɨmtɨziba agevima, kɨ tugha gavgavighavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 4:3">Onger Akaba 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 43:3">43:3</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn dei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:4">Ezɨ a uan mɨghsɨar ua baghavɨra inabazimɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:4">na baragha nan akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 3:4">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5"/>Kɨ mɨsiamɨn akuava onganigha, egha gɨn osegha bar deravɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:5">Bar guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God bar deravɨra nan gari.<verse eid="PSA 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 23:4">Onger Akaba 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:3">27:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:10-13">118:10-13</ref></char>
    </note>Nan apanir 10,000pla danganiba bar na ekɨaru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:6">ezɨ kɨ men atiatir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 16:10">Jop 16:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:21">Onger Akaba 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 57:4">57:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 58:6">58:6</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan God, nɨ dɨkavigh izɨ nan akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">Guizbangɨra, nɨ mati gumazim uan apanibar koviabav sozi moghɨn, nɨ nan apaniba aghumsɨzim me ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:7">Nɨ mati gumazim uan apanibar atariba apɨrizɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">nɨ gumazir kurar kaba abɨri.<verse eid="PSA 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 28:8">Onger Akaba 28:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 29:11">29:11</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ uabɨra en akurvagha uam e ini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:8">ezɨ bizir katam bar e gasɨghasɨghizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 3:8">Nɨ bar deraghavɨra uan gumazamizibagh ami.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 3:8">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 3:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim dɨmagarimɨn gavgavim iniasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akar kabar faragha zuim, gumazibav geima, me gitabav sosi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:6">Onger Akaba 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:6">18:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:18-19">18:18-19</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nan Akurvazir Gumazim, nɨ nan akuragha nan apaniba abɨra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">ezɨ kɨ nɨn dei, nɨ nan akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:1">Fomɨra osɨmtɨzir bar ekiam nan itima, nan navim bar na baseme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">ezɨ nɨ nan akurazɨ osɨmtɨzim datɨrɨghɨn gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 4:1">Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn nan apangkuvigh nan dɨmdiam barakigh.<verse eid="PSA 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2"/>O gumaziba, dughiabar manmaghɨn, ia akar aghumsɨziba na gasɨ nan ziam gasɨghasɨvɨra ikiam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:2">Egh dughiabar manmaghɨn, ia nguazir kamɨn bizir kɨnibagh ifueghvɨra ikiam?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 4:2">Ia dughiabar manmaghɨn arazir ifavarim gifueghɨvɨra ikiam?</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 4:2">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 6:8-9">Onger Akaba 6:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:5">50:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:4">135:4</ref></char>
    </note>Ia akar kam bar deragh a gɨfogh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:3">Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn apengan itiba, God ua baghavɨra me ginaba.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 4:3">Ezɨ kɨ an diazɨ, a nan azangsɨzim barasi.<verse eid="PSA 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 77:6">Onger Akaba 77:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:11">119:11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:26">Efesus 4:26</ref></char>
    </note>Ia atar uari bagh gan, egh arazir kuratam damuan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">Ia uan mɨsiabagh ireghɨv ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 4:4">mɨgɨrɨgɨar kam gɨnɨghnɨgh uan akabar kumigh.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 4:4">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:19">Godɨn Araziba 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:19">Onger Akaba 51:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:8">62:8</ref></char>
    </note>Ia nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ikɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:5">ofan a ifongezibar amu.<verse eid="PSA 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:26">Dɨboboniba 6:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 7:7">Jop 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 9:25">9:25</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir avɨriba bizir aghuibar gan, bar akueghasa ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:6">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn guamɨn angazangarim e gisirazɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 4:6">nɨ bar e gifuegh en boroghɨra ikɨ, egh en apangkuvigh en akurvagh.<verse eid="PSA 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 97:11-12">Onger Akaba 97:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:14">119:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:72">119:72</ref></char>
    </note>Wit ko wainɨn ovɨziba azenibar aghua bar puvɨra bema, gumaziba da bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:7">Ezɨ nɨ na gamizɨ kɨ nɨ bagha bar akongezir arazim, nan navir averiam bar a gizɨvagha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 4:7">wit ko wain gifongezir arazim guizbangɨra bar a gafira.<verse eid="PSA 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:19">Jop 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 16:9">Onger Akaba 16:9</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ mɨsiamɨn ghua atiatir puvatɨghava akui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:8">Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨrara deragha na akumakua nan garima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 4:8">kɨ deraghvɨra ikia atiatir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 4:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim deragh uabɨ geghuvasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Ezɨ gumazir onger akar kamɨn faragha zuim gumazibav geima me itabagh ivi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:1">kɨ nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba nɨ da baragh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 5:1">egh kuarim atɨgh nan ararem baragh.<verse eid="PSA 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 3:4">Onger Akaba 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 65:2">65:2</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nan atrivim ko nan God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">kɨ nɨ ko mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 5:2">nɨ nan ararem baragh.<verse eid="PSA 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 30:5">Onger Akaba 30:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:13">88:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 130:6">130:6</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ mɨzarazibar nɨ ko mɨgeima, nɨ na barasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">Aruem anadir dughiabar kɨ nɨ ko mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:3">Kar mati nan ofa kɨ a isa nɨ ganɨdi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">ezɨ nɨ datɨrɨghɨn na ikarvaghasa kɨ nɨ mɨzua iti.<verse eid="PSA 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4"/>Nɨ Godɨn arazir kurabagh ifongezir puvatɨzim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:4">Kamaghɨn, gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 5:4">nɨn boroghɨn ikian kogham.<verse eid="PSA 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 1:13">Habakuk 1:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazamizir uarira uari feba, me nɨn damazimɨn ikian kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:5">Ezɨ gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba, nɨ bar me gifongezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 55:23">Onger Akaba 55:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:8">Akar Mogomem 21:8</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir ifavaribagh amiba, nɨ me gasɨghasɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:6">Egha gumazamizir gumazibav sozi me ariaghɨriba ko ifavaribagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 5:6">nɨ bar men aghua.<verse eid="PSA 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:29-30">1 Atriviba 8:29-30</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:7">Onger Akaba 132:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 138:2">138:2</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ zurara nan apangkufi, kamaghɨn, kɨ nɨn Dɨpenir mɨriamɨn aven mangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">Kɨ dɨpenir nɨ ua bagha inabazimɨn izɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 5:7">nɨn atiatigh uan tevimning apɨrigh nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 24:4-5">Onger Akaba 24:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:11">27:11</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan apaniba bar avɨrasemegha na gasɨghasɨghasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">Kamaghɨn nɨ nan aku mangɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 5:8">kɨ nɨn guizɨn arazimɨn tuavimɨn gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:4">Onger Akaba 62:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:44">Luk 11:44</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:13">Rom 3:13</ref></char>
    </note>Nan apaniba, me guizɨn akam bar a gɨfozir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">Me gumazir igharaziba me gasɨghasɨghasavɨra nɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:9">Men akatoriba mati gumazamizibar moziba akaba akari;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">me mɨgeima ovevem otifi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:9">Gumazamiziba me baragh men gɨn mangɨsɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">me ifavarir akar bar isɨngtɨzibav kɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 15:31">2 Samuel 15:31</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 17:14">17:14</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 17:23">17:23</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ men arazir kuraba tuisɨgh ivezir kuram me danɨng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">Nɨ men nɨghnɨzir kurar kabagh iraghtɨ, me bar onganigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:10">Me arazir bar kurar avɨribagh amua nɨn akam batosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">kamaghɨn nɨ me batueghtɨ me nɨn saghon ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:13">Aisaia 65:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Egh gumazamizir nɨ bagha iza nɨn aven modiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">nɨ me ateghtɨ me bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:11">Gumazamizir nɨ ativagha gariba, men naviba deraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">me ighiabar amu bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:11">Gumazamizir bar nɨ gifongeziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">me bar akongegh nɨn ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:13">Onger Akaba 115:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamizir nɨn akamɨn gɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:12">nɨ bar deraghavɨra me gami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:12">Nɨn ifongiam oramɨn mɨn me avaragha me modima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:12">me bar deraghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 5:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim osɨmtɨzim ikia uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akar kamɨn faragha zuim, gita gikararang ongasa me mɨkeme.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 38:1">Onger Akaba 38:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:24">Jeremaia 10:24</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ adarim ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:1">pamten na mɨkɨman markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:1">Nɨn navim ikuvightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:1">nɨ ivezir kuram na danɨngan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:4">Onger Akaba 41:4</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:1">Hosea 6:1</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ bar osemegha ua gavgaviba puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:2">ezɨ nɨ nan apangkufigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:2">Nan gavgaviba bar gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:2">eghtɨ nɨ gavgavir igiam na danɨngightɨ kɨ ua deragham.<verse eid="PSA 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 90:13">Onger Akaba 90:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan navim osɨmtɨzir ekiam a itaragha ghuaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:3">Ezɨ dughiaba manmaghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 6:3">osɨmtɨzir ekiar kam nan navir averiamɨn ikɨvɨra ikiam?<verse eid="PSA 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ iragh izɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:4">nan akuragh ua na inigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:4">Nɨn apangkuvim zurara ikia mamaghɨra iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:4">nɨ uan apangkuvim ginɨrɨgh nan akuraghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 6:4">kɨ ovengan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 88:11">Onger Akaba 88:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:17">118:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:18">Aisaia 38:18</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir oveaghueziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:5">me ua nɨ gɨnɨghnɨzir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:5">Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:5">tina ua nɨn ziam fam?<verse eid="PSA 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6"/>Kɨ dia ghuavti, nan gavgaviba bar gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:6">Nan temeriba zurara dɨmagaribar nan mɨsiam giri,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 6:6">kɨ ara ghuav itima,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 6:6">nan dapanir aghoghonim bar kumkumi.<verse eid="PSA 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 17:7">Jop 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 38:10">Onger Akaba 38:10</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:17">Azir Akam 5:17</ref></char>
    </note>Nan apanir avɨriba iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:7">kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ dughiabar aziavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:7">Nan damazimning nan bezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:7">kɨ deragha bizibar garir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:115">Onger Akaba 119:115</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:23">Matyu 7:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:27">Luk 13:27</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God nan azirakam baregha gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:8">kamaghɨn, ia gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 6:8">na gitagh.<verse eid="PSA 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9"/>Kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa Ikiavɨra Itir God ko mɨgeima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:9">a na baregha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 6:9">Kɨ a ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba, a da baregha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10"/>Nan apaniba osɨmtɨzir ekiam inigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:10">bar aghumsɨgh atiatigham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 6:10">Me zuamɨra na ategh onganigh arɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:10">tintinibar mangegham.<verse eid="PSA 6:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim osɨmtɨzim ikia God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Benjaminɨn adarazir gumazir mam an ziam Kus, an arazir mam gamizɨ, Devit a basemegha onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">A God ko mɨgɨa a bange.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:1">Onger Akaba 31:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:15">31:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:1">71:1</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:1">kɨ nɨ bagha iza nɨn uabɨ apazagha uan apanibar modo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:1">Nɨ nan akuraghtɨ, nan apanir nan agɨntɨziba na mɨsueghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:1">kɨ aremeghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2"/>Puvatɨghtɨma, laion gumazim gasɨghasɨzi moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:2">me na gasɨghasɨgh nan mɨkarzim abɨghɨrarigham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:2">Me na gekuigh mangɨghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:2">gumazir nan akuragh na iniamiba puvatɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan God, kɨ arazir kuram damigham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3">o gumazir igharazitam gasɨghasigham,<verse eid="PSA 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 109:4-5">Onger Akaba 109:4-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>o kɨ uan namakam gifaragh puram akatam a gasam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 7:4">o kɨ arazir kuramɨn pura uan apanim damightɨ,<verse eid="PSA 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5"/>nɨ nan apanibar amamangatɨghtɨ, me nan agɨragh nan suiragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:5">Egh na dɨkabɨragh magɨrɨ nan mɨkarzim bar a gasɨghasɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 7:5">anetɨghtɨ a pura nguazim girɨghɨv ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 7:5">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 35:23">Onger Akaba 35:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 94:2">94:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 138:7">138:7</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">nɨ anɨngaghegh dɨkavighasa kɨ ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:6">Apaniba bar anɨngaghegha na mɨsosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">nɨ izɨ nan akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:6">O nan God, nɨ gumazibar araziba tuisɨghamin dughiam amɨsefe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">kamaghɨn nɨ dɨkavigh izɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:27">Onger Akaba 22:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ bar ikɨziba akuvaghtɨ, me nɨ okarigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:7">Egh nɨ uan atrivir dabirabir pɨn itim daperagh</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 7:7">bar me gativagh men gan.<verse eid="PSA 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 26:1">Onger Akaba 26:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 43:1">43:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:9">98:9</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">Nɨ fo, kɨ guizɨn arazir aghuibara ami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 7:8">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ nan araziba tuisɨghamin dughiamɨn nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:21">Onger Akaba 34:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:2">40:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 94:23">94:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:23">Akar Mogomem 2:23</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ bar Godɨn aghuimra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">Nɨ gumazamiziba bar men navir averiaba ko nɨghnɨziba tuisɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:9">Nɨ gumazamizir kurabar arazir kuraba bar ada gɨfagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">Egh nɨn damazimɨn derazir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 7:9">nɨ me damutɨ, me tugh gavgafigh.<verse eid="PSA 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:2">Onger Akaba 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:30">18:30</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:10-11">97:10-11</ref></char>
    </note>God nan oramɨn mɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:10">na geghuva nan garir gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:10">Gumazamizir an akam baragha an gɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:10">a men akurvagha ua me isi.<verse eid="PSA 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 50:6">Onger Akaba 50:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:9">90:9</ref></char>
    </note>God guizɨn arazimra gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:11">Gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 7:11">a zurara me dɨkabɨra ivezir kuram me ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:41-42">Godɨn Araziba 32:41-42</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 64:7">Onger Akaba 64:7</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazim uan navim giraghan koghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:12">God uan mɨdorozir sabam amɨnam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 7:12">Egh a uan barir pim dafagh mɨdorozim bagh mɨzuam ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:14">Onger Akaba 18:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 45:5">45:5</ref></char>
    </note>A gumazir kurar kabav sueghtɨ me aremeghasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:13">uan mɨdorozir biziba akɨrigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 7:13">An afuzir aviba itiba men akuighav iti.<verse eid="PSA 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:35">Jop 15:35</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:4">Aisaia 59:4</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:15">Jems 1:15</ref></char>
    </note>E gari, gumazir kuram arazir kuram damuasa uan nɨghnɨzim akɨrigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:14">A zurara ifarava, osɨmtɨzir kabagh amima da otivavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 57:6">Onger Akaba 57:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A gumazir igharaziba mozir torir kamɨn magɨrasa, me bagh a gɨkui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:15">Egha a uabɨ mozir torir a kuizir kam giraghu.<verse eid="PSA 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 140:9-11">Onger Akaba 140:9-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kamaghɨra, osɨmtɨzir an amizim, anarɨram avaragham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:16">Akam adariba ko, mɨdorozir a igharaz darazi damuasava amiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 7:16">da raghɨrɨgh anarɨram asɨghasɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God a bar guizbangɨra dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:17">kamaghɨn kɨ bar a mɨnabagham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:17">Kɨ Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itimɨn ziam fɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:17">a bagh ighiaba bangam.<verse eid="PSA 7:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn ziar ekiam ko gumazibar ziar aghuim</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akar kamɨn faragha zuim gumazibav kemezɨ, me Getɨn nguibamɨn ingarizir gita inigha a gikararai.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 113:4">Onger Akaba 113:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 148:13">148:13</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ en Ekiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">Nguazir kamɨn nguibaba bar dar gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 8:1">nɨn gavgavimɨn gara ziar ekiam nɨ ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">Ezɨ nɨn ziar ekiam bar overiam gizɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 44:16">Onger Akaba 44:16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:16">Matyu 21:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:27">1 Korin 1:27</ref></char>
    </note>Borir bar iririviba uaghan nɨn ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">Nɨn apaniba ko, nɨn akam batozir darazi nɨ men tuavim apɨrasa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 8:2">dɨvazir bar gavgavim atɨ.<verse eid="PSA 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 111:2">Onger Akaba 111:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ kogha pɨn overiar nɨ uan dafarimɨn ingarizimɨn gara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">egha uaghan iakɨnim ko mɨkovezir uan danganir nɨ me arɨghɨzibar gari,<verse eid="PSA 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:17-18">Jop 7:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 144:3">Onger Akaba 144:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:6-8">Hibru 2:6-8</ref></char>
    </note>kɨ kamaghɨn nɨghnɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:4">e gumazamiziba ti manmaghɨram amizir biziba, ezɨ nɨ mɨghɨgha e gɨnɨghnɨsi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:4">E pura biziba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:4">Manmaghɨram amizɨ, nɨ bar puvɨrama e gɨnɨghnɨsi?<verse eid="PSA 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5"/>Nɨ uabɨ en ingarigha, e isa uabɨn apengan e atɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:5">Nɨ gavgavim ko ziar ekiam isa e ganɨga e afazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 8:5">bizir nɨ ingariziba bar en apengan iti.<verse eid="PSA 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:26-28">Jenesis 1:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:27">1 Korin 15:27</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:22">Efesus 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:8">Hibru 2:8</ref></char>
    </note>Bizir nɨ ingarizir kaba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:6">nɨ dagh ativagh dar ganasa e amɨsefe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:6">Biziba bar moghɨra nɨ da isa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:6">e gumazamiziba en suemningɨn apengan da arɨki.<verse eid="PSA 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7-8"/>Bizir kaba bar moghɨra:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:7-8">Sipsipba, bulmakauba, asɨzir ruarimɨn itiba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:7-8">overiamɨn itir kuaraziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:7-8">ongarimɨn osiriba ko ongarimɨn aven aruir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 8:7-8">da bar en apengan iti.<verse eid="PSA 8:7-8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ en God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:9">Nguazir kamɨn nguibaba bar dar gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 8:9">nɨn gavgavimɨn gara ziar ekiam nɨ ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 8:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn guizɨn arazir bagha a mɨnabi</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akar kamɨn faragha zuim, a gumazamizibav kɨmtɨ, me Almut Labenɨn tiarimɨn gɨn mangɨ ighiar kam bangam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1"/>O God, kɨ uan navir averiamɨn nɨ mɨnabaghasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:1">Kɨ nɨ amir ingangarir aghuir kaba bagh gumazamizibav kɨmasa.<verse eid="PSA 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:11">Onger Akaba 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 83:18">83:18</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨ gɨnɨghnɨgh nɨ bagh ongɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:2">bar akuegham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:2">O Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim, kɨ nɨ bagh ongɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:2">egh ziar ekiam nɨ danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3"/>Nan apaniba nɨn ganigha ara ghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:3">nɨn damazimɨn daghiregha bar ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4"/>Nɨ uan atrivir dabirabim gaperagha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:4">guizɨn arazimɨn gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:4">Egha nan araziba guizɨn arazimɨn da tuisigha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:4">kɨ osɨmtɨziba puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 9:14">Godɨn Araziba 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 10:7">Aghuzir Akaba 10:7</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar araziba tuisigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:5">Gumazamizir kuraba, nɨ bar me gasɨghasigh men ziaba angarightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 9:5">gumazamiziba me gɨnɨghnɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6"/>Nɨ bar apanibagh asɨghasigha gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">eghtɨ me ikuvigh ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:6">Men nguibar ekiaba sara, nɨ bar dagh asɨghasigha gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">eghtɨ gumazitam ua me gɨnɨghnɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:12">Onger Akaba 102:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:26">102:26</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:11">Hibru 1:11</ref></char>
    </note>Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God zurara uan atrivir dabirabim daperaghav ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:7">A guizɨn arazimɨn gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 96:13">Onger Akaba 96:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:9">98:9</ref></char>
    </note>A uan guizɨn arazir kabar gɨn ghua gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:8">A uan arazir aghuimɨn gumazamizibagh ativagha men gari.<verse eid="PSA 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:39">Onger Akaba 37:39</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 46:1">46:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:2">91:2</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God osɨmtɨziba itir gumazamiziba bagha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:9">dɨpenir gavgavir mamɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:9">Eghtɨ apaniba osɨmtɨzibar anɨngamin dughiabar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:9">me an aven mangegh muegham.<verse eid="PSA 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:6-8">Godɨn Araziba 31:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:25">Onger Akaba 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 70:4">70:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:14">91:14</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamizir nɨ bagha iziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:10">nɨ akɨrim giragha me gasir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:10">Kamaghɨn gumazamizir nɨ gɨfoziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:10">me nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:22">Onger Akaba 107:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, Saionɨn nguibamɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">uan atrivir dabirabim gaperaghav iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:11">E a bagh ongɨva an ziam fam!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">E Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar tongɨn ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 9:11">arazir an amizibar gun mɨkɨmɨva an ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 4:11">2 Samuel 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 9:18">Onger Akaba 9:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:17">10:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:24">22:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:25">37:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:14-15">Aisaia 49:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:5">Hibru 13:5</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamizir mɨzaziba isiba, a me gɨnɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:12">A me baragha uan kuarimning dukuir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:12">Gumazamizir arazir kurabar me gamiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:12">a men arazir kuraba ikarvasi.<verse eid="PSA 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan apangkufigh!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">Apaniba na garɨzir osɨmtɨziba nɨ dar gan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:13">Kɨ bar ovengasava amir dughiabar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">nɨ nan akurvagha ua na isima kɨ deraghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 13:5">Onger Akaba 13:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 20:5">20:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:9">35:9</ref></char>
    </note>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ na gamizir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">kɨ bar dagh eghan nɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:14">Nɨ ua na inizir bizim bagh, kɨ Saionɨn nguibamɨn tiar akamɨn tughɨv ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">bar akuegh an gun mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:15">Onger Akaba 7:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 94:23">94:23</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 5:22">Aghuzir Akaba 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 26:27">26:27</ref></char>
    </note>Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba en suighasa, nguazimɨn toribagh tui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:15">Egha me uari dagh iraghue.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:15">Me en suighasa azuaziba guizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:15">azuaziba merara suiki.<verse eid="PSA 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:31">Ua Me Ini 14:31</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 5:22">Aghuzir Akaba 5:22</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, guizɨn arazimɨn gumazamiziba tuisɨzir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:16">a uan arazir aghuim akakasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:16">Gumazamizir kuraba, igharaz darazigh asɨghasɨghasa amir biziba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:16">meraram asɨghasɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 9:16">(Nɨ akar kam gɨnɨghnɨgh kuarimɨn aven bar aghumra ighiam damu.)</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 9:16">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:13">Jop 8:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:22">Onger Akaba 50:22</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir kuraba ko Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizir akɨrim ragha God gasaraziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:17">me bar moghɨra mangɨ Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 12:5">Onger Akaba 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 23:18">Aghuzir Akaba 23:18</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:14">24:14</ref></char>
    </note>Dughiabar zurara, God onganarazibagh amir gumazamizibagh nɨghnɨghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:18">Gumazamizir osɨmtɨziba itiba, me nɨghnɨzir gavgavim ikia kamaghɨn fo,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 9:18">God men akurvagham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:18">A me ateghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 9:18">me puram a mɨzuam ikian kogham.<verse eid="PSA 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ dɨkavigh izɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">Nɨ nguazimɨn gumazamiziba ateghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 9:19">me gavgavigh nɨ gafiraghan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 9:19">Nɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar amightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">me nɨn kotɨn aven nɨn damazimɨn tuifigh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 9:19">Egh nɨ guizɨn arazimɨn men araziba tuisɨgh.<verse eid="PSA 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:9">Onger Akaba 62:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:3">Aisaia 31:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Esekiel 28:2</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ me damightɨ me bar atiatingigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:20">Nɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba kamaghɨn me damightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 9:20">me bar fogh suam me gavgaviba puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 9:20">me pura bizir kɨniba.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 9:20">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 9:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gumazir maba ghaze, Onger Akabar Akɨnafarimɨn sapta 10, a sapta 9ɨn akɨnafarir otevir mam.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ manmaghsuavɨra nan saghuiamɨn tughav iti?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:1">Kɨ osɨmtɨziba itir dughiabar, nɨ manmaghsuavɨra nan modi?<verse eid="PSA 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:16">Onger Akaba 7:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 9:15">9:15</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 5:22">Aghuzir Akaba 5:22</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kuraba uari fa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:2">egha gumazir onganarazibagh amibagh asɨghasɨghasa men agɨntɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:2">Nɨ me damightɨ, me nguazir torir gumazir igharaziba magɨrasa kuiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:2">me uari dar magɨrɨ.<verse eid="PSA 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 94:4">Onger Akaba 94:4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:32">Rom 1:32</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kuram uabɨ fa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:3">uan navir averiamɨn aven itir arazir kurabagh ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:3">Gumazir bizir avɨribagh ifongezim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:3">an akar kurabar Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨgɨava, akɨrim ragha a gasi.<verse eid="PSA 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 14:1-2">Onger Akaba 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1">53:1</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kuram ifaghata ghaze, kɨ bar bizibagh fo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:4">A ghaze, kɨ nɨghnɨzir aghuir avɨriba iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:4">Egha God gɨnɨghnɨzir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:4">A ghaze, “God, arazir kurar kɨ amibar gari puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:4">A nan arazir kaba ikaraghan kogham.”<verse eid="PSA 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 12:5">Onger Akaba 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:11">Aisaia 26:11</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kam amir biziba, da bar deraghavɨrama otifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:5">Egha a ifaghata, bar tong nɨn nɨghnɨzibagh fozir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:5">egha uan apaniba men apanim gami.<verse eid="PSA 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 56:12">Aisaia 56:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:7">Akar Mogomem 18:7</ref></char>
    </note>A uabɨra uabɨ gɨnɨghnɨgha ghaze, kɨ tugha gavgafi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:6">Bizitam bar na munamadaghan koghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:6">kɨ osɨmtɨzitam batoghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:12">Jop 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 12:2">Onger Akaba 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:14">Rom 3:14</ref></char>
    </note>An atamra paza bizibav gɨava, gumazamizir igharazibagh asɨghasɨghasa mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:7">A gumazamizibar amutɨ me atiatingasa, bizibar me gifara atamra mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:7">An arazir kuraba ko osɨmtɨzibar amutɨ da otivasa atamra bizibav gei.<verse eid="PSA 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:11">Onger Akaba 17:11</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 3:14">Habakuk 3:14</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kamaghɨn amim, nguibamɨn aven modoghav iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:8">A ikɨ ganam, gumazir aghuim izɨtɨ an a mɨsueghtɨ an aremegham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:8">A gumazir gavgaviba itir puvatɨziba bagha modoghav ikia gari.<verse eid="PSA 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:12">Onger Akaba 17:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:2">Maika 7:2</ref></char>
    </note>A laionɨn mɨn uan torimɨn modogha gara iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">A modogh ikɨ egh gumazir onganarazibagh amibar suighasa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:9">A uan iver ekiamɨn men pɨgha men suigha me amɨkɨrvagha zui.<verse eid="PSA 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10"/>Gumazir kurar kam nɨmɨram apiav ikia gara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:10">gumazir gavgaviba puvatɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:10">a uan gavgavir ekiar kamɨn me abɨri.<verse eid="PSA 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 22:13">Jop 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 94:7">Onger Akaba 94:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 9:9">Esekiel 9:9</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kuram kamagh nɨghnɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:11">“God ti arazir kurar kɨ amir kaba, mɨghɨgha dagh nɨghnɨzir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:11">A uan damazimning dukuagha, nan garir puvatɨ.”<verse eid="PSA 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ dɨkavigh izɨ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:12">Egh gumazir kurar kaba ivezir kuram isɨ me danɨngigh!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:12">Nɨ osɨmtɨziba aterir gumazamiziba, me bakɨnɨghnɨghan markɨ!<verse eid="PSA 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13"/>Gumazir kuram akɨrim ragha nɨ gasaragha uan navir averiamɨn ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">“God ti, kɨ amizir arazir kurar kaba uam ada ikaraghan kogham.”<verse eid="PSA 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 68:5">Onger Akaba 68:5</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:12">2 Timoti 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:19">1 Pita 4:19</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir kurabar arazir kuraba, nɨ dar ganigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">Egha mɨzaziba ko, osɨmtɨzir me gumazamizir igharazibagh anɨdiba, nɨ dagh fogha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:14">Nɨ osɨmtɨziba aterir gumazamizir kabar akurvaghasa mɨzua iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">Nɨ zurara, borir afeziaba ariaghireziba, ko gumazir gavgaviba puvatɨgha uari isa nɨ ganɨdiba, nɨ men akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15"/>Nɨ gumazir kurar kabar gavgavim bar anegɨfagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">Egh me amir arazir kurar kam uam an ganan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 145:13">Onger Akaba 145:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:10">Jeremaia 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:34">Daniel 4:34</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:17">1 Timoti 1:17</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God atrivimɨn ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">Egh a uan nguazimɨn, Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizir kuraba batueghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:16">me bar moghɨra gɨvagham.<verse eid="PSA 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:23">Ua Me Ini 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 9:12">Onger Akaba 9:12</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamizir osɨmtɨziba atera nɨn apengan itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:17">nɨ men dɨmdiam baragh gavgavim isɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:17">men navir averiabar anɨngigh.<verse eid="PSA 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 82:3">Onger Akaba 82:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:4">Aisaia 11:4</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ, borir afeziaba ariaghireziba ko, gumazir osɨmtɨziba itiba, nɨ men arareba baragh men akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:18">Nɨ uan guizɨn arazimɨn men araziba tuisɨghtɨ me ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 10:18">Eghtɨ nguazimɨn gumazamiziba uam osɨmtɨzim me darɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn iti</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">An onger akabar faragha zuir gumazim gɨnɨghnɨgha, onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:12">Onger Akaba 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 121:1">121:1</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ikia kamaghɨn fo, a na geghuva nan gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">Nɨ ti onganigh kamagh na mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 11:1">“Nɨ kuarazimɨn mɨn mɨghegh mɨghsɨamɨn mavanang.”<verse eid="PSA 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:14">Onger Akaba 37:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 64:3-4">64:3-4</ref></char>
    </note>Guizbangɨra, gumazir kuraba uan barir pibagh afegha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:2">Me amɨnirbɨrimɨn uan baribar gumazir aghuibagh asasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 87:1">Onger Akaba 87:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:152">119:152</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamiziba arazir aghuiba ateghtɨ biziba bar ikuvightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:3">gumazir arazir aghuibar gɨn zuim manmaghɨra damuam?<verse eid="PSA 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 1:2">Maika 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:16-22">Matyu 23:16-22</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God uan Dɨpenimɨn aven ikiavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">A uan Nguibamɨn atrivimɨn ikiavɨra iti,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 11:4">egha gumazamiziba amir biziba a bar moghɨra dar gara da tuisɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:1">Jenesis 22:1</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:12">Jems 1:12</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a gumazamizir aghuiba ko kuraba uaghara men araziba tuisɨgha men gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">Egha gumazir mɨsoghasa ifongeziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 11:5">a uan navir averiamɨn aven bar men aghua.<verse eid="PSA 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 75:8">Onger Akaba 75:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:11-12">Jeremaia 4:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Esekiel 38:22</ref></char>
    </note>An avir bar puvɨra isia feim gumazir kurabagh inge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">Kar a men ivezir kuram ikarvazima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 11:6">men mɨkarziba bar puvɨra men feima me mɨzazir kuram isi.<verse eid="PSA 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:9-11">Onger Akaba 7:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 16:11">16:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:5">33:5</ref></char>
    </note>Guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God arazir aghuibagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">A uabɨ arazir aghuim bar a gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:7">Gumazamiziba an akam baragh an gɨn mangɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">an guamɨn ganam.<verse eid="PSA 11:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn gumazamiziba uarir akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akar kamɨn faragha zuim, stringɨn 8pla itir gita gikararang ongasa me mɨkeme.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 57:1">Aisaia 57:1</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:2">Maika 7:2</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ en akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">Gumazamizir aghuiba bar puvatɨ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 12:1">Nɨ ua gumazamizir zurara nɨghnɨzir gavgavir nɨn ikiavɨra itibar ganan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:6">Onger Akaba 41:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:8">Jeremaia 9:8</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:18">Rom 16:18</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamiziba bar, gumazamizir igharaziba ko ifavaribagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:2">Me asuir akaba uariv gɨa egha uarira uarigh ifari.<verse eid="PSA 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ gumazamizir igharaz darazi apezeperiba ko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:3">gumazamizir uari fa mɨgeiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 12:3">nɨ bar men akabar kumigh.<verse eid="PSA 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4"/>Me kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:4">“E mɨkɨmsɨ ifongegh e mɨkɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">Gumazitam en anogoroghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 12:4">Tinara e gativagh en ganam?”<verse eid="PSA 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:18">Onger Akaba 10:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:6">34:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:10">35:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:10">Aisaia 33:10</ref></char>
    </note>Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God ghaze, “Gumazamizir onganarazibagh amiba, gumazamizir igharaziba paza me gamizɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 12:5">me mɨzaziba isa ara iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:5">Me nan akurvazim iniasa bar ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn dɨkavigh izɨ men akurvagham.”<verse eid="PSA 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:140">Onger Akaba 119:140</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 30:5">Aghuzir Akaba 30:5</ref></char>
    </note>Godɨn akam bar guizbangɨra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:6">An akam mati me avimɨn silva tuazɨma,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 12:6">a 7plan dughiabar isigha bar zue.<verse eid="PSA 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7-8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:7-8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:28">Onger Akaba 37:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 55:10-11">55:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:10">97:10</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamizir kuraba, me danganiba bar dar iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:7-8">Guizbangɨra, nguazimɨn itir gumazamizibar nɨghnɨzim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 12:7-8">arazir kuram a bizir bar aghuim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:7-8">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ bar deravɨra e geghuv en gan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:7-8">Eghtɨ gumazamizir kurar kaba e gasɨghasɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 12:7-8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn akurvazim bagh an azangsɨsi</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">An onger akar kabar faragha zuir gumazim gɨnɨghnɨgha onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:24">Jop 13:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:14">Onger Akaba 88:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:2">Aisaia 59:2</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ manadɨzoghɨn ua na gɨnɨghnɨgham?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:1">Nɨ ti bar na gɨn amadagha ma?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 13:1">Nɨ manadɨzoghɨn uan guam nan akaghtɨma kɨ an ganigham?<verse eid="PSA 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2"/>Nɨ manadɨzoghɨn osɨmtɨzir kɨ isir kaba gɨvagham?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">Dɨmagariba ko aruebar, mɨzazir kaba ti nan ikɨvɨra ikiam, o?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 13:2">Nɨ manadɨzoghɨn nan akuraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 13:2">kɨ ua apanibar apengan ikian kogham?<verse eid="PSA 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 51:39">Jeremaia 51:39</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">Nɨ na gɨnɨghnɨgh kɨ nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba baragh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 13:3">Egh gavgavim ua na danightɨ kɨ ovengan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 25:2">Onger Akaba 25:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:19">35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 38:16">38:16</ref></char>
    </note>Apaniba kamaghɨn mɨkɨman markɨ suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:4">e anebɨragha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 13:4">Kɨ irɨghamin arazir kam, me an ganigh a bagh bar akueghan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5"/>Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim kamaghɨn ikia ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:5">nɨ nan apangkuvigha ikia kamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 13:5">Nɨ nan akurvaghasa kɨ bar ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 116:7">Onger Akaba 116:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:17">119:17</ref></char>
    </note>Bar guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God bar deravɨra na gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:6">Kamaghɨn kɨ an ziamɨn onger akabar amuva,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 13:6">ziar ekiam a danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 13:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazamizibar arazir kuraba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 53">Onger Akaba 53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">An onger akar kabar faragha zuir gumazim gɨnɨghnɨgha onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:4">Onger Akaba 10:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1">53:1</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1-3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 3:10-12">Rom 3:10-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazamizir onganiba uan navir averiabar aven nɨghnɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">“God itir puvatɨ.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:1">Gumazamizir kaba, me bar gumazamizir kurabara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">Me bar moghɨra arazir aghuitam gamir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:13">Onger Akaba 33:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:19">102:19</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God uan Nguibamɨn pɨn ikia, nguazimɨn itir gumazamizibar garima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">men tav nɨghnɨzir aghuim ikia a gɨfofoghasa a buri,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 14:2">ti puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3"/>Me bar tuavir aghuim ataki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">Me bar moghɨra ikuvigha magh gari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:3">Men tav arazir aghuitam bar a gamizir pu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">Bar puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 64:7">Aisaia 64:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:25">Jeremaia 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 8:4">Amos 8:4</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">“Gumazamizir arazir kuram gamiba, nɨghnɨzir aghuitam men itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:4">Me bret apa anegevi moghɨn, me nan gumazamiziba agefi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">Egha me tong na ko mɨgeir puvatɨ.”<verse eid="PSA 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5"/>God gumazamizir an akam baragha an gɨn zuiba, a me ko iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:5">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amir kaba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 14:5">a me gɨnobaghtɨ me nɨghɨva akong bar atiatigham.<verse eid="PSA 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:9">Onger Akaba 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 142:5">142:5</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir onganarazibagh amiba, Ikiavɨra Itir God me akumakua deragha men garima, me an aven modi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:6">Kamaghɨn, gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 14:6">me onganarazibagh amir gumazamiziba damuasa mɨgeir bizibar ingaravati.<verse eid="PSA 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 42:10">Jop 42:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:6">Onger Akaba 53:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 126:1">126:1</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ kamaghɨn ifonge, Israelian akurvaghamin gumazitam Saionɨn nguibamɨn ikegh azenan izɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">Ikiavɨra Itir God, uan gumazamizibar akuraghtɨ me deravɨra ikɨtɨ, Jekopɨn ovaviba bar akuegham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 14:7">Guizbangɨra, Israelian naviba deragham.<verse eid="PSA 14:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15"/>
  <para style="s">God ifongezir arazir e damuamiba</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 23:6">Onger Akaba 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 24:3">24:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:4">27:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 61:4">61:4</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, tinara nɨn Dɨpenimɨn ikiam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">Tinara mɨghsɨar nɨ ua bagha inabazim dapiam?<verse eid="PSA 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 33:15">Aisaia 33:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Sekaraia 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:25">Efesus 4:25</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazim, God ifongezɨ moghɨn biziba bar dar gɨn ghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">arazir aghuiba zurara dagh amua,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 15:2">egha zurara uan navir averiamɨn aven guizɨn akam gɨnɨghnɨgha guizbangɨra mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 15:2">a nɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:1">Ua Me Ini 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:3">Onger Akaba 28:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:20">50:20</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kam, gumazir igharazibar ziabagh asɨghasɨzir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">egha arazir kurabar uan namakabagh amir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 15:3">egha akar kɨnibar pura uan roroabav geir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 15:3">gumazir kamnang, a nɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 9:18-20">Josua 9:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:35">Gumazir Dapaniba 11:35</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:10">Aposel 28:10</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kam, akɨrim ragha God gasarazir gumazamiziba, a bar men aghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">egha gumazamizir Godɨn apengan ikia an atiatiba, a men ziaba fe,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 15:4">egha uan akar dɨkɨrɨzibar gɨrara ghua bizibagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:4">Bizir kam osɨmtɨzir ekiam a danɨngtɨ, a nɨghnɨgh suam, a pura bizim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">A guizbangɨra uan akar dɨkɨrɨzir kamɨn gɨn mangam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 15:4">Gumazir kamnang, a nɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:19">Godɨn Araziba 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:8">Esekiel 18:8</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kam uan dagɨaba amadima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">gumazir igharaziba pura da ini,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 15:5">egha me ua da ikarvazir dughiamɨn, a dagh isɨn ua dagɨataba isir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:5">Gumazir arazir kuratam gamizir puvatɨzitam kotɨn tughɨv ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">gumazitam kotiam gifarɨsɨ anepezeper dagɨaba a danɨngtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 15:5">a dagɨar kaba inian markɨ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 15:5"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:5">Gumazir kamaghɨn amim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">a tugh gavgavigh irɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 15:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim nɨghnɨzir gavgavim ikia God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Onger akar kabar mam, me ziam Miktam, a garɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:1">Onger Akaba 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 17:8">17:8</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ deragh na geghuv egh nan gan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:1">Kɨ deraghvɨra ikiasa nɨ bagha iza nɨn aven modi.<verse eid="PSA 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2"/>Kɨ kamaghɨn Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:2">“Nɨ nan Ekiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:2">Bizir aghuir kɨ datɨrɨghɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:2">da nɨn agharimrama otifi.”<verse eid="PSA 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 101:6">Onger Akaba 101:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:63">119:63</ref></char>
    </note>Godɨn gumazamizir nguazir kamɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:3">me bar gumazamizir aghuiba.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 16:3">Kɨ me ko ikiasa bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 23:7">Josua 23:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 32:10">Onger Akaba 32:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:37-38">106:37-38</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir aseba bagha ivemara zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">me osɨmtɨzir avɨriba ateram.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:4">Kɨ me ko uari akuv asebar ziaba fɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">asɨzibav sogh me ko ofa damuan aghua.<verse eid="PSA 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 23:5">Onger Akaba 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:57">119:57</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 125:3">125:3</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨrara nana, bizir igharaziba ua puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:5">Bɨzir kɨ oteveziba, nɨ da na ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 16:5">Ezɨ nan ikɨrɨmɨrim nɨn dafarimɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:19">Jeremaia 3:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ bizir aghuiba nɨn dafarimɨn da ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:6">Bar guizbangɨra, bizir kaba da bar guizbangɨra dera.<verse eid="PSA 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 73:24">Onger Akaba 73:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 77:6">77:6</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God nan sure gamima, kamaghɨn kɨ an ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:7">Nan navir averiam dɨmagaribar nan sure gamima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 16:7">kɨ datɨrɨghɨn deraghavɨra nɨghnɨgha bar bizibagh fo.<verse eid="PSA 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 27:8">Onger Akaba 27:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 73:23">73:23</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:8-11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:25-28">Aposel 2:25-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ fo, Ikiavɨra Itir God zurara nan boroghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">A bar roghɨra ikia gavgavim na ganɨdima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">kɨ atiatiava agoir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 13:5">Onger Akaba 13:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 30:12">30:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 108:1">108:1</ref></char>
    </note>Kamaghɨn nan navir averiam bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:9">Ezɨ nan duam bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:9">Ezɨ nan mɨkarzim bar bizitamɨn atiatir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 49:15">Onger Akaba 49:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:13">86:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:35">Aposel 13:35</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ fo, nɨ na ateghtɨ kɨ Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn magɨran kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:10">Nɨ gumazir ua baghavɨra inabazim ateghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:10">a mozir konimɨn ikɨ kurighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:7-8">Onger Akaba 36:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 43:4">43:4</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ uabɨ ikɨrɨmɨrir aghuarim iniamin tuavim nan akagha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">Kɨ nɨn damazimɨn ikɨtɨ, nan navir averiam agorogem bar a gizɨvagham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">Kɨ nɨn boroghɨra ikɨ zurara bar akueghvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 16:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17"/>
  <para style="s">Arazir kuratam gamizir puvatɨzir gumazim, a God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">God ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨar kam, Devit an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨn damazimɨn dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">egha osɨmtɨzir me na garɨziba bagha nɨn dɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 17:1">nɨ na baragh nan akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">Kɨ guizbangɨra nɨ ko mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 17:1">nɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2"/>Guizɨn arazir gumazamiziba tuisɨzim, nɨ a gɨfo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:2">Kamaghɨn nɨ nan kotiamɨn nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3-4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:3-4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:7">Onger Akaba 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:9">Sekaraia 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2-3">Malakai 3:2-3</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:7">1 Pita 1:7</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ uabɨ nan navir averiam gɨfo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3-4">Nɨ dɨmangan na bagha iza nan araziba tuisigha gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 17:3-4">egha nan arazir kuratamɨn apizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:3-4">Gumazamizir igharaziba akar kurabav gei, ezɨ kɨ bar gavgavigha ghaze, kɨ akar kuratam mɨkɨman kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3-4">Kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgavimɨn suiragha an gɨn gua,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 17:3-4">adariba ko mɨdorozir arazibar gɨn zuir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 17:3-4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:133">Onger Akaba 119:133</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dughiabar zurara nɨ nan akakazir tuavimra, kɨ an gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:5">Kɨ tuavir kam ategha pura tintinibar zuir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6"/>O God, kɨ fo, kɨ nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba nɨ da barasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ nɨn dia nɨ ko mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:6">Kɨ nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨar kaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">nɨ kuarim atɨgh da baragh.<verse eid="PSA 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:21">Onger Akaba 31:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ uan apangkuvir arazir kam azenara anekagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">uan gavgavimɨn en akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:7">Eghtɨ e nɨ ko ikɨ nɨn aven modoghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">apaniba e gasɨghasighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:10">Godɨn Araziba 32:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:1">Onger Akaba 91:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:4">91:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:8">Sekaraia 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:37">Matyu 23:37</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ uabɨ uan damazir tuzim geghuva deragha an gari moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:8">nɨ na geghuv deragh nan ganam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:8">Mati tuarir amebam uan nguziba akumakua uan avɨzimningɨn apengan me modi moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:8">nɨ na avaragh na modogh.<verse eid="PSA 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9"/>Kamaghɨn gumazir kurar kaba na gasɨghasighan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:9">Me datɨrɨghɨn bar nan apanim gamigha na okarigha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:3">1 Samuel 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 73:7">Onger Akaba 73:7</ref></char>
    </note>Me gumazamizir igharazibar apangkuvir nɨghnɨzitam tong bar men itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:10">Me akaba akara egh uarira uan ziaba fe.<verse eid="PSA 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11"/>Me datɨrɨghɨn nan diariba pegha iza bar na okarigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:11">Me na abɨraghtɨ kɨ magɨrasa dafariba na gasegha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12"/>Me mati laion asɨzim mɨsueghtɨ an aremeghasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:12">na bagha modogha mɨzua iti.<verse eid="PSA 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ dɨkavigh izɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:13">Egh nan apanibav sogh bar me abɨnigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:13">Nɨ uan mɨdorozir sabam inigh egh gumazir kurar kaba ko mɨsogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:13">men dafaribar ua na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ uan gavgavir ekiamɨn nan akuraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">gumazir kaba nan ikɨrɨmɨrir kam agɨvaghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:14">Nguazir kamɨn bizir gumaziba uari bagha akuviba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">nɨ men dafaribar ua da inigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:14">Kɨ fo, gumazamizir nɨ bar ifongeziba, nɨ men mɨtiriaba agefi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">Men boriba dagher avɨriba iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 17:14">Ezɨ me uan ovavir borir gɨn otivamiba bagha bizir aghuiba arɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 4:6-7">Onger Akaba 4:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 16:11">16:11</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:2">1 Jon 3:2</ref></char>
    </note>Eghtɨ kɨrara, kɨ gumazir nɨn damazimɨn derazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:15">kɨ nɨn guamɨn ganam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:15">Kɨ dakuigh osegh dɨkavigh fogh suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:15">nɨ na ko iti, egh kɨ bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 17:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ikiavɨra Itir God en akurvazima, e uan apaniba abɨri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 22:1-51">2 Samuel 22:1-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">Devit a Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ingangarir gumazim, an onger akar kabar faragha zuir gumazim gɨnɨghnɨgha onger akam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Dughiar kam Ikiavɨra Itir God, Devitɨn apanim Sol ko apanir igharaziba da uam a ini. Ezɨ a bizir kam gɨnɨghnɨgha Ikiavɨra Itir God bagha onger akar kam gami.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:47-50">2 Samuel 22:47-50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ gavgavim na ganɨdi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:1">ezɨ kɨ nɨ bagha bar ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 2:13">Hibru 2:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a nan dɨvazir bar gavgavim mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">A nan dagɨar kɨ aven uabɨ modimɨn mɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:2">nan akuragha nan apaniba da ua na ini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:2">Nan God, a dagɨar ekiamɨn mɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">ezɨ kɨ uan apanibar ara ghua an modi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:2">A nan oramɨn mɨn ikia na avara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">ezɨ kɨ an uabɨ modi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:2">A nan akuragh nan ganamin gavgavim ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">egha nan dɨvazir bar gavgavimɨn mɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3"/>E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam feka!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:3">Kɨ an deima a nan akurazɨma,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:3">apaniba na gasɨghasɨghizir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 116:3">Onger Akaba 116:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:4-6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JON 2:5-7">Jona 2:5-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Guizbangɨra, kɨ atam areme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:4">Ovevem benir gavgavimɨn mɨn na ikiagharigha gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:4">Mati ongarim dɨkava dɨpɨraghira, na avasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5"/>Ovevem bar na inizɨ kɨ Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn magɨrasava ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:5">Mati me nan suighasa azuazim agurazɨ, a nan suighasa iti.<verse eid="PSA 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6"/>Kɨ osɨmtɨzir ekiamɨn ikia egha pamten Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn dei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">Kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa uan Godɨn arai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:6">Ezɨ a uan Dɨpenimɨn ikia nan ararem barazima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">an an kuarir torim giraghu.<verse eid="PSA 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7"/>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, a nan apanibar atari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">Egha mɨkɨmkɨzim gamizɨ an otogha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:7">mɨghsɨabagh inobaghnobasi.<verse eid="PSA 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8"/>Mɨgharim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atinimɨn otivaghiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">ezɨ avim an akamɨn otivaghira bizir avɨribar isi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:8">Egha mɨzariaba ira tintinibar zui.<verse eid="PSA 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9"/>God overiam kuigha izaghiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:9">ezɨ mɨgharir pɨziba an dagarimningɨn apengan iti.<verse eid="PSA 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:3">Onger Akaba 104:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mati a enselɨn bar gavgavim gaperazɨ, an a inigha izi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:10">Mati amɨnim avɨzimning ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:10">God inigha bar atamra izi.<verse eid="PSA 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11"/>An amɨnirbɨrim gamizɨ an anevara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:11">Mati a purirpenimɨn aven modoghav itima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:11">amozimɨn mɨturir pɨziba anevara.<verse eid="PSA 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12"/>A ghuariar pɨzibagh amizɨ, angazangarim bar da avarazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:12">onɨmarim ko amozir ofɨzir ekiar dagɨabar mɨn gariba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:12">ghuariar pɨzir kam abɨgha azenim giri.<verse eid="PSA 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God uan Nguibamɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:13">tiarim akara pamten dagarvasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:13">Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim uan akam akarizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:13">an akaba mati onɨmarim ko amozir ofɨzir ekiar dagɨabar mɨn gariba daghira izaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14"/>An onɨmaribagh amizɨ, da mati an barir aviba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:14">an apanibagh asavamadi, ezɨ me tintinibar ara zui.<verse eid="PSA 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ men atarir adarir kam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">mati amɨnir ekiam nɨn atinimɨn otogha me gɨva me munamadi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:15">Nɨn adarir kam ongarim gamizɨ, a bar mɨsɨngi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">ezɨ bizir nguazir mɨngarimɨn suiraziba bar azenim gire.<verse eid="PSA 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God pɨn ikia uan agharim amadazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:16">a izaghira nan suiragha na gekui.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:16">An ongarir bar konimɨn uam na inigha azenim gatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17"/>Dughiar kamɨn nan apaniba bar gavgavigha na abɨnasava ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:17">Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God men dafaribar ua na ini.<verse eid="PSA 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18"/>Kɨ dughiar kuramɨn itima nan apaniba iza na ko mɨsosi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:18">Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God na geghuva nan gari.<verse eid="PSA 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:8">Onger Akaba 31:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:5">118:5</ref></char>
    </note>A deravɨra nan gara nan akurazɨ, kɨ danganir aghuimɨn ikia deravɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:19">A bar guizbangɨra na gifonge, egha kamaghɨn a ua na ini.<verse eid="PSA 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 24:19">1 Samuel 24:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ arazir aghuimɨn gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:20">Ezɨ bizir kam bagha Ikiavɨra Itir God bizir bar aghuir avɨribar na gami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:20">Kɨ Godɨn damazimɨn zue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:20">ezɨ a ivezir aghuim isa na ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a nan God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:21">Kɨ akɨrim ragha a gasarazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:21">Kɨ guizbangɨra an Akar Gavgavibar gɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22"/>Kɨ zurara bizir a damuasa e mɨkemezibagh nɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:22">Egha kɨ arazir a ifongeziba batoghezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23"/>A fo, kɨ an damazimɨn osɨmtɨziba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:23">Kɨ guizbangɨra arazir kurabar uabɨra uabɨ geghuva ua bagha gari.<verse eid="PSA 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 26:23">1 Samuel 26:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn damazimɨn zuegha iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:24">Kamaghɨn a nan arazir aghuir kamɨn ganigha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:24">a ikaragha arazir aghuimɨn na gami.<verse eid="PSA 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 25:10">Onger Akaba 25:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:23">31:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:28">37:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:11">40:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:24">89:24</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazir nɨ ataghɨrazir puvatɨzim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:25">nɨ uaghan an ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:25">Gumazir nɨn damazimɨn derazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:25">nɨ uaghan arazir aghuim an akakasi.<verse eid="PSA 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26"/>Gumazir nɨn damazimɨn zuezir arazibagh amim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:26">nɨ uaghan uan arazir zuezibar an akakasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:26">Eghtɨ gumazir arazir kuramɨn gɨn zuim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:26">nɨ uaghan arazir kuramɨn a ikarvasi.<verse eid="PSA 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 101:5">Onger Akaba 101:5</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 6:17">Aghuzir Akaba 6:17</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir uari abɨriba, nɨ men akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:27">Gumazamizir uari pɨrafiba, nɨ me abɨri.<verse eid="PSA 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 29:3">Jop 29:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan God, nɨ angazangarim na ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:28">Egha na da mɨtarmem batosi.<verse eid="PSA 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29"/>Kɨ nɨn gavgavimɨn uan apanibav sogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:29">Kɨ uan Godɨn akurvazimɨn, apanibar dɨvazim ikiavkɨnigh me abɨragham.<verse eid="PSA 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:7">Onger Akaba 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:140">119:140</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 4:37">Daniel 4:37</ref></char>
    </note>Godra, an araziba da guizbangɨra egha bar aghungi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">A bizitam damusɨ akam akɨrigh, egh an a damuam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:30">An oramɨn mɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">eghtɨ gumazitam a bagh izɨ an aven modogh nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikɨ, gumazir kam deraghvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:31">Godɨn Araziba 32:31</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:39">32:39</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:2">1 Samuel 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:5">Aisaia 45:5</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a bar guizbangɨra God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:31">A bar uabɨra dagɨar ekiamɨn mɨn ikia e apasa.<verse eid="PSA 18:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32"/>Godra nan daroribar na akumakui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:32">egha gavgavim na ganɨga deragha nan garima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:32">kɨ zui.<verse eid="PSA 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:13">Godɨn Araziba 32:13</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 2:18">2 Samuel 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 3:19">Habakuk 3:19</ref></char>
    </note>A nan suemning gamizɨ, kɨ asɨzir atiabar mɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:33">mɨghsɨabar pɨn mar deravɨram arui.<verse eid="PSA 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34"/>A mɨdorozir arazibar nan sure gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:34">nan agharimning barir pir me ainɨn ingarizim, gekuamin gavgavim iti.<verse eid="PSA 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35"/>O God, nɨ uan oram na ganɨngizɨ, kɨ an gɨrakɨrangɨn modozɨ, nɨ nan apanibar dafaribar ua na ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">Nɨ uan gavgavimɨn nan akura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:35">Nɨ nan dɨmdiam baregha nan akurazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">kɨ gumazamizibar damazimɨn ziar ekiam iti.<verse eid="PSA 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 4:12">Aghuzir Akaba 4:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ bar tuavir aghuim na ganɨngizɨ kɨ an ghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:36">apɨghsigha irɨzir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37"/>Kɨ uan apanibar agɨntɨghavɨra ikia ghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:37">men suiragha me gasɨghasɨgha bar me agɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38"/>Kɨ me gasezɨ me kuabara ira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:38">nan dagarimningɨn apengara ira ua dɨkavasava amuava avenge.<verse eid="PSA 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39"/>Nɨrara mɨdorozim damuasa gavgavim na ganɨngi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:39">ezɨ kɨ me mɨsogha me abɨrazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:39">me nan dagarimningɨn apengan iti.<verse eid="PSA 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40"/>Nɨ nan apanibagh amizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:40">me akɨribagh ighegha na gasegha uam are.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:40">Gumazir na gifongezir puvatɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:40">kɨ bar me gasɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41"/>Gumazir kaba uarir akurvaghasa diava arai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:41">ezɨ men akurvaghamin gumaziba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:41">Me Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn diava arai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:41">ezɨ a men dɨmdiaba barazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42"/>Kɨ bar me gasɨghasɨghizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:42">me mati amɨnim nguazir mɨnemeniam giveragha ghu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:42">Kɨ me dɨkabɨra me abɨni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:42">mati kɨ tuavimɨn nguazir beghneaziba dɨka zui.<verse eid="PSA 18:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43"/>Nɨ gumazir na gasɨghasɨzibar dafarimɨn uam nan akura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">Nɨ na gamizɨ, kɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar dapanimɨn oto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:43">Gumazamizir kɨ fozir puvatɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">nɨ men kantriba na ganɨngizɨ, kɨ dagh ativagha dar gari.<verse eid="PSA 18:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44"/>Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba kamaghɨn na baregha zuamɨra iza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:44">nan guamɨn uan teviba apɨrigha nan akam barasi.<verse eid="PSA 18:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45"/>Men gavgaviba bar gɨvazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:45">me nɨrɨzim ko agorogem sara na bagha izi.<verse eid="PSA 18:45"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a zurara ikia mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:46">A dagɨar ekiamɨn mɨn na modozɨ kɨ an apazangɨn itima a na geghufi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:46">kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ ziar ekiam a danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:46">God nan akurvazimɨn ikia ua na inizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:46">kamaghɨn, kɨ an ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 18:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 94:1">Onger Akaba 94:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan apaniba na gamizir arazir kuraba, Godra ua da ikarvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:47">A Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba isa nan apengan me atɨ.<verse eid="PSA 18:47"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48"/>A nan apaniba da ua na ini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:48">Bar guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:48">nɨ nan apanibar damazibar ziar ekiam na ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:48">Nɨ nan akurazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:48">mɨdorozir gumaziba na mɨsoghezɨ kɨ aremezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 18:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:49 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:9">Rom 15:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:49">kɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar tongɨn ikɨ nɨn ziam fɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:49">onger akar nɨn ziam feba bangam.<verse eid="PSA 18:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50"/>Kɨ Devit, Ikiavɨra Itir God atrivimɨn ikiasa na ginabagha na amɨsefe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">A nan akurvazima, kɨ uan apanibav sogha me abɨri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:50">A zurara nan apangkuva mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">Nan gɨn otivamin ovavir boriba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 18:50">a kamaghɨra me damu mangɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 18:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19"/>
  <para style="s">God ingarizir biziba, an ziar ekiam en akakasi</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">An onger akar kabar faragha zuir gumazim gɨnɨghnɨgha onger akam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 8:1">Onger Akaba 8:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:6">50:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:19-20">Rom 1:19-20</ref></char>
    </note>Overiam Godɨn gavgavir ekiam ko ziar ekiam en akakasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:1">Bar guizbangɨra, bizir pɨn itiba, da an gun e geghara ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 19:1">a bar deragha dar ingari.<verse eid="PSA 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2"/>Arueba zurara sɨgha gara, bizir kamɨn gun mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:2">Ezɨ dɨmagariba uaghan bizir kamɨn en akakagha ghuavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3"/>Aruem ko dɨmagarim mɨkɨmamin akaba puvatɨgha mɨgeir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:3">E aningɨn mɨgɨrɨgɨataba barazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 10:18">Rom 10:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ezɨ e aruem ko dɨmagarimɨn gara fofoziba isi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:4">Akam inigha izir gumazibar akatoribar otivir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:4">da ghua nguazir kamɨn nguibaba bar dar otozɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 19:4">gumazamiziba bar, men kuariba da baraki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:4">Overiamɨn pɨn, God aruem bagha purirpenir mamɨn ingari.<verse eid="PSA 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5"/>Aruem otogha anaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:5">mati gumazim amuimɨn ikiasa bar akuegha, a itir danganim ategha azenan izi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 19:5">Aruem anaga,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 19:5">mati gumazir gavgavim itim pamtem ivemara bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 113:3">Onger Akaba 113:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aruem dɨkavigha overiamɨn mɨriamɨn anagava otogha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">ua vongɨn uaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 19:6">Ezɨ bizitam an fefer gavgavir kamɨn modoghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:130">Onger Akaba 119:130</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Araziba, da bar guizbangɨra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">egha ikɨrɨmɨrir aghuim e ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:7">E nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn akabar ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">Ezɨ fofoziba puvatɨzir darasi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 19:7">a fofozir aghuim me ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 12:6">Onger Akaba 12:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 36:9">36:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:128">119:128</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn akaba bar deravɨra en sure gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">An akar kaba en sure damutɨ, e uan navir averiabar da bagh bar akuegham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:8">An Akar Gavgaviba angazangarim e ganɨdi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">egha fofozir bar aghuim en nɨghnɨzibagh arɨki.<verse eid="PSA 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:138">Onger Akaba 119:138</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:142">119:142</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatia an apengan itir arazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">a bar deragha zuegha ikia mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:9">Bizir Ikiavɨra Itir God damuasa mɨkemezibar arazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">a bar guizbangɨra deragha voroghɨra zui.<verse eid="PSA 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:72">Onger Akaba 119:72</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:103">119:103</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:127">119:127</ref></char>
    </note>Godɨn akam bar deragha bar gol gafira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">E fo, gumaziba gol tuema, a isigha golɨn aghuimram oto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:10">Guizbangɨra, Godɨn akam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">golɨn isigha bar derazir avɨrim gafira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:10">Godɨn akam bar isɨngi, egha hani gafira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">A guizbangɨra bar hanin isɨngizim gafira.<verse eid="PSA 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:4">Onger Akaba 17:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:11">Nɨn akaba fofozim na ganɨdi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 19:11">kɨ dar gɨn zuima,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 19:11">nan dabirabim bar dera.<verse eid="PSA 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:12">Onger Akaba 40:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:1-2">51:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:8">90:8</ref></char>
    </note>Tinara uabɨ uan osɨmtɨzir an itibagh fogham?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:12">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, arazir kurar kɨ amizir maba, kɨ dagh fozir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:12">Nɨ nan arazir kurar kaba batueghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:12">kɨ nɨn damazimɨn zuegham.<verse eid="PSA 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:32">Onger Akaba 18:32</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:11">25:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:133">119:133</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, nɨ bar deragh na geghuv nan gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">kɨ uabɨ fer arazim ko akaba batozir arazir kuram,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 19:13">bar na gativaghan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:13">Kamaghɨn kɨ arazir kuratam damuan koghɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">deravɨra ikɨtɨ osɨmtɨziba nan puvatɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:2">Onger Akaba 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:5">31:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:34">104:34</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan ifongiam kamakɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">nɨ nan mɨgɨrɨgɨaba ko nan navir averiamɨn aven itir nɨghnɨzibagh fogh dagh ifuegham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:14">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan dagɨar ekiamɨn mɨn itima, kɨ nɨn aven uabɨ modi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">Nɨ nan Akurvazir Gumazimra!<verse eid="PSA 19:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akuragh mɨdorozim damuasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1"/>Nɨ osɨmtɨzim ikiamin dughiamɨn, Ikiavɨra Itir God nɨn dɨmdiam ikaragh nɨn akurvagham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:1">A en ovavim Jekopɨn God, a nɨ geghuv nɨn ganam.<verse eid="PSA 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2"/>A Saionɨn Mɨghsɨamɨn ikia uan Dɨpenimɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:2">egh a uan akurvazim nɨ bagh anemadagh gavgavim nɨ danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3"/>Ofan nɨ a bagha amiba, a bar dagh nɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:3">egh nɨn ofan bar isia mɨghɨribagh ifuegham.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 20:3">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 21:2">Onger Akaba 21:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ bizir tizim gifuegha navim a bagha nɨ dɨkafi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:4">God a isɨ nɨ danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:4">Bizir nɨ damuasa nɨghnɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:4">a dar amightɨ da bar otivigham.<verse eid="PSA 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:14">Onger Akaba 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 60:4">60:4</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ uan apanibav sogh me abɨraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">e bizir kam bagh bar akuegham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 20:5">E bizir kam gɨnɨghnɨgh uan Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:5">E ghaze, nɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn azangsɨzir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">an ada ikaragh da isɨ nɨ danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6"/>Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn fo, Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">uabɨ uan atrivir a ua baghavɨra mɨsevezir kam, an an akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:6">A uan Nguibar aghuimɨn ikia, an azangsɨziba barasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">Egha uan gavgavimɨn an akurvazima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 20:6">a mɨdorozimɨn uan apaniba abɨri.<verse eid="PSA 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:16-17">Onger Akaba 33:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 21:31">Aghuzir Akaba 21:31</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:1">Aisaia 31:1</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir maba nɨghnɨzir gavgavim uan mɨdorozir karisbar ikia ghaze, da men akurvagham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">Ezɨ marazi nɨghnɨzir gavgavim uan hoziabar ikia ghaze, da men akurvagham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:7">Ezɨ eia, e nɨghnɨzir gavgavim uan Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziamɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">kamaghɨn fo, a en akurvagham.<verse eid="PSA 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8"/>Gumazamizir kamaghɨn amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:8">me asaghpora ira bar puvarɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 20:8">E puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:8">E dɨkavigh tuivigh gavgavigham.<verse eid="PSA 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:9">nɨ atrivimɨn akuraghtɨ a uan apaniba abɨnigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 20:9">E nɨn deir dughiabar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:9">nɨ en dɨmdiam ikaragh en akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 20:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21"/>
  <para style="s">God atrivimɨn akurazɨ, an an ziam fe</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ gavgavim isa atrivim ganɨngizɨ, a bizir kam bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:1">Nɨ a gamizɨ, a uan apanibav sogha me abɨra,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 21:1">bizir kam bagha a guizbangɨra bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2"/>Bizir a uan navir averiamɨn ifongeziba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:2">nɨ a ganɨgha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 21:2">Bizir a iniasa nɨn azarazir kam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:2">nɨ an anogoroghezir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 21:2">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3"/>Nɨ a bagha iza bizir aghuiba isa a ganɨga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:3">atrivimɨn dapanir asuar me golɨn aghuimɨn ingarizim isa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 21:3">an dapanim garu.<verse eid="PSA 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 61:5-6">Onger Akaba 61:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:16">91:16</ref></char>
    </note>A ikɨrɨmɨrir aghuim bagha nɨn azarazɨma, nɨ a isa a ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:4">Guizbangɨra, ikɨrɨmɨrir a ikiamin dughiaba, da bar ruaragh ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 21:4">mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5"/>Nɨ an akurazɨma, a gavgavim ko ziar ekiam iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:5">Nɨ uabɨ gavgavir ekiam ko ziar ekiar kam a ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:11">Onger Akaba 16:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 45:7">45:7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:28">Aposel 2:28</ref></char>
    </note>Bar guizbangɨra, nɨ bar deraghavɨrama a gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:6">egh nɨ deravɨram a damu kamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 21:6">Nɨ an boroghɨra ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:6">a bizir kam bagh bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:8">Onger Akaba 16:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Atrivim nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itir kam, an apangkuvighavɨra iti,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 21:7">kamaghɨn atrivim tugh gavgavigh mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8"/>Nɨ uan agharimɨn uan apanibar suigham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:8">Nɨ uan agharir guvimɨn, nɨ gifongezir puvatɨzir darazir suigham.<verse eid="PSA 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:8">Onger Akaba 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:11">Aisaia 26:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:1">Malakai 4:1</ref></char>
    </note>An azenaram otogh izamin dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">avim bizibar isia da gevi moghɨn, a me agɨvagham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 21:9">Guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God puv men ataram,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">mati gumazim bizim tuvaremezɨ a bar iraghuzɨ moghɨn, God me agɨvagham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 21:9">An anɨngagharim avimɨn mɨn men isi bar me gasɨghasigham.<verse eid="PSA 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10"/>Nɨ, men ovavir borir nguazir kamɨn gɨn otivamiba, nɨ bar me mɨsueghtɨ me arɨmɨghiregham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:10">Eghtɨ men boritam ua nguazir kamɨn ikian kogham.<verse eid="PSA 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:1">Onger Akaba 2:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Me arazir kuratabar pazɨ nɨ damuasa, nɨghnigha akam akɨrigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:11">Eghtɨ men nɨghnɨzir kam, a dagheba puvatɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12"/>Guizbangɨra, nɨ uan bariba men guamɨn dagh asavamangɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:12">me raghɨregh arɨ mangegham.<verse eid="PSA 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ dɨkavigh uan gavgavim sara izɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:13">e ighiaba bangɨ nɨn gavgavir ekiam fam.<verse eid="PSA 21:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim osɨmtɨzim ikia akurvazim bagha dia, egha ighiam banga God mɨnabi</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gumazamizibav kemezɨ me tiarir kamɨn ighiam bange, “Mɨzarazimɨn asɨzir dian amebam.”</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:1">Onger Akaba 10:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:46">Matyu 27:46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:34">Mak 15:34</ref></char>
    </note>O nan God, nan God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:1">nɨ tizim bagha na ataki?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:1">Nɨ manmaghsua saghon ikia nan ararem baragha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:1">nan akurvaghan aghua?<verse eid="PSA 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 42:3">Onger Akaba 42:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:1">88:1</ref></char>
    </note>O nan God, kɨ aruebar nɨn deima, nɨ na barazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">Kɨ dɨmagaribar nɨn azangsɨghavɨra ikia tong avughsir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3"/>Ezɨ nɨrara bar deragha zuegha, arazir aghuibaram amua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:3">uan atrivir dabirabim gaperaghav itima, Israelia nɨn ziam fe.<verse eid="PSA 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:53">Onger Akaba 78:53</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:6">107:6</ref></char>
    </note>Fomɨra en ovaviba nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:4">Me nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn itima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:4">nɨ men akurazɨ, men apaniba me abɨrazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5"/>Me nɨn diava araima, nɨ men akuragha ua me ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:5">Ezɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavir me nɨn itir kam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:5">a pura ghuzir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 25:6">Jop 25:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:11">Onger Akaba 31:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:14">Aisaia 41:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:7">49:7</ref></char>
    </note>Ezɨ kɨrara, kɨ gumazim puvatɨ, kɨ pura apizir kuramɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:6">Gumazamiziba bar nan atara na dɨpova na dɨkabɨra, akɨriba igha na gasi.<verse eid="PSA 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:3">Aisaia 53:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:39">Matyu 27:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">Mak 15:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:35">Luk 23:35</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamiziba bar nan gara akaba na gasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:7">mɨzeba onga na garɨgha uan dapaniba roi.<verse eid="PSA 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:43">Matyu 27:43</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Me ghaze, “Nɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">A manmaghsua nɨn akuragha ua nɨ inizir puvatɨ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:8">God nɨ gifongegha nɨ bagha bar akonge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">egha manmaghsua a nɨn akurazir puvatɨ?”<verse eid="PSA 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 71:5-6">Onger Akaba 71:5-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O God, nɨ nan amebamɨn navir averiamɨn na inigha azenan na atɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:9">kɨ uan amebamɨn otem apavɨra itima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:9">nɨ na geghuva deragha nan gari.<verse eid="PSA 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 46:3">Aisaia 46:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:1">49:1</ref></char>
    </note>Nan amebam na batezir dughiamɨn iza datɨrɨghɨn, kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:10">Nan amebam na batezir dughiamra, nɨ nan Godɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:26">2 Atriviba 14:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 72:12">Onger Akaba 72:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:5">Aisaia 63:5</ref></char>
    </note>Osɨmtɨzim bar nan boroghɨn izegha gɨvazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">nan akurvaghamin gumaziba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:11">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ nan saghon ikian markɨ!<verse eid="PSA 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12"/>Nan apanir avɨriba bulmakaun apuribar mɨn na ekɨarugha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:12">Me mati, Distrik Basanɨn bulmakaun gavgaviba.<verse eid="PSA 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13"/>Me, laion uan akam akara asɨzibav sogha dagh asɨghasɨzi moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:13">me na gasɨghasɨghasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 73:26">Onger Akaba 73:26</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:6">Daniel 5:6</ref></char>
    </note>Nan gavgaviba bar gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">mati me dɨpam nguazim gingezɨ a ghua pura gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:14">Nan namnamɨn aghariba bar nan apunapuni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:14">Kendel purama emɨra uaghiri moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">nan navir averiam purama amɨragha uaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 38:10">Onger Akaba 38:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan kuarmɨzim mɨner bɨghizir mamɨn mɨn na mɨsɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">Ezɨ nan mɨzem iza nan akatorimɨn aven pura itoroghav iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:15">Nɨ na ataghizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">kɨ nguazir mɨnemeniamɨn mɨn irɨghav ikia bar ovengasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16"/>Gumazir kuraba bar na ekɨarugha gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:16">mati afiaba bar asɨzim okarigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:16">Me nan suemning ko dafarimning ginivaghasi.<verse eid="PSA 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17"/>Nan aghariba bar azenim girezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:17">gumazir kaba nan ganigha na dɨpova bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:35">Matyu 27:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mak 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:34">Luk 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:24">Jon 19:24</ref></char>
    </note>Me nan korotiaba tuiragh uarira uari danɨngasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:18">da bagha satu gikararai.<verse eid="PSA 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:11">Onger Akaba 22:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 70:5">70:5</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan saghon ikian markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:19">Nɨ nan Akurvazir Gumazim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:19">nɨ zuamɨra izɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20"/>Nɨ nan akuraghtɨ men mɨdorozir sabam na atughan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:20">Nɨ nan akuraghtɨ, gumazir afiabar mɨn itir kaba na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:20">Kɨ angamɨra ikɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:4">Onger Akaba 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:5">118:5</ref></char>
    </note>Laionba asɨzir atiabav sogha da api moghɨn, me na agɨvasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:21">Egha bulmakaun atiabar mɨn uan kombar na ginivasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:21">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ nan akuragh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:21">men dafariba da ua na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:10">Onger Akaba 40:10</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:12">Hibru 2:12</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uan adarazir tongɨn ikɨ nɨn ziamɨn gun me mɨkɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:22">Gumazamiziba uari akuvamin danganimɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:22">kɨ men tongɨn ikɨ nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23"/>Kɨ kamagh mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:23">“Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatia an apengan iti darasi, ia an ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">Ia Jekopɨn ovavir boriba, ia ziar ekiam a danɨng.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:23">Ia Israelia, ia an damazimɨn tugh an ziam pɨrafɨ.”<verse eid="PSA 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:22">Onger Akaba 31:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:17">69:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:33">69:33</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 5:7">Hibru 5:7</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir onganaraziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">a men osɨmtɨzibar gara pura da ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:24">A kamaghɨn mɨgeir puvatɨ, men osɨmtɨziba pura biziba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">A men saghon itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:24">A men azangsɨziba barasi.<verse eid="PSA 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 35:18">Onger Akaba 35:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:9-10">40:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 61:8">61:8</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamiziba uari akuvagh nɨn ziam famin dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">kɨ nɨ amizir biziba bagh nɨn ziamra fam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:25">Egh gumazamizir nɨn atiatia nɨn apengan itibar damazimɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">kɨ fomɨra nɨn ofa damuasa akam akɨrizir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:25">kɨ nɨ bagh dar damuam.<verse eid="PSA 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:16">Onger Akaba 40:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:32">69:32</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir onganaraziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">me damasa ifongezɨ moghɨn, damɨ bar izɨvagh ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:26">Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn boroghɨn zuiba, me an ziam pɨrafɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">Men naviba amɨragh deraghvɨra ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:8">Onger Akaba 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 82:8">82:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:9">86:9</ref></char>
    </note>Nguazimɨn itir ikɨziba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:27">me Ikiavɨra Itir God gɨnɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:27">a bagh izɨ an guamɨn teviba apɨrigh an ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 47:7-8">Onger Akaba 47:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:9">Sekaraia 14:9</ref></char>
    </note>Me fogh suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:28">Ikiavɨra Itir God atrivimɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:28">kantriba bar dar gumazamizibagh gativagha men gari.<verse eid="PSA 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:48">Onger Akaba 89:48</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bar guizbangɨra, gumazamizir uarira uari feba, an guamɨn teviba apɨrigh an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:29">Eghtɨ gumazamizir ovengasava amiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:29">me bar Godɨn guamɨn teviba apɨrigh an ziam pɨrafam.<verse eid="PSA 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:18">Onger Akaba 102:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:28">102:28</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir gɨn otivamiba, Ekiamɨn ingangarim damuam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:30">Gumazamiziba, uan ovavir borir gɨn otivamiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 22:30">me an akamɨn gun me mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 71:18">Onger Akaba 71:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:6">78:6</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir men amebaba tɨghar me batamiba, me gɨn otivightɨ, me me mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">“God uabɨ uan gumazamizibar akuragha ua me ini.”<verse eid="PSA 22:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23"/>
  <para style="s">Ikiavɨra Itir God, a na geghuvir gumazim</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:9-10">Onger Akaba 34:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:11">Aisaia 40:11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:11">Jon 10:11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:25">1 Pita 2:25</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a gumazir deragha uan sipsipbagh eghuva dar garimɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:1">Kamaghɨra, a deragha na geghuva nan gari.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 23:1">Kamaghɨn kɨ bizitamɨn otevezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:8">Onger Akaba 36:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:14">Esekiel 34:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:17">Akar Mogomem 7:17</ref></char>
    </note>A na inigha ghua grazir aghuiba itir danganimɨn na atɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:2">kɨ dagh isɨn irav iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:2">A na inigha dɨpar aghuiba itir danganibar zuima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:2">kɨ dar boroghɨn avughsa iti.<verse eid="PSA 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:8">Onger Akaba 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 19:7">19:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 85:13">85:13</ref></char>
    </note>A gavgavir igiam na ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:3">A fomɨra uan ziar ekiam bangɨn mɨkemezɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 23:3">a na inigha tuavir aghuibara zui.<verse eid="PSA 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:8">Onger Akaba 16:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:1">27:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:2">Aisaia 43:2</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:14">Maika 7:14</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ na ko iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">Kamaghɨn, kɨ danganir zarimɨn mangɨva ovevemɨn tuavir mɨtarmemɨn mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 23:4">egh bizir kurabar atiatingan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:4">Nɨ uan asadivir aghorir sipsipbagh eghuvimɨn suirazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">kɨ an gara fo, nɨ na geghuv deragh nan ganam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 23:4">Kamaghɨn, nan navim bar nan dera.<verse eid="PSA 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:19">Onger Akaba 78:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 92:10">92:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:46">Luk 7:46</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ na bagha daghem gamigha azenara na dafazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">nan apaniba bar nan gari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:5">Nɨ nan diazɨ kɨ iza nɨ ko aperazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">nɨ borem isa nan dapanim ginge.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 23:5">Ezɨ nan itarim bar izɨvagha fasfagha iri.<verse eid="PSA 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 25:7">Onger Akaba 25:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:10">25:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:4-6">27:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:1">2 Korin 5:1</ref></char>
    </note>Bar guizbangɨra, nɨn arazir aghuim ko apangkuvir arazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">dughiabar zurara na ko ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:6">Eghtɨ kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 23:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24"/>
  <para style="s">God a bar atrivir ekiam</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Ua Me Ini 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:14">Godɨn Araziba 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:12">Onger Akaba 50:12</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:26">1 Korin 10:26</ref></char>
    </note>Nguazir kam ko an itir biziba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:1">da bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn bizibara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 24:1">Ezɨ nguazimɨn itir gumazamiziba bar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:1">uaghan an bizibara.<verse eid="PSA 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:5">Onger Akaba 104:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:6">136:6</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:5">2 Pita 3:5</ref></char>
    </note>An ongarir konibar aven mati akɨnir guariba asegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:2">nguazimɨn ingarigha a isava dɨpar kabagh isɨn anefazɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 24:2">a bar gavgafi.<verse eid="PSA 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 15:1">Onger Akaba 15:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tinara Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn mɨghsɨamɨn ghuavanangam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:3">Tinara an Dɨpenimɨn aven mangam?<verse eid="PSA 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 15:4">Onger Akaba 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:15-16">Aisaia 33:15-16</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:8">Matyu 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:8">1 Timoti 2:8</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir kamagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">merara an aven mangam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 24:4">Men navir averiaba ko, me amir araziba ko, nɨghnɨziba zue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">egha asebar ziaba fer puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 24:4">igharaz darazi ko akam akɨrigha egha gɨn me gifarir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5"/>Kamagh amir darasi, Ikiavɨra Itir God deragh me damu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:5">ua me inigh men akuragh me dɨpon suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 24:5">me nan damazimɨn dera, egha osɨmtɨziba puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 27:8">Onger Akaba 27:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:4">105:4</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir kamagh amiba, kar me God buri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:6">Me Jekopɨn Godɨn boroghɨra ghua</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 24:6">a baghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 24:6">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 26:2">Aisaia 26:2</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:7">Hagai 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malakai 3:1</ref></char>
    </note>Ia tiar akaba, ia uari kuighiregh!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">Ia tiar akar fomɨra itiba, ia bar arokegh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 24:7">Eghtɨ Atrivir Gavgavir Bar Ekiam Itim aven izam.<verse eid="PSA 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8"/>Atrivir Gavgavir Bar Ekiam Itir kam, a tinara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">A Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 24:8">A gavgavir bar ekiam ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">uan apanibav sogha me abɨri.<verse eid="PSA 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9"/>Ia tiar akar ekiaba, ia uari kuighiregh!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">Ia, tiar akar fomɨra itiba, ia bar arokegh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 24:9">Eghtɨ Atrivir Gavgavir Bar Ekiam Itim aven izam.<verse eid="PSA 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10"/>Atrivir Gavgavir Bar Ekiam Itir kam, a tinara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 24:10">a guizbangɨra Atrivir Gavgavir Bar Ekiam!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 24:10">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim, God an daroriba deragh dar ganɨva a ko ikiasa, a God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 86:4">Onger Akaba 86:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 143:8">143:8</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:1">kɨ datɨrɨghɨn uan navir averiamɨn aven nɨn ziam fava nɨn azai.<verse eid="PSA 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:1">Onger Akaba 31:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 41:11">41:11</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nan God, ezɨ kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨrara iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:2">O God, nan nɨghnɨzir gavgavir kam pura mangɨghtɨ kɨ aghumsɨghan aghua.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:2">Nɨ nan akuraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:2">nan apaniba na abɨragh na dɨpovan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:23">Aisaia 49:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:3">apaniba me abɨn aghumsɨzim me danɨngan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:3">Gumazamizir pura nɨn akaba batoziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:3">merara aghumsɨzim iniam.<verse eid="PSA 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 27:11">Onger Akaba 27:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:11">86:11</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ uan arazir aghuiba nan akakagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:4">Egh tuavir kɨ mangamiba, nɨ dar nan sure damu.<verse eid="PSA 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:1">Onger Akaba 40:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 43:3">43:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:9">79:9</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nan God, nɨ nan akuragha ua na ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">Kamaghɨn, nɨ uan guizɨn akamɨn gɨn mangamin arazibar nan sure damutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 25:5">kɨ dughiabar zurara nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 98:3">Onger Akaba 98:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:17">103:17</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn arazir aghuim ko apangkuvir arazir nɨ e gamiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:6">da fomɨra ikia iza datɨrɨghɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 25:6">Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn ua dagh nɨghnɨghɨva dar amu mangɨvɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 13:26">Jop 13:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:19">Onger Akaba 31:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:1">51:1</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uan igiamra ikiava amizir arazir kuraba, ko nan arazir akaba batoziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">nɨ dagh nɨghnɨghan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:7">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ deragha na gamua bar nan apangkufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">kamaghɨn amizɨ nɨ na gɨnɨghnɨgh.<verse eid="PSA 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:8">Onger Akaba 32:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:5">86:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 92:15">92:15</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God bar dera, ezɨ an araziba bar guizbangɨra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:8">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, a gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 25:8">a uan arazibar gɨn mangasa men sure gami.<verse eid="PSA 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 23:3">Onger Akaba 23:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:11">27:11</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir uari abɨra an apengan itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:9">a men faragha ghua tuavim men akakazima, me arazir aghuibaram ami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 25:9">Egha arazir a ifongezibar men sure gami.<verse eid="PSA 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:11">Onger Akaba 40:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:18">103:18</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim ko an Akar Gavgavibar gɨn zuima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:10">an an apangkuvighavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:10">Egha a mɨkemezɨ moghɨra deragha bizibagh amua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:10">uan nɨghnɨzim gɨghavkɨrir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 34:9">Ua Me Ini 34:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:9">Onger Akaba 79:9</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan arazir kuraba bar avɨraseme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:11">Kamaghɨn, nɨ uan ziam bagh uan akar dɨkɨrɨzimɨn gɨn mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 25:11">nan arazir kuraba gɨn amadagh.<verse eid="PSA 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12"/>Gumazir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatia an apengan itim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:12">Godra, a bagha atɨzir tuavir aghuim an akaghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 25:12">an an mangam.<verse eid="PSA 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:36">Onger Akaba 69:36</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:33">Aghuzir Akaba 1:33</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:6">Jeremaia 23:6</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kam zurara dabirabir aghuim inivɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:13">Eghtɨ an ovavir boriba nguazir aghuir kam inightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 25:13">a men nguazim gavagh ikɨ kamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 17:1">Jenesis 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 29:4">Jop 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:32">Aghuzir Akaba 3:32</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatia an apengan itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:14">a men namakam gami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:14">Egha uan Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim azenara anekazɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:14">me a gɨfo.<verse eid="PSA 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 123:2">Onger Akaba 123:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 124:7">124:7</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ zurara uabɨn akurvaghasa Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn gara a mɨzuai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:15">ezɨ a bizir na gasɨghasɨghasava amibar aven ua na isi.<verse eid="PSA 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:16">Onger Akaba 69:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 143:4">143:4</ref></char>
    </note>O God, kɨ uabɨra ikia osɨmtɨzim aterima nan gavgaviba bar gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:16">Kamaghɨn amizɨ nɨ nan kuarkuvigh na bagh izɨ.<verse eid="PSA 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:12">Onger Akaba 40:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:6">107:6</ref></char>
    </note>Osɨmtɨziba nan navimɨn aven ikia ekɨva ghuavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:17">Nɨ nan akuraghtɨ osɨmtɨzir kaba na abɨnan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:7">Onger Akaba 31:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:3">103:3</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nan osɨmtɨziba ko mɨzazibar gan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:18">egh nan arazir kuraba gɨn amadagh.<verse eid="PSA 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 3:1-2">Onger Akaba 3:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 9:13">9:13</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ ge, nan apaniba bar avɨrasemegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:19">bar nan aghuagha guizbangɨra nan apanim gami.<verse eid="PSA 25:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20"/>Nɨ nan akuragh deragh nan gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">me na abɨntɨ kɨ aghumsɨghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:20">Nɨrara nan akurvasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">ezɨ kɨ nɨ bagha iza nɨn aven modi.<verse eid="PSA 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:12">Onger Akaba 41:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨn araziba dera, egha bar guizbangɨra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:21">Ezɨ kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn ikia nɨ mɨzua ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 25:21">nɨ zurara na geghuv deragh nan gan.<verse eid="PSA 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 130:8">Onger Akaba 130:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O God, nɨ uan gumazamiziba Israelia ua me inightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:22">osɨmtɨzir kaba ua me abɨnan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 25:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26"/>
  <para style="s">Arazir kuratam itir puvatɨzir gumazim God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 20:3">2 Atriviba 20:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:7">Onger Akaba 28:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 20:7">Aghuzir Akaba 20:7</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim pamtem nɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">egha nɨn damazimɨn arazir kuratam gamizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 26:1">Kamaghɨn, nɨ nan gun mɨkɨm suam, kɨ gumazir aghuim.<verse eid="PSA 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:3">Onger Akaba 17:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:23">139:23</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:9">Sekaraia 13:9</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ bar nan araziba ko, nan nɨghnɨziba ko, nan navim tuisɨgh ingangarim na danigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:2">deragh na gɨfogh.<verse eid="PSA 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 20:3">2 Atriviba 20:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Guizbangɨra, nɨn apangkuvim nan faragha ghua tuavim nan akakasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:3">Nɨ na mɨkemezɨ moghɨra deragha bizibagh amua zurara nan faragha zui,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 26:3">ezɨ kɨ zurara nɨn guizɨn arazimɨn gɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 1:1">Onger Akaba 1:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ ifavaribagh amir gumazamiziba ko arua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:4">me ko apiav itir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 1:1">Onger Akaba 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:6">31:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:21-22">139:21-22</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amibar gɨn daruan bar aghuagha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:5">me gitavɨrasi.<verse eid="PSA 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 73:13">Onger Akaba 73:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ uan dafariba ruegha kamagh uabɨ akagha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">kɨ osɨmtɨziba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 26:6">Egha kɨ iza nɨn ofa gamir dakozir mɨriamɨn arua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">nɨn ziam fe.<verse eid="PSA 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7"/>Kɨ nɨ mɨnabava nɨ bagha onger akar mam banga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:7">nɨn ingangarir bar aghuir nɨ amizibar gun mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, Dɨpenir nɨ itim kɨ bar a gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:8">Danganir kam, nɨn angazangarim ko gavgavir ekiam bar a gizɨvagha iti.<verse eid="PSA 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 25:29">1 Samuel 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:3">Onger Akaba 28:3</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ fo, mati amizim uan dɨpenim bar anevia ghuzɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:9">nɨ gɨn gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba avigh mangɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 26:9">na sara inigh mangan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:9">Egh uaghan gumazir gumazibav sozi me ariaghɨriba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 26:9">nɨ me sara na gasɨghasɨghan kɨ aghua.<verse eid="PSA 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 16:19">Godɨn Araziba 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 8:3">1 Samuel 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:15">Aisaia 33:15</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir kaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:10">me zurara arazir kurabar amuasavɨra ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 26:10">egha dagɨaba isa arazir kurabar amuasa gumazir igharazibagh ivesi.<verse eid="PSA 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11"/>Ezɨ kɨ uabɨ, kɨ nɨn damazimɨn arazir kuratam gamizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:11">Eghtɨ nɨ nan kuarkuvigh ua na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:22">Onger Akaba 22:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:2">40:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:32">107:32</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nguazir aghuimra tugha gavgafi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:12">Bizitam na gasɨghasɨghsɨ damuva avegham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 26:12">Kɨ gumazamizir avɨribar tongɨn ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:12">egh Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 26:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn ziam fava a ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:14">Onger Akaba 118:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:2">Aisaia 33:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:20">60:20</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:8">Maika 7:8</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a nan angazangarim ko nan Akurvazir Gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">Ezɨ kɨ gumazitamɨn atiatingan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:1">Ikiavɨra Itir God, a dɨpenir gavgavimɨn mɨn na modogha na geghuva nan garima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">kɨ atiatir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:3">Onger Akaba 9:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 14:4">14:4</ref></char>
    </note>Mati afiam asɨzimɨn tuzibar amasava ami moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">nan apaniba na gasɨghasɨghsɨ izɨva,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 27:2">bizibagh asaghpor iregham.<verse eid="PSA 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:6">Jop 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 3:6">Onger Akaba 3:6</ref></char>
    </note>Mɨdorozir gumazir avɨriba bar na ekɨarughamin dughiamɨn, kɨ atiatingan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">Nan apaniba na ko mɨsoghsɨ izamin dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 27:3">kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn ikɨ egh tugh gavgavigham.<verse eid="PSA 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:6">Onger Akaba 18:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 23:6">23:6</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ bizir vamɨra bagha Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn azaragha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">Bizir kɨ bar ifongezimra kara:</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 27:4">kɨ angamɨra itir dughiamɨn, kɨ an Dɨpenimrama aven ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:4">Kɨ an ganganir aghuimɨn gan an boroghɨn ikɨ bar akueghasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">Kɨ an Dɨpenimɨn ikɨ a baghvɨra ikɨva an nɨghnɨzim gɨfofoghsɨ an azangam.<verse eid="PSA 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:8">Onger Akaba 17:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:20">31:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:2">40:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:15">50:15</ref></char>
    </note>Eghtɨ osɨmtɨziba otivamin dughiamɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">a uan Dɨpenimɨn bar deravɨra na modogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:5">A na isɨ uan Purirpenimɨn aven na modogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">A na isɨ dagɨar gavgavimɨn pɨn mar na afagham.<verse eid="PSA 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 3:3">Onger Akaba 3:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:22">107:22</ref></char>
    </note>Nan apanir na okarigha itiba, kɨ bar me abɨragham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">Egh bar akongegh dɨmɨva arang an Purirpenimɨn a bagh ofa damuam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 27:6">Egh onger akabar amu Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 4:3">Onger Akaba 4:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 13:3">13:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 61:1">61:1</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨn deir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:7">nɨ nan kuarkuvigh nan mɨgɨrɨgɨaba baragh na ikarvagh.<verse eid="PSA 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:4">Onger Akaba 34:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 105:4">105:4</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 5:6">Amos 5:6</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ kamagh na mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:8">“Nɨ bar na nan boroghɨra izɨ na baghavɨra ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:8">na gɨfofoghsɨ nan azangsɨgh.”</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 27:8">Eghtɨ kɨ nɨ ko ikɨsɨ bar nɨn boroghɨra mangam.<verse eid="PSA 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 6:1">Onger Akaba 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:17">40:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:17">69:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 94:14">94:14</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ uabɨ nan mongan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, nɨ nan God, nan Akurvazir Gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:9">Nɨ dughiar avɨribar nan akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">Nɨ nan atar nan aghuagh, egh na ataghɨraghan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:11">Aisaia 40:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:15">49:15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:32">Jon 16:32</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:16-18">2 Timoti 4:16-18</ref></char>
    </note>Dughiar mabar nan amebam ko afeziam akɨrim na gasaragha nan aghuaghuasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:10">ezɨ nɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ na geghuva deragha nan gari.<verse eid="PSA 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:8">Onger Akaba 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:4">25:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:11">86:11</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ damuasa nɨ ifongezir araziba, nɨ dar nan sure damu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">Kɨ apanir avɨriba iti,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 27:11">kamaghɨn nɨ tuavir aghuimra nan akaghtɨ kɨ an mangam.<verse eid="PSA 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 19:18">Godɨn Araziba 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:60">Matyu 26:60</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:1">Aposel 9:1</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ na ateghtɨ nan apaniba na inigh me ifongezɨ moghɨn na damuan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">Me akar ifavaribagh amua egha atiatim na ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 11:19">Jeremaia 11:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨghnɨzir gavgavir kam nan ikiavɨra itima, kɨ kamaghɨn fo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:13">kɨ nguazir kamɨn angamɨra ikɨ gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 27:13">God deraghvɨra uan gumazamizibar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">27:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:5">Onger Akaba 62:5</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 20:22">Aghuzir Akaba 20:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:9">Aisaia 25:9</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ikɨ a bagh mɨzuam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">Nɨn navim osɨman markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:14">Nɨ tugh gavgavigh mamaghɨra ikɨ mangɨtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">a izɨ nɨn akuragham.<verse eid="PSA 27:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 83:1">Onger Akaba 83:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:4">88:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 143:7">143:7</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨrara dagɨar gavgavimɨn mɨn na modozɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">kɨ nɨn apazangɨn itima nɨ na geghufi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:1">Kɨ uabɨn akurvaghsɨ nɨn dɨmamin dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">nɨ gumazir kuarir onganimɨn mɨn na baraghan koghan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:1">Kɨ nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba, nɨ da baraghan koghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">kɨ ti ovegh mangɨ Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn mangɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:7">Onger Akaba 5:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 138:2">138:2</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ orakigh, kɨ uabɨn akurvaghsɨ uan dafarimning fegh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">nɨn Dɨpenimɨn akagh nɨn dɨmɨva arangtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 28:2">nɨ nan kuarkuvigh nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 26:9">Onger Akaba 26:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 55:21">55:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:8">Jeremaia 9:8</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">me akar isɨngtɨziba uan namakaba ko dav gɨa, egha men navir averiaba bar ikufi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 28:3">nɨ gumazir kamaghɨn amiba sara na abɨraghan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 4:14">2 Timoti 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 18:6">Akar Mogomem 18:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:12">22:12</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir kamagh amiba, nɨ me amir arazir kaba ikarvagh ivezir kuram me danɨng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">Bizir kurar manam me a gami,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 28:4">nɨ anarɨra ikaragh uam a isɨ ivezimɨn mɨn me danɨng.<verse eid="PSA 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:27">Jop 34:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:12">Aisaia 5:12</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God me bagha amizir ingangarir ekiaba me dagh nɨghnɨzir puvatɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">a uan dafarimningɨn bizir ekiatam gamizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 28:5">Kamaghɨn, a me gasɨghasɨgh bar me kuavaremegham.<verse eid="PSA 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6"/>Kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:6">Guizbangɨra, kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa a ko mɨkemezɨ a na baraki.<verse eid="PSA 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 13:5">Onger Akaba 13:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:2">18:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:4">22:4</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ gavgavim isa na ganɨga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">nan oramɨn mɨn ikia na modi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:7">Ezɨ kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">A nan akurvagha na gamima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 28:7">kɨ uan navir averiamɨn, a bagha bar akuegha</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 28:7">onger akabagh amua a mɨnabi.<verse eid="PSA 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn gumazamiziba, a uabɨ men gavgavim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:8">Egha atrivir a ua bagha inabazim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 28:8">a uabɨ a geghuva deragha an akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:51-53">1 Atriviba 8:51-53</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ uan gumazamizibar akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">Kar gumazamizir nɨ ua baghavɨra inabaziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 28:9">nɨ deraghvɨra me damu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:9">Nɨ sipsipbar garir gumazimɨn mɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">me inigh me ater mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 28:9">deragh men gan kamaghɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 28:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn dɨmdiam, e amɨnim ko amozir ekiamɨn aven a barasi</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:1-2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 96:7-9">Onger Akaba 96:7-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ia Godɨn Nguibamɨn itir enselɨn gavgaviba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:1">ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:1">Ia an gavgavim ko an ziar ekiam bagh bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 20:21">2 Eghaghaniba 20:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziar ekiamɨn gun mɨkɨm.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:2">Egh an damazimɨn zuegh ikɨ an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn tiarim ongaribagh isɨn izima, da bar a barasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">Godɨn Gavgavir Bar Ekiam Itim, araribar mɨn pamten dagarvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">An akam ongarimɨn danganiba bar dagh isɨn pamten dagarvagha da avara.<verse eid="PSA 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn dagarvaziba gavgaviba dar iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:4">A dagarvazima, gumazamiziba a baragha an atiatia an ziam fe.<verse eid="PSA 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn dagarvazima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:5">an tiarim Lebanonɨn kantrin itir temer sidaba apɨragharɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6"/>A Lebanonɨn kantrin mɨghsɨabagh amizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:6">da bulmakaun nguzibar mɨn uari ekura uanaga izaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:6">A Hermonɨn Mɨghsɨam gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:6">a bulmakaun apurir igiabar mɨn uari ekura uanaga izaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn tiarim otiva</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:7">onɨmarim gamima a taghtasi.<verse eid="PSA 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn tiarim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:8">a gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganim gamima, a nɨghava agoi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:8">Guizbangɨra, a Kadesɨn gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganim gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:8">a puvɨra nɨghava agoi.<verse eid="PSA 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn tiarim pamtem asɨzir atiabagh amima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">da agoa otamin dughiaba ataghɨragha puram oti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:9">Ezɨ ruarimɨn ter afarir angamtɨziba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">purama asiaghira iri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:9">Ezɨ Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven itir gumazamiziba bar pamtem dɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">“God uabɨra gavgavim ko ziar ekiam iti!”<verse eid="PSA 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">29:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 6:17">Jenesis 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 38:8">Jop 38:8</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 38:25">38:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:8">Onger Akaba 28:8</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God uan atrivir dabirabim gaperagha ongarir konibagh ativagha dar gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:10">A en atrivimɨn ikia, egh mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God uan gumazamiziba gavgavim me ganɨga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:11">deragha me gamua dabirabir aghuim ko navir amɨrizim me ganɨdi!<verse eid="PSA 29:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir mam God mɨnaba a ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam banga egha Godɨn Dɨpenim a baghavɨrama a ginaba.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan osɨmtɨziba na abɨrazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">nɨ ua na fegha anabogha nan akura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:1">Egha nan apaniba ataghizɨ me na dɨpovezir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ bizir kam bagha bar akuegha nɨn ziam fe.<verse eid="PSA 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 6:2">Onger Akaba 6:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:13">88:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:3">103:3</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:2">kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa nɨn dei,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 30:2">ezɨ nɨ nan arɨmariam gamizɨ kɨ ua dera.<verse eid="PSA 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 28:1">Onger Akaba 28:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:13">86:13</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ atam aremeghai, ezɨ nɨ na gamizɨ kɨ ua dɨkafi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:3">Kɨ Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn ghugha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 30:3">Ezɨ ikɨrɨmɨrir kɨ itir kam, nɨ ua na ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:15">Ua Me Ini 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:13">Onger Akaba 135:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 149:1">149:1</ref></char>
    </note>Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn gumazamiziba, ia a bagh onger akabar amu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">an ziar bar zuezim fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 30:4">Egh bizir an amizibagh nɨghnɨgh a mɨnabɨ.<verse eid="PSA 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 103:9">Onger Akaba 103:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:20">Aisaia 26:20</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 4:17">2 Korin 4:17</ref></char>
    </note>Guizbangɨra, a en atarir adariba, da dughiar otevimra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">Ezɨ dughiar e nguazir kamɨn itimɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 30:5">a uan navim sara e gifongegha deragha e gami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:5">Dɨmangan en temeriba iregham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">egh amɨmzaraghan e deragh ikɨ bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 29:18">Jop 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:6">Onger Akaba 10:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:2">62:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:6">62:6</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ deragha ikia ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:6">“Bizitam na munamadaghan kogham.”<verse eid="PSA 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ uan navim sara na gifongegha deragha na gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">kɨ mati mɨghsɨar mam tugha gavgafi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:7">Nɨ nan modozir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">kɨ bar puvɨrama atiati.<verse eid="PSA 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨ ko mɨgɨa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:8">pamten nɨn dia nɨn azai.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 30:8">Ekiam, nɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9"/>Kɨ oveghtɨ bizir aghuir tizitam otogham?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">Kɨ ti dagɨar torimɨn magɨrɨghtɨ, bizir kam tinan akuragham?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:9">Gumazamizir oveaghueziba me ti ua nɨn ziam fam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">Me ti ua dɨkavigh mɨkɨm suam, nɨ me mɨkemezɨ moghɨra zurara nɨ me bagha deragha bizibagh ami?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 30:9">Bar puvatɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ na baregh nan apangkufigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:10">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan Akurvazir Gumazimɨn ikɨ!<verse eid="PSA 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ECC 3:4">Fofozir Gumazim 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 20:2">Aisaia 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:13">Jeremaia 31:13</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nan navir osɨmtɨzim batoghezɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:11">kɨ bar akuegha ighiabagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:11">Kɨ faragha azirakar korotiaba aghui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:11">ezɨ datɨrɨghɨn nɨ nan azirakar korotiaba suegha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 30:11">nan azirakam oteghavkɨnizɨ nan navim derazɨ kɨ bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ uan akam dukuaghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:12">Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn onger akabar amu egh nɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 30:12">Egh zurara nɨ mɨnabɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 30:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn apengan itiba a deragha men gari</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">An onger akar kabar faragha zuir gumazim gɨnɨghnɨgha onger akam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:5">Onger Akaba 22:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:1">71:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:23">Aisaia 49:23</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨn aven modoghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">nɨ na geghuv deragh nan ganasa, kamaghɨn kɨ nɨ bagha ize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:1">Nɨ na ateghtɨ nan apaniba na abɨntɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">kɨ aghumsɨghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:1">Nɨ zurara arazir aghuim gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">Egh nɨ uan arazir aghuir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ nan akuragh!<verse eid="PSA 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 71:2">Onger Akaba 71:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ nan dɨmdiam baregh zuamɨra nan akuragh!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">Nɨ dagɨar ekiamɨn mɨn na modogh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:2">Nɨ dɨvazir gavgavimɨn mɨn ikɨ na ekɨarughtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">nan apaniba na abɨnan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:2">Onger Akaba 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 23:3">23:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:11">25:11</ref></char>
    </note>Guizbangɨra, nɨ uabɨ nan dagɨar ekiamɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:3">Nɨ nan dɨvazir bar gavgavimɨn mɨn ikia deragha na geghufi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:3">Nɨ uan ziar ekiam bangɨn, nɨ fomɨra mɨkemezɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:3">kɨ zui naghɨn, nɨ nan faragh mangɨ nan akua na geghuv.<verse eid="PSA 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4"/>Nɨ nan danganir mogomemɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:4">Nan apaniba modogha na bagha gurazir azuazir kam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:4">nɨ nan akuraghtɨ a nan suighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:46">Luk 23:46</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:59">Aposel 7:59</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ uan duam nɨn dafarim garɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:5">Nɨ guizɨn arazibagh amir God,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:5">nɨ nan akuragha ua na inigha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6"/>Marvir guar gavgaviba puvatɨzibar ziaba fer gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:6">nɨ bar men aghua.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:6">Ezɨ ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:6">kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7"/>Nɨ zurara nan apangkufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">kamaghɨn kɨ nɨ bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:7">Guizbangɨra, bizir kurar na bativiba, nɨ bar dar gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">Egha nan navir averiamɨn aven itir osɨmtɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:7">nɨ bar dagh fo.<verse eid="PSA 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:19">Onger Akaba 18:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ nan akurazɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:8">kɨ apanibar dafaribar itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:8">Nɨ nan akurazɨ kɨ deragha iti.<verse eid="PSA 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ osɨmtɨzir ekiam ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">egha azia ghua nan damazimning bezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:9">nan gavgaviba bar gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">Kamaghɨn, nɨ nan apangkufigh.<verse eid="PSA 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:3">Onger Akaba 32:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:3">102:3</ref></char>
    </note>Osɨmtɨzir kam, na gamua nan ikɨrɨmɨrim otefe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">Kɨ aziavɨra iti, egh kamaghɨn kɨ dughiar ruarimɨn ikeghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:10">Osɨmtɨzir ekiam nan itima, kɨ gavgaviba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">Nan agharapaniba nan amiraghamɨrasi.<verse eid="PSA 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11"/>Nan apaniba na dɨpova na mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">Ezɨ nan namakaba nan aghuagha akar kurabar na mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:11">Ezɨ nan roroaba uaghan nan atiatia ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">God ivezir kuram a ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:11">Kɨ tuavimɨn zuir dughiabar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">gumaziba nan gara nan ari.<verse eid="PSA 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 88:4-5">Onger Akaba 88:4-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazim aremezɨ gumazamiziba bar a gɨn amadazɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:12">me na gɨn amada.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:12">Kɨ mati, nguazir mɨnem bɨghizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 31:12">me na makuni.<verse eid="PSA 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:25">Jeremaia 6:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:3">20:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:10">20:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:1">Matyu 27:1</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ orazi, apanir avɨriba uari akuva gɨrakɨrangɨn moghɨn aghumra uariv gei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">Me atiatim na danɨngasa uari akuva na gasɨghasɨghasa akam mɨsosi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:13">Egh na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasa uariv gei.<verse eid="PSA 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:14">kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15"/>Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn itir ikɨrɨmɨrir kam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:15">kɨ a isa nɨn dafarim gatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:15">Nɨ nan akuragh</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:15">nan apanir nan agɨntɨzibar dafaribar ua na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:25-26">Dɨboboniba 6:25-26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 4:6">Onger Akaba 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 67:1">67:1</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, nɨ uan guam na mɨtuazɨ an angazangarim na gisirazɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:16">kamaghɨra nɨ bar na gifuegh nan boroghɨra ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:16">Nɨ zurara nan apangkuvighavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:16">Kamaghɨn, nɨ nan akurvagh!<verse eid="PSA 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:9">1 Samuel 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:2">Onger Akaba 25:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:17">115:17</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨn azangsɨsi, nɨ nan akuragham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">Nɨ apanibar amamangatɨghtɨ me na abɨraghtɨ kɨ aghumsɨzim inian markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:17">Gumazir kuraba mar ikuvighɨva aghumsɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">Me mar oveng mangɨ Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn magɨrɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:17">egh akabar kumigh ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:3">1 Samuel 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 12:3">Onger Akaba 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:15">Jut 1:15</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kaba uari fa akaba batogha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:18">gumazir aghuiba dɨpova akar kurabar me mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:18">Egha ifavarir akabav gei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:18">Nɨ me gasɨghasightɨ, me uam akaba akaran kogham.<verse eid="PSA 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 64:4">Aisaia 64:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:9">1 Korin 2:9</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir nɨn atiatia nɨn apengan itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">nɨ men akurvaghasa bizir aghuir avɨriba me bagha dagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:19">Gumazir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn ikia nɨn aven modiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">nɨ deravɨra me gami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:19">Egha gumazamizibar damazibar nɨ zurara men akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:21">Jop 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:5">Onger Akaba 27:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 32:7">32:7</ref></char>
    </note>Men apaniba me gasɨghasɨghasa akabar kɨri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">eghtɨ dughiar kamɨn, nɨ me avaragh deraghvɨra me geghuvtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:20">me me gasɨghasɨghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:20">Me nɨn dafarimɨn apengan ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">apanibar akar kuraba me gasɨghasighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 23:7">1 Samuel 23:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 17:7">Onger Akaba 17:7</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God bar nan apangkufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">ezɨ kɨ ghaze, kɨ an ziam fam!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:21">Nan apaniba na ekɨarugha na gasɨghasɨghasava amima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">God uan gavgavimɨn nan akurazɨ kɨ deravɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 38:11-12">Aisaia 38:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="JON 2:4">Jona 2:4</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ faragha bar atiatigha kamagh nɨghnɨsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ na batoghezɨ kɨ ua nɨn boroghɨn itir pu</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:22">Puvatɨ, nɨ nan ararem baregha nan akura.<verse eid="PSA 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23"/>Ia gumazamizir God baghavɨra itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">ia bar moghɨra a gifongegh!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:23">Gumazamizir zurara an gɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">a bar deraghavɨra me geghuva men gari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:23">Egha gumazir uari fa akaba batoziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">a ivezir kuram me ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 27:14">Onger Akaba 27:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ia gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:24">ia uan navibar aven atiatingan kogh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 31:24">egh tugh gavgavigh mamaghɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 31:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uan arazir kurabar gun God mɨgeima, an an arazir kuraba gɨn amada</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamaghɨn a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 85:2">Onger Akaba 85:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:3">103:3</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:1-2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 4:7-8">Rom 4:7-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:1">God men arazir kuraba gɨn amadagha da avara,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 32:1">eghtɨ gumazamizir kaba bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:47">Jon 1:47</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:19">2 Korin 5:19</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba, God men arazir kuram mengvɨra ikian koghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:2">arazir ifavaritam an ikian kogham,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 32:2">eghtɨ gumazamizir kaba bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:10">Onger Akaba 31:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 38:8">38:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:2-3">39:2-3</ref></char>
    </note>O God, kɨ uan arazir kurabar gun nɨ mɨkemezir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:3">dɨmagariba ko aruebar ara kamaghɨra ikia</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 32:3">ghua nan aghariba bar nan amɨra.<verse eid="PSA 32:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4"/>Dɨmagariba ko arueba, nɨ ivezir kuram na ganɨngizɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">nan gavgaviba bar gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 32:4">Mati aruer ekiam nguazim gaboima a bar mɨsɨngi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 32:4">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 32:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:40">Ofa Gami 26:40</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 12:13">2 Samuel 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 31:33">Jop 31:33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:12">Onger Akaba 103:12</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 1:9">1 Jon 1:9</ref></char>
    </note>Datɨrɨghɨn kɨ uan arazir kuraba bar dar gun Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨkemezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">an ada gɨn amadagha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:5">Egha kɨ uan arazir kuratam modozir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">kɨ bar da aghurigha nɨ mɨkeme.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 32:5">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 46:1-3">Onger Akaba 46:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:1">69:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:13">69:13</ref></char>
    </note>Kamaghɨn dera, nɨn gumazamiziba osɨmtɨziba bativ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">egh zurara nɨ ko mɨkɨmtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:6">osɨmtɨzim aperiar ekiamɨn mɨn me avigh mangɨsɨ izɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">me avigh mangɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 5:1-31">Gumazir Dapaniba 5:1-31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:20">Onger Akaba 31:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:1">91:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 121:7">121:7</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨrara nan mogomer danganim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:7">kɨ nɨn aven modima osɨmtɨziba na abɨrir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:7">Kɨ osɨmtɨzibar aven itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:7">nɨ na ekɨarugha nan akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 32:7">Kamaghɨn kɨ pamten dia ighiabagh amua nɨn ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 32:7">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 25:8">Onger Akaba 25:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:18">33:18</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:8">Tuavir nɨ mangamim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:8">kɨ nɨn sure damu deragh nɨ gegharaghtɨ, nɨ an mangam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 32:8">Kɨ deravɨra nɨn sure damu egh nɨn gan nɨ geghuvam.<verse eid="PSA 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9"/>Nɨ hoziaba ko donkibar mɨn onganan markɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">mati me ain ko benir ruaribar men akabagh aghuigha me getuima me izi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 32:9">Puvatɨghtɨ me izeghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:4">Onger Akaba 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 13:21">Aghuzir Akaba 13:21</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:9">Rom 2:9</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba osɨmtɨzir avɨriba bativam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">Ezɨ gumazir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 32:10">me zurara an apangkuvir ekiamɨn aven deragh ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">32:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 7:10">Onger Akaba 7:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 64:10">64:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:12">97:12</ref></char>
    </note>Ia gumazamizir arazir aghuibagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:11">Ikiavɨra Itir God ia bagh amizir biziba, ia da bagh naviba deragh bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:11">Ia Godɨn damazimɨn zuezir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:11">ia bar pamten dɨm mɨkɨm bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 32:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn ziam fer onger akam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1"/>Ia gumazamizir aghuiba, ia Ikiavɨra Itir God ia bagha amizir bizir aghuim bagh bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:1">Arazir kam bar dera:</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 33:1">ia an akam baragha an gɨn zui darasi, ia an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2"/>Ia kulele ko gitan stringɨn 10pla itim mɨsogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:2">Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh ighiam damu an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3"/>Ia onger akar igiaba osirigh da bangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:3">egh deragh gita mɨsoghtɨ an ararem deraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 33:3">ia bar akongegh pamten dɨm mɨkɨm.<verse eid="PSA 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4"/>E fo, Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn akam a guizbangɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:4">Ezɨ an akam mɨkemezɨ moghɨra, a zurara guizɨn arazibar gɨn ghua ingangariba bar dagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 11:7">Onger Akaba 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:28">37:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:64">119:64</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a en arazir aghuiba ko guizɨn araziba bar dagh ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:5">An apangkuvir arazim, nguazimɨn itir gumazamiziba bar me ave.<verse eid="PSA 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:14-19">Jenesis 1:14-19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 2:1">2:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:30">Onger Akaba 104:30</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:3">Hibru 11:3</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God fomɨra mɨkemezɨ, aruem ko iakɨnim ko mɨkoveziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:6">ko overiamɨn pɨn itir biziba bar otivigha iti.<verse eid="PSA 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:8">Ua Me Ini 15:8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 3:16">Josua 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:13">Onger Akaba 78:13</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazim dɨpam isa itam guruizɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:7">an ongarim isa danganir vamɨran anekufa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 33:7">Egha ongarim gamizɨ a bar konegha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:7">nguazimɨn apengan itir danganimɨn vɨn mar iraghu.<verse eid="PSA 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8"/>Ia nguazimɨn itir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:8">ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godram atiating an apengan ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 148:5">Onger Akaba 148:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A mɨkemezɨ nguazir kam puram oto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:9">An Akar Gavgavim mɨkemezɨ, biziba bar nguazir kamɨn otifi.<verse eid="PSA 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:1-3">Onger Akaba 2:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:10">Aisaia 8:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:3">19:3</ref></char>
    </note>Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba damuasava nɨghnɨzir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:10">Ikiavɨra Itir God dagh amima da ghua puvarɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 33:10">Ikɨzir igharaziba damuasa akabav sozir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:10">an adar tuaviba apɨri.<verse eid="PSA 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 23:13">Jop 23:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:5">Onger Akaba 40:5</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 19:21">Aghuzir Akaba 19:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:8">Aisaia 55:8</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God damuasava amir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:11">da gavgavigh mangɨvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 33:11">A uan navir averiamɨn aven itir nɨghnɨzim giraghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:11">An nɨghnɨzim zurara ikɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 7:6">Godɨn Araziba 7:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:9">Onger Akaba 28:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 144:15">144:15</ref></char>
    </note>Kantrin tam God baghavɨra ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:12">Ikiavɨra Itir God deravɨra a damutɨ a bar akongegham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 33:12">Kantrin kamɨn gumazamiziba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:12">God ua baghavɨra me ginaba.<verse eid="PSA 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 28:24">Jop 28:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 11:4">Onger Akaba 11:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 14:2">14:2</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God uan Nguibamɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:13">nguazimɨn itir gumazamiziba bar men gari.<verse eid="PSA 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:39">1 Atriviba 8:39</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:43">8:43</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:19">Onger Akaba 102:19</ref></char>
    </note>A uan Nguibamɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:14">egha nguazimɨn bar deragha en gari.<verse eid="PSA 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 16:9">2 Eghaghaniba 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 10:8">Jop 10:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:73">Onger Akaba 119:73</ref></char>
    </note>A uabɨ nɨghnɨziba ko navir averiabar ingarigha da isa gumazamizibagh arɨki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:15">egha bizir me amiba a bar dagh fo.<verse eid="PSA 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 44:6">Onger Akaba 44:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 60:11">60:11</ref></char>
    </note>Atrivim mɨdorozir gumazir avɨriba ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:16">me an akuragh mɨdorozim damu an apaniba abɨraghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 33:16">Ezɨ kamaghɨra mɨdorozir gumazim uan gavgavimɨn apaniba abɨraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 20:7">Onger Akaba 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 147:10">147:10</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 21:31">Aghuzir Akaba 21:31</ref></char>
    </note>Mɨdorozir hoziam mɨdorozir gumazimɨn akuraghtɨ, a uan apaniba abɨraghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:17">Apaniba mɨdorozir gumaziba abɨraghtɨ, men hoziaba men akuraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:7">Jop 36:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 32:8-10">Onger Akaba 32:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:12">1 Pita 3:12</ref></char>
    </note>Ia oragh! Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatia an apengan itiba, an damazim men iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:18">Gumazamizir kaba, me nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an apangkuvir arazimɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:20">Jop 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:19">Onger Akaba 37:19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:11">Aposel 12:11</ref></char>
    </note>A deragh gumazamizir kabar gantɨ me angamɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:19">Mɨtiriam aghamin dughiam otoghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 33:19">a men akuraghtɨ me daghem bagh ovengan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">33:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:1">Onger Akaba 62:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:9">115:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:17">Aisaia 8:17</ref></char>
    </note>E Ikiavɨra Itir God baghvɨra mɨzuamɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:20">nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikɨtɨ an e geghuvam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 33:20">A en oramɨn mɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:20">ezɨ e an aven modima a en akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21"/>E nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ziar bar zuezimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:21">Kamaghɨn, e uan navir averiabar aven a bagh bar akongegham.<verse eid="PSA 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, e nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn ikiavɨra ikia nɨn akurvazim bagha mɨzuai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:22">Kamaghɨn amizɨ nɨ en apangkuvigh mamaghɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 33:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34"/>
  <para style="s">God bar deragha Devit gamizɨ, an an ziam fe</para>
  <para style="d">Devit, Abimelek ko ikia ifarava onganizɨ moghɨn amima, Abimelek a batoke. Devit uamategha ghugha onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:13-15">1 Samuel 21:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:20">Efesus 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:18">1 Tesalonika 5:18</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 1:3">2 Tesalonika 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:13">2:13</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ zurara ziar ekiam Ikiavɨra Itir God danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:1">Kɨ an ziam fɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God nan akurazir bizir kam bangɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:2">kɨ a mɨnabava a bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 34:2">Gumazamizir osɨmtɨziba ateriba me bizir kam uaghan a baragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:2">men naviba bar moghɨra deragham.<verse eid="PSA 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:30">Onger Akaba 69:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:46">Luk 1:46</ref></char>
    </note>E bar moghɨra an ziar ekiamɨn gun mɨkɨmɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:3">egh an ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:6">Onger Akaba 18:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7">Matyu 7:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:9">Luk 11:9</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn azangsɨzima, a nan azangsɨzim baraki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:4">A nan atiatiba bar da batoghezɨ, kɨ datɨrɨghɨn navir amɨrizimɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5"/>Gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:5">me bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 34:5">Men nɨghnɨzir gavgavir kam, a ikɨ gavgavightɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:5">me aghumsɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 3:4">Onger Akaba 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:17-19">34:17-19</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir onganarazibagh amiba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:6">Ikiavɨra Itir God ko mɨgeima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 34:6">a me baragha men osɨmtɨzibar aven deragha men akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 6:17">2 Atriviba 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:22">Daniel 6:22</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:8">Sekaraia 9:8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:14">Hibru 1:14</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ensel, gumazamizir an atiatia an apengan itiba, a me apaza men akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:7">Eghtɨ osɨmtɨziba me gasɨghasɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:12">Onger Akaba 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:3">1 Pita 2:3</ref></char>
    </note>Ia kamaghɨn ganigh fogh suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:8">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn araziba da bar moghɨra dera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 34:8">Gumazim God bagh mangɨ an aven modogh nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:8">egh a deragh ikɨ bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:23">Onger Akaba 31:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn gumazamiziba, ia an atiating an apengan ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:9">Gumazamizir an atiatia an apengan itiba me bizitamɨn otevezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 4:10-11">Jop 4:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 84:11">Onger Akaba 84:11</ref></char>
    </note>Dughiar mabar laionɨn nguziba dagheba puvatɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:10">mɨtiriaba men azi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 34:10">Ezɨ gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir God ikia an apengan itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:10">me bizir aghuiba bagha asaghasazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11"/>Nan boriba, ia izɨ na baraghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:11">kɨ ian sure damutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 34:11">ia zurara Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiating an apengan ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:12-16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 3:10-12">1 Pita 3:10-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨn dabirabim deraghasa nɨ ifongez, o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:12">Nɨ dughiar ruarimɨn ikɨ bar akongeghasa ifonge?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 34:12">Are!<verse eid="PSA 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:22">1 Pita 2:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ kamaghɨn ikɨsɨ, akar kurabav kɨman koghɨva</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:13">ifavarir akaba atakigh.<verse eid="PSA 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:16-17">Aisaia 1:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:18">Rom 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:14">Hibru 12:14</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ akɨrim ragh arazir kurabagh asaragh, egh arazir aghuibara damu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:14">Egh navir amɨrizimɨn gumazamizir igharaziba ko ikɨsɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 34:14">gavgavigh mamaghɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:7">Jop 36:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:6">Onger Akaba 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:17">34:17</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn damazimɨn derazir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:15">a deragha men gara, men arareba barasi.<verse eid="PSA 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 10:7">Aghuzir Akaba 10:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:11">Jeremaia 44:11</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 9:4">Amos 9:4</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:16">a me batogha men aghua.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 34:16">Kamaghɨn, me oveghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 34:16">gumazamiziba ua me gɨnɨghnɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:6">Onger Akaba 34:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:15">34:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:19">34:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 145:19-20">145:19-20</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn damazimɨn derazir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:17">me Godɨn deima a me barasi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 34:17">A men akurvazima osɨmtɨziba me abɨrir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 51:17">Onger Akaba 51:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:15">Aisaia 57:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:2">66:2</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir naviba osɨa itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:18">Ikiavɨra Itir God bar men boroghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 34:18">Egha gumazamizir osɨmtɨzir ekiar me abɨnasava amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:18">a men akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 24:16">Aghuzir Akaba 24:16</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 3:11-12">2 Timoti 3:11-12</ref></char>
    </note>Osɨmtɨzir bar avɨriba gumazir aghuiba batifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:19">Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God men akurvazima</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 34:19">osɨmtɨzir kaba me abɨrir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 19:36">Jon 19:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God guizbangɨra men akurazɨma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:20">men agharitam dɨpɨriaghirɨzir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21"/>Gumazamizir kuraba, bizir kurar avɨriba me damutɨ, me arɨmɨghiram.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:21">Godɨn damazimɨn derazir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 34:21">God men apanibagh asɨghasɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">34:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 4:9">2 Samuel 4:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 1:29">1 Atriviba 1:29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:4">Onger Akaba 103:4</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ingangarir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:22">a ua me iniam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 34:22">Egh gumazamizir a bagha ghua an aven modiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:22">a deragh men gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 34:22">me ovengan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 34:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazir nan atara na ko mɨsoziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:1">nɨ men atar me ko mɨsogh.<verse eid="PSA 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2"/>Nɨ dɨkavigh uan mɨdorozir biziba inigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:2">uan oramɨn suiragh izɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3"/>Nɨ uan afuzim ko ghuaram inigh izɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:3">gumazir nan agɨntɨziba ko mɨsogh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:3">Nɨ na mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:3">kɨ nɨn Akurvazir Gumazim!<verse eid="PSA 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:14">Onger Akaba 40:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 70:2">70:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 129:5">129:5</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kaba na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasava ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">Nɨ me abɨraghtɨ me aghumsɨkigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:4">Me na gasɨghasɨghasa akabav sosi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">Nɨ men agɨntɨgh me damightɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:4">me okam nɨghnɨgh.<verse eid="PSA 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, amɨnim pipiabagh ivai da mɨgha zui moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:5">nɨn ensel gumazir kurar kabar agɨntɨgh me batokegh.<verse eid="PSA 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ensel me batueghtɨ me mangɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:6">Tuavir me zuir kam, an a damightɨ amɨnim an pɨrightɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:6">a bar apɨghsigham.<verse eid="PSA 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7"/>Kɨ arazir kuratamɨn me gamizir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:7">ezɨ me nan suighasa modogha azuazim atɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:7">Torir kɨ magɨramim, me a gɨkuigha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8"/>Me foghan koghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">nɨ me damightɨ, dughiar bar kuram me batogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:8">Me na gasɨghasɨghasava atɨzir azuazir kam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">a meraram asɨghasɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9"/>Kɨ kamagh fogh suam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:9">Ikiavɨra Itir God nan akuragha ua na ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:9">Eghtɨ kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10"/>Kɨ bar uan navir averiamɨn aven kamagh mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">“O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazitam ua nɨn mɨn itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:10">Gumazamizir gavgaviba puvatɨziba, nɨ deravɨra men akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">Gumazamizir onganarazibagh amiba, nɨ deravɨra me geghufi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:10">Ezɨ gumazamizir gavgavir bar ekiaba itiba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">me gasɨghasɨghasa amuava avenge.”<verse eid="PSA 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11"/>Gumazamizir ifariba, arazir kurar kɨ amir puvatɨziba bagha pura kotɨn aven akam na gasa na mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 38:20">Onger Akaba 38:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:20">Jeremaia 18:20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:32">Jon 10:32</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ arazir aghuibara me gami, ezɨ me arazir kurabar na gami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:12">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ uabɨra ikia nan navim bar oseme.<verse eid="PSA 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 30:25">Jop 30:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Me arer dughiabar, kɨ men apangkuva azirakar korotiaba aghua uabɨ abɨragha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">me bagha dagheba ataghɨragha pamtem God ko mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14"/>Kɨ me bagha God ko mɨgɨa, mati kɨ uan aveghbuam o namakam gɨnɨghnɨgha a bagha God ko mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">Nan amebam aremezɨ kɨ an apangkuvigha a bagha aziagha rui moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:14">kɨ me bagh azi.<verse eid="PSA 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15"/>Kɨ osɨmtɨzimɨn irɨzir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">me uari akuva na dɨpova na mɨgɨa bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:15">Gumazamizir kɨ fozir puvatɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">me puram akaba na gasa na mɨgɨa ghuavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16"/>Me arazir bar kurabar gɨn ghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:16">osɨmtɨzim na garɨgha dɨbovir akabar na mɨgɨavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:16">Me na gifongezir puvatɨgha nan gara uan atariba kuskusi.<verse eid="PSA 35:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17"/>O Ekiam, nɨ dughiar bar ruarimɨn me mɨzua itima me kamaghɨram ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">Nɨ manadɨzoghɨn bizitam damuam?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:17">Nɨ nan akuragh ua na inightɨ, me ua na gasɨghasɨghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">Me laionbar mɨn amua na mɨsosi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:17">nɨ men dafaribar ua na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18"/>Nɨ kamaghɨn damightɨ, nɨn gumazamizir avɨriba uari akuvamin dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:18">kɨ men tongɨn nɨ mɨnamam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:18">Guizbangɨra, kɨ gumazamizir avɨribar tongɨn nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 35:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 15:25">Jon 15:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazamizir maba pura nan apanim gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">Nɨ me ateghtɨ me osɨmtɨziba na darɨgh na abɨnan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:19">Men na bagha naviba pura men ikufi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">Kamaghɨn, nɨ me ateghtɨ me osɨmtɨzir na garɨziba bagh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:19">damaziba ighɨghirɨ na dɨpov bar akueghan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 35:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20"/>Me tong igharaz darazi ko dabirabir aghuimɨn ikiasa mɨgeir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:20">Me gumazamizir nɨmɨra ikia deragha nguibamɨn apiaghav itiba, bagha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:20">uari akuva ikia, ifavarir akabagh amua</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 35:20">me gasɨghasɨghasavɨra uariv gei.<verse eid="PSA 35:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21"/>Me pamten mɨgɨa akaba na gasa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:21">“Bar guizbangɨra, e nɨn gari</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:21">nɨ arazir kurabagh ami!”<verse eid="PSA 35:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazir kamaghɨn amiba nɨ uabɨ men ganigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:22">Ekiam, nɨ uan akam dukuagh ikian markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:22">Nɨ nan saghon ikian markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 35:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23"/>O Ekiam, nɨ nan God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:23">nɨ osegh dɨkavigh izɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:23">gavgavim isɨ nan akabar anɨng, egh na bagh mɨkɨm.<verse eid="PSA 35:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 43:1">Onger Akaba 43:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan God, nɨn araziba da bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">Nɨ uan arazir aghuibar gɨn mangɨ nan akuraghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:24">nan apaniba ganigh fogh suam, kɨ arazir kuraba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">Nɨ me ateghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:24">me nan osɨmtɨzimɨn gan bar akongeghan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 35:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25"/>Nɨ men amamangatɨghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:25">me kamagh mɨkɨman markɨ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:25">“Bar dera! Bizir e damuasa bar ifongezim, an otogha gɨfa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:25">E bar a gasɨghasigha gɨfa.”<verse eid="PSA 35:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26"/>Gumazir osɨmtɨzim na gatɨgha bar akongezir kaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">nɨ me damightɨ me okam nɨghnɨgh bar aghumsɨkigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:26">Me nan ziam abɨra uan ziaba fe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">Nɨ men ziaba abɨn aghumsɨzim me danɨng.<verse eid="PSA 35:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27"/>Ezɨ gumazamizir maba kamaghɨn ifonge, nɨ na dɨpon suam kɨ nɨn damazimɨn dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">Gumazamizir kaba bar akuegh pamten dɨmɨva kamaghɨn mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:27">“Ikiavɨra Itir God, a gavgavir ekiam iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">God kamaghɨn ifonge, an ingangarir gumazim deraghvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:27">Bizir kam bagh a bar akongegh.”<verse eid="PSA 35:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">35:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 51:14">Onger Akaba 51:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:15">71:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:24">71:24</ref></char>
    </note>Eghtɨ kɨ nɨn arazir aghuibar gun mɨkɨm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:28">egh dughiabar zurara nɨn ziam fɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 35:28">mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 35:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir kurabar arazir kuraba</para>
  <para style="d">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ingangarir gumazim Devit, an onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">An onger akabar faragha zuir gumazim gɨnɨghnɨgha onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 3:18">Rom 3:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Arazir kuram, a gumazir kuramɨn navir averiamɨn ikia nɨghnɨziba a ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:1">Gumazir kabanang, me tong Godɨn atiatia an apengan itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 36:1">Bar puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 36:1">Me bar akɨrim ragha God gasara.<verse eid="PSA 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2"/>Guizbangɨra, me uari uan ziabagh nɨghnɨgha uari uan ziaba fe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:2">Me kamaghɨn fozir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 36:2">God me isɨ kot darɨgh egh me amizir arazir kuraba tuisɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3"/>Men akatoribar akaba ikuvizɨ, me zurara bizibagh ifari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:3">Egha arazir aghuibara amuamin fofozir aghuitam itir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4"/>Me uan mɨsiabagh irav ikia arazir kurabara damuasa nɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">Me zurara tuavir kuramɨn nɨghnɨzibar gɨn mangasavɨra nɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 36:4">Egha tong akɨrim ragha arazir kuratam gasarazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Godɨn arazir aghuim</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 57:10">Onger Akaba 57:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 108:4">108:4</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn apangkuvim bar ekevegha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">uanaga overiamɨn suira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:5">Ezɨ nɨ zurara guizɨn arazimɨn gɨn ghua uan nɨghnɨzim gɨghavkɨrir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">ezɨ nɨn arazir kam uaghan bar ekevegha uanaga,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 36:5">overiamɨn itir ghuariabar suira.<verse eid="PSA 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6"/>Nɨn arazir aghuim bar ekevegha mɨghsɨar ekiabar mɨn tughav iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">Nɨn kotɨn aven itir arazimɨn mɨngarim, e deragha a gɨfozir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 36:6">An ongarimɨn mɨn bar konegha vɨn mar iraghu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:6">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ gumazamiziba ko asɨziba vɨrara deravɨra me geghuva</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 36:6">men gari.<verse eid="PSA 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="RUT 2:12">Rut 2:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 17:8">Onger Akaba 17:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:19">31:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:4">91:4</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨn apangkuvir arazim bar derazɨ e bar a gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:7">Gumazamiziba bar ghua nɨn aven modi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 36:7">Mati tuarir nguziba uan amebamɨn avɨzimningɨn apengan ghua modi.<verse eid="PSA 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:17">Jop 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 16:11">Onger Akaba 16:11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:1">Akar Mogomem 22:1</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨn Dɨpenimɨn dagher avɨriba itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:8">nɨn gumazamiziba apa izɨvagha mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:8">Mati nɨ uan faner aghuimɨn gumazamizibar amamangatɨzɨ, me anepi moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:8">nɨ bizir aghuir bar avɨriba e ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">36:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 2:13">Jeremaia 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:10">Jon 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:14">4:14</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pita 2:9</ref></char>
    </note>Biziba bar, nɨ dar ikɨrɨmɨrimɨn mɨngarim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:9">mati dɨpar ikɨrɨmɨrir aghuim anɨdim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:9">Kamaghɨn, nɨn angazangarimɨn amodoghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:9">e deravɨra bizibar gari.<verse eid="PSA 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10"/>Gumazamizir nɨ gɨfoziba, nɨ men apangkuvigh kamaghɨra ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:10">Gumazamizir nɨn damazimɨn deraziba, nɨ deragh me damu.<verse eid="PSA 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11"/>Nɨ gumazir uari fava akaba batoziba ateghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:11">me na dɨkabɨnan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:11">Egh gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba ateghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:11">me nan agɨraghtɨ kɨ aran kogham.<verse eid="PSA 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12"/>Ia gan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:12">Gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba daghiregha nguazimɨn fueghav iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 36:12">Me ua dɨkavan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 36:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37"/>
  <para style="s">God gumazamizir aghuiba deragh me damuva, gumazamizir kuraba pazɨ me damuam</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 73:3">Onger Akaba 73:3</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 23:17">Aghuzir Akaba 23:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:1">24:1</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:19">24:19</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ gumazamizir kuraba amir araziba bagh nɨghnɨgh osɨman markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:1">Egh me amir bizibar gan navim dɨkavan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 90:5-6">Onger Akaba 90:5-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Guizbangɨra, me graziba mɨdɨi moghɨn zuamɨra mɨsigham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:2">Egh ter afarir gariba imua mɨdɨi moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:2">zuamɨra mɨsigh puvarigham.<verse eid="PSA 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3"/>Nɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:3">egh arazir aghuibar amu.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:3">Egh nɨ nguazir kamɨn ikɨ deragh ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:14">Aisaia 58:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh bar akueghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:4">a bizir nɨn uan navir averiam ifongeziba nɨ danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 16:3">Aghuzir Akaba 16:3</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:25">Matyu 6:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22">Luk 12:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:7">1 Pita 5:7</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ uabɨra uabɨ isɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God danigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:5">egh nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikɨtɨ, a nɨn akuragham.<verse eid="PSA 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:17">Jop 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:9">Maika 7:9</ref></char>
    </note>A nɨn arazir aghuim damightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:6">nɨn arazir aghuir kam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:6">aruem aruer arɨzimɨn isiragha gavgavizɨ moghɨn isiragham.<verse eid="PSA 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:1">Onger Akaba 62:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:15">Aisaia 30:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:1">Jeremaia 12:1</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn damazimɨn uabɨn asugh a mɨzuamtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">a nɨn akuragham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:7">Gumazamizir taba uan nɨghnɨzibar gɨn mangɨ bizir aghuir avɨriba initɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">nɨ men gan navim dɨkavan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:7">Eghtɨ gumazamiziba arazir kurabar amutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">nɨ dagh nɨghnɨgh osɨman markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 73:3">Onger Akaba 73:3</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:26">Efesus 4:26</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ atar egh osɨman markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:8">Bizir kaba nɨ gekuightɨ nɨ arazir kuram damigham.<verse eid="PSA 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 27:13-14">Jop 27:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:13">Aisaia 57:13</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:9">me uan nguazimɨn ikɨ deraghvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:9">Eghtɨ gumazamizir kuraba bar ikuvigham.<verse eid="PSA 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:9">Jop 20:9</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:36-37">Hibru 10:36-37</ref></char>
    </note>Dughiar ruarim puvatɨghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:10">gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba pura puvarigham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:10">Nɨ men nguibabar me buriva</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:10">men apighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:5">Matyu 5:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazamizir uari abɨra aghumra itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:11">me deragh uan nguazim dapiagh</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:11">bizir avɨriba inigh bar akuegh ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12"/>Gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:12">me gumazamizir aghuibagh asɨghasɨghasava amua,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:12">men atara atariba kuskusi.<verse eid="PSA 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13"/>Ekiam kamaghɨn fo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:13">gumazamizir kuraba gɨvaghamin dughiam a izi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:13">Kamaghɨn a men ingaravati.<verse eid="PSA 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14"/>Gumazir kuraba uan mɨdorozir sababa asia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">egha beniba uan pibagh afi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:14">Me gumazamizir onganarazibagh amiba ko, asaghasaziba ko, gumazamizir aghuibagh asasa.<verse eid="PSA 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15"/>Puvatɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:15">Men mɨdorozir sababa raghɨregh merara mɨsueghtɨ me arɨmɨghiregham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:15">Eghtɨ men piba, bar moghɨra dɨpɨrighiregham.<verse eid="PSA 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 15:16">Aghuzir Akaba 15:16</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:8">16:8</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:6">1 Timoti 6:6</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir aghuimɨn bizir muziarim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:16">a gumazamizir kurabar bizir avɨribagh afira.<verse eid="PSA 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17"/>E fo, Ikiavɨra Itir God gumazir kurabar gavgavim agɨvagham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:17">Egh a gumazamizir aghuiba deragh me geghuv men ganam.<verse eid="PSA 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God gumazamizir an akamɨn gɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:18">a deravɨra me geghuva men gari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:18">Ezɨ nguazir me itim, a bar moghɨra men nguazimɨn mɨn ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:18">mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19"/>Me dughiar kurabar osɨmtɨziba bativan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:19">Egh dagheba oteveghamin dughiamɨn, me dagheba oteveghan kogham,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:19">me damɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20"/>Eghtɨ gumazamizir kuraba me bar ikuvigham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn apaniba, me graziba ko akɨmarir aghuibar mɨn bar iregham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:20">Me mɨgharimɨn mɨn dughiar otevimɨn ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 37:20">mangɨgh bar puvarigham.<verse eid="PSA 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21"/>Gumazir kuram, a pura gumazibar biziba isa da ikarvazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:21">Gumazir aghuim, arazir aghuibagh amua</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:21">pura biziba isa gumazir igharazibagh anɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22"/>Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir God deragha amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:22">me nguazir kam inigh deraghvɨra an ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:22">Eghtɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God asɨghasɨghamin gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:22">me puvarigham.<verse eid="PSA 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:9">1 Samuel 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 16:9">Aghuzir Akaba 16:9</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God ifongezɨ moghɨn, a gumazamiziba daruasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:23">me bagha tuavim atɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:23">A gumazitamɨn arazim bagh bar akongeghɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:23">an a geghuv gavgavim a danɨngtɨ, a tugh gavgavigham.<verse eid="PSA 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God uan dafarimɨn gumazamizir kabar suiragh men akuraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:24">me ua dɨkavigh tuivigham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:24">Kamaghɨn gumazamizir kaba irɨghsɨ damuamin dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:24">me bar ireghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 37:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:28">Onger Akaba 37:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 59:15">59:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:10">109:10</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uan igiamɨn ikia iza datɨrɨghɨn kɨ ghurigha gari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">God akɨrim ragha gumazir aghuitam gasarazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:25">Kɨ uaghan garima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">men boriba dagheba puvarɨgha da bagh azangsɨghizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:25">Bar puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 37:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26"/>Gumazamizir aghuiba zurara apangkuva biziba isa pura gumazamizibagh anɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:26">Ezɨ God bizir bar aghuiba isa me ganɨdi moghɨn, a boriba isa me ganɨdima</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:26">me bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 37:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27"/>Nɨ uan arazir kuraba akɨrim ragh dagh asaragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:27">egh arazir aghuibara amu.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:27">Egh nɨ zurara deravɨra nguazir kamɨn ikɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 37:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 11:7">Onger Akaba 11:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 2:22">Aghuzir Akaba 2:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:20">Aisaia 14:20</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, an arazir aghuibara ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">Kamaghɨn, a uan gumazamiziba me ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:28">A dughiabar zurara me geghuva arazir aghuibara me gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">Egh a gumazir kurabar boribagh asɨghasɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 37:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29"/>Gumazamizir aghuiba, God me ganɨngizir nguazim inigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:29">a dapiagh ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 37:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30"/>Gumazamizir aghuiba, mɨgɨrɨgɨar aghuibaram ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:30">Men mɨgɨrɨgɨaba bar moghɨra nɨghnɨzir aghuiba ikia</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:30">guizɨn arazimɨn gumazamizibar akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 37:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:6">Godɨn Araziba 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:8">Onger Akaba 40:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:98">119:98</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:7">Aisaia 51:7</ref></char>
    </note>Me uan Godɨn Akar Gavgavim isa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:31">uan navir averiabagh atɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:31">deragha arui.<verse eid="PSA 37:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32"/>Gumazir kuram gumazir aghuim mɨsueghtɨ an aremeghasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:32">a bagha mɨzua gara iti.<verse eid="PSA 37:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God gumazamizir aghuiba ataghɨrazima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:33">apaniba me mɨsozi me ariaghirir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:33">Gumazir kuram gumazir aghuim isɨ kot datɨghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:33">Ikiavɨra Itir God gumazir aghuim ateghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:33">gumazir kuram kotɨn aven a gafiragh anebɨraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 37:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34"/>Nɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ikɨ a mɨzuamɨva an akabar gɨn mangɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">Nɨ kamaghɨn damutɨ a ziar ekiam isɨ nɨ danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:34">Eghtɨ nguazir a nɨ ganɨngizir kam nɨ a iniam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">Egh nɨ uabɨ gantɨ a nɨn apanibagh asɨghasigham.<verse eid="PSA 37:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:3">Jop 5:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ gumazir kuramɨn garima, a gavgavir ekiam iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:35">A Lebanon kantrin temer sidan mɨn ekevegha tughav ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:35">temer igharaziba bar dagh afira.<verse eid="PSA 37:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36"/>Kɨ gɨn uamategha zuima, gumazir kam ua itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:36">Kɨ a bagha gara,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:36">bar an apizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 37:36">Bar puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 37:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 32:17">Aisaia 32:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:2">57:2</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir Godɨn damazimɨn deraziba, me osɨmtɨzitam itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:37">Nɨ men gan fogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:37">Me navir amɨrizimɨn ikia deravɨram apiazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:37">men ovavir boribar dabirabim deragha ikia mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 37:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38"/>Gumazamizir kuraba me bar puvarigham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:38">Eghtɨ men ovavir boriba uaghan bar gevegham.<verse eid="PSA 37:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ, gumazamizir an damazimɨn derazibar akura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:39">Me osɨmtɨzibar aven ikiava, a baghavɨra ghua an aven modima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 37:39">a me geghuva deragha men gari.<verse eid="PSA 37:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">37:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 5:20">1 Eghaghaniba 5:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:5">Aisaia 31:5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 3:17">Daniel 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 3:28">3:28</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:23">6:23</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God men akuragha ua me ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">Me an boroghɨn ikia an aven modi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:40">Ezɨ a gumazamizir kurabar dafaribar uam me inizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">me deraghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 37:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim osɨmtɨzim ikia, God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit kamaghɨn ifonge, God an osɨmtɨzibar gan dagh nɨghnɨgham. Kamaghɨn an onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ anɨngagharim ikɨ, egh nan ataran markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:1">Nɨ adarim nan ikɨ, egh nɨ ivezir kuram na danɨngan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2"/>Nɨ uan baribar na gasegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:2">na abɨrazɨ kɨ iraghu.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 38:2">Nɨ uan agharimɨn na mɨsoghezɨ, kɨ iraghu.<verse eid="PSA 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 33:19">Jop 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 32:4">Onger Akaba 32:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:10">102:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:6">Aisaia 1:6</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ adarim nan itima, kɨ mɨzazir ekiam isi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:3">Nan arazir kuram bangɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 38:3">nan namnam arɨmariam bar anevara.<verse eid="PSA 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 9:6">Esra 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:12">Onger Akaba 40:12</ref></char>
    </note>Nan arazir kuraba bar na avaragha gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:4">ezɨ osɨmtɨzir kaba mati kɨ bizir avɨrir maba ateri ezɨ da bar oseme.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 38:4">Ezɨ kamaghɨn, kɨ da ateran iburaghburaki.<verse eid="PSA 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5"/>Kɨ arazir onganir bar kuram gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:5">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nan mɨkarzimɨn itir duaba emimiziba ikia bar kuri.<verse eid="PSA 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6"/>Nan navir averiam osɨmtɨzir ekiam ikia, egha bar moghɨra na itaragha ghuaghiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:6">ezɨ kɨ nguazimɨn fuaghav iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 38:6">Kɨ dughiabar zurara a gɨnɨghnɨgha aziavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7"/>Nan mɨkarzim fei, mati avim nan mɨkarzimɨn isima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:7">arɨmariam bar na akuatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8"/>Arɨmariam bar guizbangɨra na akuatɨzɨ, kɨ onganigha bizitam gɨnɨghnɨzir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:8">Mati bizir mam nan navir averiamɨn ikia na dɨkabɨri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 38:8">Nan navir averiam osɨmtɨzir ekiam an itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:8">kɨ mɨzazim isava arai.<verse eid="PSA 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 6:6">Onger Akaba 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:17">10:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:5">102:5</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan ifongiar ekiam gɨfo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:9">Nan navir arerer kam nɨn modozir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10"/>Nan dɨghorim bar pamten nan ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:10">Nan gavgaviba gɨvazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 38:10">nan damazimning nan pɨrizɨ kɨ ua deragha garir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11"/>Ezɨ nan namakaba ko nan roroaba, me nan duabar ganan atiatigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:11">nan boroghɨn izan aghua.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 38:11">Nan adarazi uaghan nan saghon iti.<verse eid="PSA 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12"/>Gumazir na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasava amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">me na bagha azuazim guragha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 38:12">Gumazir na gasɨghasɨghasava amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">me zurara pazavɨra na damuasavɨra mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 38:12">Egha me dughiabar zurara na gasɨghasɨghasavɨra akabav sosi.<verse eid="PSA 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13"/>Kɨ gumazir kuarim onganizimɨn mɨn ikia, egha me barazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:13">Kɨ gumazir mɨgeir puvatɨzimɨn mɨn ikia, akam akarigha mɨgeir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14"/>Guizbangɨra, kɨ gumazir kuarir onganimɨn mɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:14">egha men akaba baragha da ikarvazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn ikia nɨ mɨzuai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:15">O Ekiam, nɨ nan God, nɨrara uabɨ nan mɨgɨrɨgɨaba ikarvagham.<verse eid="PSA 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16"/>Kɨ nɨn azangsɨsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 38:16">“Nan apaniba na abɨrazir bizir kam bagh bar akongeghsɨ, nɨ men amamangarɨghan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:16">Kɨ irɨzir bizir kam, me a mɨkɨm na dɨpova bar akongeghan markɨ.”<verse eid="PSA 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17"/>Nɨ fo, mɨzazir ekiar kam nan ikia kamaghɨra iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:17">ezɨ kamaghɨn kɨ irasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:5">Onger Akaba 32:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 7:9-10">2 Korin 7:9-10</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn uan arazir kurabar gun nɨ mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:18">da bar osɨmtɨzir ekiam nan navim ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19"/>Nan apanibar mɨkarziba bar deragha gavgafi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:19">Gumazir avɨriba pura nan apanim gamua nan aghua.<verse eid="PSA 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20"/>Kɨ arazir aghuibar me gamima, me arazir kurabar na ikarvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">Kɨ arazir aghuimɨn gɨn zui, ezɨ me bizir kam bagha nan apanim gami.<verse eid="PSA 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">38:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:19">Onger Akaba 22:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:22">35:22</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ na ataghɨraghan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:21">Nɨ nan God, nɨ nan saghon ikian markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22"/>O Ekiam, nɨ nan Akurvazir Gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:22">Nɨ zuamɨra na bagh izɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 38:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir osɨmtɨzim itimɨn akam</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">An onger akar kamɨn faragha zuir gumazim Jedutun gɨnɨghnɨgha onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 141:3">Onger Akaba 141:3</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:5">Kolosi 4:5</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 3:2">Jems 3:2</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uabɨra uabɨ mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:1">“Kɨ amir araziba bagh deravɨra uabɨn ganam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">Kɨ uan mɨzem bagh deraghvɨra gantɨ, a na isɨ arazir kuratam datɨghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 39:1">Gumazir kuraba na ko ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 39:1">kɨ mɨzer otuaritam mɨkɨman kogham.”<verse eid="PSA 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2"/>Kɨ bar nɨmɨra ikia, egha bizir aghuitam bar a mɨgeir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:2">Kamaghɨn, nan osɨmtɨzim bar ekevegha ghuavanabo.<verse eid="PSA 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3"/>Kɨ bizir kam dughiabar zurarama a gɨnɨghnɨghavɨra ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:3">nan navir averiam osɨmtɨzim a gizɨvavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 39:3">Ezɨ kɨ mɨgɨa ghaze,<verse eid="PSA 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 90:12">Onger Akaba 90:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan ikɨrɨmɨrimɨn dughiamɨn ruarim nan akagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">Kɨ dughiar manamrama ovengam?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:4">Nɨ na mɨkemegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">kɨ nguazir kamɨn ikiamin ikɨrɨmɨrim a ruara, o an otefe?”<verse eid="PSA 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">39:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:9">Onger Akaba 62:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:4">90:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 144:4">144:4</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ ti nan ikɨrɨmɨrimɨn dughiabagh amizɨ da bar otefe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">Nan ikɨrɨmɨrimɨn dughiar kam nɨn damazimɨn a pura bizimɨn oto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">Gumazamiziba bar, men ikɨrɨmɨrim mati gumazim akamɨn amɨnim giverazɨ a zui.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 39:5">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6"/>Gumazamiziba bar, men ikɨrɨmɨrim mati aruem temem gisirazɨ an nedazim otogha iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">Egha me bizir avɨriba iniasa puvɨra ingari, ezɨ men ingangarir kaba pura zui.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:6">Gumazamiziba angamɨra ikia bizir avɨriba uari bagha da akuva, egha fozir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">men ovevemɨn gɨn tinara da iniam.<verse eid="PSA 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7"/>O Ekiam, kɨ datɨrɨghɨn ua tina mɨzuamam? Puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:7">Nan nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨrara ikɨtɨ, kɨ zurara nɨ mɨzuamam.<verse eid="PSA 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8"/>Nɨ nan arazir kuraba gɨn amadagh, egh uam na inigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:8">Nɨ gumazir kurar onganibar amamangatɨghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 39:8">me na dɨpova nan ingarvakan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9"/>Nɨ uabɨ osɨmtɨzir kam na ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:9">Ezɨ kamaghɨn, kɨ akam akarigh bizitam mɨkɨman kogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 39:9">Kɨ uan akam dukuagh pura ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10"/>Nɨ ivezir kuram isɨ na danɨngvɨra ikian markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:10">Nɨ mɨzazim na gasezɨ kɨ atam areme.<verse eid="PSA 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11"/>Nɨ gumazimɨn arazir kuram ikarvagha osɨmtɨzim a ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">Egha bizir a ifongeziba, nɨ bar dagh asɨghasɨsi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 39:11">mati barereba ko omebaba da apima da mazava akuaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">Bar guizbangɨra, gumazimɨn ikɨrɨmɨrim mati amɨnim varagha ghu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 39:11">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan azangsɨziba baragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">Egh nan ararem baregh nan akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 39:12">Nan temeriba irir dughiar kam, nɨ kuarim atɨgh na baragh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:12">Nɨ fo, nan ovaviba dughiar otevimɨn nguazir kamɨn ikezɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">kɨ uaghan dughiar otevimɨn nguazir kamɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13"/>Nɨ ivezir kuram ua na danɨngan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:13">Nɨ na ateghtɨ kɨ uabɨra ikɨtɨ, nan navim tong deraka.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 39:13">Egh kɨ gɨn ovegh nguazim bar anetaghɨragham.<verse eid="PSA 39:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn ziam fer onger akam</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">An onger akar kabar faragha zuir gumazim gɨnɨghnɨgha onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1"/>Kɨ dughiar bar ruarimɨn Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨzua itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:1">a nan ararem baregha nan akura.<verse eid="PSA 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 27:5">Onger Akaba 27:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:2">69:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">Jeremaia 38:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:10-13">38:10-13</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ mati gumazim torir konimɨn aven ikia oveghasava amima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">Ikiavɨra Itir God nan suiragha na gekuigha anabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:2">Mati kɨ beghneazim bar a giraghugha an aven itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">a ua na asigha dagɨar ekiam gisɨn na afazɨ, kɨ gavgavim inigha tu.<verse eid="PSA 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:7">Onger Akaba 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:3">33:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 64:9">64:9</ref></char>
    </note>An onger akar igiar mam nan akam gatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">Kar onger akar e uan Godɨn ziam famim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:3">Gumazamizir avɨrim kamaghɨn ganigh atiatigh an apengan ikɨsɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 84:12">Onger Akaba 84:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 125:5">125:5</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn itiba, me bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">Gumazamizir kaba, me gumazir uari uan ziaba febar gɨn zuir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 40:4">uamategha asebar ziaba fer puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 71:15">Onger Akaba 71:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:17-18">139:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:8-9">Aisaia 55:8-9</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan God, nɨ bizir aghuir bar avɨriba e bagha dagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">Gumazitam nɨn mɨn amir puvatɨ, nɨ bar me gafira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:5">Nɨ e bagha bizir aghuir avɨribagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">Dar dɨbobonim bar ghuavanabozɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 40:5">kɨ da mengan ibura.<verse eid="PSA 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:11">Aisaia 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 6:20">Jeremaia 6:20</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:6-8">Maika 6:6-8</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:6-8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 10:5-7">Hibru 10:5-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Asɨzir e mɨsogha nɨ bagha ofa gamiba ko, bizir aghuir e ofan mɨn isa nɨ ganɨdiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">nɨ dar aghua.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:6">Asɨzir e nɨ bagha avimɨn tuazɨ bar isigha mɨghɨriziba ko, arazir kuraba gɨn amangamin ofaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">nɨ dar aghua.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:6">Nɨn ifongiamra kara, nɨ nan nɨghnɨzim kuightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">kɨ nɨn akaba baragh dagh fogh dar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7"/>Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:7">“God, kɨra kara. Moses fomɨra nan gun Akɨnafarir rɨghizimɨn aven osirizɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 40:7">kɨ datɨrɨghɨn izegha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:31">Onger Akaba 37:31</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:3">2 Korin 3:3</ref></char>
    </note>O nan God, kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgaviba uan navimɨn aven ada arigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:8">nɨn ifongiamɨn gɨn mangasa bar ifonge.”<verse eid="PSA 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamiziba uari akuva nɨn ziam fer danganimɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">nɨ en akurazir akar aghuir kam, kɨ an gun me mɨkemegha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 40:9">Nɨ fo, kɨ me mɨkɨm mangɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 89:1">Onger Akaba 89:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:20">Aposel 20:20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:27">20:27</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ en akuragha ua e inizir bizir aghuir kam, kɨ a modozɨ a narara itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">Kɨ gumazamiziba uari akuvir danganibar kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:10">Nɨ zurara en apangkufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">egha mɨkemezɨ moghɨra deragha bizibagh amua, uan nɨghnɨzim gɨghavkɨrir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ fo, nɨ nan apangkuvir arazir kam, nɨ anegɨvaghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:11">Nɨ zurara uan guizɨn akamɨn gɨn mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 40:11">na gifongezir arazir kam bagh na geghuv nan akurvagham.<verse eid="PSA 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa Godɨn azai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 70">Onger Akaba 70</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">40:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:5">Onger Akaba 18:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 38:4">38:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 65:3">65:3</ref></char>
    </note>Guizbangɨra, arazir kurar bar avɨrim na okarigha itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">kɨ da mengan iburaghburaki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:12">Nan arazir kuraba bar na abɨragha gɨvazɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">kɨ ua garir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:12">Dar dɨbobonim bar nan dapanir arɨzibar dɨbobonim gafirazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">nan navim bar nan amɨrazɨ kɨ gavgaviba puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ ifuegh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:13">zuamɨra izɨ nan akuragh!<verse eid="PSA 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14"/>Gumazamizir maba na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">Eghtɨ nɨ me abɨnigh men nɨghnɨziba aghamsightɨ, me aghumsika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:14">Osɨmtɨzir kɨ isiba, gumazamizir maba dar gara bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">Nɨ men ziaba abɨnigh me batueghtɨ me mangɨ.<verse eid="PSA 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15"/>Gumazir maba na mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:15">“A mara! Nɨ magh a baragh!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:15">Nɨ me damightɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 40:15">me amir arazir kam bagh aghumsɨzir dafam inigh.<verse eid="PSA 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16"/>Gumazamizir nɨ bagha iziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">men naviba deraghtɨ, me nɨ bagh bar akongegham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:16">Gumazamizir nɨn akurvazim iniasa bar ifongeziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">me zurara nɨ mɨnabɨva kamaghɨn mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 40:16">“Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 40:16">a bar ekevegha bar pɨn iti!”<verse eid="PSA 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17"/>Kɨrara, kɨ gavgaviba puvatɨgha uabɨra uabɨn akurvaghan iburaghburaki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">Ezɨ Ekiam na gɨnɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:17">O nan God, nɨ uabɨ nan akuragha ua na ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">Nɨ suighsuighan markɨ, nɨ zuamɨra izɨ nan akuragh!<verse eid="PSA 40:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim arɨava uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">An onger akar kabar faragha zuir gumazim gɨnɨghnɨgha onger akam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 14:21">Aghuzir Akaba 14:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazir onganarazibagh amir gumazamizibagh nɨghnɨgha men akurvazim, a bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:1">Guizbangɨra, an osɨmtɨzim ikiamin dughiamɨn Ikiavɨra Itir God an akurvagham.<verse eid="PSA 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 27:12">Onger Akaba 27:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God deragh a geghuv an gantɨ, an angamɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">A uan nguazimɨn ikɨtɨ, Ikiavɨra Itir God bar deragh a damuam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 41:2">God aneteghtɨ apaniba uan ifongiamɨn gɨn mangɨ anebɨraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3"/>Gumazir kam arɨmamin dughiamɨn, Ikiavɨra Itir God a ko ikɨ gavgavim a danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:3">Egh an arɨmariam damightɨ, a deragh ghuamaghegham.<verse eid="PSA 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4"/>Ezɨ kɨ uabɨ, nan mɨgɨrɨgɨam kamakɨn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 41:4">“O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨn akam batuegha arazir kuram gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:4">Eghtɨ nɨ nan apangkuvigh nan arɨmariam agɨfagh.”<verse eid="PSA 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5"/>Nan apanibar naviba nan ikuvigha na dɨpova kamaghɨn mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 41:5">“A zuamɨra aremeghtɨ deragham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:5">eghtɨ e ua a gɨnɨghnɨghan kogham.”<verse eid="PSA 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6"/>Gumazir iza nan garir maba, me ifara pura mɨgɨrɨgɨar kɨnibar na mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">Me na mɨkɨm nan azang kamaghɨn foghasa, kɨ arɨmariar kuram iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 41:6">Egh azenan danganiba bar dar mangɨ nan arɨmariamɨn gun me mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7"/>Apaniba bar na gifongezir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:7">egha nan arɨmariamɨn gun aghumra uarira uari geghari.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 41:7">Me kamagh nɨghnɨsi, bizir kuram na gasɨghasigham.<verse eid="PSA 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8"/>Me kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 41:8">“Bizir bar kuram a inigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:8">A uan mɨsiar irɨghav itim ategh dɨkavighan kogham.”<verse eid="PSA 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 15:12">2 Samuel 15:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 55:12-13">Onger Akaba 55:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 55:20">55:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:10">Jeremaia 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:23">Matyu 26:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:20">Mak 14:20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21">Luk 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Jon 13:18</ref></char>
    </note>Nan roroar aghuim, kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">Gumazir na ko dagheba apim, nan apanimɨn oto.<verse eid="PSA 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan kuarkuvigh egh nan arɨmariam agɨfagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:10">Eghtɨ kɨ gumazir kabar arazir kurar kam ikaraka.<verse eid="PSA 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11"/>Apaniba na abɨraghan koghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:11">kɨ fogh suam, nɨ bar na gifonge.<verse eid="PSA 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12"/>Nɨ nan gari, nan daroriba nɨn damazimɨn dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:12">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ ua na inigh nan suiraghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 41:12">kɨ nɨn boroghɨn ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">41:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:48">Onger Akaba 106:48</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam, a Israelian God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:13">Eghtɨ gɨn otivamin ovaviba bar, me uaghan an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 41:13">Guizbangɨra!</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 41:13">Bar guizbangɨra!<verse eid="PSA 41:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42"/>
  <para style="ms">Akɨnafarir namba 2</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 42-72">Onger Akaba 42--72</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uan nguibam ategha saghon ikia God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Koran adarazir onger akam.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akar kamɨn faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha onger akam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamagh a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:131">Onger Akaba 119:131</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Asɨzir atiam dɨpatam amasa ariaghira ivemara daghurir muziaribar uaghiri moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:1">O God, kɨ nɨn boroghɨn ikiasa bar ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 42:11">Onger Akaba 42:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 43:5">43:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 63:1">63:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 143:6">143:6</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ Godɨn Angamɨra Itim, kɨ nɨ bagha kuarim bar puvɨra nan pɨri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:2">mati gumazim kuarim an pɨrizɨ a dɨpatam amasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:2">God, dughiar manamra kɨ bar nɨn boroghɨra mangɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:2">egh nɨn ziam fam?<verse eid="PSA 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 80:5">Onger Akaba 80:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ zurara arueba ko dɨmagaribar aziavɨra iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">ezɨ nan temeriba mati nan dagher kɨ zurarama apim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:3">Dughiabar zurara gumazamiziba nan azangsɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">“Nɨn God managh iti?”<verse eid="PSA 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:15">1 Samuel 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 95:2">Onger Akaba 95:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:4">100:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:29">Aisaia 30:29</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ fomɨra gumazamizir avɨrimɨn faragha ghua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">me inigha Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven ghu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:4">Kɨ me ko zuir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">gumazamizir avɨrir kam Godɨn ziam fa a mɨnabava pamten tiariba akara onger akabagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 42:4">Kɨ bizir kabagh nɨghnɨgha egha nan navim bar moghɨra biaghɨrɨ.<verse eid="PSA 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:1">Onger Akaba 9:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 38:6">38:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:38">Matyu 26:38</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven uabɨra uabɨn azangsɨgha ghaze, kɨ tizim bagha bar oseme?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">Kɨ osɨman kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:5">Kamaghɨn dera, kɨ ua nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn ikɨva, uam an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">Nan God, a nan Akurvazir Gumazim.<verse eid="PSA 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6-7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:6-7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:1-2">Onger Akaba 69:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:7">88:7</ref>; <ref loc="JON 2:3">Jona 2:3</ref></char>
    </note>Nan God, kɨ orazi osɨmtɨziba aperiamɨn mɨn afora na bagha izi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6-7">Mati dɨpav sɨzim Jordanɨn Fanem ko Hermon ko Misan mɨghsɨamningɨn ikegha afora nɨga izaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:6-7">Ongarir konim, ongarir bar konezimɨn diava a mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6-7">Ezɨ dɨpar dagɨabar zaghiriba nɨgɨnir dafam gami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:6-7">Nɨ ongarim gamima, a dɨkava dɨpɨraghira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6-7">ghua bar ongarir dadaribar ghuavanadi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:6-7">Kamaghɨra, osɨmtɨzir nɨ na ganɨdir kaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6-7">mati dɨpav sɨziba iza na mɨsogha na ave.<verse eid="PSA 42:6-7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">42:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:7">Onger Akaba 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 57:3">57:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 63:6">63:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 149:5">149:5</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ kamaghsua ifonge, Ikiavɨra Itir God aruemɨn nan apangkuvtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">kɨ dɨmagaribar a bagh onger akabar amuva a ko mɨkɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 42:8">A Godɨn ikɨrɨmɨrir aghuim na ganɨdim.<verse eid="PSA 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9"/>God, a dagɨar ekiamɨn mɨn gavgavim na ganɨdi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">ezɨ kɨ kamaghɨn a mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:9">“Nɨ manmaghsua na gɨnɨghnɨzir puvatɨ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">Nɨ manmaghsua nan apaniba ataghizɨ me na abɨrazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 42:9">nan navir averiam bar na baseme?”<verse eid="PSA 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10"/>Dughiabar zurara nan apaniba na dɨpova nan azangsɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:10">“Nɨn God a managhɨra iti?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:10">Ezɨ men azangsɨzir kam afuzimɨn mɨn nan mɨkarzim ginivima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 42:10">kɨ aremeghasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 42:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11"/>Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven uabɨra uabɨn azangsɨgha ghaze, kɨ tizim bagha bar oseme?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">Kɨ osɨman kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:11">Kamaghɨn deragham, kɨ ua nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn ikɨva, uam an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">Nan God, a nan Akurvazir Gumazim.<verse eid="PSA 42:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uan nguibam ategha saghon itir kantrin ikia God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 24:15">1 Samuel 24:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 5:6">Onger Akaba 5:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 26:1">26:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 38:12">38:12</ref></char>
    </note>O God, gumazamizir akɨrim ragha nɨ gasiba na abɨnasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">Nɨ nan akuragh gavgavim isɨ nan akabar anɨng, egh na bagh mɨkɨmtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 43:1">me kamaghɨn fogham, kɨ arazir kuratam gamizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">Nɨ gumazir ifara arazir kurabagh amibar dafaribar nan akuragh ua na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 43:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2"/>O God, kɨ nɨ baghavɨra zuima nɨ na modi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">Nɨ manmaghsua nan aghuagha na batoke?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:2">Manmaghsua nan apaniba na abɨrazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">nan navim osemegha kamaghɨra iti?<verse eid="PSA 43:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">43:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:9">Onger Akaba 36:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ uan guizɨn akam amadagh uan angazangarim akaghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">aning tuavim nan akagh uam na inigh Saionɨn Mɨghsɨar nɨ ua bagha inabazimɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 43:3">Dɨpenir nɨ uabɨ itimɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4"/>O God, nɨ nan God, nɨrara nan navim gamima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">a derazɨ kɨ bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:4">Kɨ nɨn ofa gamir dakozimɨn mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">egh uan gita mɨsogh nɨn ziar ekiam fam.<verse eid="PSA 43:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5"/>Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven uabɨra uabɨn azangsɨgha ghaze, kɨ tizim bagha bar oseme?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">Kɨ osɨman kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:5">Kamaghɨn deragham, kɨ ua nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn ikɨva, uam an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">A nan God, a nan Akurvazir Gumazim.<verse eid="PSA 43:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44"/>
  <para style="s">Apaniba paza Israelia gamima, me uarir akurvaghasa Godɨn azangsɨsi</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Koran adarazir onger akam.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akar kamɨn faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha an osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamagh a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:26-27">Ua Me Ini 12:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:3">Onger Akaba 78:3</ref></char>
    </note>O God, e uan kuarir toribar orazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">en inazir afeziaba bizir ekiar nɨ men dughiamɨn fomɨra me bagha amizibar e geghani.<verse eid="PSA 44:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:55">Onger Akaba 78:55</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 80:8">80:8</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ uabɨ uan gavgavimɨn ikɨzir igharazibar gumazamizibar nguazimɨn me batuegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">uan gumazamiziba isa nguazir kamɨn me arɨghizɨ me gavgavigha iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:2">Nɨ ivezir kuram isa Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibagh anɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">Egha en inazir afeziabagh amizɨ, me deravɨra ikia borir bar avɨriba bate.<verse eid="PSA 44:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:17">Godɨn Araziba 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:12">Josua 24:12</ref></char>
    </note>En inazir afeziaba uan mɨdorozir sababar mɨdorozim gamua nguazir kam inizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">Me uan agharibar mɨsogha uan gavgavibar apaniba abɨrazir pu.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 44:3">Bar puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:3">Nɨ uabɨ me gifongegha me ko itima, nɨn angazangarimɨn gavgavim me gisirazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">me nɨn gavgavimra, uan apaniba abɨni.<verse eid="PSA 44:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4"/>Nɨ nan atrivim ko nan God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:4">Nɨ Akar Gavgavim anɨngizɨma, Jekopɨn adarazi uan apanibav sogha me abɨri.<verse eid="PSA 44:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5"/>E nɨn gavgavimɨn amodoghɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:5">e uan apanibav sogha me abɨra.<verse eid="PSA 44:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:16">Onger Akaba 33:16</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:7">Hosea 1:7</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim uan barir pim ko baribar itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:6">Da nan akuraghtɨ kɨ uan apaniba abɨraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7"/>Nɨrara en akurazɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:7">en apaniba e mɨsogha e abɨrazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:7">En aghuazir gumaziba, nɨ me abɨrazɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:7">me aghumsɨgha okam nɨghnɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 44:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8"/>O God, nɨrara e nɨn ziam fɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:8">egh nɨ mɨnabɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 44:8">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 44:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9"/>Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn manmaghsua akɨrim ragha e gasara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:9">Kamaghɨn en apaniba uam e abɨrima, e aghumsɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:9">En mɨdorozir gumaziba mɨsoghasa zuima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:9">nɨ ua me ko zuir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 44:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10"/>Nɨ kamaghɨn e gamizɨ, e uan apanibar atiatigha are.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:10">Ezɨ en apaniba uari bagha bar en biziba ini.<verse eid="PSA 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11"/>Nɨ e ataghizɨ, e sipsipɨn me mɨsueghtɨ aremeghamibar mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:11">Nɨ en nguazimɨn e batuegha e amangizɨ, e tintinibar ghua</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 44:11">Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar tongɨn pura iti.<verse eid="PSA 44:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12"/>Nɨ uan gumazamiziba isa gumazir igharaziba pura ingangarir gumazir kɨnibar ikiasa me amangizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:12">gumazir kaba dagɨar ekiatamɨn me givezezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 44:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13"/>Nɨ kamaghɨn e gamizɨ, en boroghɨn itir darasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:13">dɨbovir akabar e mɨgɨa en ingaravati.<verse eid="PSA 44:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14"/>Bizir nɨ e gamizir kamɨn eghaghanim otozɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:14">Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba a baregha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 44:14">dapaniba roa aghumsɨzir akabar e mɨgɨa en ingaravati.<verse eid="PSA 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15-16"/>Kɨ zurara orazima, gumaziba dɨbovir akabar na mɨgɨa aghumsɨzim na ganɨga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:15-16">bar akar kurabar na mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:15-16">Kɨ uaghan zurara garima, apaniba ko gumazir ivezir kuram na danɨngasava amiba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:15-16">mɨzazim na gasi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 44:15-16">Kamaghɨn amizɨ kɨ zurara aghumsɨzir bar dafam isima a bar nan avara.<verse eid="PSA 44:15-16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17"/>O God, en nɨghnɨzimɨn, e nɨ ataghizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">Nɨn Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim, e anebɨghizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 44:17">Ezɨ bizir kurar kaba e batifi.<verse eid="PSA 44:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 23:11">Jop 23:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E akɨrim ragha nɨ gasarazir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:18">egha nɨn tuavim ataghizir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 44:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 23:4">Onger Akaba 23:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ guizbangɨra e abɨra, mati nɨ asɨzir atiaba itir danganimɨn e ataghizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:19">e akurvaziba puvatɨgha uarira iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 44:19">Nɨ mɨtarmer bar ekiamɨn e avarazɨ e an aven iti.<verse eid="PSA 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20-21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:20-21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 139:1">Onger Akaba 139:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Jeremaia 17:10</ref></char>
    </note>O en God, e nɨn ziam fan koghɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:20-21">godɨn ifavaribar ziaba fɨtɨ nɨ fogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:20-21">Nɨ guizbangɨra gumazibar navir averiabar itir nɨghnɨzir mogomeba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:20-21">nɨ bar dagh fogha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 44:20-21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:36">Rom 8:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E nɨn gɨn zui, ezɨ bizir kam bangɨn me zurara e mɨsozima e ariaghirasava ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:22">Me kamaghɨn nɨghnɨgha ghaze, e mati sipsipɨn gumaziba mɨsueghtɨ aremeghasavɨrama amibar mɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 44:22">me e mɨsoghasa.<verse eid="PSA 44:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">44:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 35:23">Onger Akaba 35:23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:65">78:65</ref></char>
    </note>O Ekiam, nɨ manmaghɨn amigha akuavɨra iti?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:23">Nɨ osegh dɨkafigh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 44:23">Nɨ akɨrim ragh e gasaraghvɨra ikian markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24"/>Nɨ manmaghsua uan guam bar en modo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:24">Egha apaniba pazavɨra e gamir araziba ko mɨzazir e isir kabar garir puvatɨ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 44:24">Nɨ en osɨmtɨzim bakɨnɨghnɨghan markɨ!<verse eid="PSA 44:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25"/>E nguazim gisɨn daghirezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:25">en mɨkarziba mati gumaziba ariaghiregha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 44:25">nguazim gireghav iti.<verse eid="PSA 44:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26"/>O God, nɨ uan apangkuvir arazim gɨnɨghnɨgh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:26">dɨkavigh izɨ en akuragh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 44:26">egh uam e inightɨ e arɨmɨghiran kogham.<verse eid="PSA 44:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45"/>
  <para style="s">Atrivim amuimɨn ikiamim dughiamɨn onger akam</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Koran adarazir onger akam.</para>
  <para style="d">Kar, gumazim amizim gifongezir ighiam.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akar kabar faragha zuim gumazibav gɨa ghaze, me Akɨmarir Aghuibar tiarimɨn gɨn mangɨ, ighiar kam bangɨ.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamagh a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1"/>Mɨgɨrɨgɨar aghuir avɨrir maba nan nɨghnɨzimɨn izi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">Kɨ onger akar kam osirightɨ me atrivim bagh a dɨponam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:1">Nan mɨzem mati fɨnfɨnim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">a gumazir akɨnafariba osira fofozimɨn mɨn ikia onger akar kam osiri.<verse eid="PSA 45:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2"/>O atrivim, nɨ gumazir ganganir aghuim gamim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">Gumazir igharazitam nɨn mɨn garir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:2">Mɨgɨrɨgɨar nɨn akamɨn otiviba bar deravɨra zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">Ezɨ God deragha nɨ gamua mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 45:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3"/>Nɨ atrivir bar gavgavim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:3">Nɨ adiarir bar aghuim gamizɨ nɨn ziam bar pɨn mar iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:3">Nɨ uan mɨdorozir sabam inigh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:3">uan oghɨriam gikegh mɨsoghsɨ gan.<verse eid="PSA 45:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4"/>Nɨ atriviba bar dar faragha ghua ziar ekiam iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">Nɨ guizɨn akam ko arazir aghuim baghavɨra mɨsoghasa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 45:4">uan hoziam gaperagha ghua mɨsogha uan apaniba abɨra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:4">Eghtɨ nɨn mɨdorozir arazim gavgavim sara mangɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">gumazir kuraba bar nɨn atiatigham.<verse eid="PSA 45:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5"/>Nɨn bariba bar ghumigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:5">apanibar dɨghoriba okorava aven zui.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:5">Nɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibav sogha me abɨrima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:5">me nɨn suemningɨn apengan iti.<verse eid="PSA 45:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 93:2">Onger Akaba 93:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:9">98:9</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:6-7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 1:8-9">Hibru 1:8-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨn atrivir dabirabir God nɨ ganɨngizim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:6">a zurara ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:6">Eghtɨ nɨ guizɨn arazimɨn uan gumazamizibagh ativagh men ganam.<verse eid="PSA 45:6"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 11:7">Onger Akaba 11:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ arazir aghuibara ifuegha, arazir kuraba bar dar aghua.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:7">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, God nɨ amɨsevegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">nɨ ziar ekiam ikiasa a borem nɨn dapanim ginge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:7">A kamaghɨn nɨ gamizɨ nɨ bar akonge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">ezɨ nɨ bar akongezir bizir kam, atrivir igharaziba bar me gafira.<verse eid="PSA 45:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8"/>Mea ko kasia ko alo, dar mughuriar aghuim, nɨn korotiar ruarimɨn ikia mughuriar aghuim zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">Me elefanɨn ataribar dɨgɨrir igharagha garibar ingarigha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 45:8">atrivir dɨpenim asigha nɨ bar akueghasa me gitabagh ikiararai.<verse eid="PSA 45:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9"/>Atrivibar guivir maba, me nɨn ziaba itir amizibar tongɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">nɨn dɨpenimɨn aven iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:9">Ezɨ amizir igiar nɨn amuimɨn otoghamim, a nɨn agharir guvimɨn tughav iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">A Ofirɨn kantrin golɨn asɨngizir korotiar aghuim arugha tughav iti.<verse eid="PSA 45:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10"/>Amizir igiar atrivimɨn ikiasava amim, kɨ datɨrɨghɨn a mɨkɨmasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:10">O guivim, nɨ kuarim atɨgh deragh nan mɨgɨrɨgɨaba baragh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 45:10">Nɨ uan nguibamɨn gumazamiziba ko, nɨn afeziamɨn dɨpenimɨn itir darazi gɨn amadagh.<verse eid="PSA 45:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11"/>Nɨ kamaghɨn damuva atrivimɨn damazimɨn ganganir bar aghuim damutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:11">a nɨn gan nɨ gifuegham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:11">A nɨn gumazir ekiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:11">nɨ an akaba baragh dar gɨn mangɨ.<verse eid="PSA 45:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12"/>Tairɨn kantrin gumazamiziba nɨ bagh bizir aghuiba inigh izɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:12">dagɨar avɨriba itir gumaziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 45:12">nɨ me gɨnɨghnɨghsɨ me uaghan dagɨaba nɨ danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 45:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13"/>Atrivimɨn amuir bar igiam, an akua itir danganimra ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:13">ganganiba bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 45:13">A korotiar me tret golɨn nuavigha kurkezim aru.<verse eid="PSA 45:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14"/>Korotiar an aruzir kam dirir bar avɨriba iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">ezɨ me an akua atrivim bagha zui.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:14">A zuima an namakar amizir igiaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">me uaghan an akua zui.<verse eid="PSA 45:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15"/>Men naviba men derazɨ me bar akuegha ghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:15">atrivimɨn dɨpenimɨn aven zui.<verse eid="PSA 45:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16"/>O atrivim, nɨ datɨrɨghɨn otarir avɨriba ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:16">me nɨn inazibar danganiba inigh atrivibar ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:16">Nɨ me damightɨ me ziar ekiam ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:16">nguazir kamɨn gumazamiziba bar me gativagh men ganam.<verse eid="PSA 45:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">45:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 138:4">Onger Akaba 138:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:11">Malakai 1:11</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨn ziar ekiamɨn gun mɨkɨmtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:17">gumazamizir gɨn otivamiba nɨ gɨnɨghnɨghvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 45:17">Eghtɨ dughiar gɨn izamiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:17">gumazamiziba zurara nɨn ziam fɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 45:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46"/>
  <para style="s">God e ko iti</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Koran adarazir onger akam.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akar kamɨn faragha zuim gumazamizibav kemezɨ, me ighiar ziam “Amizir Igiaba,” an tiarimɨn a bange.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:7-8">Onger Akaba 62:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:2">91:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 142:5">142:5</ref></char>
    </note>God en danganir mogomemɨn mɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:1">e akumakua deragha en gara, gavgavim zurarama e ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 46:1">Dughiar e osɨmtɨzir ekiabar aven itibar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:1">a en akurvaghasa gara iti.<verse eid="PSA 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2"/>Mɨkɨmkɨziba otivtɨ, mɨghsɨaba dɨpɨrighɨrɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:2">ongarir torimɨn magɨrɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 46:2">e atiatingan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 93:3-4">Onger Akaba 93:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:22">Jeremaia 5:22</ref></char>
    </note>Ongarim dɨkav pamten dɨpɨrighɨrɨ mangɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:3">mɨghsɨabav soghtɨ, da nuighnuigham,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 46:3">eghtɨ e akongan kogham.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 46:3">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 48:1">Onger Akaba 48:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:8">48:8</ref></char>
    </note>Godɨn Nguibam, a Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim ua bagh a ginaba, egha an aven iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:4">Ezɨ faner bar ekiar mam an torimɨn ivemarima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 46:4">gumazamiziba dɨpar kam bagha bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 8:3">Sekaraia 8:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>God Nguibar kamɨn aven iti, ezɨ Nguibar kam ikuvighan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:5">Amɨnim tɨghar tisɨ damutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 46:5">God an akuragham.<verse eid="PSA 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 2:9">Josua 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 2:24">2:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:1">Onger Akaba 2:1</ref></char>
    </note>Kantrin avɨribar gumazamiziba dɨgavir kuram damigh uarira uariv sogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">Eghtɨ atriviba uan gumazamiziba ko bar iregham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 46:6">Eghtɨ Godɨn tiarim ararimɨn mɨn dagaraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">nguazim puram ameregh magɨram.<verse eid="PSA 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim, an e ko iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:7">A Jekopɨn God,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 46:7">a en danganir mogomem.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 46:7">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8"/>Aria! Ia izɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God amizir bizibar ganigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:8">A nguazimɨn amizir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 46:8">ia dar gan dɨgavir kurabar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9"/>A nguazimɨn oteviba bar dar mɨdoroziba agefi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">Egha barir piba ko afuzibar suigha da apɨragharigha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 46:9">oraba aviba dagh arɨzi da isi.<verse eid="PSA 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">46:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 4:35">Godɨn Araziba 4:35</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:36-39">1 Atriviba 18:36-39</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:11">Aisaia 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:17">2:17</ref></char>
    </note>A kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze, “Ia uarir asugh nɨmɨra ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">Egh deragh na gɨfogh, kɨ guizbangɨra God.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 46:10">Kantriba bar nan ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">Nguazir kamɨn itir gumazamiziba bar kamaghɨn mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 46:10">Kɨrara kɨ ekevegha bar pɨn iti.”<verse eid="PSA 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim, an e ko iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:11">A Jekopɨn God,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 46:11">a en danganir mogomem.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 46:11">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 46:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47"/>
  <para style="s">God gumazamiziba bar men atrivimɨn iti</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Koran adarazir onger akam.</para>
  <para style="d">Kar gumazir onger akar kamɨn faragha zuimɨn onger akam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1"/>Ia gumazamiziba bar, ia God bagh bar akongegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">egh uan dafaribav sogh pamtem dɨmɨva</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 47:1">onger akabar amuva an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:2">an atrivir ekiamɨn ikia nguazir kam gativagha an gari.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 47:2">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, e bar an atiatiava an apengan iti.<verse eid="PSA 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3"/>God ikɨzir igharaziba bar me abɨrazɨ, e me gatifa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:3">A Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibagh amizɨ, me en apengan iti.<verse eid="PSA 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4"/>E Jekopɨn ovavir boriba, ezɨ God bar e gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:4">God Kenanɨn nguazim e bagh a ginabagha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 47:4">a isa e ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 47:4">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5"/>God uan Nguibamɨn ghuavanangamin dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:5">gumazamiziba bar akuegha tiariba akari,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 47:5">ezɨ sɨghabagh ivir gumaziba dagh ivi.<verse eid="PSA 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6"/>E God bagh ongɨva an ziam fam!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:6">A en atrivim, e a bagh ighiabar amuva</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 47:6">ziar ekiam a danɨngam!<verse eid="PSA 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7"/>God, a nguazimɨn itir gumazamiziba bar men atrivim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:7">E a bagh ongɨva an ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 47:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8"/>God uan atrivir dabirabim gaperagha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:8">nguazir kamɨn itir kantriba bar dagh ativagha dar gari.<verse eid="PSA 47:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9"/>Gumazamizibar gumazir dapaniba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">me Abrahamɨn Godɨn gɨn zuir gumazamiziba ko uari akuvagh ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 47:9">Nguazimɨn itir atriviba bar men mɨdorozir gumazibar oraba, da bar Godɨn biziba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">Eghtɨ me bar an ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 47:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48"/>
  <para style="s">Saionɨn nguibam, ziar ekiam ikɨ egh ikɨvɨra ikiam</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Koran adarazir onger akam.</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Godɨn ziam fer onger akam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, ziar ekiam iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:1">E Godɨn mɨghsɨamɨn ghuavanang,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 48:1">egh an nguibar ekiamɨn aven mangɨ an ziar ekiam pɨrafam.<verse eid="PSA 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:35">Matyu 5:35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Saionɨn Mɨghsɨar kam, an ganganim bar deragha bar pɨn mar iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">A notɨn amadaghan iti, ezɨ atrivir ekiamɨn nguibam an iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 48:2">Ezɨ nguazimɨn gumazamiziba mɨghsɨar kam bagha bar ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3"/>God nguibar kamɨn ikia, mɨdorozibar dughiabar uan gumazamizibagh eghuva men akurvazima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:3">me deravɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4"/>Atriviba uan mɨdorozir gumaziba ko uari akuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:4">Saionɨn nguibam ko mɨsoghasa izi.<verse eid="PSA 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5"/>Me iza nguibamɨn gara atiatim men anadima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:5">me agoava ara zui.<verse eid="PSA 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:15">Ua Me Ini 15:15</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:13">Hosea 13:13</ref></char>
    </note>Me nguibamɨn gara nɨghava agoa mɨzazim isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:6">mati amizim borim batasa mɨzazim isi.<verse eid="PSA 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7"/>Amɨnir ekiam aruem anadi naghɨn ikegha iza, Tarsisɨn nguibamɨn kuribagh asɨghasɨzi moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:7">nɨ me gasɨghasɨkigh.<verse eid="PSA 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8"/>God fomɨra amizir bizibar akaba, e pura da baraki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">E datɨrɨghɨn uan damazibar uan Godɨn Nguibamɨn ikia garima, a bizir kabagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:8">A Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">kamaghɨn a uan nguibamɨn gara gavgavim isa a ganɨdima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 48:8">a tugh gavgavigh, egh kamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 48:8">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9"/>O God, e nɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:9">nɨn apangkuvir arazir kam gɨnɨghnɨghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10"/>Nguazir kamɨn gumazamiziba bar fo, nɨ ziar ekiam iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:10">Egha me bar nɨn ziam pɨrafi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 48:10">Nɨ arazir aghuim gamua gumazamiziba me gativagha men gari.<verse eid="PSA 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11"/>Saionɨn nguibamɨn aven itir gumazamiziba bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">Nɨ arazir aghuimra gɨn ghua gumaziba bar men araziba tuisɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:11">Kamaghɨn Judan aven itir nguibabar gumaziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">me bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12"/>Ia Israelia, ia bar izɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:12">Saionɨn nguibam avɨnizir dɨvazimɨn azenan daruva, an dɨpenir ruarir gumaziba ikɨ ganamiba meng.<verse eid="PSA 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13"/>Ia Saionɨn nguibam avɨnizir dɨvazim deragh an ganigh nɨghnɨzim inighɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:13">deragh an itir dɨpenir gavgavibar ganigh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 48:13">Egh ia gɨn, deraghvɨra gɨn otivamin ovavibagh eghanam.<verse eid="PSA 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">48:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 58:11">Aisaia 58:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ia kamagh me mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:14">“Godɨn kam a en God, a zurara ikia kamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:14">Egh a zurara en faragh mangɨ tuavim en akakagham.”<verse eid="PSA 48:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim dagɨaba ko bizir avɨribara nɨghnɨsi, a gumazir onganim</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Koran adarazir onger akam.</para>
  <para style="d">Kar onger akabar faragha zuir gumazimɨn onger akam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1"/>Ia bar moghɨra bizir kam baragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:1">Ia nguazir kamɨn itir gumazamiziba, ia bar kuariba arigh deragh nan akam baragh.<verse eid="PSA 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2"/>Ia gumazir ziaba itiba ko ziaba puvatɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:2">dagɨaba itir gumazamiziba, ko dagɨaba puvatɨziba, ia akar kam deragh a baragh.<verse eid="PSA 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3"/>Nan navir averiam nɨghnɨzir aghuir mam an dɨkafi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:3">Kɨ nɨghnɨzir aghuir kam mɨkɨmtɨ a fofozir aghuim ia danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4"/>Kɨ faragh aghuzir akar tabav kemegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:4">gita mɨsogh aghuzir akar kamɨn mɨngarim bangɨ ia mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:5-6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:24">Jop 31:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 52:7">Onger Akaba 52:7</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kuraba na ekɨaruzɨ, kɨ dughiar kurabar ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:5">egha dughiar kurar kabar atiatir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6"/>Gumazir bizir avɨriba itir kaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:6">me uan bizibagh nɨghnɨgha uari uan ziaba fa mɨgɨrɨgɨabagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 49:6">Ezɨ kɨ men atiatir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:18-19">Jop 36:18-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E fo, gumazitam uabɨ uan mɨkarzim givezeghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:7">Egh a uabɨ uan ikɨrɨmɨrim givesɨ dagɨatam God danɨngan kogham. Bar puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8-9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:8-9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Onger Akaba 16:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:29">22:29</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:48">89:48</ref></char>
    </note>Guizbangɨra, gumazimɨn ikɨrɨmɨrim givezamin ivezim, a bar pɨn ko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:8-9">Gumazim angamɨra ikɨsɨ dagɨaba God danightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 49:8-9">God aneteghtɨ an angamɨra dughiar ruarimɨn ikeghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 49:8-9">Bar puvatɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 49:8-9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10"/>E fofozir gumazamizibar garima, me uaghan ariaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">Ezɨ gumazamizir kuraba ko gumazamizir onganiba, me uaghan ariaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 49:10">Gumazamizir kaba bar uan dagɨaba ko bizir aghuiba ateghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">gumazamizir igharaziba da iniam.<verse eid="PSA 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11"/>Gumazamizir kaba faragha uari nguaziba iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">Datɨrɨghɨn matmatiaba men nguibar me zurara ikiamibar mɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12"/>Gumazimɨn ziar ekiam, an ovengamin tuavim apɨrighan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:12">Puvatɨ. E bar asɨzibar mɨrarama arɨmighiram.<verse eid="PSA 49:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13"/>Arazir kamnang, a gumazamizir uarira uarigh nɨghnɨgha bizir avɨriba itiba bativam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:13">Gumazamizir kamaghɨn amiba me nɨghnɨzir aghuiba puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 49:13">me bizir isir kaba bagh bar akuegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:13">uaghan kamaghɨram ovengam.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 49:13">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14"/>God me amɨsevegha ghaze, me sipsipbar mɨn arɨghirɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn mangam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 49:14">Eghtɨ ovevem me geghuv men garir gumazimɨn mɨn ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 49:14">Me uan dɨpenir aghuiba ateghtɨ, men mɨkarziba bar kurighɨreghtɨ, me Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">Eghtɨ amɨmzaraghan, gumazamizir aghuiba gumazamizir kabagh ativagh men ganam.<verse eid="PSA 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10-11">Onger Akaba 16:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 73:24">73:24</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:14">Hosea 13:14</ref></char>
    </note>Eghtɨ God nan akuragh ua nan ikɨrɨmɨrim givezeghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:15">Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn gavgavim ua nan suighan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 49:15">A ua bagh ua na iniam.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 49:15">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16"/>Gumazitam dagɨar avɨriba inigh egh dɨpenir ekiatamɨn ingarigh ua bagh bizir bar aghuiba a darightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:16">nɨ bizir kam gɨnɨghnɨgh osɨman markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">49:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:14">Onger Akaba 17:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:7">1 Timoti 6:7</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ fogha gɨfa, a gɨn aremegh bizir katam sara mangɨghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:17">An bizir aghuir kaba, a ko Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn mangɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18"/>An angamɨra itir dughiam, a bizir kabar gara da bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:18">Egha bizir avɨriba iniasa bar pamten ingarima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 49:18">gumaziba a mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 49:18">“A gumazir bar aghuim.”<verse eid="PSA 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19"/>An aremegh uan inazir afeziaba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:19">nguibar uam aruer angazangarimɨn garir puvatɨzimɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20"/>Gumazimɨn ziar ekiam, an ovengamin tuavim apɨrighan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:20">Puvatɨ. E bar asɨzibar mɨrarama arɨghiram.<verse eid="PSA 49:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50"/>
  <para style="s">God gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨsi</para>
  <para style="d">Asap onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1"/>Godɨn Bar Gavgaviba Itim, a en Ikiavɨra Itir God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">An aruem anadi naghɨn ikegha ghua aruem uaghiri naghɨn itir gumazamiziba bar men dei.<verse eid="PSA 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2"/>God Saionɨn nguibamɨn ikia uan Dɨpenimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:2">Nguibar kam a bar deragha ganganir aghuim gami,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:2">Godɨn angazangarim Saionɨn otiva a gisiragha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:2">nguazir kam bar an ghu.<verse eid="PSA 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3"/>En God a izi, egha a nɨmɨra izir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">Avir ekiam bizir avɨribar isia an faragha izima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 50:3">amozim ko amɨnir ekiam a sara izi.<verse eid="PSA 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4"/>An overiam ko nguazimɨn diazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:4">aning izɨ uaghan ikɨ gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 50:4">a guizɨn arazimɨn gɨn mangɨ uan gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5"/>God ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:5">“Ia nan gumazamiziba, ia na bagh izɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:5">Ia na ko Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim gamigha gavgavim a danɨngasa, asɨzibav sogha ofa gami.”<verse eid="PSA 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 75:7">Onger Akaba 75:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:6">97:6</ref></char>
    </note>Overiam uabɨ ghaze, Godɨn Araziba bar moghɨra dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:6">Guizbangɨra, a uabɨ guizɨn arazimɨn gɨn ghua</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 50:6">gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨsi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 50:6">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7"/>God ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:7">“Nan gumazamiziba, ia oraghtɨ kɨ mɨkɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">Ia Israelia, kɨ kotɨn aven tugh ia gasir akamɨn gun mɨkɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 50:7">Kɨ uabɨra God, kɨ guizbangɨra ian God.<verse eid="PSA 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8"/>Kɨ ofan ia amiba bagha ian atarir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:8">Kɨ ian garima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 50:8">ia zurara nan damazimɨn ofa bagha amua avimɨn da tue da bar isia mɨghɨri.<verse eid="PSA 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9"/>Kɨ ian dɨvazibar aven ian bulmakaun apuriba ko memen apuriba inian aghua.<verse eid="PSA 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10"/>Guizbangɨra, ruarimɨn itir asɨzir atiaba bar nana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:10">Mɨghsɨaba bar dar itir bulmakauba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:10">da bar vaghvagha nan asɨzibara.<verse eid="PSA 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11"/>Kuarazir mɨghsɨabar itiba, kɨ vaghvagha dagh fo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:11">Asɨziba ko apizir tuzibar aven aruiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 50:11">da bar nana.<verse eid="PSA 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 24:1">Onger Akaba 24:1</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 10:26">1 Korin 10:26</ref></char>
    </note>Mɨtiriam nan aghɨtɨ, kɨ dagheba bagh ian azaraghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:12">Guizbangɨra, nguazim ko bizir an itiba, da bar nan biziba.<verse eid="PSA 50:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13"/>Kɨ ti bulmakaun tuziba api, o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:13">Kɨ ti memen ghuzim api?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 50:13">Bar puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14"/>“Kamaghɨn deragham, ia bar God mɨnabagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:14">Kamaghɨn garir ofa ia a damu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:14">Kɨ Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim, bizir aghuir ia na danɨngasa mɨkemegha gɨvaziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:14">ia da isɨ na danɨng.<verse eid="PSA 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 91:15">Onger Akaba 91:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:6">107:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:13">107:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:19">107:19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:9">Sekaraia 13:9</ref></char>
    </note>Osɨmtɨzim ia bativamin dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">ia nan dɨmtɨ kɨ ian akuragham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 50:15">Eghtɨ ia nan ziam fam.”<verse eid="PSA 50:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16"/>God kamaghɨn gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amibav gɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:16">“Ia tizim bagha nan arazir kɨ ifongeziba pura dar bori?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">Ian arazir kam tong ian akurazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 50:16">Egha tizim baghavɨra nan Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim purama a mɨgei?<verse eid="PSA 50:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 9:26">Nehemia 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:21-22">Rom 2:21-22</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ ia akɨr ia mɨkɨman ia aghuagha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:17">nan akaba gɨrakɨrangɨn ada arɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18"/>Ia okɨmakɨar gumazibar gara me ko namakabagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:18">Egha ia poroghamiba uari bakɨa uari ko akuir gumazamiziba koma arui.<verse eid="PSA 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19"/>“Ia zurara akar kurabav gɨa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:19">ian mɨzeba ifavarim ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 50:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20"/>Ia uan aveghbuaba gɨrakɨrangɨn me mɨgɨa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:20">me isa kotiabagh arɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 50:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 90:8">Onger Akaba 90:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:8-9">Aisaia 55:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:11">57:11</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:4">Rom 2:4</ref></char>
    </note>Ia bizir kabagh amima, kɨ akam akarigha bizitam mɨgeir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">Ia ghaze, kɨ ti ia ko e magh ghue?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:21">Bar puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn ia isɨ kot datɨgh azenara ian guabar ian atarɨva akam ia gasam.<verse eid="PSA 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22"/>“Ia deraghvɨram oragh!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">Ia gumazamizir akɨrim ragha na gasaraziba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:22">Ia kamaghɨn damutɨ, kɨ ia gasɨghasightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">gumazitam ian akuragh ua ia inighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 50:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">50:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 27:6">Onger Akaba 27:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazim a na mɨnabi, mati a na bagha ofa gamua nan ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:23">Gumazamizir nan akamɨn gɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 50:23">kɨ men akuragh ua me iniam.”<verse eid="PSA 50:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uan arazir kuraba gɨn amangasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha an osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Devit Batseba ko arazir kuram gamizɨ, Godɨn akam inigha izir gumazim Natan, iza akam a gasara. Ezɨ Devit uan arazir kuram gɨnɨghnɨgha ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 12:1-15">2 Samuel 12:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:26">Onger Akaba 109:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:25">Aisaia 43:25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 3:19">Aposel 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:14">Kolosi 2:14</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ uan apangkuvir arazimɨn gɨn mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">egh nan apangkufigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:1">Nɨ apangkuvir ekiar kam nan ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">egh nan arazir kuraba batokegh.<verse eid="PSA 51:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:16">Aisaia 1:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:14">Jeremaia 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:14">Hibru 9:14</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamiziba rua ua zue moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:2">nɨ na rueghtɨ nan arazir kuraba mangɨghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 51:2">kɨ zueka.<verse eid="PSA 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:12">Aisaia 59:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ fo, kɨ arazir kuram gamigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:3">Egha arazir kurar kɨ amizir kam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 51:3">kɨ a gɨnɨghnɨghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 12:13">2 Samuel 12:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:21">Luk 15:21</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:4">Rom 3:4</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ bar nɨrara, nɨn damazimɨn arazir kuram gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">Nɨ uan arazir aghuimɨn gɨn ghua na isa kot gatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 51:4">nan arazir kuraba bagha ivezir kuram na ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 15:14">Jop 15:14</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:3">Efesus 2:3</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uan amebamɨn navir averiamɨn aven ikiavɨra itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:5">arazir kuraba nan iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:5">Arazir kurar kaba nan mɨkarzimɨn ikiavɨra itima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:5">nan amebam na bate.<verse eid="PSA 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 15:2">Onger Akaba 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 2:6">Aghuzir Akaba 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:5">Jems 1:5</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ fo, nɨ kamaghɨn ifonge, kɨ uan nɨghnɨzimɨn aven nɨn guizɨn akamɨn gɨn mangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:6">Kamaghɨn, nɨ uan nɨghnɨzir aghuim isɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 51:6">nan navir averiam datɨgh.<verse eid="PSA 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 19:18">Dɨboboniba 19:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 1:18">Aisaia 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:19">Hibru 9:19</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ hisopɨn ter aguar muziaritam inigh a isɨ dɨpam darugh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:7">egh nan mɨkarzimɨn a kavamadaghtɨ, kɨ nɨn damazimɨn zueka.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 51:7">Egh na rueghtɨ kɨ bar zuegh nir ghurghurimɨn mɨn bar ghurghurika.<verse eid="PSA 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 35:10">Onger Akaba 35:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:10">Aisaia 35:10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 1:16">Joel 1:16</ref></char>
    </note>Bar guizbangɨra, nɨ bar na dɨkabɨragha egha nan arazir kuraba ikaragha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:8">Datɨrɨghɨn nan navir averiam deraghtɨ kɨ bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 16:17">Jeremaia 16:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ nan arazir kuraba ua dar ganan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:9">Nɨ da batuegh ua adagh nɨghnɨghan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:37">Onger Akaba 78:37</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:8">Matyu 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:9">Aposel 15:9</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:10">Efesus 2:10</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ nan navir averiam damightɨ a zuegh ua igiamɨn otogh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:10">Eghtɨ nɨn ifongiar aghuim nan aven izɨtɨ kɨ nɨrara ganam.<verse eid="PSA 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 13:23">2 Atriviba 13:23</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:10-11">Aisaia 63:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:15">Jeremaia 7:15</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨn Duam nan aven iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:11">ezɨ nɨ uabɨn boroghɨn na batuegh, na da uan duam inian markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 13:5">Onger Akaba 13:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ faraghavɨra ua na inizɨ kɨ nɨ bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:12">Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn bar akongezir arazir kam na danɨngigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:12">Kɨ nɨn akabar gɨn mangamin ifongiar kam, nɨ ua na danɨngigh.<verse eid="PSA 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:27">Onger Akaba 22:27</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:21-22">Aposel 9:21-22</ref></char>
    </note>Eghtɨ kɨ gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba nɨn akamɨn me mɨkɨmam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:13">eghtɨ me nɨ bagh izam.<verse eid="PSA 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 12:9">2 Samuel 12:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:28">Onger Akaba 35:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:15">71:15</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ nan Akurvazir Gumazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">kamaghɨn nɨ nan akuraghtɨ, kɨ uan arazir kurar kam bagh ovengan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:14">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ nan akurazir bizir kam bagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">kɨ pamten ighiabar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 4:15">Ua Me Ini 4:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 9:14">Onger Akaba 9:14</ref></char>
    </note>O Ekiam, nɨ nan akuraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:15">kɨ deragh eghaghanibagh fogh nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Onger Akaba 40:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ fo, nɨ kamaghɨn aghua, kɨ asɨzim inigh izɨ nɨ bagh an ofa damuam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:16">Kɨ ofa damusɨ asɨzim mɨsuegh a tuaghtɨ, a bar isi mɨghɨran nɨ aghua.<verse eid="PSA 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">51:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:18">Onger Akaba 34:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O God, nɨ kamaghɨn ifonge, kɨ ofan mɨn bar uabɨ abɨragh bar nɨn apengan ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:17">Gumazamizir uari abɨra navibagh iziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 51:17">nɨ akɨrim ragha me gasir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18"/>O God, nɨ uan ifongiamɨn gɨn mangɨ Saionɨn gumazamizibar akuragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:18">egh Jerusalemɨn nguibamɨn dɨvaziba uam adar ingarightɨ da tuifigh.<verse eid="PSA 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19"/>Dughiar kamɨn me ofan aghuir nɨn damazimɨn deraziba ko, asɨzim tuaghtɨ a bar isi mɨghɨrighamin ofa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">me da isɨ nɨ danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 51:19">Me uan bulmakaun apuriba inigh nɨn ofa gamir dakozimɨn izɨ</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 51:19">nɨ bagh dar ofa damuam.<verse eid="PSA 51:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir arazir kurabagh ifongezim, a gumazir onganim</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha an osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Idomian gumazim Doek, Solɨn dɨpenimɨn ghugha ghaze, Devit Ahimelekɨn dɨpenimɨn ghu. Dughiar kamɨn Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamagh a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:9-10">1 Samuel 22:9-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O gumazir ekiam, nɨ manmaghsua uabɨ fa, arazir kurar nɨ Godɨn gumazamizibagh amiziba bagha bar akonge?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">Godɨn apangkuvim men ikia mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 52:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 50:19">Onger Akaba 50:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 59:7">59:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 64:3">64:3</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨn mɨzem resan mɨn bar ghumigha ifavaribagh ami da otifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">Dughiabar zurara nɨ gumazamizibagh asɨghasɨghasa mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 52:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3"/>Nɨ arazir aghuim bar an aghuagha arazir kuram baghavɨra ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:3">Nɨ guizɨn akam gifongezir puvatɨgha, ifarasa bar ifonge.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 52:3">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 52:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4"/>Nɨ ifarir gumazim!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:4">Nɨ uan akamɨn gumazamizibagh asɨghasɨghasa bar ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 52:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5"/>Nɨ orakigh, God bar nɨ gasɨghasightɨ nɨ ikuvigh kamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">A nɨn dɨpenimɨn nɨn suiragh nɨ batuegh bar nɨ agɨvaghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 52:5">nɨ ua nguazir kamɨn ikian kogham.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 52:5">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6"/>Godɨn gumazamiziba kamaghɨn nɨn ganigh atiatingam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:6">Me nɨn ingarɨva akɨ kamaghɨn mɨkɨmam,<verse eid="PSA 52:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">52:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 49:6">Onger Akaba 49:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Ia gumazir kamɨn gan! Gumazir kam God a geghuv egh deragh an ganan an aghua.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">A uan dagɨaba ko bizir avɨribagh nɨghnɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 52:7">an arazir kuraba an akuraghtɨ a deragh ikiam.”<verse eid="PSA 52:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8"/>Ezɨ kɨ, olivɨn tememɨn mɨn Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven tughav ikia deravɨrama aghui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an apangkuvir arazimɨn ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 52:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9"/>O God, nɨ nan akurazɨ kɨ zurara nɨ mɨnabɨvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">Kɨ gumazamizibar damazibar nɨn ziam fɨ kamagh mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 52:9">“God arazir bar aghuimɨn na gami.”<verse eid="PSA 52:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52"/>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazamizibar arazir kuraba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 14">Onger Akaba 14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Kar onger akar kabar faragha zuir gumazimɨn onger akam. <optbreak/>A gumazamizibav kemezɨ me Mahalatɨn tiarimɨn ighiar kam bange.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamagh a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:4">Onger Akaba 10:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 14:1">14:1</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:1-3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 3:10-12">Rom 3:10-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazamizir onganiba uan navir averiabar aven nɨghnɨgha ghaze, “God itir puvatɨ.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">Gumazamizir kaba me bar gumazamizir kurabara.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 53:1">Me bar moghɨra arazir aghuitam gamir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 53:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">53:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 15:2">2 Eghaghaniba 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 19:3">19:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:13">Onger Akaba 33:13</ref></char>
    </note>God uan Nguibamɨn pɨn ikia nguazimɨn itir gumazamizibar gari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">men tav ti nɨghnɨzir aghuim ikia a gɨfofoghasa a buri,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 53:2">ti puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 53:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3"/>Me bar tuavir aghuim ataki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">Me bar moghɨra ikuvigha magh gari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:3">Men tav arazir aghuitam bar a gamizir pu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">Bar puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 53:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4"/>God kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:4">“Gumazamizir arazir kuram gamiba, nɨghnɨzir aghuitam men itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">Me bret apava anegevi moghɨn, me nan gumazamiziba a gefi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 53:4">Egha me tong na ko mɨgeir puvatɨ.”<verse eid="PSA 53:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5"/>Gumazamizir kamaghɨn amiba atiatir bar dafam me bativam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">Fomɨra atiatir kamaghɨn garitam me batozir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:5">Guizbangɨra, God bar uan gumazamizibar apanibar aghua.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">Me ariaghirezɨ, a men aghariba tintinibar da kavkɨnizɨ, da irezɨ, me bar aghumsɨki.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 53:5">Kamaghɨn, a bar me gafiragha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 53:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6"/>Kɨ kamaghɨn ifonge, Israelian akurvaghamin gumazitam Saionɨn nguibamɨn ikegh azenan izɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">God uan gumazamizibar akuraghtɨ me deravɨra ikɨtɨ, Jekopɨn ovaviba bar akuegham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 53:6">Guizbangɨra, Israelian naviba deragham.<verse eid="PSA 53:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53"/>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54"/>
  <para style="s">God nan Akurvazir Gumazim</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim, kar an onger akam. Gumazir kam, gumazir gitabav sozibav kemezɨ me ighiam gami.</para>
  <para style="d">Sifia ghua Sol mɨgɨa ghaze, Devit men tongɨn modoghav iti. Ezɨ Devit dughiar kamɨn ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamagh a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 23:19">1 Samuel 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 26:1">26:1</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ uan ziar gavgavimɨn nan akuragh gumazir kurabar dafaribar ua na inigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:1">Nɨ uan gavgavir bar ekiamɨn nan akuraghtɨ, kɨ fɨrighɨrɨka.<verse eid="PSA 54:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2"/>O God, kɨ nɨ ko mɨgei, nɨ na baragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:2">Nɨ kuarim atɨgh nan mɨgɨrɨgɨaba baragh.<verse eid="PSA 54:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3"/>Nguibar igharazibar gumaziba na mɨsoghasa izegha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">Gumazir igharaz darazigh asɨghasɨziba, me na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 54:3">Gumazir kaba kamaghɨn nɨghnɨsi, God a pura bizim.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 54:3">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 54:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4"/>Bar guizbangɨra, God uabɨra nan akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:4">Ekiam nan akurvazima, kɨ deravɨra ikia, angamɨra ikiavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 54:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5"/>Nan apaniba, God mar mɨzazim me gasɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:5">Egh arazir kurar me na gamiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 54:5">a maghɨra da otevkɨnigh da isɨ me gasegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 54:5">Nɨ mɨkemezɨ moghɨra deragha bizibagh amua, uan nɨghnɨzim gɨghavkɨrir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:5">Egh kamaghɨra, nɨ bar nan apaniba agɨvagham.<verse eid="PSA 54:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ bar derazɨ kɨ nɨ mɨnaba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">Kɨ uan ifongiamɨn nɨ bagh ofa damuasa bar ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 54:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">54:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 59:10">Onger Akaba 59:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ nan akurazima, osɨmtɨzir na bativiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:7">tam na abɨrazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 54:7">Kɨ nɨn gari, nɨ nan apanibagh bar me gasɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 54:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54"/>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim God an akurvaghasa, an a ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Kar onger akabar faragha zuir gumazimɨn onger akam. <optbreak/>A gumazir gitabav sozibav kemezɨ me ighiam bange.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamaghɨn a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1"/>O God, kɨ nɨ ko mɨgei nɨ na baragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:1">Nɨ uan kuarim dukuaghan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 55:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2"/>Kɨ nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba, nɨ deragh da baregh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:2">egh uamategh da ikaragh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 55:2">Osɨmtɨzir kam bar na gasɨghasɨghasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 55:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3"/>Nan apaniba na gasɨghasɨghasa pamtem mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">Gumazir kurar kaba na abɨri, ezɨ nan navir averiam derazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:3">Me osɨmtɨzir avɨriba na garɨgha puvɨra nan atara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">bar nan apanim gami.<verse eid="PSA 55:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:4-5">Onger Akaba 18:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 116:3">116:3</ref></char>
    </note>Bizir kam na gami, nan navim bar na baseme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:4">Ezɨ kɨ bar atiatigha aremeghasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 55:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5"/>Atiatim bar puvɨra nan anadima kɨ agoa nɨzima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:5">atiatim bar na avara.<verse eid="PSA 55:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:13">Jop 3:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ezɨ kɨ ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:6">“Kɨ kuarazir bunbamɨn mɨn avɨziba ikɨtɨ deragham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:6">Kɨ danganitamɨn mangɨ ikɨ avughsɨsɨ, mɨghegh an mangam.<verse eid="PSA 55:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7"/>Kɨ mɨghegh saghon mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:7">gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn avughsɨ ikiam.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 55:7">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 55:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8"/>Kɨ zuamɨra mɨghegh mangɨ ua bagh danganitamɨn apigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:8">egh uabɨ modogh amɨnir ekiam ko amozim gitagham.”<verse eid="PSA 55:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9"/>O Ekiam, kɨ gari, gumazamiziba nguibar ekiamɨn aven mɨdoroziba fora dagh ami da otifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">Kamaghɨn nɨ nan apanir kabar mɨzebar amightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 55:9">da osemeghtɨ me deragh bizibav kɨman kogham.<verse eid="PSA 55:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10"/>Arueba ko dɨmagaribar me nguibar ekiamɨn dɨvazir gavgavibagh isɨn arui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:10">Nguibar ekiamɨn gumazamiziba arazir kurar avɨribagh amua osɨmtɨzibagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 55:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11"/>Nguibar ekiar kamɨn aven an danganiba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:11">gumazamiziba tintinibar uari gasɨghasɨghasava amua, arazir igharazibagh ami da otifi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:11">Tuavir mɨriaba ko biziba amaga dagh ivezir danganiba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:11">gumaziba gumazir igharazibav gɨa me abɨra,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 55:11">ifara pura men biziba isi.<verse eid="PSA 55:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12"/>Nan apanitam akar kuram na mɨkemeghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">kɨ pura uabɨ abɨragh purama an akamɨn osɨmtɨzim ateram.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 55:12">Gumazir kɨ fozitam akatam na gasɨ na mɨkɨmtɨ</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 55:12">kɨ uabɨ isɨva an modogham.<verse eid="PSA 55:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 15:12">2 Samuel 15:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Onger Akaba 41:9</ref></char>
    </note>Ezɨ nɨrara, nɨ bar nan namakamra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:13">Nɨrara, nɨ nan roroamra, egha bar nan boroghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 55:13">Egha nɨrara nɨ arazir kurar kabar na gami.<verse eid="PSA 55:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14"/>Ga fomɨra uaning ko aruava bizibar uaning mɨgɨa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:14">gumazamizir igharaziba ko Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 55:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15"/>Arazir kuram bar nan apanibar naviba ko dɨpenibagh izɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, me zuamɨrama arɨmɨghireghasa kɨ ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:15">Me angamɨra itir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">me Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn mangɨ.<verse eid="PSA 55:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16"/>God nan akuraghasa kɨ an dei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:16">Eghtɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan akuragh ua na iniam.<verse eid="PSA 55:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17"/>Mɨzaraziba ko aruer arɨziba ko dɨmagaribar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">kɨ uan osɨmtɨziba bagh a ko mɨkɨmɨva arangtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 55:17">a na baragham.<verse eid="PSA 55:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18"/>Gumazir avɨriba na ko mɨsosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:18">ezɨ kɨ osɨmtɨzir ekiatam uan mɨkarzimɨn a inizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 55:18">God bar deraghavɨra nan gara uamategha na inigha izi.<verse eid="PSA 55:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19"/>Bar fomɨra, God atrivimɨn iti, egha datɨrɨghɨn atrivimɨn ikiavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 55:19">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:19">Gumazir Godɨn atiatir puvatɨziba, me uan arazir kurabagh ighan aghua.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, God uabɨ nan azangsɨzim baregh, egh mɨdorozimɨn apaniba abɨragham.<verse eid="PSA 55:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20"/>Nan namakam, a uan namakabara mɨsosi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:20">Egha me ko fomɨrama amizir akar dɨkɨrɨzim abɨki.<verse eid="PSA 55:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 12:2">Onger Akaba 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 28:3">28:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 59:7">59:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 5:3-4">Aghuzir Akaba 5:3-4</ref></char>
    </note>A uan akamɨn, akar isɨngtɨzibar na mɨgei, egha nan apanim gamuavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">A uan akamɨn na ko navir amɨrizimɨn ikiasa mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 55:21">Ezɨ mɨzer otevir a mɨgeiba, da mati mɨdorozir sabar ghumtɨzimɨn mɨn na aghori.<verse eid="PSA 55:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">55:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:5">Onger Akaba 37:5</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:7">1 Pita 5:7</ref></char>
    </note>Osɨmtɨzir nɨ aterir kaba bar, nɨ da isɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn dafarim datɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">eghtɨ an ada ater gavgavim nɨ danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:22">Gumazir Godɨn damazimɨn deraziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">a me ateghtɨ bizitam me gasɨghasighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 55:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23"/>O God, gumazir gumazibav sozi me ariaghɨriba ko, gumazir ifariba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">me uan igiabara ikɨvɨra ikɨtɨ, nɨ me batueghtɨ me mozir bar konimɨn magɨrɨgh bar ovengegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:23">Eghtɨ kɨ uabɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 55:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55"/>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim itim God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Filistiaba Getɨn nguibamɨn Devitɨn suirazɨ, Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Onger akar kabar mam, me ziam Miktam, a garɨsi.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim, a gumazamizibav gei me tiarir kamɨn gɨn ghua ighiam bange, “Kuarazim temer saghon itim gaperaghav iti.”</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:13-15">1 Samuel 21:13-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O God, nɨ nan apangkufigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:1">Gumaziba zurara na mɨsogha nan agɨntɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 56:1">Me dughiabar zurara arazir kurabar na gami.<verse eid="PSA 56:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2"/>Nan apanir kaba kamaghɨn ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:2">me mɨzaraghara na ko mɨsogh mangɨ guaratɨghɨn gɨvagham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 56:2">Gumazir bar avɨriba uari fa nan apanim gami.<verse eid="PSA 56:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 30:6">1 Samuel 30:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:3">2 Eghaghaniba 20:3</ref></char>
    </note>O God, kɨ atiatir dughiabar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:3">kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn ikɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 56:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:6">Onger Akaba 118:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:3">Aisaia 31:3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:6">Hibru 13:6</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ Godɨn akam fa, egha nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn ikia atiatir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">Gumazir kɨnitam, arazir manatamɨn na damuam? Puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 56:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5"/>Dughiaba bar, bizir kɨ amiba nan apaniba dagh asɨghasɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:5">Egha zurara na gasɨghasɨghasa tuaviba buri.<verse eid="PSA 56:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6"/>Me na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasa uari akuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">nan tuaviba isa mogav ikia, nan daroribar nan akuvamadi.<verse eid="PSA 56:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7"/>O God, nɨ men arazir kurar me amir kaba bagh arazitam men akagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:7">Nɨ uan anɨngagharim akagh egh gumazir kaba bar me agɨfagh.<verse eid="PSA 56:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8"/>Nɨ na gɨfo, kɨ osɨmtɨziba aterava ara iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">Nɨ nan temerir irir kaba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 56:8">nɨ bar ada mengegha uan akɨnafarimɨn ada osiri.<verse eid="PSA 56:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 56:4">Onger Akaba 56:4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:31">Rom 8:31</ref></char>
    </note>O God, kɨ kamaghɨn fo, nɨ na baghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:9">Egh kɨ nɨn dɨmamin dughiamɨn, nɨ nan apanibar amightɨ me aregham.<verse eid="PSA 56:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10"/>Kɨ Godɨn akam gɨnɨghnɨgha a fe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:10">Guizbangɨra, kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn mɨgɨrɨgɨaba pɨrafam.<verse eid="PSA 56:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">56:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 56:4">Onger Akaba 56:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:11">kamaghɨn, kɨ bizitamɨn atiatir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 56:11">Gumazir kɨnitam arazir manatamɨn na damuam? Puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 56:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12-13"/>O God, bizir kɨ fomɨra damuasa nɨ ko akam akɨrizim, kɨ a damuam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:12-13">Nɨ nan akurazɨ kɨ ovengezir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 56:12-13">Nɨ nan akurazɨ kɨ asaghpora irɨzir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:12-13">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ dughiabar zurara nɨ ko daru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:12-13">nɨn angazangarimɨn aven daru mangɨvɨra ikɨ ovegham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:12-13">Egh bizir nɨ amizir kaba bagh nɨ mɨnabɨva</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:12-13">ofa isɨ nɨ danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 56:12-13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56"/>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim akurvazim bagha Godɨn azangsɨsi</para>
  <para style="d">Devit Solɨn aravghugha dagɨar torir mamɨn ikia ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir ighiabar faragha zuim a gumazamizibav kɨmtɨ, me tiarir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ ighiar kam bangam, “Gumazitam gasɨghasɨghan markɨ.”</para>
  <para style="d">Onger akar kabar mam, me ziam Miktam, a garɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:1">1 Samuel 22:1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 24:3">24:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 56:1">Onger Akaba 56:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 63:7">63:7</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ nan apangkuvigh nan akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">Kɨ nɨn boroghɨra ikia bar deragha iti,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 57:1">mati tuarir nguziba uan amebamɨn avɨzibar apengan modoghav ikia deraghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">Kɨ kamaghɨra deravɨra ikɨ mangɨtɨ, bizir na gasɨghasɨghamin kaba mangɨ gɨvagham.<verse eid="PSA 57:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 38:8">Onger Akaba 38:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim, a God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:2">kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa an dei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:2">Bizir kɨ oteveziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:2">a bar ada isa na ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 57:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3"/>God uan Nguibamɨn iti, ezɨ kɨ a ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">a da baregh nan akuragh ua na iniam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 57:3">A gumazir na gasɨghasɨghamba abɨnigh egh ua na iniam.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 57:3">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">God bar nan apangkuvigha mɨkemezɨ moghɨra,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 57:3">a zurara uan akamɨn gɨn ghua bizibagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 57:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 55:21">Onger Akaba 55:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 64:3">64:3</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 30:14">Aghuzir Akaba 30:14</ref></char>
    </note>Nan apaniba bar na okarizɨ kɨ men torimɨn akui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">Me laionbar mɨn gumazibar amasa men atariba baribar mɨn bar ghumi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 57:4">Ezɨ men mɨzeba sabar ghumtɨzir pumuning itimɨn mɨn bar ghumi.<verse eid="PSA 57:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5"/>O God, nɨ overiamɨn uan gavgavim akaghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:5">nguazimɨn gumazamiziba ganigh fogh suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 57:5">nɨn gavgavim bar ekevegha me gafiragha pɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 57:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6"/>Nan apaniba nan suighasa na bagha ivem agura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">Mati gumazim asɨzir atiamɨn suighasa azuazim agura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:6">Kɨ magɨramin mozim, me tuavir kɨ zuimɨn an okorezɨ osɨmtɨzir ekiam nan iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">Ezɨ puvatɨ, me atamakuigha uari torir kam giraghue.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 57:6">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 57:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 108:1">Onger Akaba 108:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O God, kɨ uan navir averiamɨn nɨghnɨzir gavgavimra nɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:7">egha nɨghnɨzir igharaziba ua nan puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:7">Kɨ gitabav sogh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:7">nɨn ziam famin ighiabar amuasa.<verse eid="PSA 57:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8"/>Kɨ daguim ategh dɨkavigh uan gita ko kulele mɨsogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">Eghtɨ dar ararer aghuim otivtɨ aruem bigh anangam.<verse eid="PSA 57:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9"/>O Ekiam, kɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar tongɨn nɨ mɨnamam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:9">Gumazamiziba bar moghɨra oraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 57:9">kɨ nɨn ziam fɨ ighiam bangam.<verse eid="PSA 57:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">57:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:5">Onger Akaba 36:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:11">103:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 108:4">108:4</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ fo, nɨ en apangkuvir arazim, a bar ekefe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:10">egha overiamɨn ababanimɨn tu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:10">Nɨ zurara amir arazir aghuir kaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:10">e da meng mangɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 57:10">da mangɨ overiamɨn ghuariabar suiragham.<verse eid="PSA 57:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11"/>O God, nɨ overiamɨn uan gavgavim akagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:11">Eghtɨ nguazimɨn gumazamiziba ganigh fogh suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 57:11">nɨn gavgavim bar ekevegha me gafiragha pɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 57:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57"/>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58"/>
  <para style="s">God gumazir kurabagh asɨghasɨghasa</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir ighiabar faragha zuim a gumazamizibav kɨmtɨ, me tiarir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ ighiar kam bangam, “Gumazitam gasɨghasɨghan markɨ.”</para>
  <para style="d">Onger akar kabar mam, me ziam Miktam, a garɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1"/>Ia gumazir dapaniba, ia kotiabar deragha biziba baragha dav gei, o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:1">Ia gumazamizibar mɨgɨrɨgɨaba deragha da baragha da tuisɨsi, o puvatɨ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 58:1">Ti puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 58:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2"/>Ian nɨghnɨziba arazir kurabara damuasa dɨkafi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:2">Ia nguazimɨn gumazamizibagh asɨghasɨghasavɨram ami.<verse eid="PSA 58:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3"/>Gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba, me mangamin tuavim ataki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:3">Men amebaba me batezir dughiamɨn ikegha iza datɨrɨkɨn, me ifaravɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 58:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4"/>Men mɨgɨrɨgɨaba mati, kuruzimɨn aven itir imezir kuram dagh izɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:4">Egha me kuruzimɨn mɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 58:4">uan kuarir toribav konegha biziba barazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 58:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5"/>Kuruziba oraghtɨ, gumazim marvim givitɨ, kuruzir kaba dɨkavigh ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:5">Gumazir kurar kaba, me kuruzir mariviba barazir puvatɨzibar mɨn ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 58:5">Marvibagh ivir fofozir gumazim marvim givitɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:5">kuruzim oreghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 58:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6"/>O God, nɨ arazir kurabagh amir gumazir kabagh asɨghasɨkigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:6">Ikiavɨra Itir God, me laionɨn mɨsozibar mɨn ikia puvɨra mɨsosi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 58:6">Nɨ men ataribav sogh, bar da apɨrarigh da asigh.<verse eid="PSA 58:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7"/>Nɨ me damightɨ, me dɨpam nguazimɨn aven uaghiri moghɨn mangɨ pura puvatɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:7">Nɨ me dɨkabɨntɨ, me gumazim grazim dɨkabɨri a uaghira mɨdɨi moghɨn me mɨsɨngigh.<verse eid="PSA 58:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 3:16">Jop 3:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ me damutɨ, me demdembar mɨn arɨmɨghiregh puvatɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:8">Nɨ me damightɨ, me borim amebamɨn navir averiamrama aremezɨ moghɨn ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 58:8">Egh amebam gɨn a bateghtɨ an aruemɨn ganighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 58:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9"/>Gumazim temer muziarim voroghɨrama anetuzɨ moghɨn, God bar zuamɨra me gasɨghasigham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">Me angamɨra ikiavɨra itima, God men anɨngaghegha bar moghɨra me agɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 58:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10"/>God, gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amibagh asɨghasɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:10">Eghtɨ gumazamizir aghuiba arazir kamɨn ganigh bar akuegh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 58:10">gumazir kurabar ghuzibar uan dagariba ruam.<verse eid="PSA 58:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">58:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 67:4">Onger Akaba 67:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 92:7">92:7</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir igharaziba uaghan ganigh fogh suam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 58:11">“Bar guizbangɨra, gumazir aghuiba me ivezir aghuim isi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">Bar guizbangɨra, God ikia</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 58:11">kotɨn aven nguazimɨn itir gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨsi.”<verse eid="PSA 58:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58"/>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim apaniba a gasɨghasɨghan koghasa, God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri. Atrivim Sol, Devit mɨsueghtɨ an aremeghasa, gumazir maba amangizɨ me an dɨpenimɨn zui. Ezɨ dughiar kamɨn, Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir ighiabar faragha zuim a gumazamizibav kɨmtɨ, me tiarir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ ighiar kam bangam, “Gumazitam gasɨghasɨghan markɨ.”</para>
  <para style="d">Onger akar kabar mam, me ziam Miktam, a garɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 19:11">1 Samuel 19:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O nan God, nɨ nan apanibar dafaribar ua na inigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:1">Egh deragh nan gantɨ, me na gasɨghasɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 59:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2"/>Nɨ gumazir arazir kurabagh amibar dafarimɨn ua na inigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:2">Nɨ gumazir na gasɨghasɨgh na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghamibar dafaribar ua na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 59:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3"/>Nɨ gan, gumazir kurar mɨsoziba na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">uari akuvagha zuamɨra ghua uan danganibar mueghav ikia na bagha gari.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 59:3">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ arazir kuratam gamizir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 59:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4"/>Guizbangɨra, kɨ osɨmtɨziba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:4">Ezɨ me na mɨsoghasa ivemara ghua uan danganibar ikia, na bagha gara iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 59:4">Nɨ uan danganim ategh dɨkavigh izɨ nan gan nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 59:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim, nɨ Israelian God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">Nɨ dɨkavigh zuamɨra izɨ ivezir kuram isɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar anɨng.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 59:5">Gumazir uan namakaba isa apanibar dafaribagh arɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 59:5">nɨ men apangkuvan markɨ, nɨ bar me gasɨghasɨkigh.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 59:5">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 59:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6"/>Me dɨmagaribar ua nguibar ekiamɨn izegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:6">afiabar mɨn aroava nguibamɨn azenan arui.<verse eid="PSA 59:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7"/>Nɨ men akar otuariba baragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">men mɨgɨrɨgɨaba mati mɨdorozir sabamɨn mɨn bar ghumi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 59:7">Me ghaze, “Tina e baregham.”<verse eid="PSA 59:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ dɨbovir akabar gumazir kurar kabav kɨmɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:8">Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba bar men ingarvakɨ.<verse eid="PSA 59:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:9">Onger Akaba 9:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O God, nɨrara nɨ gavgavim na ganɨga deragha nan gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:9">Nɨrara nɨ nan danganir mogomem.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 59:9">Kamaghɨn, Kɨ nɨ baghavɨra gara iti.<verse eid="PSA 59:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10"/>Nan God apangkuvim nan iti, a izɨ nan akuragham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:10">A nan apaniba abɨnamin dughiam, a nan amamangatɨghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 59:10">kɨ ikɨ men gantɨ, a me gasɨghasɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 59:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11"/>O God, nɨ me mɨsueghtɨ me arɨmɨghiran markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">Kɨ kamaghɨn aghua, nan gumazamiziba bizir nɨ amir kam bakɨnɨghnigham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:11">Nɨ uan gavgavimɨn me abɨnigh egh pura tintinibar me aghamsɨkigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">Ekiam, nɨ en oramɨn mɨn itima, e nɨn aven modi.<verse eid="PSA 59:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12"/>Me zurara arazir kurabar amusɨ mɨkɨm uari fɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">nɨ azuazim asɨzimɨn suirazɨ moghɨn men suiragh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 59:12">Me nɨn ziam akar kurabar a mɨgɨa egha zurara ifari.<verse eid="PSA 59:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13"/>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ uan anɨngagharim men akagh me mɨsueghtɨ me arɨmɨghiregh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">Nɨ men tav ateghtɨ a ikian markɨ, nɨ bar me kuavaremegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:13">Nɨ kamaghɨn damightɨ, nguazimɨn gumazamiziba bar fogham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">nɨ Jekopɨn ovavibar God.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 59:13">Nɨ uaghan nguazimɨn gumazamiziba bar men atrivim.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 59:13">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 59:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14"/>Me dɨmagaribar ua nguibar ekiamɨn izegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">afiabar mɨn aroava nguibamɨn azenan arui.<verse eid="PSA 59:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15"/>Me afiabar mɨn, damɨsɨ dagheba buri daru, egh damegh izɨvaghan kogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:15">me puvɨra dapurɨva arangam.<verse eid="PSA 59:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 22:3">2 Samuel 22:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 46:1">Onger Akaba 46:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:13">88:13</ref></char>
    </note>Osɨmtɨzir bar avɨriba faragha na bativizɨ, nɨ nan dɨvazimɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">Kɨ nɨn aven modogha itima nɨ bar deragha nan gari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:16">Kamaghɨn, kɨ mɨzarazibar vaghvagh nɨn gavgavim ko apangkuvir arazim gɨnɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">ighiabar amu nɨn ziar ekiam fam.<verse eid="PSA 59:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">59:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 59:9-10">Onger Akaba 59:9-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O God, nɨrara nɨ gavgavim na ganɨga deragha nan gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">Nɨrara nɨ nan danganir mogomemɨn mɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 59:17">egha bar nan apangkufi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:17">Bizir kaba bagha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">kɨ ighiam bangɨ nɨn ziam fasa.<verse eid="PSA 59:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59"/>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akuragh uabɨ iniasa, God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir ighiabar faragha zuim a gumazamizibav kɨmtɨ, me tiarir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ ighiar kam bangam, “Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavimɨn akɨmarir aghuim.”</para>
  <para style="d">Ighiar kam kamagh en sure gami. Bar fomɨra Devit Sirian gumaziba ko mɨsosi, kar Mesopotemian nguazim ko Soban kantrin adarasi. Ezɨ Joap uamategha izegha Idomɨn kantrin ghua Danganir Zarir Amangsɨzir Avɨrim Itimɨn ikia, me mɨsogha men 12,000pla gumazibav soghezɨ me ariaghire. Dughiar kam Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Onger akar kabar mam, me ziam Miktam, a garɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:13">2 Samuel 8:13</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 18:12">1 Eghaghaniba 18:12</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ akɨrim ragha e gasaragha uam en garir puvatɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:1">en apaniba e mɨsogha e abɨra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 60:1">Nɨ adarim en ikia kamaghɨn ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:1">nɨ datɨrɨghɨn uamategh izɨ en akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 60:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2"/>Nɨ Israelɨn nguazim gamizɨ mɨkɨmkɨzim a batozɨ a tongɨra bigha torir bar ekiam iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:2">Nɨ a gamizɨ a bigha akuar pumuning iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 60:2">Kamaghɨn, nɨ uam an akuamning inigh aning dukuaghtɨ a ua gavgafigh.<verse eid="PSA 60:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3"/>E nɨn gumazamiziba, nɨ osɨmtɨzir avɨriba e ganɨngi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">mati nɨ wainɨn onganim e ganɨdima, e anepava ongani.<verse eid="PSA 60:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:26">Aisaia 5:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:10-12">11:10-12</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nir avɨzitam fegh ghuavanaboghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:4">nɨn atiatia nɨn apengan iti darazi an ganigh fogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 60:4">Eghtɨ men apaniba men agɨntɨghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 60:4">me arɨ izɨ nɨn nir avɨzim batogh an apengan deragh ikiam.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 60:4">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 60:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5"/>Nɨ bar ifongezir darazi bar deravɨra ikiasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:5">nɨ uan agharir guvir gavgavimɨn en suiragh en akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 60:5">Nɨ en azangsɨzim baragh!<verse eid="PSA 60:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6"/>God uan Dɨpenimra ikia ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">“Kɨ apaniba ko mɨsogha me abɨragha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 60:6">Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn Sekemɨn nguibamɨn nguazim ko Sukotɨn danganir zarim abɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">egh uan gumazamizibar anɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 60:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7"/>Guizbangɨra, Gileatɨn nguazim ko Manasen nguazim, aning nana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">Ezɨ Efraimɨn nguazim a nan mɨdorozir dapanir asuamɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 60:7">Ezɨ Judan nguazim mati nan atrivir fidizim.<verse eid="PSA 60:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8"/>Moapɨn kantri, a nan itarir dɨpar kɨ ruemɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">Idomɨn kantri, a nan danganir kɨ uan dagarir asuaba arɨzimɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 60:8">Ezɨ Filistiaba, kɨ mɨdorozimɨn me abɨragha bar akuegha pamten dei.”<verse eid="PSA 60:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9"/>O God, tinara na inigh gavgavim itir nguibar kamɨn aven mangam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:9">Tina nan faragh mangɨtɨ, kɨ Idomɨn kantrin ekiamɨn aven mangam?<verse eid="PSA 60:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10"/>O God, nɨ akɨrim ragha e gasaras ti?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:10">Nɨ ti en mɨdorozir gumazibar akurvaghan aghua?<verse eid="PSA 60:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">60:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:8">Onger Akaba 118:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:3">146:3</ref></char>
    </note>O God, gumazibar gavgavibar akurvazim a pura bizim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:11">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ en akuraghtɨ e uan apaniba ko mɨsogham.<verse eid="PSA 60:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12"/>E fo, Godɨn akurvazimra, e uan apanibav sogh me abɨnigham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:12">A uabɨ en apanibav sogh me agɨvagham.<verse eid="PSA 60:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60"/>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim deragh uabɨn ganasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim, kar an onger akam. Gumazir kam, gumazir gitabav sozibav kɨmtɨ me ighiam bangam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1"/>O God, nɨ kuarim atɨgh nan dɨmdiam baragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:1">kɨ nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba nɨ deragh da baragh.<verse eid="PSA 61:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:2">Onger Akaba 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 42:6">42:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 77:3">77:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 94:22">94:22</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uan nguibamɨn saghon iti, ezɨ nan navim bar oseme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">Nɨ nan akurvaghasa kɨ nɨn dei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 61:2">Nɨ na inigh mangɨ dagɨar gavgavimɨn aven na modoghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">nan apaniba na gasɨghasɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 61:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 18:10">Aghuzir Akaba 18:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨrara nɨ nan dɨvazir bar gavgavimɨn iti, ezɨ kɨ an modima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:3">nan apaniba na abɨnamin tuaviba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 61:3">Nɨrara dɨpenir ruarir gavgavimɨn mɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:3">bar deragha nan gara na geghufi.<verse eid="PSA 61:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:8">Onger Akaba 17:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:4">27:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:4">91:4</ref></char>
    </note>Nan ifongiam kamakɨn, kɨ zurara nɨn dɨpenimɨn ikɨ mamaghɨra ikɨ mangɨ ovegham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:4">Kɨ, tuarir nguziba uan amebamɨn avɨzimɨn apengan ikia deragha iti moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 61:4">kɨ nɨn apengan bar deravɨra ikiasa.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 61:4">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 61:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5"/>God, kɨ nɨ ko akam akɨrigha mɨkemezir biziba nɨ da baregha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:5">Gumazamizir nɨn atiatia nɨn ziam feba, nɨ bizir aghuiba me ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 61:5">Arazir kamra nɨ uaghan bizir aghuiba na ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 61:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6"/>Nɨ atrivim ateghtɨ, an azenir avɨribar angamɨra ikɨvɨra ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:6">Nɨ aneteghtɨ, a dughiar ruarimɨn nguazimɨn ikegh.<verse eid="PSA 61:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7"/>O God, nɨ aneteghtɨ a nɨn damazimɨn dughiar ruarimɨn atrivimɨn ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:7">Nɨ bar a gifongegha mɨkemezɨ moghɨra deragha bizibagh amua,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 61:7">uan nɨghnɨzim gɨghavkɨrir puvatɨ, kamaghɨra nɨ bar deragh a geghuv an gan.<verse eid="PSA 61:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">61:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 56:12">Onger Akaba 56:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ kamaghɨn damutɨ, kɨ dughiabar zurara akar faragha nɨ ko dɨkɨrɨzibar gɨn mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:8">zurara ighiaba bangɨ nɨn ziar ekiam fam.<verse eid="PSA 61:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61"/>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62"/>
  <para style="s">God uabɨra deragha en gara e geghufi</para>
  <para style="d">Devit igiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">An onger akar kabar faragha zuir gumazim Jedutun gɨnɨghnɨgha, onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:39">Onger Akaba 37:39</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 59:9">59:9</ref></char>
    </note>Godra, kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikia a baghavɨra mɨzua iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:1">Anarɨra, a nan akurvazima kɨ angamɨra ikiavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 62:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:6">Onger Akaba 62:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:26">89:26</ref></char>
    </note>Godra, a nan dagɨamra, ezɨ kɨ an aven modima, a nan akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:2">A nan dɨvazir gavgavimɨn mɨn iti, ezɨ kɨ akongan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 62:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3"/>Ia dughiaba manmaghɨn, na gasɨghasɨghasa na bagha izi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">Ia ghaze, kɨ dɨvazir ghurimɨn mɨn irɨgh bar dɨpɨrighiregh bar gɨvagham.<verse eid="PSA 62:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4"/>Kɨ ziar ekiam iti, eghtɨ ia na abɨragh nan ziar ekiar kam gasɨghasɨghasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">Ia ifavarir arazim bar a gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:4">Ia uan akabar God deragh na damuasa ia a mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">ezɨ ian navir averiaba ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 62:4">“God a gasɨghasɨkigh.”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 62:4">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 62:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:1">Onger Akaba 62:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godra ikia a baghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:5">Anarɨra deragha nan garima, kɨ angamɨra ikiavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 62:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6"/>Godra, a nan dagɨam, ezɨ kɨ an aven modima, a nan akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:6">A nan dɨvazir gavgavimɨn mɨn iti, ezɨ kɨ akongan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 62:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 46:1">Onger Akaba 46:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 85:9">85:9</ref></char>
    </note>God uabɨra nan akurvagha ziar ekiam na ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:7">A nan dagɨamɨn mɨn itima, kɨ an aven modi.<verse eid="PSA 62:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 1:15">1 Samuel 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 52:8">Onger Akaba 52:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 26:4">Aisaia 26:4</ref></char>
    </note>Nan adarasi, ia zurara nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">Egh osɨmtɨzir ia itiba ko nɨghnɨzir ia itiba, ia bar da isɨ a danɨng.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 62:8">E ia a bagh mangɨ an aven mongegh deraghvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 62:8">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 62:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9"/>Gumazir kɨniba mati, amɨnim pura akamɨn otiva zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">Gumazir ziaba itiba, me uaghan pura biziba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:9">E men osɨmtɨziba tuisɨgh fogham, me guizbangɨrama osemes ti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">Men osɨmtɨziba akamɨn otivir amɨnim ko magh ghue.<verse eid="PSA 62:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:8">Aisaia 61:8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 22:29">Esekiel 22:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:15">Luk 12:15</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:10">1 Timoti 6:10</ref></char>
    </note>Ia mɨdorozir arazim ko okɨmakɨar arazim kamaghɨn aning gɨnɨghnɨghan markɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">“Aning dera, aning e damightɨ e dagɨar avɨriba ikiam.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:10">Ian dagɨaba ko ian biziba bar avɨrasemeghtɨ, ia kamaghɨn mɨkɨman markɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">“Bizir kaba darara en gavgaviba.”<verse eid="PSA 62:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11"/>Nan orarazim, God dughiar avɨribar kamaghɨn mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:11">“Kɨ God, kɨ gavgavir ekiam iti.<verse eid="PSA 62:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">62:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:11">Jop 34:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:8">Onger Akaba 103:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Jeremaia 17:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Matyu 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:8">1 Korin 3:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:23">Akar Mogomem 2:23</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ zurara gumazamizibar apangkufi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:12">Ekiam, nɨ gumazamiziba amir ingangariba baghvɨra ivezim isɨ me danɨngam.”<verse eid="PSA 62:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62"/>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim God ko ikiasa a ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ghua Judan Distrighɨn aven itir gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ikia, ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 23:14">1 Samuel 23:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 42:2">Onger Akaba 42:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 84:2">84:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 143:6">143:6</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ nan God, kɨ nɨn ganasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">nɨ baghavɨra mɨzua iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:1">Kɨ mati, dɨpaba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">dɨpam bagha ariaghiri moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:1">nan duam nɨ ko ikiasa ifongezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">kɨ bar uabɨ isa nɨ ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 63:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2"/>Kɨ nɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven nɨn ganasa ifonge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:2">nɨ uan gavgavim ko ziar ekiam nan akaghasa kɨ ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 63:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3"/>Nguazir kamɨn ikɨrɨmɨrim a dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:3">ezɨ nɨn apangkuvir arazim a gafiragha bar moghɨra dera.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 63:3">Kamaghɨn, kɨ nɨn ziam fe.<verse eid="PSA 63:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4"/>Kɨ angamɨra ikɨvɨra ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:4">nɨ mɨnabɨva nɨn ziam fɨvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 63:4">Kɨ uan dafariba fegh ghuanabogh nɨ ko mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 63:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5"/>Nan duam bar deraghavɨra ikia mati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:5">gumazim dagher aghuiba amegha bar ikɨri.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 63:5">Kamaghɨn, kɨ bar akuegha nɨn ziam fa ighiabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 63:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6-7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:6-7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 42:8">Onger Akaba 42:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 61:4">61:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:55">119:55</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 149:5">149:5</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ dughiabar zurara nan akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:6-7">Ezɨ kɨ dɨmagaribar uan mɨsiam girɨghav ikia nɨrara nɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:6-7">Kɨ tuarir nguzim uan amebamɨn avɨzimɨn apengan iti moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:6-7">kɨ bar nɨn boroghɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 63:6-7">bar akuegha ighiabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 63:6-7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 26:9">Aisaia 26:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan duam nɨ ko poroghav iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:8">ezɨ nɨn agharim deragha na avara.<verse eid="PSA 63:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9"/>Gumazir na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasava amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:9">me Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 63:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10"/>Me mɨdorozim damu an aven oveghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:10">afiar atiaba men mɨkarzibar amam.<verse eid="PSA 63:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">63:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Godɨn Araziba 6:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:23">Aisaia 45:23</ref></char>
    </note>Eghtɨ Atrivim God bagh bar akuegham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">Gumazir Godɨn ziam dɨbora a koma akam akɨriziba, me an gɨn mangɨ bar akuegham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 63:11">Gumazir ifariba, God men akabar kumightɨ me mɨkɨman kogham.<verse eid="PSA 63:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63"/>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim God a geghuv deragh an ganasa, an a ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Kar gumazir onger akabar faragha zuimɨn ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1"/>O God, gumazir kuraba na gasɨghasɨghasava ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:1">ezɨ kɨ osɨmtɨzir bar ekiamɨn aven iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 64:1">Nɨ nan mɨgɨrɨgɨam barakigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:1">eghtɨ me na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ ovengan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 64:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2"/>Gumazir kuraba modogha uari akuvagha na mɨsogh na gasɨghasɨghasa akabav sosi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:2">Kamaghɨn, nɨ deragh na geghuv na modoghtɨ me na gasɨghasɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 64:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3"/>Me mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba bar ghumigha mɨdorozir sabamɨn mɨn nan mɨkarzim aghori.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:3">Men akar kuraba nan akuighav iti,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 64:3">mati gumazim igharazitav gasasava barir pim ana akuighav iti.<verse eid="PSA 64:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4"/>Me atiatir puvatɨgha mongeghav ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:4">akaba gumazir aghuibagh asa me mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 64:4">Kamaghɨn me bar zuamɨrama asi.<verse eid="PSA 64:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:11">Onger Akaba 10:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 59:7">59:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:11">Aghuzir Akaba 1:11</ref></char>
    </note>Me gumaziba bagh azuazim aguaraghtɨ a men suighasa me uariv gei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">Me arazir kurar kam damuasa nɨmɨra uarira uariv gɨa, gavgavim uari ganɨga ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 64:5">“Tina e gɨfogham?”<verse eid="PSA 64:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6"/>Me arazir kurabar amuasa akam mɨsuegha gɨvagha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">“E arazir kuram damuasa nɨghnɨzir aghuir mam batogha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 64:6">E damuasa amir bizir kam, gumazitam bar a gɨfozir puvatɨ.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">Guizbangɨra, e gumazibar nɨghnɨziba ko navir averiabagh fozir puvatɨ, da bar modo.<verse eid="PSA 64:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7"/>Me kamaghɨn damutɨ God uan barimɨn me gaseghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:7">me zuamɨra duar ekiam inigham.<verse eid="PSA 64:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8"/>Me gumazir igharazibagh asɨghasɨghasa mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">kamaghɨn God meraram asɨghasɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 64:8">Eghtɨ gumaziba men gan beniba aku</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 64:8">men ingarɨva akam.<verse eid="PSA 64:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9"/>Gumazamiziba bar Godɨn atiatingam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">Egh God amizir bizir kam mɨkɨm zurara a gɨnɨghnɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 64:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">64:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:11">Onger Akaba 32:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 58:10">58:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:3">68:3</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir arazir aghuibagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">me Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh bar akongegh a bagh mangɨ bizir kurar kamɨn modogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 64:10">Gumazamizir navir aghuiba itiba, Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 64:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64"/>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn gumazamiziba bar akuegha a mɨnabi</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1"/>O God, e Saionɨn nguibamɨn mangɨ nɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:1">Egh fomɨra nɨ ko akam akɨrizir bizir kabar amightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 65:1">da guizbangɨrama otivigham.<verse eid="PSA 65:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2"/>Nɨ guizbangɨra en mɨgɨrɨgɨaba barasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:2">Kamaghɨn, e gumazamiziba bar moghɨra nɨ bagh mangam.<verse eid="PSA 65:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3"/>E uan arazir kuraba bagh nɨ bagh mangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:3">En arazir kurabar osɨmtɨziba e abɨrima e bar iraghue,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 65:3">ezɨ nɨrara en arazir kuraba gɨn amadi.<verse eid="PSA 65:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:12">Onger Akaba 33:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 36:8">36:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 84:4">84:4</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir nɨ uan Dɨpenimɨn ikiasa mɨsevegha inigha ghueziba, me bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">Nɨn Dɨpenir kam, bizir bar aghuir avɨriba an iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 65:4">Kamaghɨn, e nɨn Dɨpenimɨn gumazamiziba uari akuvi naghɨn ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 65:4">navir amɨrizim ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 65:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5"/>O God, nɨ en akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">Nɨ en azangsɨziba baragha ingangarir bar ekiar aghuibagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:5">Gumazamizir nguazir kamɨn saghuiamɨn itiba, me nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">Men marazi uaghan ongarir bar ekiamɨn vongɨn saghon ikia, nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 65:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6"/>Nɨ uan gavgavimɨn mɨghsɨabagh amizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:6">da otivigha uan danganibara iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 65:6">Nɨn gavgavir kam bar moghɨram ekefe.<verse eid="PSA 65:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7"/>Ongarim dɨkavima, nɨrarama a mɨgeima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">an aghumra irɨghav ikia dɨpɨraghirir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 65:7">Nɨ gumazamizibar mɨdorozibagh ami da gefi.<verse eid="PSA 65:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8"/>Gumazamiziba bizir kabar gara bar nɨn atiatingi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">Me aruem anaga uaghiri naghɨn bizir nɨ amir kabar gara,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 65:8">nɨ bagha bar akongegha, pamten diava arai.<verse eid="PSA 65:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">65:9-10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 46:4">Onger Akaba 46:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 72:6">72:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:13">104:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:24">104:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 147:8">147:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 147:14">147:14</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nguazim damutɨ a deravɨra ikiasa, nɨ amozim amadima a izi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">Nɨ nguazim gamima a deravɨra itima, dagheba a gisɨn deraghavɨram aghui.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:9">God, nɨn Fanem dɨpaba bar a gizɨvazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">a ivemara ghua danganibar ghuaghira datir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 65:9">Arazir kamɨn, dagher avɨriba nguazir kamɨn otifi.<verse eid="PSA 65:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10"/>Nɨ amozir avɨriba amadima, da azenibagh izi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">ezɨ dɨpam nguazimɨn aven ghuaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 65:10">Dɨpam nguazim gami an amɨraghɨrɨzɨ dagheba deraghavɨram aghui.<verse eid="PSA 65:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11"/>Nɨ danganir manamɨn iti, dagher aghuiba danganir kamɨn ikɨ bar avɨrasemegham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:11">Nɨ bar en deragha daghebagh amima, da otiva bar avɨraseme.<verse eid="PSA 65:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12"/>Danganir dadaba itiba, bulmakauba ko sipsipba dagh izefi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:12">Azenir avɨriba mɨghsɨabar ikɨtɨ, mɨghsɨaba bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 65:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13"/>Danganir dadaba itiba, sipsipɨn bar avɨriba iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:13">Danganir zarir mɨghsɨabar tongɨn itiba, witba bar dagh izɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 65:13">Bizir kaba bar moghɨra gumazir God bagha bar akuegha an ziam febar mɨn damuam.<verse eid="PSA 65:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65"/>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66"/>
  <para style="s">Me God mɨnabɨva an ziam fasa onger akabagh ami</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir mam, gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 100:1">Onger Akaba 100:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ia nguazimɨn itir gumazamiziba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:1">God bagh pamtem dɨmɨva bar akongegh an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 66:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2"/>E ighiaba bangɨ an ziar ekiamɨn gun mɨkɨm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:2">an ziar ekiam fɨtɨ, a bar pɨn ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 66:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3"/>E Godɨn mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 66:3">“Bizir nɨ amiba da bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">Nɨn gavgavim bar moghɨram ekefe,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 66:3">ezɨ nɨn apaniba bar atiatigha, nɨn damazimɨn uan teviba apɨri.”<verse eid="PSA 66:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 67:3">Onger Akaba 67:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:1-2">96:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 117:1">117:1</ref></char>
    </note>Nguazimɨn gumazamiziba bar nɨn ziam fava,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">ighiabagh amua ziar ekiam nɨ ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 66:4">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 66:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 46:8">Onger Akaba 46:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ia izɨ God amizir bizibar ganigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:5">A gumazamizibar tongɨn bizir bar ekiabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 66:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21">Ua Me Ini 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Josua 3:14-17</ref></char>
    </note>An ongarim gamizɨ a dakezɨ, nguazir mɨdiarim otozɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">en ovaviba puram a gisɨn arua dɨpam abigha ize.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 66:6">Me iza vongɨn otivigha, bizir an amizir kam bagha bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 66:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7"/>A gavgavir bar ekiam ikia, atrivimɨn ikia mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">A kantribar gumazamiziba amir ingangariba, a bar deragha dar gari.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 66:7">Gumazir akaba batoziba uari fan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 66:7">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 66:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8"/>Ia bar moghɨra izɨ, e uan Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:8">E an ziam fɨtɨ gumazamiziba bar e baragham.<verse eid="PSA 66:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 121:3">Onger Akaba 121:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A bar deragha e geghuva en garima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:9">e angamɨra ikiavɨra itima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 66:9">arazir kuram e abɨrazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 66:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:3">Onger Akaba 17:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:10">Aisaia 48:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:9">Sekaraia 13:9</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:6-7">1 Pita 1:6-7</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazim avimɨn silva tuagha an kuraba isa da makuri da bar zuezɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:10">e osɨmtɨziba ateri, God en gara e tuisɨgh foghasa, e gavgavis o puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 66:10">Egha tuavir kamɨn an e gamizɨ, e zue.<verse eid="PSA 66:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11"/>Nɨ osɨmtɨzir ekiaba e garɨki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:11">mati nɨ e bagha azuaziba guizɨ e dar aven ghue.<verse eid="PSA 66:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12"/>Nɨ en apanibar amamangatɨzɨ, me e dɨkabɨragha bar e rɨghɨrɨki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">E mati avim ko dɨpam e avarazɨ, e aningɨn tongɨn arui.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 66:12">Ezɨ nɨ datɨrɨghɨn e inigha danganir aghuimɨn ize.<verse eid="PSA 66:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13-14"/>Osɨmtɨzim faragha na batozɨ, kɨ nɨ koma akam akɨra ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:13-14">kɨ asɨzir avimɨn tue bar isia mɨghɨrizim isɨ, ofan mɨn nɨ danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 66:13-14">Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn akar dɨkɨrɨzir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:13-14">nɨn Dɨpenimɨn mangɨ ofan kam damuam.<verse eid="PSA 66:13-14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15"/>Kɨ asɨzir mɨkarziba sara itiba inigh izɨ, ofan mɨn da isɨ nɨ danɨngɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">da tueghtɨ da bar isi mɨghɨram.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 66:15">Kɨ sipsipɨn apuriba tueghtɨ, ofan kamɨn mughuriar aghuim nɨn mangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">Kɨ bulmakaun apuriba ko memeba inigh izɨ nɨ bagh ofa damuam.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 66:15">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 66:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16"/>Ia gumazamizir Godɨn atiatia an apengan itiba, ia izɨ nan akam baragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:16">God nan akurvaghasava amizir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 66:16">kɨ dar gun ia mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 66:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17"/>Kɨ faragha uabɨn akurvaghasa an dia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:17">egha uaghan an ziam fasa onger akabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 66:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:15">Aisaia 1:15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:31">Jon 9:31</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:3">Jems 4:3</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ ti arazir kuram uan navir averiamɨn a gifongezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:18">Ekiam nan azangsɨzim bareghan koghai.<verse eid="PSA 66:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">66:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 116:1-2">Onger Akaba 116:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Puvatɨ. A na baregha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:19">A guizbangɨra, kɨ a ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba ana da baregha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 66:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20"/>God nan azangsɨzim batoghezir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">Egha uan apangkuvir arazim na dam a inizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 66:20">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ an ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 66:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66"/>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67"/>
  <para style="s">Me dagher igiaba inigha, da bagha God mɨnabi</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim, kar an onger akam. Gumazir kam, gumazir gitabav sozibav kemezɨ me ighiam gami.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">67:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:25">Dɨboboniba 6:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:16">Onger Akaba 31:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:135">119:135</ref></char>
    </note>God, e kamaghɨn nɨn azai, nɨ deraghvɨra e damuva en apangkuv.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:1">Mati nɨn angazangarim e gisirazɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 67:1">nɨ ragh en gan en akurvagh.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 67:1">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 67:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2"/>Eghtɨ nguazimɨn gumazamiziba ganigh nɨn arazibagh fogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:2">Me kamaghɨn fogham, nɨ gavgavir bar ekiam ikia men akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 67:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3"/>O God, nan ifongiam, gumazamiziba bar nɨ gifuegh nɨn ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:3">Guizbangɨra, me nɨn ziar ekiam pɨrafam.<verse eid="PSA 67:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">67:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 96:10">Onger Akaba 96:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:13">96:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:9">98:9</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ guizbangɨra gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨgha, tuavir aghuim men akazɨ, me nɨn ifongiamɨn gɨrara zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, gumazamizibar naviba bar akueghɨva,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 67:4">ighiaba bangɨ nɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 67:4">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 67:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5"/>O God, nan ifongiam, gumazamiziba bar nɨ gifuegh nɨn ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:5">Guizbangɨra, me nɨn ziar ekiam pɨrafam.<verse eid="PSA 67:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">67:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:4">Ofa Gami 26:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 85:12">Onger Akaba 85:12</ref></char>
    </note>God, nɨ en God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:6">nɨ bar deragha e gami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 67:6">Ezɨ dagher aghuir avɨriba en nguazibar otifi.<verse eid="PSA 67:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7"/>Bar guizbangɨra, God deragha e gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:7">Nguazimɨn gumazamiziba bar an atiating an apengan ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 67:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67"/>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68"/>
  <para style="s">God Israelian akurazɨ me bar akonge</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akar kabar faragha zuim, gumazibav geima me Godɨn ziam fa ighiam bange.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1"/>Gumazamizir Godɨn apanim gamiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:1">a zuamɨra dɨkavigh izɨ tintinimɨn me batuegham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:1">Gumazamizir Godɨn apanimɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:1">me a gitagh aregham.<verse eid="PSA 68:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2"/>Amɨnim mɨgharim givai a ghua puvatɨzɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">God uan apaniba batuegham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:2">Kandel isia an dɨpam suaghiri moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">gumazamizir kuraba Godɨn damazimɨn ikuvigham.<verse eid="PSA 68:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3"/>Gumazamizir aghuiba, Godɨn damazimɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">naviba deragh bar akuegh ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 68:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4"/>God ghuariabagh aperagha overiamɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">Ia an tuavim akɨr.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:4">An ziam kara, Ikiavɨra Itir God.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:4">E an damazimɨn bar akuegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">ighiaba bangɨ ziar ekiam a danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 68:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">68:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 10:14">Onger Akaba 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:18">10:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:9">146:9</ref></char>
    </note>God uan Nguibamɨn ikia, borir ameboghfeziaba ariaghireziba deragha men gara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:5">paba ariaghirezir amiziba deragha men gari.<verse eid="PSA 68:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">68:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 107:34">Onger Akaba 107:34</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:6">Aposel 12:6</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir uarira itiba, a men adarazi isa me ko me akufi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">Ezɨ me uari ko ikia deragha iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:6">A kalabusɨn itir gumazamiziba inigha azenan izegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">me gamizɨ me deragha iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:6">Ezɨ gumazamizir akaba batoziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">a me gamizɨ me nguazir dɨpaba puvatɨzibar iti.<verse eid="PSA 68:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7"/>O God, nɨ fomɨra uan gumazamiziba men faragha ghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:7">me inigha iza gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganim garui.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 68:7">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 68:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">68:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:18">Ua Me Ini 19:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bar guizbangɨra, Israelian God, nɨ izegha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">Nɨ izegha gɨvazɨ, Sainain Mɨghsɨam mɨkɨmkɨzim a gunabavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:8">Mɨkɨmkɨzim otozɨ amozir dafam arɨki.<verse eid="PSA 68:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9"/>O God, nɨ amozir dafam amadazɨ, a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:9">nguazir kurar kam giza a gamizɨ a ua dera.<verse eid="PSA 68:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">68:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 26:5">Godɨn Araziba 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 26:9">26:9</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨn gumazamiziba nguazir kamɨn nguibabar ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:10">Nɨ bar dera, egha nɨ dagheba isa</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:10">onganarazibagh amir gumazamizibagh anɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 68:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11"/>Ekiam uan akam isa amizir avɨribagh anɨngizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:11">me a inigha ghua an gun mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 68:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12"/>Akar me kurir kam kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:12">“Atriviba uan mɨdorozir gumaziba ko, me bar moghɨra aregha gɨfa.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:12">Ezɨ amizir nguibamɨn itibara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:12">gumaziba mɨsogha inizir biziba uarigh anɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 68:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13"/>Men marazi sipsipba ko ikia atiatigha pura aghumra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">Amizir kaba uaghan silva ko gol uarir kurkegha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:13">kuarazir ozamɨn mɨn ganganiba bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">Ozamɨn avɨzimning silvan mɨn taghtasi, ezɨ an namnam golɨn mɨn taghtasi.<verse eid="PSA 68:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14"/>Atrivir maba Salmonɨn Mɨghsɨamɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:14">Ezɨ Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim men agɨrazɨ, me tintinimɨn are.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:14">Egha aisɨn amozim gamizɨ, a mɨghsɨar kam gizi.<verse eid="PSA 68:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15"/>O Basanɨn Mɨghsɨar ekiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:15">nɨ ruarir akɨrir avɨriba iti.<verse eid="PSA 68:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16"/>Nɨ mɨghsɨar ekiar ruarir akɨrir avɨriba itim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">God ua baghavɨra mɨghsɨar igharazim ginabagh a gisɨn dapiasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:16">Ezɨ nɨ manmaghsua, Godɨn mɨghsɨar igharazimɨn gara nɨn navim oseme?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">Guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God, mɨghsɨar kamɨn daperagh ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 68:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17"/>Ekiam Sainain Mɨghsɨam ategha iza uan Dɨpenimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">An mɨdorozir gumazir bar avɨriba, karisɨn gavgavir bar avɨribagh apiagha a ko izi.<verse eid="PSA 68:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">68:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:8">Efesus 4:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>God mɨghsɨar kamɨn ikiasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">bar pɨn ghuavanaga,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:18">kalabuziar gumazir avɨrim inizɨ, me a ko ghue.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:18">Gumazir an akam batoziba, a men bizir bar aghuiba, me dam a da ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, O Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgavim, nɨ kagh ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 68:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">68:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 55:22">Onger Akaba 55:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 65:5">65:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 46:4">Aisaia 46:4</ref></char>
    </note>E Ekiamɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:19">A dughiabar vaghvagha en akurvagha en osɨmtɨziba ateri.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:19">God uabɨ en Akurvazir Gumazim.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 68:19">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 68:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">68:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 49:15">Onger Akaba 49:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 56:13">56:13</ref></char>
    </note>En God, a uabɨ God, an en akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:20">Ikiavɨra Itir God, an en Ekiam, an en akurvazima, e ariaghiri puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 68:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21"/>Bar guizbangɨra, God uan apanibar dapaniba abɨghɨrarigham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:21">Gumazamizir kaba, me zurarama arazir kurabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 68:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22"/>Ekiam kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze, “Kɨ Basanɨn ian apaniba inigh uamategh izam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:22">Me ongarir konimɨn bar vɨn mar ikiam, pura bizim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:22">kɨ ua me inigh azenan izegham.<verse eid="PSA 68:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23"/>Ia uan apaniba bar me agɨvagh, men ghuziba uan dagariba ruegh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:23">Eghtɨ ian afiaba, men ghuzibar amɨ mangɨ uan ifongiaba agɨvagham.”<verse eid="PSA 68:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24"/>O God, nɨ nan Atrivim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:24">Gumazamiziba bar nɨn gari nɨ apanim ko mɨsogha anebɨragha, bar akuegha izi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:24">Me bar moghɨra nɨn gari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:24">nɨ ghua uan Dɨpenimɨn aven ghu.<verse eid="PSA 68:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25"/>Gumaziba onger akam gamua faragha zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:25">Ezɨ guivir igiaba tongɨra ikia tambarinbav sosi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:25">Gumazir gitabav soziba abuan iti.<verse eid="PSA 68:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26"/>Me kamaghɨn onge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:26">“E Godɨn gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:26">e uari akuvagha gɨfa, e Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:26">E Israelia, e Godɨn adarasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:26">e Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.”<verse eid="PSA 68:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27"/>Benjaminɨn ikɨzir muziarim men faragha zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">Men gɨrara, Judan anabamɨn gumazir dapaniba uan adarazi ko zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">Ezɨ men gɨrara, Sebulun anabam ko Naptalin anabamɨn gumazir dapaniba me zui.<verse eid="PSA 68:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28"/>O God, nɨ uan gavgavim en akagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:28">Gavgavir nɨ faragha en akazɨ kamra, nɨ datɨrɨghɨn en akagh.<verse eid="PSA 68:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29"/>Atriviba bizir aghuiba inigha iza, nɨn Dɨpenir Jerusalemɨn itimɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:29">nɨ ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 68:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30"/>Nɨ Asɨzir atiar dakarabar itir kamɨn atari moghɨn, nɨ Isipɨn atar.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">68:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gumazir maba ghaze, “Asɨzir atiar dakarabar itir kam,” kar kantri Isipɨn akar isɨn zuim.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">Nɨ bulmakaun apuriba uan nguziba ko men atari moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:30">nɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar atar.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:30">Nɨ men atar mangɨtɨ, me nɨ bagh teviba apɨrigh uan silvaba nɨ danɨng.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">Gumazir mɨdoroziba foriba, nɨ bar men agɨntɨghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:30">me arɨ tintinibar mangegh.<verse eid="PSA 68:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31"/>Isipɨn atrivim uan ingangarir gumaziba amadaghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:31">me Jerusalemɨn mangɨ nɨn akam baragham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:31">Eghtɨ Itiopiaba nɨ ko mɨkɨmsɨ uan dafariba fam.<verse eid="PSA 68:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32"/>Ia Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:32">ia onger akabar amu</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:32">egh Godɨn ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 68:32">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 68:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33"/>Overiar kam fomɨra iti, ezɨ God a gaperagha zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:33">Ia orakigh. God bar pamtemɨn dei.<verse eid="PSA 68:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34"/>Ia gumazamiziba bar, Godɨn ziar ekiamɨn gun mɨkɨm.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">A Israelian atrivim.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 68:34">An gavgavir ekiam, e overiamɨn pɨn an ganam.<verse eid="PSA 68:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35"/>Israelian God uan Dɨpenimɨn iti, ezɨ e an atiatingam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:35">A gavgavir ekiam isa uan gumazamizibagh anɨdi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 68:35"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:35">E Godɨn ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 68:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68"/>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa Godɨn azangsɨsi</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akar kabar faragha zuim gumazibav gɨa ghaze, <optbreak/>“Me Akɨmarir Aghuibar tiarimɨn gɨn mangɨ, ighiar kam bangɨ.”</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">69:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:2">Onger Akaba 69:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:14-15">69:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="JON 2:5">Jona 2:5</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nan akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:1">Dɨpam na avaragha anaga nan fɨragharimɨn tu.<verse eid="PSA 69:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">69:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:2">Onger Akaba 40:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ beghneazim itir dɨpamɨn suegha uaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">Kɨ tugh gavgavighamin nguazir gavgaviba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:2">Kɨ dɨpar konimɨn arua zuima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">dɨpam bar na avaraghasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 69:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3"/>O God, kɨ nɨn dia ghua nan dɨmdiaba bar moghɨra gɨvagha taghizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">nan kuarim nan pɨrizɨ, nan gavgaviba gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:3">Kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa fomɨra nɨ bagha gara ikia ghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">nan damazimning na gami.<verse eid="PSA 69:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4"/>Gumazir bar avɨrim pura nan apanim gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">Men dɨbobonim bar nan dapanir arɨzibagh afira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:4">Nan apaniba arazir kurabar na gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">ezɨ bizir me na gamir kaba mɨngariba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:4">Apanir kaba na gasɨghasɨghasa, akar ifavaribar na gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">Kɨ men bizitam okemezir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 69:4">me pura uan akaba na gasa ghaze, kɨ bizitaba pura me danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 69:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5"/>God, nɨ na gɨfo kɨ gumazir onganim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:5">Nan arazir kurabar osɨmtɨziba nɨn damazimɨn mongezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 69:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6"/>O Ekiam, nɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim, nɨ nan dɨmdiam baragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">nɨ na baraghan koghtɨ, nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn iti darasi aghumsɨzim iniam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:6">O Israelian God, nɨ nan dɨmdiam baragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">puvatɨghtɨ, gumazamiziba nɨn ziam fe darazi dɨpova, akar kurabar me mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 69:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7"/>Nɨ bangɨn, gumazamiziba dɨbovir akabar na mɨgeima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:7">kɨ aghumsɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 69:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8"/>Nan aveghbuaba gumazir igharazimɨn gari moghɨn nan gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:8">Ezɨ nan adarazi nguibar igharazibar gumazimɨn gari moghɨn nan gari.<verse eid="PSA 69:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">69:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:17">Jon 2:17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 15:3">Rom 15:3</ref></char>
    </note>Nan navir averiam bar nɨn Dɨpenim gifuegha a baghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:9">Egha kɨ pamtemɨn Dɨpenir kamɨn ingara deragha an garima, a deraghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 69:9">Gumazamizir maba akar kurabar nɨ mɨgei, ezɨ men akaba nan izi.<verse eid="PSA 69:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10"/>Kɨ dagheba ataghɨragha, arazir kamɨn kɨ nɨn damazimɨn uabɨra uabɨ abɨri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:10">Ezɨ gumazamiziba akar kurabar na mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 69:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11"/>Kɨ azirakar korotiaba azui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:11">ezɨ gumazamiziba na dɨpovava akar kurabar na mɨgɨavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 69:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12"/>Gumaziba tuavir akabar uari akuva ikia, na geghara na mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:12">Gumaziba wainɨn dɨpaba apava onganigha, na dɨghora onger akabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 69:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ uabɨ bizir kabagh nɨghnɨzir puvatɨ, kɨ nɨ ko mɨkɨmasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">Nɨ dughiatamɨn uan ifongiam ko apangkuvir ekiamɨn gɨn mangɨ nan azangsɨzim ikaragh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:13">Nɨ na ko akam akɨrigha gɨvagha an gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">Kamaghɨn, nɨ guizbangɨra nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 69:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14"/>Nɨ beghneazir kamɨn aven ua na inightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">kɨ an aven mangɨ ovengan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:14">Nɨ deragh na geghuv nan gantɨ, nan apaniba na gasɨghasɨghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">Eghtɨ osɨmtɨzir kam, dɨpar konimɨn mɨn na avaraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 69:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15"/>Nɨ na ateghtɨ aperiam na avan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">Nɨ na ateghtɨ kɨ mozimɨn magɨrɨghtɨ, a na avan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 69:15">Nɨ na ateghtɨ dɨpar konim na avan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 69:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ zurara nan apangkuvir arazir kam bar dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">kamaghɨn nɨ zurara nan azangsɨziba baragh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 69:16">Nɨn apangkuvim zurara nan iti,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 69:16">kamaghɨn nɨ izɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 69:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17"/>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, kamaghɨn nɨ nan mongan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:17">Osɨmtɨzir ekiam nan iti, kamaghɨn nɨ zuamɨra nan azangsɨziba ikaragh.<verse eid="PSA 69:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18"/>Nɨ nan boroghɨn izɨ egh nan akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:18">Nɨ nan apanibar dafaribar ua na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 69:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19"/>Gumazamizir akar kurabar na mɨgeiba, nɨ dagh fogha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:19">Egha nɨ fogha gɨfa, me na dɨpovava aghumsɨzim na ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 69:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">69:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 16:2">Jop 16:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 142:4">Onger Akaba 142:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:5">Aisaia 63:5</ref></char>
    </note>Akar kurar kaba, nan nɨghnɨzim gasɨghasɨgha nan navim gamizɨ, a bar moghɨrama oseme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">Ezɨ gavgaviba ua nan puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:20">Kɨ ghaze, gumazitaba ti tong nan apangkuvam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">ezɨ bar puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 69:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">69:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:48">Matyu 27:48</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:36">Mak 15:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26">Luk 23:26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-29">Jon 19:28-29</ref></char>
    </note>Mɨtiriam nan azima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:21">me aguiam daghem gatɨgha na ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:21">Ezɨ kuarim nan pɨrima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:21">me pura wainɨn kuram amasa na ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 69:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">69:22-23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 11:9-10">Rom 11:9-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kamaghɨn deragham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:22">dughiar me isar ekiaba bagha uari akuvibar,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 69:22">men isar ekiar kaba me damutɨ me irɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 69:22">mati azuazim asɨzim mɨsoke.<verse eid="PSA 69:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23"/>Nɨ men damazibar amightɨ amɨnim men pɨrightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:23">me ua ganan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:23">Nɨ men akɨragharibar amightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:23">me tugh gavgavighsɨ damuva avegham.<verse eid="PSA 69:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24"/>Nɨ puvɨra men atar mɨzazim me gasɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:24">Nɨn anɨngagharir kam me initɨ me oveng.<verse eid="PSA 69:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">69:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:20">Aposel 1:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Eghtɨ nguibar me itir kam pura ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:25">nɨ gumazitaba ateghtɨ, me men purirpenibar ikian markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 69:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26"/>Gumazamizir maba, nɨ faragha men arazir kuraba ikarvagha me gasɨghasɨki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:26">ezɨ gumazir kurar kaba paza me gamuavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:26">Gumazamizir maba, nɨ men mɨkarzibagh asɨghasɨghizɨ me mɨzaziba inizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:26">gumazir kuraba osɨmtɨziba me garɨgha dɨbovir akabar me mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 69:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27"/>Nɨ gumazir kurar kabar arazir kurabagh nɨghnɨghvɨra ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:27">Egh me ateghtɨ me nɨn gumazamizibar aven izan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 69:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">69:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:32">Ua Me Ini 32:32</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:5">Akar Mogomem 3:5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:8">13:8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 17:8">17:8</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ gumazamizir kabar ziaba, akɨnafarir zurara itimɨn aven da angarigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:28">Egh men ziaba, nɨn damazimɨn zuezir gumazamizibar ziaba koma ada osiran markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 69:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29"/>O God, kɨ osɨmtɨzir ekiam atera mɨzazim isi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:29">Nan akuragh ua na inightɨ kɨ ua deraka.<verse eid="PSA 69:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30"/>Kɨ Godɨn ziam fɨ egh onger akabar amuam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:30">Egh a mɨnabɨva an ziar ekiamɨn gun mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 69:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ damuamin arazir kam, nɨ a bagh bar akongegham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:31">Me bulmakauba tue da bar isia mɨghɨrir ofaba dera,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 69:31">eghtɨ nan arazir kam Godɨn damazimɨn bar dagh afiragham.<verse eid="PSA 69:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32"/>Gumazamizir osɨmtɨziba ateriba, me God nan akurazir bizimɨn ganigh bar akuegham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:32">Gumazamizir Godɨn ziam feba, me ua gavgavir igiam iniam.<verse eid="PSA 69:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God gumazamizir biziba puvatɨzibar azangsɨziba barasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:33">egha uan gumazamizir kalabusɨn itiba, a me gɨn amadir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 69:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34"/>Ia overiam ko, nguazim, ongarim ko osiriba ko, bizir bar ongarimɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:34">ia bar Godɨn ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 69:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35"/>Guizbangɨra, God Saionɨn nguibamɨn gumazamizibar akuragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">men apanibar dafaribar ua me inigh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 69:35">Judan nguibaba ua dar ingaram.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:35">Godɨn ingangarir gumaziba nguibar kabar aven deraghvɨra ikɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">nguazir kaba bar ada iniam.<verse eid="PSA 69:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36"/>Eghtɨ Godɨn ingangarir gumazibar ovavir boriba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:36">nguazir kaba iniam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:36">Gumazamizir kaba bar God gifongegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:36">nguazir kamɨn ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 69:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69"/>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 40:13-17">Onger Akaba 40:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">Devit, God an osɨmtɨzibar gan an akurvaghasa, an onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">70:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:17">Onger Akaba 40:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 141:1">141:1</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:1">nɨ ifuegh zuamɨra izɨ nan akuragh!<verse eid="PSA 70:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2"/>Gumazamizir maba na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">Eghtɨ nɨ me abɨnigh men nɨghnɨziba aghamsightɨ, me aghumsika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:2">Osɨmtɨzir kɨ isiba, gumazir maba dar gara bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">Nɨ men ziaba abɨnigh me batueghtɨ me mangɨ.<verse eid="PSA 70:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3"/>Gumazir dɨbovir akabar na mɨgeiba, nɨ bar aghumsɨzir ekiam me danɨngigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:3">eghtɨ me uan arazir kurar me amir kam bagh, akongegh fogham.<verse eid="PSA 70:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4"/>Eghtɨ gumazamizir nɨ baghavɨra zuiba, men naviba deraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">me bar akuegh ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:4">Gumazamizir kaba, nɨ bar moghɨra ua me ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">Nɨ me bagha amizir ingangarir kam me bar a gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 70:4">Egh me zurara kamagh mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 70:4">“God, a guizbangɨra bar dera.”<verse eid="PSA 70:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5"/>O God, kɨ gavgaviba puvatɨgha uabɨra uabɨn akurvaghan iburaghburaki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">Kamaghɨn, nɨ zuamɨra na bagh izegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:5">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨrara nan akurvagha ua na isir gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">Nɨ suighsuighan markɨ, nɨ zuamɨra izɨ nan akuragh!<verse eid="PSA 70:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70"/>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir ghurim God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">71:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:1-3">Onger Akaba 31:1-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨ ko ikɨtɨ nɨ na geghuv na avaragh nan gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:1">gumazir kuraba na gasɨghasɨghtɨ kɨ aghumsɨghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 71:1">Nɨ me ateghtɨ me na abɨnan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 71:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2"/>Nɨ zurara arazir aghuim gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:2">Egh nɨ uan arazir aghuir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ nan akuragh!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 71:2">Kɨ nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 71:2">nɨ da baregh ua na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 71:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">71:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:2">Onger Akaba 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 42:8">42:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:1">90:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:9">91:9</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ dagɨar ekiamɨn mɨn na modogh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">Nɨ dɨvazir gavgavimɨn mɨn ikɨ na ekɨarughtɨ, nan apaniba na abɨnan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:3">Kɨ nɨn aven modogh ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">Nɨrara deragh na geghuv nan gantɨ, kɨ deragh ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 71:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4"/>Nan God, nɨ gumazir kurabar dafarimɨn ua na ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:4">Me arazir kurabar amuasa bar gavgafi.<verse eid="PSA 71:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5"/>Ekiam, kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:5">Kɨ fomɨra uan igiamra ikia, nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 71:5">iza datɨrɨghɨn ikia kamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 71:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6"/>Nan ikɨrɨmɨrir kɨ itir kam, a nɨn agharimra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">Nan amebam na batezɨ dughiamra, nɨ na geghuva deragha nan gara iza datɨrɨkɨn.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 71:6">Kamaghɨn, kɨ nɨn ziam zuraram a fam.<verse eid="PSA 71:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7"/>Na bativizir biziba, gumazamizir avɨriba dar ganigha fo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:7">nɨ na geghuv nan ganasa gavgafi.<verse eid="PSA 71:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8"/>Dughiabar zurara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:8">kɨ nɨn ziar ekiam fɨ, an gun gumazamizibav kɨmasa.<verse eid="PSA 71:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">71:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 92:14">Onger Akaba 92:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 46:4">Aisaia 46:4</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ ghurigha gɨvagha gavgaviba puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:9">nɨ na ategh akɨrim ragh na gasan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 71:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10"/>Nan apaniba na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:10">uari akuvagha akabav sosi.<verse eid="PSA 71:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11"/>Me ghaze, “God anetegha gɨvazɨ, gumazir an akurvaghamiba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:11">Aria, e an agɨragh an suiraka.”<verse eid="PSA 71:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">71:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:11">Onger Akaba 22:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 38:21-22">38:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 70:5">70:5</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ na ategh nan saghon ikian markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:12">O nan God, nɨ zuamɨra izɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 71:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13"/>Gumazir akaba na gasiba, nɨ me abɨnigh bar moghɨra me agɨfagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:13">Me na gasɨghasɨghasa, nɨ me gasɨghasɨgh men ziaba abɨnightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 71:13">me okam nɨghnɨgh bar aghumsigham.<verse eid="PSA 71:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">71:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 130:7">Onger Akaba 130:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ nan akurvaghsɨ, kɨ nɨ mɨzuam nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:14">Egh nɨn ziam fɨ mangɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 71:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15"/>Kɨ nɨn arazir aghuimɨn gun gumazamizibav kɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">Bizir aghuir nɨ amir kabar dɨboboniba, kɨ deragha dagh fozir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 71:15">Nɨ ua na inizir arazir kam, kɨ dughiabar zurara an gun me mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 71:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16"/>O Ekiam, nɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨn gavgavir ekiam gɨnɨghnɨgh nɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:16">Egh kamaghɨn akam akun suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 71:16">“Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨra dera.”<verse eid="PSA 71:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17"/>O God, kɨ igiamra ikia iza datɨrɨghɨn, nɨ nan sure gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:17">Ezɨ bizir aghuir nɨ amir kaba, kɨ dughiar kamɨn dar gun mɨkɨmvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 71:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">71:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:31">Onger Akaba 22:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:4-6">78:4-6</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn ghurigha gɨvagha bar ghurapani.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">God, nɨ na ataghɨraghan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:18">Nɨ na ko ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">kɨ nɨn gavgavir ekiamɨn gun gumazamizir gɨn otivamibav kɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 71:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19"/>God, nɨn arazir aghuim nguazir kamɨn danganiba bar dagh izɨvagha, uanaga overiamɨn tu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">egha gumazamizibar damazibar azenara iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 71:19">Nɨ ingangarir bar ekiam gami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:19">Ezɨ nguazir kamɨn gumazitam nɨn mɨn garir pu. Bar puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">Nɨ bar moghɨra me gafira.<verse eid="PSA 71:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20"/>Osɨmtɨzir kaba nɨ na bagha da amangizɨ da izi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">Ezɨ kɨ fo, nɨ gavgavim ua na danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:20">Kɨ mati aremegha nguazir torimɨn ikia fo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">nɨ ua na inigh azenan izam.<verse eid="PSA 71:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21"/>Nɨ nan ziam damightɨ a bar ekevegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:21">egh na damightɨ kɨ navir amɨrizim ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 71:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22"/>Kɨ gita mɨsoghtɨ an ararer aghuim otivtɨ, kɨ nɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">O nan God, nɨn akam a bar guizbangɨra, ezɨ nɨ na ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 71:22">Kamaghɨn, kɨ nɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:22">Nɨ, Israelian Godɨn Bar Zuezim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">kɨ buam mɨsogh ighiam bangɨ ziar ekiam nɨ danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 71:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23"/>Kɨ ighiam bangɨ bar akongegh dɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">Kɨ nɨn ighiaba bangɨ, egh uan akamra da bangan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:23">Puvatɨ. Nɨ ua na inizir bizir kam bagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">kɨ uan navim ko, nɨghnɨzim sara nɨn ighiaba bangam.<verse eid="PSA 71:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24"/>Gumazamiziba na gasɨghasɨghasava amima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">nɨ me abɨrazɨ me bar aghumsɨki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:24">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ dughiabar zurara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">arazir aghuir nɨ amizir kamɨn gun gumazamizibav kɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 71:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71"/>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72"/>
  <para style="s">God atrivimɨn akurvaghasa, gumazim a bagha God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Solomon ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1"/>O God, nɨ uan arazir aghuiba deravɨra atrivim geghan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:1">Eghtɨ a kotɨn aven deragh gumazamiziba tuisɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:1">Nɨn kotiar araziba, da bar guizbangɨra zui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:1">egh nɨ atrivir kamɨn akuraghtɨ an kotiar araziba guizbangɨra mangɨ.<verse eid="PSA 72:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2"/>Eghtɨ a nɨn gumazamiziba ko gumazir onganarazibagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:2">an arazir aghuimra me gativagh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 72:2">guizɨn arazimɨn gɨn mangɨ men araziba tuisɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 72:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3"/>Nɨ men ingangaribar aven bizir aghuir avɨribar amutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:3">men dabirabim deragham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:3">Nɨ gumazamizibar amutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:3">me arazir aghuibar gɨn mangɨ.<verse eid="PSA 72:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4"/>Atrivim deragh onganarazibagh amir gumazamizibar akurvagh men osɨmtɨziba akɨram.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">A biziba puvatɨzir gumazamizibar akurvagham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 72:4">Egh gumazir igharaz darazi gasɨghasɨghasava amiba, a me abɨnam.<verse eid="PSA 72:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5"/>O God, kɨ kamaghɨn nɨn azai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:5">Aruem ko iakɨnim isiragh ikɨvɨra ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 72:5">nɨn gumazamiziba zurara nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 72:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6"/>Nɨ atrivim damightɨ a gumazir aghuimɨn mɨn ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:6">an arazir aghuiba, amozim azenibagh izi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 72:6">dagheba dar aghui moghɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 72:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7"/>A ikɨvɨra ikiamin dughiar kam, gumazamiziba arazir aghuimra gɨn mangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:7">Iakɨnim isiraghavɨra itir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 72:7">dabirabir aghuim otiv mangɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 72:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">72:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 9:10">Sekaraia 9:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An atrivimɨn ikɨ ongarimɨn roghɨra itir gumazamiziba ko saghon itiba, a me gativagh men ganam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:8">Eghtɨ an nguazir oteviba, Yufretisɨn Fanemɨn ikegh mangɨ nguazir kam bar an mangam.<verse eid="PSA 72:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9"/>Atrivir kamɨn apanir maba dɨpaba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ikɨ a bagh teviba apɨram.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:9">An apaniba an damazimɨn nguazim giregham.<verse eid="PSA 72:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10"/>Spenɨn kantrin atriviba ko arighatɨzibar atriviba, me bizir aghuiba a danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">Egh uaghan, Seban kantri ko, Arebian kantrin atriviba, me a bagh takisba inigh izam.<verse eid="PSA 72:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11"/>Atriviba bar izɨ a bagh teviba apɨram.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:11">Eghtɨ kantriba bar, dar gumazamiziba an ingangaribar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 72:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12"/>Guizbangɨra, an onganarazibagh amir gumazamizibar dɨmdiaba baragha men akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:12">Gumazir onganarazibagh amua akurvaziba men puvatɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 72:12">a uabɨ men akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 72:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13"/>Gumazamizir onganarazibagh amua gavgaviba puvatɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:13">a men apangkufi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 72:13">Gumazir biziba puvatɨziba a ua me isi.<verse eid="PSA 72:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">72:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 116:15">Onger Akaba 116:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba, me gasɨghasɨgh me abɨnsɨ damutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:14">a men akuragh ua me iniam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 72:14">An ifongiam bar men ekevezɨ, an arazir kabar me gami.<verse eid="PSA 72:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15"/>Atrivimɨn ikɨrɨmɨrim a ruaragham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">Eghtɨ Arebian kantrin gumaziba gol a danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:15">Gumazamiziba a bagh God ko mɨkɨmtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">God zurara deravɨra a damu an akurvagham.<verse eid="PSA 72:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16"/>Dagher avɨriba Lebanonɨn kantrin otivi moghɨn, gumazamizibar azenibar otiv.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">Eghtɨ gumazamiziba bar avɨrasemegh nguibabar ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 72:16">egh grazibar mɨn danganiba bar dar ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 72:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">72:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:18">Jenesis 22:18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 4:2">Jeremaia 4:2</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamiziba, atrivir kamɨn ziam gɨnamangan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">Dughiaba bar, aruem tɨghar maghɨn anangtɨ, gumazamiziba ziar ekiam atrivir kam danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 72:17">Egh gumazamiziba an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:17">God deragha atrivim gamir arazir kam bagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">me uaghan kamaghɨra deragh uari damusɨ Godɨn azangsɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 72:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18"/>E Israelian Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:18">A bar uabɨra arazarazir aghuir kabagh amima da otifi.<verse eid="PSA 72:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19"/>E zurara an ziar aghuir kam fɨvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:19">Bar guizbangɨra. An ziar Ekiam nguazir kam bar a gizɨfagh.<verse eid="PSA 72:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20"/>Kar Jesin otarim Devit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:20">an azangsɨziba kamaghɨra tu.<verse eid="PSA 72:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72"/>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73"/>
  <para style="ms">Akɨnafarir namba 3</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 73-89">Onger Akaba 73--89</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba, God mɨzazim me gasam</para>
  <para style="d">Asap ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1"/>God bar guizbangɨra Israelian dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:1">Egha an damazimɨn zuezir gumazamiziba, a bar men dera.<verse eid="PSA 73:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2"/>Kɨ guizbangɨra arazir kuramɨn irasa bar gefi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:2">Nan suemning mati apɨghsighizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 73:2">kɨ uan nɨghnɨzir gavgavim ataghɨraghasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 73:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">73:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:1">Onger Akaba 37:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:1">Jeremaia 12:1</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir maba uari fa dagɨar avɨriba isi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:3">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ gumazir kurar kabar bizibar gara,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 73:3">nan navim da bagha dɨkafi.<verse eid="PSA 73:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4"/>Men mɨkarziba mɨzaziba puvatɨzɨ me dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:4">Me gavgavigha mɨkarziba deraghvɨra ikia naviba fiki.<verse eid="PSA 73:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5"/>Me gumazir igharaziba osɨmtɨziba ateri moghɨn, me osɨmtɨziba aterir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:5">Gumazir igharaziba aterir osɨmtɨzir kaba</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 73:5">bar me bativir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 73:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6"/>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, me uari fer arazir kam mati, me deragha uan mɨkarzibar kurti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:6">Me pura gumazir igharazibav sogha me gasɨghasɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 73:6">Ezɨ arazir kam me avara, mati me korotiaba isa uan mɨkarziba ave.<verse eid="PSA 73:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7"/>Men nɨghnɨziba ko navibar aven,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:7">arazir kurar avɨrir me damuasa ifongeziba otivaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 73:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8"/>Me dɨbovir akabar gumazir igharazibav gɨa uari fa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:8">arazir kurabar me damuasa nɨghnɨzibagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 73:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9"/>Me mɨzer otuaribar Godɨn uan Nguibamɨn itimɨn mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:9">Me uarira uan ziaba fe,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 73:9">gumazamiziba men gɨn mangasa me arazir kam bagha bar gavgafi.<verse eid="PSA 73:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10"/>Me kamaghɨn damutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:10">Godɨn gumazamiziba men akabagh ifuegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:10">nɨghnɨzir gavgavim dar ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 73:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11"/>Gumazir kurar kaba ghaze, “E amir biziba God dagh foghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:11">Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 73:11">en arazir e amiba, a tam bativsɨ damuva avegham.”<verse eid="PSA 73:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12"/>Gumazir kurar kabar arazim kamakɨn, men dabirabim derazɨ, me bizir avɨriba ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:12">egha ua inivɨra ikiasa.<verse eid="PSA 73:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13"/>Kɨ uabɨ bar deravɨra uan navir averiam geghuvima, a Godɨn damazimɨn zuezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:13">kɨ arazir kuratabagh amizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 73:13">Nan arazir kam, a ti pura ghuz o?<verse eid="PSA 73:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14"/>O God, nɨ arueba ko dɨmagaribar mɨzaziba na ganɨgavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:14">Ezɨ osɨmtɨzir kaba, mɨzarazibar fofoziba na ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 73:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15"/>Kɨ gumazir kurabav gei moghɨn, nɨn gumazamiziba akar otevitam me mɨkemeghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:15">me okam nɨghnɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 73:15">Kɨ kamaghɨn amizir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 73:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16"/>Kɨ mɨghɨgha osɨmtɨzir kabagh nɨghnɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:16">dar mɨngaribagh foghfoghasa amuava avenge.<verse eid="PSA 73:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">73:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 27:4">Onger Akaba 27:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:38">37:38</ref></char>
    </note>O God, kɨ kamaghɨn amua ghua amɨragha nɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven ghu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:17">Kɨ nɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven ikia nan nɨghnɨzim derazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 73:17">kɨ bizir gumazir kuraba bativamibagh fofosi.<verse eid="PSA 73:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18"/>Guizbangɨra, tuavir me aruiba nɨ dagh ami da bar apɨghsɨki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:18">egha me gami me ira bar moghɨra ikufi.<verse eid="PSA 73:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19"/>Me bar moghɨra ikuvamin arazir kam, a bar zuamɨra me batogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:19">Eghtɨ me ovengamin arazir kam bar moghɨra men ikuvigham.<verse eid="PSA 73:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20"/>O Ekiam, me mati gumazim irebamɨn ganizɨ, an amɨmzaraghan pura gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">A mɨzarazimɨn irebam gɨnɨghnɨzima, a uam an nɨghnɨzimɨn itir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 73:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21"/>Kɨ faragha bizir kabagh nɨghnigha nan navim bar oseme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:21">Mati, kɨ bizir kurar mam amezɨ, nan navir averiam puvɨra na gami.<verse eid="PSA 73:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22"/>Nan nɨghnɨzim nan otevezɨ, kɨ deragha nɨn arazibagh fozir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:22">Kɨ asɨzir atiar nɨghnɨziba puvatɨzimɨn mɨn, nɨn damazimɨn an arazibagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 73:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23"/>Bar guizbangɨra, kɨ nɨ ko zurara iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:23">ezɨ nɨ nan dafarimɨn suira.<verse eid="PSA 73:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">73:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 48:14">Onger Akaba 48:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 49:15">49:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 58:11">58:11</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ uan akar aghuimɨn, tuavir kɨ daruamibar nan akakasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:24">Nɨ gɨn na inigh mangɨtɨ, kɨ nɨ ko nɨn Nguibamɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 73:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25"/>O God, tina ua nɨn Nguibamɨn ikɨ deragh nan ganam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:25">Nɨ bar uabɨra, ua gumaziba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 73:25">Kɨ bar nɨ gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:25">Kɨ nguazir kamɨn ua bizitam gifongezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 73:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">73:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:5">Onger Akaba 16:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:12">40:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 84:2">84:2</ref></char>
    </note>Nan nɨghnɨzim ko nan mɨkarzim ua gavgaviba puvatɨghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">God, nɨ uabɨ gavgavim nan navir averiam danɨng.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 73:26">Kɨ ua gumazir igharazitamɨn ganan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">Nɨ bar uabɨra kɨ nɨn ganam.<verse eid="PSA 73:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27"/>Bar guizbangɨra, gumazamizir akɨrim ragha nɨ gasaraziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:27">me bar moghɨra gɨvagham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 73:27">Gumazir faragha nɨn gɨn ghua datɨrɨghɨn nɨ ataghiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:27">nɨ me gasɨghasɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 73:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">73:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 14:6">Onger Akaba 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:5">40:5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:22">Hibru 10:22</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:8">Jems 4:8</ref></char>
    </note>O God, kɨ nɨn boroghɨra itir arazir kam, a bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">Ekiam, nɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ guizbangɨra nan dɨvazir gavgavim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 73:28">ezɨ kɨ nɨn aven modi.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 73:28">Bizir nɨ amiba, kɨ bar adar gun mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 73:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73"/>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim God ko mɨgei, <optbreak/>eghtɨ a Israelian akurvagham</para>
  <para style="d">Asap onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamaghɨn a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1"/>O God, nɨ manmaghsua akɨrim ragha e gasara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:1">E nɨn gumazamiziba, nɨ navim en ikuvigh en atar kamaghɨra ikiam, o?<verse eid="PSA 74:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2"/>Nɨ fomɨra ua bagha e ginaba, nɨ e gɨnɨghnɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">Nɨ e givezegha gɨvazɨ, e nɨn adarazira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 74:2">Nɨ faragha Saionɨn Mɨghsɨamɨn ike,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">egh nɨ ua mɨghsɨar kam ginɨrɨgh.<verse eid="PSA 74:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3"/>En apaniba nɨn Dɨpenim ko an itir biziba bar dagh asɨghasɨki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:3">Nɨ dɨkavigh izi bizir me fomɨra asɨghasɨghizir kabar ganigh.<verse eid="PSA 74:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4"/>Nɨn apaniba nɨn Dɨpenim inigha gɨvagha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:4">paza bizibagh amua dɨa ghaze, me God abɨragha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 74:4">Me nɨn biziba inigha, uan bizir men ababaniba itiba isa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:4">dar danganibagh arɨki.<verse eid="PSA 74:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5"/>Me mati gumazim ruarimɨn temeba okava da aghorogharɨghizɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:5">me temer nɨn dɨpenimɨn ingariziba, bar ada okava da aghore.<verse eid="PSA 74:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6"/>Temer me fomɨra dɨgɨrir aghuibagh amiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:6">apaniba hamaba ko sobiabar dav sogha da akari.<verse eid="PSA 74:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7"/>Nɨn Dɨpenir nɨ uabɨ aven itir kam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:7">me a gasɨghasɨgha, a gaborozɨ a isi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 74:7">Me danganir gumazamiziba ikɨ nɨ ziam famim bar a gasɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 74:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8"/>Me uan navir averiabar aven bar e abɨnigh guizbangɨra e gasɨghasɨghasa nɨghnigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:8">e God ko mɨgeir dɨpenir en nguazimɨn itiba, bar dagh aponge.<verse eid="PSA 74:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9"/>E gan fofoghamin arazarazitaba bar itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">Da bar moghɨra ghuegha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 74:9">Ezɨ Godɨn akam inigha izir gumazitam uam e ko itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">Osɨmtɨzir kam gɨvamin dughiam, en tav bar a gɨfozir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 74:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10"/>O God, dughiaba manmagh apaniba nɨ dɨpovam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:10">Me nɨn ziam akar kurabar a mɨkɨmvɨra ikiam?<verse eid="PSA 74:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11"/>Nɨ manmaghsua en akurvaghan aghuagha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:11">agharimning gɨrakɨrangɨn amadagha puram en gari?<verse eid="PSA 74:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12"/>Bar guizbangɨra, O God, nɨ fomɨrama en atrivimɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:12">dughiar avɨribar en akurvazi, e mɨdorozibagh amua uan apaniba abɨri.<verse eid="PSA 74:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">74:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21">Ua Me Ini 14:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ uan gavgavimra ongarir ekiam tongɨram anebɨki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:13">Egha maburan osirir ongarimɨn itibar dapaniba abɨghizɨ da ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 74:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">74:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:1">Jop 41:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 104:26">Onger Akaba 104:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:1">Aisaia 27:1</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ guar bar ekiamɨn dapanim abɨghizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:14">ongarir mɨriamɨn itir gumazamiziba aneme.<verse eid="PSA 74:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15"/>Faneba ko daghuriba, nɨ dɨpaba dagh atɨzɨ da ivemara uaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:15">Nɨ faner ekiabagh ami da dati.<verse eid="PSA 74:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">74:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:14">Jenesis 1:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ angazangarim ko mɨtatemɨn ingari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:16">egha aruem ko iakɨnimɨn ingarizɨ aning pɨn uan danganimningɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 74:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">74:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 8:22">Jenesis 8:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:26">Aposel 17:26</ref></char>
    </note>Nguazim mangɨ tuivamin danganiba, nɨ dar ababaniba arigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:17">Azenibar aven, aruem ganamin dughiaba ko amozim izamin dughiaba, nɨ da arigha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 74:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ okɨnɨghnɨghan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:18">Nɨn apaniba gumazir onganibar mɨn nɨghnɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 74:18">nɨ mati pura bizim egha nɨ dɨpova nɨ mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 74:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19"/>Nɨn gumazamiziba gavgaviba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:19">Asɨzir atiam kuarazir muziarim mɨsuegha anemezɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 74:19">apanir kaba bar moghɨra me agɨvan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 74:19">Kamaghɨn, nɨ me isɨ apanibar dafaribar arɨghan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:19">E nɨn gumazamiziba, apaniba mɨzazim e gasi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 74:19">Ezɨ e nɨn azai, nɨ e gɨnɨghnɨgh kamaghɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 74:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20"/>En nguazibar danganiba bar, gumazir kuraba dar moga ikia tintinimɨn mɨdorozibagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:20">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ e ko dɨkɨrɨzir akar kam, nɨ uam a gɨnɨghnɨgh.<verse eid="PSA 74:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21"/>Nɨ gumazir kuraba ateghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:21">me gumazir igharaziba dɨkaragh bar me abɨnan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 74:21">Nɨ biziba otevezir gumazamizibar akurvaghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:21">me nɨn ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 74:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22"/>O God, nɨ dɨkavigh izɨ pamten apanibav kɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:22">iarara osɨmtɨzim gami, kɨ puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 74:22">Egh gumazir akaba batogha dɨbovir akabar nɨ mɨgeiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:22">nɨ me gɨnɨghnɨgh bizitam damu.<verse eid="PSA 74:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23"/>Nɨn apaniba tiariba akara akar kurabar nɨ mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:23">Me akaba akara pamtem mɨgɨavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 74:23">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ men arazir kurar me amir kabagh nɨghnɨghvɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 74:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74"/>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75"/>
  <para style="s">God gumazamizir kuraba abɨnigha, gumazamizir aghuibar akura</para>
  <para style="d">Asap onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir ighiabar faragha zuim a gumazamizibav kɨmtɨ, me tiarir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ ighiar kam bangam, “Gumazitam gasɨghasɨghan markɨ.”</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1"/>O God, e zurara nɨ mɨnaba egha nɨn ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">E nɨn ziar ekiamɨn gun mɨgɨa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 75:1">bizir igharagha garir nɨ amibagh eghari.<verse eid="PSA 75:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2"/>God kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 75:2">“Kɨ kotiamɨn dughiar mam amɨsevegha gɨvazɨma a iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:2">Nan kotiam guizbangɨra zui.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 75:2">Egha ifarir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 75:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3"/>Nguazir kam, mɨkɨmkɨzim a batoghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:3">an itir gumazamiziba akongam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 75:3">Nguazimɨn mɨngarir apengan itim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:3">kɨ an suiraghtɨ a ikɨ gavgavigham.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 75:3">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 75:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4"/>Kɨ gumazamizir akaba batogha pura uan ziaba febav gɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:4">‘Ia uari fɨva akaba batoghan markɨ.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 75:4">Kɨ gumazamizir kurabav gɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:4">‘Ia uarira uan gavgavibagh nɨghnɨgh uan ziaba fan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 75:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5"/>Ia uan gavgavibagh nɨghnɨgh da bagh ifaghatan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:5">Egh pamten akabagh itɨ, dɨbovir akabar na mɨkɨman markɨ.’ ”<verse eid="PSA 75:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6"/>Gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨghamin gumazitam, an</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:6">aruem anadi naghɨn ko, aruem uaghiri naghɨn ko, not ko sautɨn amadaghan ikɨva otoghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 75:6">Puvatɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 75:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">75:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:7">1 Samuel 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:6">Onger Akaba 50:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 147:6">147:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:21">Daniel 2:21</ref></char>
    </note>God uabɨra en araziba tuisɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:7">A gumazamizir maba fa, igharaziba abɨri.<verse eid="PSA 75:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn anɨngagharim kamaghɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">A kavɨn mamɨn suira, ezɨ wainɨn igiar gavgavir ekiam itim a gizɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 75:8">An a ingezɨ gumazamizir kuraba anepa bar anegɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">Arazir kamra, gumazamizir kuraba Godɨn kotɨn otivigh, egh bar gevegham.<verse eid="PSA 75:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9"/>Kɨ uabɨ zurara Jekopɨn God bagh ighiaba bangɨvɨra ikɨ an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:9">Egh an akabar gun mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 75:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10"/>Eghtɨ God gumazamizir kurabar gavgaviba bar ada gɨvagham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:10">Egh an damazimɨn derazir gumazamiziba, a gavgavim ua me danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 75:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75"/>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76"/>
  <para style="s">God mɨdorozim gamua uan apaniba abɨra</para>
  <para style="d">Asap onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Onger akar kam kar Godɨn ziam fer onger akam. Onger akar kamɨn faragha zuir gumazim, gumazibav gɨa ghaze, me gitabav sogh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1"/>Judan adarazi bar deravɨra God gɨfo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:1">Israelia an ziar ekiam fe.<verse eid="PSA 76:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2"/>An Dɨpenim Jerusalemɨn nguibamɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:2">Egha Saionɨn Mɨghsɨamɨn ikia kamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 76:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3"/>A danganir kamɨn uan apanibar afuziba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:3">oraba, ko mɨdorozir sababa ko,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 76:3">mɨdorozir bizir igharaziba sara apɨragharɨki.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 76:3">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 76:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4"/>God, nɨ atrivibar ekiam egha ziar ekiam iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:4">Nɨn ziam bar pɨn ikia, egha mɨghsɨar ekiabar ziar ekiabagh afira.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 76:4">Nɨ mɨghsɨabar uan apanibav sogha me abɨragha uamategha ize.<verse eid="PSA 76:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5"/>Nɨ men mɨdorozir gumazir gavgavibav sogha men bizir aghuiba bar ada ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">Ezɨ mɨdorozir gumazir kaba datɨrɨghɨn ariaghirezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 76:5">gumazir ikɨ mɨsogh ua men biziba iniamba puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 76:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6"/>O Jekopɨn God, nɨ men atarigha gɨvazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:6">hoziaba ko gumazir hoziabagh apiaziba ariaghiregha nguazim gireghav iti.<verse eid="PSA 76:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7"/>O God, nɨ men ataran bighangɨn, tinara nɨn damazimɨn tuivam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:7">Bar puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 76:7">Gumazamiziba bar puvɨra nɨn atiati.<verse eid="PSA 76:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8-9"/>Nɨ uan Nguibamɨn ikia gumazamiziba isa uan kotiam gatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:8-9">Nɨ dughiar kamɨn tugha kotiamɨn gun me mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 76:8-9">Egha nɨ iza gumazamizir igharaz darazi paza me gamiba, nɨ men akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:8-9">Gumazamiziba bar atiatigha mɨkɨman asa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 76:8-9">Me pura uan akabar kumigha iti.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 76:8-9">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 76:8-9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">76:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 18:11">Ua Me Ini 18:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumaziba naviba men ikufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:10">ezɨ bizir kam gumazir igharazibagh ami me nɨn ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 76:10">Gumazir mɨdorozim gamua deragha ikiavɨra itiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 76:10">me nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 76:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God a nɨn God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">nɨ a ko Akar Gavgavim akɨrigh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 76:11">egh guizbangɨra akar dɨkɨrɨzir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 76:11">Egh ifaran markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 76:11">E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatingam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">kamaghɨn, gumazamiziba bar a bagh bizir aghuiba inigh mangɨ.<verse eid="PSA 76:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12"/>An atrivir akaba batoziba abɨri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:12">Egha nguazimɨn atrivibagh ami</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 76:12">me bar an atiati.<verse eid="PSA 76:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76"/>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim osɨmtɨzim itir dughiamɨn a God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Asap onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">An onger akar kamɨn faragha zuir gumazim Jedutun gɨnɨghnɨgh a bagha onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">77:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 3:4">Onger Akaba 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 142:1">142:1</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ osemegha uabɨn akurvaghasa arava God ko mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:1">A na baraghasa kɨ pamten an dei.<verse eid="PSA 77:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2"/>Osɨmtɨziba na bativir dughiaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">kɨ Ekiam buriava an dei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 77:2">Kɨ dɨmagaribar uan dafariba favɨra ikia a ko mɨgɨa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 77:2">navir amɨrizim inizir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 77:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3"/>Kɨ God gɨnɨghnɨgha nan navim arai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:3">Kɨ God gɨnɨghnɨgha nan navim bar na basemezɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 77:3">damaziba nan sɨri.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 77:3">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 77:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4"/>God na gamima kɨ dɨmagaribar akuir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:4">Nan navim bar na basemezɨ kɨ mɨkɨman asa.<verse eid="PSA 77:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5"/>Kɨ dughiar fomɨra ghueziba ko, azenir fomɨra ghuezibagh nɨghnɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 77:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">77:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 4:4">Onger Akaba 4:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 42:8">42:8</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ dɨmagaribar uan onger akar kam gɨnɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:6">Kɨ nɨghnɨgha ikia, egha uabɨra uabɨn azangsɨsi:<verse eid="PSA 77:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7"/>“Ekiam zurara akɨrim ragh na gasam o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:7">Egh a ua na gifongeghan kogham o?<verse eid="PSA 77:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8"/>An apangkuvir arazim nan ikiavɨra iti, o puvatɨ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:8">A na ko dɨkɨrɨzir akar kam na ko ikiavɨra iti, o puvatɨ?<verse eid="PSA 77:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9"/>God en akurvaghasa ua nɨghnɨsi o puvatɨ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:9">An en apangkuvir arazim, an adarim ti anepɨrighama?”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 77:9">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 77:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10"/>Kɨ nɨghnɨzir kam gamua nan navim na baseme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:10">Ezɨ kɨ ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 77:10">“Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim, datɨrɨghɨn nan akurvaghan aghua.”<verse eid="PSA 77:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ dɨgavir kuram gamir araziba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:11">ingangarir ekiar nɨ faragha amiziba, kɨ uamategh dagh nɨghnɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 77:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12"/>Kɨ guizbangɨra dɨgavir kuram gamir araziba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:12">ingangarir ekiar nɨ faragha amiziba, kɨ uamategh dagh nɨghnɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 77:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13"/>O God, arazir nɨ amiba, da bar deragha guizbangɨra zue.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:13">Ezɨ godɨn ifavaritamɨn gavgavim nɨ gafirazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 77:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14"/>O God, nɨrara mirakelbagh amua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:14">uan gavgavir ekiam Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba bar men aka.<verse eid="PSA 77:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15"/>Nɨn gavgavimra nɨ uan gumazamizibar akuragha me ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:15">Gumazamizir kaba, me Jekop ko Josepɨn ovavir boriba.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 77:15">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 77:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16"/>O God, fomɨra dɨpaba nɨn gara nɨn atiati.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">Ongarir konimɨn aven, mɨkɨmkɨziba tintinibar otifi.<verse eid="PSA 77:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17"/>Ezɨ amozir ekiaba izaghirima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">onɨmariba danganiba bar dar taghtasi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 77:17">ezɨ arariba pamten dagarvasi.<verse eid="PSA 77:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18"/>Nɨn arariba amɨnir ekiamɨn tongɨn dagarvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">Ezɨ onɨmariba taghtagha bar nguazim gisɨsi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 77:18">ezɨ nguazim mozorogha sɨvaghsɨvasi.<verse eid="PSA 77:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19"/>Nɨ ongarir torimɨn arua zuima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">tuavir aruim, ongarir konimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 77:19">Ezɨ nɨn diaritam tuavir kamɨn itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">gumazitam an ganizir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 77:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20"/>Nɨ sipsipbar garir gumazimɨn mɨn, gumazamizibar faragha ghua me inigha zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:20">Egha ingangarim Moses ko Aron ganɨngizɨ, aning men faragha ghua men gari.<verse eid="PSA 77:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77"/>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazamiziba God gamizɨ a bar me baseme</para>
  <para style="d">Asap nɨghnɨzir aghuim isɨ gumazamizibar anɨngasa onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamagh a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1"/>Nan gumazamiziba, kɨ ian sure damuamin mɨgɨrɨgɨaba ia deragh da baragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:1">Nan akamɨn otivir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba, ia deragh kuariba arigh da baragh.<verse eid="PSA 78:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:35">Matyu 13:35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ akar isɨn zuibar bizir mogomemɨn itibav kɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:2">Eghaghanir kaba fomɨra ikegha iza datɨrɨghɨn otifi.<verse eid="PSA 78:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3"/>Akar kaba en inazir afeziaba fomɨra dav mɨkemegha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:3">Ezɨ e bizir kaba baregha dagh fo.<verse eid="PSA 78:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4"/>E akar kaba uan boribar ghuangsɨghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">Borir igiar datɨrɨghɨn otivamiba, e kamagh me geghanam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:4">Ikiavɨra Itir God, a gavgavir ekiam iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">A ingangarir ekiabagh amua, mirakelɨn arazarazir avɨribagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 78:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5"/>God Akar Gavgaviba isa Israelian gumazamizibagh anɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">Jekopɨn ovavir boriba akar kabar gɨn mangasa, a da isa me ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:5">A fomɨra en inazir afeziaba kamaghɨn me mɨkeme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">“Ia bar deraghvɨra nan Akar Gavgavibar uan boribar sure damu.”<verse eid="PSA 78:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6"/>Eghtɨ men borir gɨn otivamiba uaghan dagh fogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">egh me uaghan uan boribagh eghanam.<verse eid="PSA 78:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7"/>Me kamaghɨn damuva, nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:7">egh bizir an amiziba gɨn amangan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 78:7">Me bar an Akar Gavgavibar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 78:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8"/>Me uan inazir afeziabar arazibar gɨn mangan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">Men inazir afeziaba orazir puvatɨgha Godɨn akam batoke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:8">Egha nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an itir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">an akaba zurara dar gɨn zuir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 78:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9"/>Fomɨra Efraimɨn adarazi piba ko bariba inigha mɨsoghasa zuima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:9">mɨdorozim otozɨ me are.<verse eid="PSA 78:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10"/>Me Godɨn Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim batuegha, an akamɨn gɨn zuir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:10">God men apangkuvighavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 78:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11"/>A men damazibar amizir mirakelba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:11">bizir an amiziba, me da gɨn amada.<verse eid="PSA 78:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 7:8-12:32">Ua Me Ini 7:8--12:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>God en inazir afeziabar damazibar Isipɨn kantrin aven,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:12">a Soanɨn nguibamɨn mirakelbagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 78:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21-22">Ua Me Ini 14:21-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>God ongarim abɨghizɨ ongarim vong ko vongɨn tughav itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:13">a Israelian akua an torimra ghua vongɨn oto.<verse eid="PSA 78:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Ua Me Ini 13:21-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An aruebar ghuariamɨn tongɨn ikia men faragha zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:14">Egha dɨmagaribar avimɨn angazangarimɨn aven ikia men faragha zui.<verse eid="PSA 78:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:15-16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Ua Me Ini 17:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:2-13">Dɨboboniba 20:2-13</ref></char>
    </note>A gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn dagɨaba abɨzi, dɨpar nguazimɨn aven mar itiba otifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:15">Egha dɨpam uan gumazamizibagh anɨdima me da api.<verse eid="PSA 78:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16"/>A dɨpabagh amizɨ, da dagɨamɨn azenan otiva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:16">fanemɨn mɨn ivemara ghuaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 78:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17"/>A kamaghɨn amima, me gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:17">akaba batoghavɨra ikia, Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itimɨn damazimɨn arazir kurabagh amuavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 78:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:18-31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 16:2-15">Ua Me Ini 16:2-15</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 11:4-23">Dɨboboniba 11:4-23</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 11:31-35">11:31-35</ref></char>
    </note>Me God isɨ ingangarim datɨgh an gan foghasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:18">egha dagher me bar ifongezir kam bagha bar puvɨra an diava arai.<verse eid="PSA 78:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19"/>Me God dɨpova ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:19">“Gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganir kam, God ti dagher avɨriba e danɨngam, o?<verse eid="PSA 78:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20"/>A guizbangɨra faragha dagɨam mɨsoghezɨ dɨpam azenan otogha afora uaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">Ezɨ a datɨrɨghɨn bret ko asɨzim e danɨngam, o?”<verse eid="PSA 78:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God kamaghɨn me baregha an adarim bar ekevezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">an avim Jekopɨn adarazi bagha anemadazɨ a izaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 78:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22"/>Me kamaghɨn nɨghnɨzi puvatɨ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:22">A uan gavgavimɨn men akuraghtɨ me deragh ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 78:22">Egha me nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an itir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 78:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23"/>An nɨghnɨzim men ikiavɨra itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:23">a pɨn overiam mɨkemezɨ a kuiaghirɨ.<verse eid="PSA 78:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:31">Jon 6:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Egha a uan Nguibamɨn manan daghem isa gumazamizibagh anɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:24">Gumazamiziba damasa, a me bagh manan daghem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">78:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mana, a dagher manmagh garim. Nɨ foghsɨ, Ua Me Ini 16:31ɨn an gan.</char></note> anemadazɨ a iri.<verse eid="PSA 78:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25"/>Enselba apir dagheba, God dar avɨriba isa me ganɨngizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:25">me da amegha bar izefe.<verse eid="PSA 78:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26"/>God uan gavgavimɨn, aruem anadi naghɨn ko sautɨn amadaghan izir amɨnim amadazɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:26">a ivai.<verse eid="PSA 78:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27"/>A nguazir mɨnemniaba ko, ongarir gigimɨn mɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:27">kuarazir avɨriba amangizɨ da izaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 78:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28"/>God kuarazir kaba amangizɨ da danganir me itimɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:28">bar men purirpenibar mɨriabara iri.<verse eid="PSA 78:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29"/>Dagher gumazamizir kaba iniasa ifongeziba, God da me ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:29">Ezɨ me da apa ghua bar izefe.<verse eid="PSA 78:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30-31"/>Me apima dagheba men akatoribar ikiavɨra itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:30-31">God men atara</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 78:30-31">Israelian gumazir igiar gavgavibav soghezɨ me ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 78:30-31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32"/>God bizir kabagh ami, ezɨ me arazir kurabagh amua ghuavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:32">A mirakelbagh ami, ezɨ me nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an itir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 78:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33"/>A mati gumazim uan akamɨn amɨnim giverazɨ an otogha ghua pura gɨvazɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:33">A bar zuamɨra me gasɨghasɨghizɨ me ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 78:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34"/>God men maraziv soghezɨ me ariaghirezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:34">men marazi guizbangɨra navibagh iragha ua God bagha ize.<verse eid="PSA 78:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:13">Ua Me Ini 15:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:8">Godɨn Araziba 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:14">Aisaia 41:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 63:9">63:9</ref></char>
    </note>Me ua nɨrɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:35">e Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itimɨn aven moga egha deragha iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 78:35">Ezɨ a en akuragha uam e ini.<verse eid="PSA 78:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36"/>Mɨgɨrɨgɨar me amir kaba, da bar guizbangɨra puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:36">me a gifarava a mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 78:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:21">Aposel 8:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Me an akabar gɨn zuir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:37">egha a me ko Dɨkɨrɨzir Akar Gavgavim abɨki.<verse eid="PSA 78:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38"/>Ezɨ a men apangkuvighavɨra ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">men arazir kuraba gɨn amadagha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 78:38">me gasɨghasɨzir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:38">A dughiar avɨribar uan adarim amɨnivagha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">men akazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 78:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 103:14-16">Onger Akaba 103:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:6-8">Jon 3:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:14">Jems 4:14</ref></char>
    </note>An nɨghnɨzim, me gumazibara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:39">men ikɨrɨmɨrim dughiar ruarimɨn itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:39">Men ikɨrɨmɨrim mati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:39">amɨnim dughiar bar otevimra varagha ghugha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 78:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40"/>Me gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:40">dughiar avɨribar an akam batosi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 78:40">Me dughiar avɨribar a gami an navim oseme.<verse eid="PSA 78:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41"/>Me zurara Godɨn gavgavim gɨfofoghasa, a gavgavis ti o puvatɨ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:41">Egha arazir kabagh amua,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 78:41">Israelian Godɨn Bar Zuezim gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 78:41">an navim bar osemegha men atari.<verse eid="PSA 78:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42"/>God men akuragha men apanibar dafariba da ua me inizir gavgavir kam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:42">me a gɨnɨghnɨzir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 78:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43"/>A mirakelɨn arazir kaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:43">Isipɨn kantrin aven, Soanɨn nguibamɨn dagh ami da otifi.<verse eid="PSA 78:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 7:17-21">Ua Me Ini 7:17-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A Isipian fanebagh amizɨ ghuzim dar otozɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:44">gumazamiziba damamin dɨpaba puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 78:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:45 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 8:1-6">Ua Me Ini 8:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 8:20-24">8:20-24</ref></char>
    </note>A berezir avɨriba ko, mɨtivir avɨriba me bagha da amangizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:45">bereziba me givima, mɨtiviba men azenibagh asɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 78:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 10:12-15">Ua Me Ini 10:12-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An apiziba ko, odeziba amangizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:46">da iza men azenibar aghuir dagheba ko zuravariba bar ada ame.<verse eid="PSA 78:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:47-48 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 9:22-25">Ua Me Ini 9:22-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An amozir ofɨzir dagɨabar mɨn gariba amangizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:47">da men wainɨn ikarɨzibagh ira bar dagh asɨghasɨki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:47">An ais gamizɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:47">a men fighɨn temebagh ira bar dagh asɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 78:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48"/>An aisɨn amozir ofɨzir ekiaba amangizɨ da iza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:48">men bulmakaubagh asɨghasɨki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:48">An onɨmaribagh amizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:48">da asɨzir igharazibagh asɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 78:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49"/>An adarir bar ekiam men ikia men anɨngaghegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">bar moghɨra me gasɨghasɨghasa enselɨn avɨriba amangi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:49">Ezɨ me iza me gasɨghasɨgha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">osɨmtɨzir bar ekiam me ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 78:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50"/>A men atara me ataghizɨ me itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">An arɨmariar ekiam me ganɨngizɨ me arɨa bar ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 78:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:51 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:29">Ua Me Ini 12:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Isipian adarazir otarir ivariaba, a vaghvagha bar me mɨsoghezɨ me ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 78:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:52 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 13:17-22">Ua Me Ini 13:17-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A sipsipbagh eghuvir gumazimɨn mɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:52">uan gumazamizibar faragha ghua, men akua gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ghu.<verse eid="PSA 78:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:53 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:26-28">Ua Me Ini 14:26-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A me ko zuima me atiatir puvatɨgha deraghavɨra ghuava otifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:53">Ezɨ men apaniba, ongarim bar moghɨra me avara.<verse eid="PSA 78:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:54 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:17">Ua Me Ini 15:17</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Josua 3:14-17</ref></char>
    </note>A me inigha ghua uan nguazir a ua bagha inabazimra me atɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:54">Nguazir mɨghsɨar kam, a uan gavgavimɨn a ini.<verse eid="PSA 78:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:55 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 11:16-23">Josua 11:16-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Israelia izezɨ, a ikɨzir igharazibar gumazamiziba batuegha, nguazir kaba abɨgha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">da isa Israelian anababagh anɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 78:55">Ezɨ me pura, men dɨpeniba inigha deragha dagh apiaghav iti.<verse eid="PSA 78:55"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:56 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:11-15">Gumazir Dapaniba 2:11-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Me Godɨn gavgavim gɨfofoghasa, a gavgavis, ti puvatɨ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">Egha me Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itimɨn akaba batogha ghaze, a gavgaviba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 78:56">Egha an Akar Gavgavibar gɨn zuir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 78:56"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57"/>Men inazir afeziaba faragha amizɨ moghɨn, me an akaba batogha nɨghnɨzir gavgavim dar itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:57">Me mati barir pim ikɨrazɨ, gumazim asi bariba ikɨzɨrɨgha zui.<verse eid="PSA 78:57"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58"/>Me mɨghsɨabar ghua asebar ofa gamir dakozibar ingarizɨ, God puvɨra men atari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:58">Me marvir guabar ingarizɨ, Godɨn navim me bagha bar ikufi.<verse eid="PSA 78:58"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59"/>God bizir kabar gara adarir ekiam ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:59">egha bar Israelian aghua.<verse eid="PSA 78:59"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:60 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 18:1">Josua 18:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:12-14">Jeremaia 7:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:6">26:6</ref></char>
    </note>A Dɨpenir Silon nguibamɨn itimɨn ikia, e ko iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:60">A datɨrɨghɨn Purirpenir kam ataki.<verse eid="PSA 78:60"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:61 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 4:4-22">1 Samuel 4:4-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An apanibar amamangatɨzɨ me an Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim itir Boksiam inigha ghu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:61">Boksiar kamɨn me an gavgavir ekiam ko, an guamɨn angazangarir ekiamɨn gari.<verse eid="PSA 78:61"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62"/>A uan gumazamizibar atara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:62">me ataghizɨ men apaniba me mɨsoghezɨ me ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 78:62"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63"/>Men otarir igiaba mɨdorozimɨn aven bar ariaghirezɨma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:63">men amizir igiaba ikiamin gumaziba puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 78:63"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64"/>Apaniba men ofa gamir gumazibav sozi me ariaghɨrima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:64">men amuiba men apangkuva men azian iburaghburaki.<verse eid="PSA 78:64"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65"/>Ekiam akuavia osegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">mati gumazir igiam wainɨn dɨpam amegha gavgavigha tintinibar dia mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 78:65"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66"/>A uan apanibav sogha me abɨnigha men agɨntɨghizɨ me ghuegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:66">aghumsɨzir dafam isa kamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 78:66"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67"/>A Josepɨn adarazir ovavir boribar aghua.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:67">A Efraimɨn anabamɨn adarazi amɨsevezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 78:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68"/>A Saionɨn Mɨghsɨar a ifongegha uabɨ itim ko Judan anabam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:68">a ua bagha a ginaba.<verse eid="PSA 78:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69"/>A Saionɨn Mɨghsɨar kamɨn uan Dɨpenimɨn ingarizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:69">a gavgavigha overiamɨn mɨn pɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:69">A mati nguazir a ingarizir kamɨn mɨn anetɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:69">a gavgavigha ikia mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 78:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:70-71 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 16:11-12">1 Samuel 16:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:8">2 Samuel 7:8</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:7">1 Eghaghaniba 17:7</ref></char>
    </note>Godɨn ingangarir gumazim Devit, uan sipsipbar gara itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:70">God a inigha uan gumazamizibar ganasa anemɨsefe.<verse eid="PSA 78:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71"/>A sipsipbar garir ingangarim an anogoregha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">Israelian atrivimɨn ikiasa anemɨsefe.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 78:71">A Godɨn gumazamiziba me geghuv deragh men ganam.<verse eid="PSA 78:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">78:72 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 9:4">1 Atriviba 9:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Devit uan navir aghuimɨn gɨn ghua deragha men gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:72">Egha uan fofozir aghuimɨn men faragha ghua bizibagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 78:72"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78"/>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79"/>
  <para style="s">Israelia uarir akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Asap onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">79:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 25:8-10">2 Atriviba 25:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:17-19">2 Eghaghaniba 36:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:12-14">Jeremaia 52:12-14</ref></char>
    </note>O God, Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba nɨn nguazimɨn ize.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">Egha Dɨpenir nɨ ua bagha inabagha itim gamizɨ, a bar moghɨra nɨn damazimɨn mɨzegha ikufi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 79:1">Egha me Jerusalem bar a gasɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 79:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2"/>Me nɨn gumazamizibav soghezɨ me ariaghirezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">me nɨn ingangarir gumazir kabar kuaba isa kuaraziba ko asɨzir atiabar daghebar mɨn dagh anɨngizɨ, da da ame.<verse eid="PSA 79:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3"/>Me nɨn gumazamizibav soghezɨ me ariaghirezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">men ghuziba dɨpamɨn mɨn Jerusalemɨn nguibar averiam bar a gɨmɨri.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 79:3">Ezɨ gumazir men kuabar suigh me mozibar arɨghamitam ua itir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 79:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4"/>Gumazamizir en boroghɨra itiba e dɨpova, en ingaravaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:4">akar kurabar e mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 79:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">79:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 85:5">Onger Akaba 85:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:19">Esekiel 38:19</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ en ataravɨra iti o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">Nɨ dughiar ruarimɨn en atar ikɨ kamaghɨra ikiam o?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 79:5">Nɨ navim en ikuvigh, nɨn anɨngagharim avimɨn mɨn isi kamaghɨra ikiam o?<verse eid="PSA 79:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6"/>Nɨ kantrin nɨ gɨfozir puvatɨgha nɨ ko mɨgeir puvatɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">nɨ men atartɨ deragham.<verse eid="PSA 79:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7"/>Me kamaghɨn amua, Jekopɨn ovavir boriba bar me mɨsuagharigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:7">men nguazim bar a gasɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 79:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">79:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 106:6">Onger Akaba 106:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 64:9">Aisaia 64:9</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ en inazir afeziaba amizir arazir kurabagh nɨghnighɨva, pazɨva e damuan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">En nɨghnɨzir gavgaviba datɨrɨghɨn bar iraghuegha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 79:8">Kamaghɨn, nɨ zuamɨra en apangkufigh.<verse eid="PSA 79:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">79:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 14:11">2 Eghaghaniba 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:11">Onger Akaba 25:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:3">31:3</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ Godɨn En Akurvazim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">Nɨ uan ziar ekiam bagh nɨghnigh en akuragh uam e inigh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 79:9">en arazir kuraba gɨn amadagh.<verse eid="PSA 79:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10"/>O God, Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba manmaghsu kamagh e mɨkɨmam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">“Ian God mana?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:10">Nɨ uan gumazamizibar ghuziba ikarvagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba mɨzazim me gasɨtɨ e ganika.<verse eid="PSA 79:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11"/>Nɨ kalabusɨn itir gumazamizibar ararem baragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:11">Nɨ uan gavgavir ekiamɨn, gumazir apaniba mɨsueghtɨ aremeghasava amiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 79:11">uam men akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 79:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12"/>O Ekiam, apanir kaba akar kurabar nɨ mɨkeme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:12">Kamaghɨn, nɨ men arazir kurar kaba ikaragh bar moghɨra me agɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 79:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13"/>Nɨn gumazamizir nɨn sipsipbar mɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">zurazurara nɨ mɨnamam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:13">En ovavir borir gɨn otivamiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">me uaghan nɨn ziam fɨ kamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 79:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79"/>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80"/>
  <para style="s">Israelia ua tugh gavgavighasa, God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Asap onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir ighiabar faragha zuim, a gumazamizibav kɨmtɨ, me tiarir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ ighiar kam damuam, “Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavimɨn akɨmarir aghuim.”</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">80:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:22">Ua Me Ini 25:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Israelia geghuvir gumazim, nɨ deravɨra e barakigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">Nɨ sipsipbar mɨn Josepɨn ovavir boribagh eghuva, deragha men gari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:1">Nɨ uan atrivir dabirabim gaperaghav ikia, enselɨn bar gavgavibar pɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 80:1">Nɨ uan angazangarim e gisiragh.<verse eid="PSA 80:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2"/>Nɨ Efraim ko, Benjamin ko, Manase, men anababar ovavir boriba, nɨ uabɨ men akagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:2">Nɨ uan gavgavim akagh izɨ en akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 80:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3"/>O God, nɨ uamategh e inigh izɨtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:3">e ua dɨkavigh tuivigh, fomɨra ikezɨ moghɨn ua ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 80:3">Nɨ uan angazangarim e gisiragh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:3">en apangkuvigh en akuraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:3">e ovengan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 80:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4"/>O God, nɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">Nɨ dughiar bar ruarimɨn uan gumazamizibar atara,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 80:4">me nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba nɨ da barazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 80:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5"/>Nɨ e gamizɨ, e bretɨn mɨn uan temeriba apava,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:5">kavɨn temerir izɨvɨrɨzim, dɨpamɨn mɨn uarir guri.<verse eid="PSA 80:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6"/>Nɨ gumazir en boroghɨn itibar arirazɨ, me iza en nguazim iniasa uariv sosi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:6">En apaniba e dɨpovava en ingaravati.<verse eid="PSA 80:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim, nɨ uamategh e inigh izɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">e ua dɨkavigh tuivigh, fomɨra ikezɨ moghɨn ua ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:7">Nɨ uan angazangarim e gisiragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">en apangkuvigh en akuraghtɨ e ovengan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 80:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">80:8-16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:1-7">Aisaia 5:1-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ uan gumazamiziba wainɨn ikarɨzimɨn mɨn Isipɨn me asigha me inigha ize.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:8">Nɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba batuegha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 80:8">men nguazibar uan gumazamiziba, wainɨn ikarɨzimɨn mɨn me arke.<verse eid="PSA 80:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9"/>Nɨ wainɨn ikarɨzir kam bagha nguazim azenegha anekara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:9">Ezɨ an aghua an biba bar nguazim giraghuzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 80:9">an aghua ghua bar uabɨ aroke.<verse eid="PSA 80:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10"/>Wainɨn ikarɨzir kam aghua, ekɨva an dughuazim mɨghsɨaba bar ada aghuazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:10">an aghariba sidan temer ekiaba bar ada avara.<verse eid="PSA 80:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11"/>An aghariba aghua ghua Mediterenianɨn Ongarir Ekiamɨn tugha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:11">iza Yufretisɨn Fanemɨn tu.<verse eid="PSA 80:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12"/>Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn manmaghsua wainɨn azenim avɨnizir dɨvazim bar anekaragharɨki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:12">Gumazamiziba datɨrɨghɨn tuavimɨn daru, an ovɨziba okɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 80:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13"/>Dar atiaba a dɨkabɨntɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:13">asɨzir atiaba anemam.<verse eid="PSA 80:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14"/>O Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim, nɨ uam e gɨnɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:14">uan Nguibamɨn pɨn ikɨ vangɨnan wainɨn ikarɨzir kam deraghvɨra an gan.<verse eid="PSA 80:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15"/>Nɨ uabɨ uan agharir guvimɨn wainɨn ikarɨzir kam akara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:15">Nɨ wainɨn biar igiam akarazɨ an aghua gavgavigha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 80:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16"/>En apaniba anetugha a isa avim mɨkɨnigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:16">Nɨ uaghan me atugh me gasɨghasightɨ deragham.<verse eid="PSA 80:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17"/>Nɨn gumazamizir nɨ ua bagha inabaziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:17">nɨ me gamizɨ me ekevegha bar gavgafi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 80:17">Nɨ men akuragh deragh men gan.<verse eid="PSA 80:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18"/>Nɨ kamagh damightɨ e uam akɨrim ragh nɨ gasan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:18">Nɨ en akuraghtɨ e angamɨra deravɨra ikɨ nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 80:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19"/>O God, nɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">nɨ uamategh e inigh izɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 80:19">e ua dɨkavigh tuivigh fomɨra ikezɨ moghɨn ua ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:19">Nɨ en boroghɨn ikɨtɨ, nɨn angazangarim e gisiraghtɨ, nɨ deragh e damu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">Egh en apangkuvigh en akuraghtɨ e ovengan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 80:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80"/>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81"/>
  <para style="s">Dughiar ekiabar ighiaba</para>
  <para style="d">Asap ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir ighiar kamɨn faragha zuim, gumazibav kemeghtɨ me Gatɨn nguibamɨn gitabav sogham.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1"/>Godɨn e geghuva deragha en garim, e a bagh pamtem dɨmɨva bar akuegham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:1">E, ighiaba bangɨ Jekopɨn Godɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 81:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2"/>Ia faragh gitaba ko ukulelebagh ikararangɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:2">tambarinbav soghtɨ dar arareba deravɨrama otiv.<verse eid="PSA 81:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">81:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 10:10">Dɨboboniba 10:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>En isar ekiam otivamin dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:3">iakɨnir igiam otoghtɨ ia sɨghabagh ivi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 81:3">Egh iakɨnim izɨ pazaghar torimɨn tughtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:3">ia ua sɨghabagh ivi.<verse eid="PSA 81:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4"/>Arazir God ifongezir kam, a Israelia e ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:4">Kar bizir Jekopɨn God damuasa e mɨkemeziba.<verse eid="PSA 81:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5"/>God Isipia ko mɨsozir dughiam an akar kam, e Josepɨn ovavir boriba an e ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:5">Kɨ akar otevir kam baragha fozir puvatɨ tina a mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 81:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6"/>Kɨ orazi a kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:6">“Ian dɨpɨzibar itir osɨmtɨziba, kɨ bar da adegha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 81:6">Mɨtarir osɨmtɨzir ia ateriba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:6">kɨ da isa nguazim dafegha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 81:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">81:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:7">Ua Me Ini 17:7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:13">Dɨboboniba 20:13</ref></char>
    </note>Ia osɨmtɨzir bar ekiam ikia nan deir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">kɨ ian akura.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 81:7">Kɨ overiamɨn pɨn, arariba dagarvazir naghɨn uan mogomer danganimɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">ian dɨmdiam baregha a ikara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 81:7">Kɨ Meriban mozir pamɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">ian nɨghnɨzir gavgavim gɨfofoghasa arazarazir mabagh ami.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 81:7">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 81:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8"/>“Nan gumazamiziba, kɨ Akar Gavgavim ia mɨkɨm ia akɨrasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:8">O Israelia, ia deraghvɨra nan akam baragh.<verse eid="PSA 81:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">81:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:2-3">Ua Me Ini 20:2-3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:6-7">Godɨn Araziba 5:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:12">32:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:20">Onger Akaba 44:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:12">Aisaia 43:12</ref></char>
    </note>Ia marvir guabar ziaba fan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:9">Ia kantrin igharazibar asebar ziaba fan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 81:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">81:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:2">Ua Me Ini 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 37:4">Onger Akaba 37:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:9">107:9</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God, ian God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">Kɨ Isipɨn ia inigha azenan ize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 81:10">Ia nɨghnɨzir gavgavim na ikɨtɨ, kɨ bar deravɨra ia damuam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">Mati kuarazir nguzim akam akarigha itima, an amebam biziba atera iza an akam mɨkɨri.<verse eid="PSA 81:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11"/>“Nan gumazamiziba, me nan akaba baraghan aghua.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:11">Bar guizbangɨra, Israelia uari abɨnigha nan apengan itir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 81:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">81:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 8:4">Jop 8:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:42">Aposel 7:42</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:24-26">Rom 1:24-26</ref></char>
    </note>Kamaghɨn, kɨ me ataghizɨ me uan navibar kumigha uari uan arazir kurabar gɨn ghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:12">uan ifongiabar bizibagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 81:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13"/>Kɨ kamaghsua, nan gumazamiziba Israelia nan akaba baragh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:13">nan arazibar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 81:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14"/>“Me kamaghɨn damutɨ, kɨ zuamɨra uan gavgavir ekiamɨn men apanibav suegham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:14">Kɨ men apaniba bar me abɨnigham.<verse eid="PSA 81:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15"/>Nan aghuazir gumazamiziba, me atiatir ekiam sara na bagha izi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:15">Eghtɨ kɨ men apanimɨn ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 81:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16"/>Eghtɨ ia, kɨ dagher bar aghuiba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:16">ruarimɨn itir haniba ia danɨngtɨ, ia damɨ bar izevegham.”<verse eid="PSA 81:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81"/>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82"/>
  <para style="s">God an atrivir ekiam</para>
  <para style="d">Asap ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1"/>Dughiar mamɨn aseba Godɨn Nguibamɨn uari akuvazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:1">God uan dabirabir danganim gaperagha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 82:1">men faragha ghua, akam me gasa kamaghɨn me mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 82:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2"/>A ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 82:2">“Ia paza kotiaba tuisɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:2">gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba bar me gifonge.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 82:2">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 82:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3"/>Ia deragh gumazamizir uarira uarir akurvaghan koghamiba ko, borir afeziaba ariaghirezibar akurvagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:3">Ia gumazamizir osɨmtɨziba ateriba ko, onganarazibagh amir gumazamiziba, deragh me damu.<verse eid="PSA 82:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4"/>Gumazamizir gavgaviba puvatɨziba ko, onganarazibagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:4">ia gumazir kurabar dafariba da ua me inigh.<verse eid="PSA 82:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">82:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 11:3">Onger Akaba 11:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 75:3">75:3</ref></char>
    </note>“Me nɨghnɨzir aghuitam men itir puvatɨzɨ, me bizitam gɨfozir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">Me mɨtatemɨn nguazir kam garua,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 82:5">arazir aghuitam gumazamizibar akurvaghasa a gamir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 82:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">82:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 10:34">Jon 10:34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Kɨ Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:6">Ia aser muziarir kaba, ia bar nan boriba.<verse eid="PSA 82:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7"/>Ia gumaziba ariaghiri moghɨn uaghan arɨmɨghiregham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:7">Ia atrivir igharaziba iri moghɨn uaghan iregham.”<verse eid="PSA 82:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8"/>O God, nɨ dɨkavigh izɨ nguazimɨn gumazamiziba bar me gativagh men araziba tuisɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:8">Nguazimɨn itir gumazamiziba bar nɨn gumazamiziba.<verse eid="PSA 82:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82"/>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83"/>
  <para style="s">God Israelian apaniba bar me agɨvasa, gumazim God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn ziam fer ighiam, Asap an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1"/>O God, nɨ akam dukuagh pura ganan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:1">Nɨ pura uabɨn asugh nɨmɨra ikian markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 83:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2"/>Nɨ gan, nɨn apaniba me mɨdoroziba fori da otifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:2">Ezɨ gumazir nɨn aghuaziba nɨn akaba batosi.<verse eid="PSA 83:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3"/>Me nɨn gumazamiziba paza me damuasa muegha me bagha gara iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:3">Gumazamizir nɨn apengan iti nɨ eghuvir kaba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 83:3">gumazir kurar kaba me gasɨghasɨghasa.<verse eid="PSA 83:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4"/>Me ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 83:4">“Ia izɨ e Israelɨn kantri bar a gasɨghasightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:4">a ziaba puvatɨghtɨ, me uam a gɨnɨghnɨghan kogham.”<verse eid="PSA 83:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5"/>Kantrin kaba Israel abɨnasa uari akuvagha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:5">nɨghnɨzir vamɨram amigha akam mɨsoke.<verse eid="PSA 83:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6-7"/>Ikɨzir kabanang: Idomia, Ismaelia, Moapia, Hakria, ko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:6-7">Gebalia, Amonia, Amalekia, Filistia, ko Tairɨn nguibamɨn gumazamiziba.<verse eid="PSA 83:6-7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8"/>Asirian kantri uaghan men aven ghugha Moapia ko, Amonian akura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:8">Me Lotɨn ovavir borir bar gavgaviba.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 83:8">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 83:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">83:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 4:6-22">Gumazir Dapaniba 4:6-22</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 7:1-23">7:1-23</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ faragha Midiania gamizɨ moghɨn nɨ me damigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:9">Nɨ kamaghɨra Kisonɨn Fanemɨn Sisera ko, Jabin aning gasɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 83:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10"/>Nɨ dughiar kamɨn Endorɨn nguibamɨn aning gasɨghasɨghizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:10">aningɨn kuamning ikia kuri.<verse eid="PSA 83:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">83:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 7:25">Gumazir Dapaniba 7:25</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 8:12">8:12</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ faragha Orep ko, Sep gamizɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">nɨ men mɨdorozir gumazir dapanibar amigh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 83:11">Men gumazir dapaniba, nɨ faragha Seba ko, Salmuna gamizɨ moghɨn me damigh.<verse eid="PSA 83:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12"/>Gumazir kaba bar ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:12">“E Godɨn nguazir bar aghuir kam inigh an afeziam ikegham.”<verse eid="PSA 83:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13"/>O God, nɨ uan amɨnir gavgavimɨn me giveraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:13">me mɨnezibar mɨn mɨghɨ tintinibar mangegh gɨvagham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 83:13">Nɨ me giveraghtɨ, mati amɨnim raizɨn mɨsevibagh iverazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:13">da mɨgha ghuezɨ moghɨn, me mɨghɨ mangegh.<verse eid="PSA 83:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14"/>Avim ruariba ko mɨghsɨabar isia akara zui moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:14">nɨ men agɨntɨghtɨ me aregh.<verse eid="PSA 83:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15"/>Kamaghɨra, nɨ amozir ekiam amadaghtɨ a izɨ men agɨraghtɨ me aregh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:15">Nɨ amɨnir ekiam amadaghtɨ, a izɨtɨ me atiating.<verse eid="PSA 83:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 83:16">Nɨ me damightɨ me okam nɨghnɨgh bar aghumsigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:16">nɨ baghvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 83:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17"/>Nan ifongiam, nɨ me abɨraghtɨ me bar atiatingigh aghumsigh kamaghɨra ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:17">Nɨ aghumsɨzim me danigh, me mɨsueghtɨ me arɨmɨghiregh.<verse eid="PSA 83:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18"/>Nɨ kamagh damightɨ me guizbangɨra ganigh fogh suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:18">“Nɨ bar uabɨra nɨn ziam, Ikiavɨra Itir God.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 83:18">Nɨrara Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:18">egha nguazir oteviba bar dagh ativagha dar gari.”<verse eid="PSA 83:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83"/>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn Dɨpenim bar a gifonge</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Koran adarazir onger akam.</para>
  <para style="d">Gumazir onger akar kamɨn faragha zuim gumazibav kemezɨ, me Getɨn nguibamɨn ingarizir gita inigha a gikararai.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:1">Nɨn dɨpenim a bar moghɨra dera.<verse eid="PSA 84:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">84:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 42:2">Onger Akaba 42:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 63:1">63:1</ref></char>
    </note>Nan navir averiamɨn, kɨ nɨn dɨpenimɨn, dughiabar zurara gumaziba uari akuvi naghɨn aven ikiasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">Nan ifongiam kamakɨn, kɨ bar nɨn Dɨpenim gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:2">Nɨ Godɨn angamɨra itim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">Kɨ uan mɨkarzim ko nɨghnɨzim sara, nɨ bagh bar akuegh, ighiabar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 84:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">Nɨ nan God ko nan atrivim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:3">Kuarazir muziariba nɨn ofa gamir dakozimɨn boroghɨra uari bagha mɨkonibar ingara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">ota uan nguzibar gari.<verse eid="PSA 84:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4"/>Nɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven itir darasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:4">men naviba deragha bar akonge,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 84:4">me zurara nɨn ziam fava ighiaba bati.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 84:4">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 84:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">84:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 81:1">Onger Akaba 81:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:11">86:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 122:1">122:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:6">Jeremaia 31:6</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir nɨn gavgavim iniasava amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:5">nɨ bagha Saionɨn Mɨghsɨamɨn mangasa ifongeziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 84:5">me bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 84:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6"/>Me dɨpar atuir dɨpaba puvatɨzibar zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">Danganir kamɨn ziam Temeriba Itir Danganir Zarim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:6">Me mozir dɨpaba danganir kamɨn dagh amizɨ da otifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">Mɨzarazibar amoziba izima mozir dɨpar kaba izefi.<verse eid="PSA 84:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">84:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 42:2">Onger Akaba 42:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:31">Aisaia 40:31</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:18">2 Korin 3:18</ref></char>
    </note>Me tuavimɨn ghua nɨn gavgavim isa ghuavɨra ikia gavgafi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:7">Me mangɨ Saionɨn Mɨghsɨamɨn otivigh Godɨn gantɨ a ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 84:7">Godɨn kam, a godba bar dar pɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 84:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:8">nɨ Jekopɨn God.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 84:8">Nɨ nan azangsɨzim barakigh.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 84:8">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 84:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9"/>O God, nɨ en atrivimɨn gan deragh a damu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:9">A uabɨ oramɨn mɨn e moga deravɨra e geghufi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:9">Nɨ uabɨ ua bagha a ginabazɨ, an atrivimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:9">Nɨ deravɨram a damu.<verse eid="PSA 84:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">84:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 23:5">1 Eghaghaniba 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:4">Onger Akaba 27:4</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ aruer vamɨran nɨn dɨpenimɨn gumaziba uari akuvi naghɨn iti, a bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">Aruer kam, a 1,000plan aruer kɨ nguibar igharazimɨn itibagh afira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:10">Kɨ uan Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn tiar akamɨn tughɨv ikiasa bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">Kɨ gumazir kurabar dɨpenibar ikian aghua.<verse eid="PSA 84:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">84:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:10">Onger Akaba 34:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 85:9">85:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:19-20">Aisaia 60:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:2">Malakai 4:2</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgavim, an aruemɨn mɨn tuavim en akakagha, oramɨn mɨn e modi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">A en apangkuva egha ziar ekiam e ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:11">A gumazir an damazimɨn deraziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">a uan bizir aghuiba men anogorozir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 84:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:12">gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 84:12">me zurara bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 84:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84"/>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim God, an adarazigh eghuvasa a me bagha God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Koran anabam, men ighiam.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ deragha uan nguazim gamigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:1">Jekopɨn ovavir boriba ua men inizɨ me deragha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 85:1">faragha ikezɨ moghɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 85:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2"/>Nɨ uan gumazamizibar arazir kurar me amiziba, nɨ da gɨn amada.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:2">Nɨ men arazir kuraba batoghezɨ da ua itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 85:2">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 85:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3"/>Nɨ faragha men atara men anɨngazi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:3">Nɨ arazir kam, datɨrɨghɨn uam a gamir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 85:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4"/>O God, nɨ en Akurvazir Gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:4">E nɨn azangsɨsi, nɨ en ataran markɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 85:4">nɨ uam e inigh ua bagh izɨ.<verse eid="PSA 85:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5"/>Manmaghɨn ami, nɨ en atar kamaghɨra ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:5">nɨn adarim gɨvaghan kogham o?<verse eid="PSA 85:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">85:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 3:2">Habakuk 3:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ ua ikɨrɨmɨrir e itir kam damightɨ a igiamɨn otogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:6">gavgavim e danɨngtɨ e tuivigh gavgavigham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 85:6">Eghtɨ e nɨn gumazamiziba, nɨ bagh bar akuegh nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 85:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ zurara bar en apangkuvir arazir kam en akagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:7">en akuragh uam e inightɨ e deragh ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 85:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8"/>Kɨ uan kuarim atɨgh Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgavim Itim, an akam baragham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">E an gumazamiziba arazir kurar e amibar gɨn mangan kogh, uan navir averiabar aven a baghvɨra ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 85:8">a mɨkɨmtɨ e navir amɨrizim ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 85:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9"/>Bar guizbangɨra, an akurvazim, an gumazamizir an ziam fava an atiatia an apengan itiba, bar men boroghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:9">An angazangarim e gisiragha en akura,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 85:9">a uabɨ e ko en nguazir kamɨn ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 85:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10"/>Dughiar kamɨn, gumazamiziba uarir apangkuvigh, guizɨn arazir aghuibar zurara uarir amuam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:10">Me Godɨn damazimɨn deragh ikɨ, navir amɨrizimɨn ikɨ, deragh uari ko dapiagh ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 85:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11"/>Gumazamiziba nguazimɨn ikɨ, bar guizbangɨra Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn gɨn mangɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:11">nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikɨvɨra ikiam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 85:11">eghtɨ Godɨn uan Nguibamɨn Itim me damightɨ me an damazimɨn zuegham.<verse eid="PSA 85:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12"/>Guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God en akuragh bizir aghuiba isɨ e danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:12">Eghtɨ nguazir en azeniba itiba, dagher bar avɨriba dar aghungam.<verse eid="PSA 85:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamizibar amightɨ, me arazir an damazimɨn derazimɨn gɨn mangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:13">Eghtɨ arazir kamra, God ua izamin tuavim atɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 85:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85"/>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim God ko mɨkɨmtɨ God an akurvagham</para>
  <para style="d">Devit God ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ uabɨra uabɨn akurvaghamin gavgaviba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:1">Kamaghɨn, nɨ na baragh.<verse eid="PSA 86:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2"/>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn ikia, nɨn gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ ua nan akuragh na inightɨ, kɨ ovengan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 86:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3"/>O Ekiam, Kɨ dɨmagariba ko aruebar nɨn dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:3">kamaghɨn, nɨ nan apangkufigh.<verse eid="PSA 86:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4"/>Ekiam, kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:4">Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven nɨ baghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:4">Kamaghɨn, nɨ na damightɨ nan navim bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 86:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">86:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 9:17">Nehemia 9:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:8">Onger Akaba 25:8</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:13">Joel 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="JON 4:2">Jona 4:2</ref></char>
    </note>O Ekiam, nɨ bar dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">egha gumazibar arazir kuraba gɨn amadi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:5">Egha nɨ ko mɨgeir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">nɨ apangkuvir ekiam men ikia, men azangsɨziba barasi.<verse eid="PSA 86:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan azangsɨzim deragh a baregh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:6">nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 86:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">86:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:6">Onger Akaba 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:15">50:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 77:2">77:2</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ fo, nɨ na baregh nan akurvagham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:7">Kamaghɨn, kɨ osɨmtɨzim itir dughiam, kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa nɨn dei.<verse eid="PSA 86:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">86:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 3:24">Godɨn Araziba 3:24</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:22">2 Samuel 7:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:6">Jeremaia 10:6</ref></char>
    </note>O Ekiam, nɨ iti moghɨn ua godɨn tam itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:8">Tav nɨ ingari moghɨn ingari puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 86:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">86:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 66:4">Onger Akaba 66:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:23">Aisaia 66:23</ref>; <ref loc="REV 15:4">Akar Mogomem 15:4</ref></char>
    </note>O Ekiam, ikɨzibar gumazamizir nɨ ingariziba bar izɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">nɨn ziar ekiam bagh teviba apɨrigh, nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 86:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">86:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:18">Onger Akaba 72:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:6-8">Aisaia 44:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:29">Mak 12:29</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ bar uabɨra mirakelɨn bar aghuibagh ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:10">Nɨ uabɨra God.<verse eid="PSA 86:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">86:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 25:5">Onger Akaba 25:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:39">Jeremaia 32:39</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, arazir kɨ gɨn mangasa nɨ ifongeziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">nɨ deravɨra dar nan sure damigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:11">Eghtɨ kɨ darara nɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">zurara dar gɨn mangɨ nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 86:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12"/>O Ekiam, nan God, kɨ uan navimɨn aven nɨ mɨnabɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">nɨn ziar ekiam zurarama a fasa.<verse eid="PSA 86:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13"/>Nɨ zurara bar nan apangkufi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:13">Kamaghɨn, nɨ ua na inizɨ, kɨ Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn ghuzir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 86:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14"/>O God, akaba batozir gumazir maba datɨrɨghɨn iza na ko mɨsoghasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">Gumazir kurar kaba nɨn akabar gɨn zuir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 86:14">uari akuvagha na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasa.<verse eid="PSA 86:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15"/>O Ekiam, apangkuvir arazim ko, akurvazir arazim bar nɨ gizɨvazɨ nɨ zuamɨrama atarir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">Nɨ bar en apangkuvigha, deravɨra uan akamɨn gɨn ghua egha nɨghnɨzim giraghɨrazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 86:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16"/>Nɨ uamategh na bagh izɨ egh nan apangkufigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, nan amebam uaghan nɨn ingangarir amizim, a na bate.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 86:16">Kamaghɨn, nɨ nan akuragh gavgavim na danɨng.<verse eid="PSA 86:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, Nɨ bizitam damightɨ an otogh, nan akaghtɨ kɨ fogh suam, nɨ bar na gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">Eghtɨ nan apaniba uaghan ganigh fogham, nɨ nan akuragha gavgavim na ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:17">Kamaghɨn, me uan arazir kurar me amizir kam gɨnɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">bar aghumsigham.<verse eid="PSA 86:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86"/>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87"/>
  <para style="s">Me Jerusalem bagha bar akonge</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Koran ovavir boribar ighiam.</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, uan Nguibam, uan mɨghsɨamɨn an ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:1">Kar Saionɨn Mɨghsɨam.<verse eid="PSA 87:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2"/>Israelɨn nguazimɨn itir nguibaba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:2">dar tongɨn, Ikiavɨra Itir God, Jerusalemra bar a gifonge.<verse eid="PSA 87:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3"/>Ia Godɨn Nguibamɨn aven itir gumazamiziba, ia deragh oragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:3">God ghaze, nɨ nguibar bar aghuim.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 87:3">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 87:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4"/>God ghaze, “Kɨ gumazamizir nan akam baragha an gɨn zuiba mengamin dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">kɨ uaghan Isipɨn kantrin gumazamiziba ko, Babilonɨn kantrin gumazamiziba ko, Filistian ikɨzim ko, Tairɨn nguibamɨn gumazamiziba ko, Itiopian kantrin gumazamiziba, kɨ uaghan bar me mengam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 87:4">Me uaghan Jerusalemɨn adarasi.<verse eid="PSA 87:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5"/>Kɨ kamaghɨn Jerusalem mɨkɨmam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 87:5">‘Kar gumazamiziba bar men nguibam.’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim, uabɨ Jerusalem asaragh, a damightɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 87:5">a bar gavgavigham.<verse eid="PSA 87:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, uabɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar ziaba osirigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:6">men ziaba isɨ Jerusalemɨn gumazamizibar ziaba sara me akuvagham.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 87:6">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 87:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7"/>Jerusalemɨn itir gumazamiziba bar akuegh ighiaba bangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:7">Me suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 87:7">“O Jerusalem, bizir aghuir e itiba, nɨ bar dar mɨngarim.”<verse eid="PSA 87:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87"/>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Koran ovavir boribar ighiam.</para>
  <para style="d">Esran ikɨzimɨn gumazir mam Heman, ighiar kam osiri. Gumazir onger akar kamɨn faragha zuim me mɨkemezɨ, me “Mahalat Leanotɨn,” tiarimɨn a bange.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamagh a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan God, nɨ nan akuragha ua na ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:1">Kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa aruebar nɨn diava,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 88:1">dɨmagaribar nɨ ko mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 88:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2"/>Nɨ kuarim atɨgh nan azangsɨziba baragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:2">Egh deragh nan ararem baragh nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 88:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3"/>Osɨmtɨzir avɨriba na bativima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:3">kɨ Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn boroghɨn mangasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 88:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4"/>Gumazir maba ariaghiregha ghua mozir konimɨn mangasava amima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:4">kɨ uaghan men aven ikia, me ko zui.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 88:4">Kɨ guizbangɨra gavgaviba nan puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 88:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5"/>Kɨ mati, me na ataghizɨ kɨ gumazir oveaghueziba ko men danganimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">Kɨ mati, gumazim me a mɨsoghezɨ, an aremegha gumaziba ariaghira itir danganimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 88:5">Kɨ mati, gumazir nɨ bar gɨn amadagha akurvazi puvatɨzibar mɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 88:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6"/>Nɨ na isa mozir bar konir kam mɨkɨnizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:6">kɨ mozir bar konir kamɨn danganir bar mɨtatangizimɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 88:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7"/>Nɨn anɨngagharim bar na avara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:7">mati ongarir ekiam dɨpɨrigha na abɨrazɨ kɨ aven iraghu.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 88:7">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 88:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8"/>Nɨ kamaghɨn amizɨ, nan namakaba ganigha nan atiatigha bar nan saghon iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">Bizir kam na ikiagharɨghizɨ, kɨ azenan izan ibura.<verse eid="PSA 88:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9"/>Osɨmtɨzir kam nan iti, kɨ anetera ghuavti damaziba nan ikufi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:9">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ aruebar vaghvagha zurara nɨ ko mɨgei, nɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 88:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10"/>Gumazir oveaghueziba, nɨ ti me bagha mirakelbagh ami, o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:10">Me ti ua dɨkavruegh nɨn ziam fam, o?</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 88:10">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 88:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11"/>Gumazir ovegha mozim gireghav itiba, me ti nɨn apangkuvir arazimɨn uariv gei, o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:11">Me ti danganir bar kurar kamɨn kamaghɨn uariv gɨa ghaze, God mɨkemezɨ moghɨra e bagha deragha bizibagh amua, uan nɨghnɨzim gɨghavkɨrir pu.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 88:11">Puvatɨ, me kamaghɨn mɨgeir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 88:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12"/>Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibar mɨtater kamɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:12">nɨ amir arazir kabar gari, o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:12">O me danganir bar mɨtater kurar kamɨn ikia, nɨn akurvazir arazimɨn gari, o?<verse eid="PSA 88:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:13">kɨ mɨzarazibar uabɨn akurvaghasa, zurara nɨ ko mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 88:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ manmaghsua akɨrim ragha na gasara?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:14">Nɨ manmaghsua uan guam nan modo?<verse eid="PSA 88:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15"/>Kɨ uan igiamra ikia mɨzazir kamra isa iza datɨrɨghɨn atam areme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">Nɨ mɨzazir ekiam na gasezɨ, nan agharapaniba bar nan amɨra.<verse eid="PSA 88:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16"/>Nɨn anɨngagharir ekiam bar na avarazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:16">nɨ na mɨsogha bar na gasɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 88:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17"/>Nɨ kamaghɨn na gamizɨ, osɨmtɨziba arueba ko dɨmagariba sara bar na ekɨaru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:17">Mati aperiam otogha ghua nguazir oteviba bar da avara.<verse eid="PSA 88:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18"/>Nɨ nan roroar aghuiba ko namakabagh amizɨ, me bar na ataki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:18">Kɨ amɨnirbɨrimra a ko, ga roroamning gami.<verse eid="PSA 88:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88"/>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89"/>
  <para style="s">Osɨmtɨzir mam Israelɨn kantrin aven otozɨ me onger akar kam gami</para>
  <para style="d">Esran ikɨzimɨn gumazir mam Etan, an onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamagh a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">89:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 4:31">1 Atriviba 4:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 101:1">Onger Akaba 101:1</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ zurara nɨn apangkuvimɨn gun, gumazamizibav kɨmɨva ongam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">Kɨ uan akamɨn, pamten gɨn otivamin boribav kɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:1">God mɨkemezɨ moghɨra, a zurara deraghavɨra e gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">egha dughiatamɨn e ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 89:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2"/>Kɨ fo, nɨn apangkuvim a ikia mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:2">Nɨ zurara deraghavɨra e gamua dughiatamɨn e ataghɨrazir puvatɨzir arazir kam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:2">a bar ekevegha overiamɨn mɨn gavgavigha ikia mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 89:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3"/>Nɨ kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:3">“Kɨ gumazir mam ginabagha a koma Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:3">Kɨ uan ingangarir gumazim Devit ko, Akar Gavgavim gamigha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 89:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">89:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">2 Samuel 7:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:11-14">1 Eghaghaniba 17:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:11">Onger Akaba 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:30">Aposel 2:30</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ kamaghɨn a mɨgɨa ghaze, ‘Nɨn adarazira zurara atrivibar otivam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:4">Nɨn adarazir aven atrivitam otogh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:4">ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.’ ”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:4">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 89:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn Nguibamɨn itir enselba nɨ amir mirakelba bagh, ighiaba bangɨ nɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:5">Me gara fo, nɨ zurara deraghavɨra e gami, egha dughiatamɨn e ataghɨrazir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:5">egh me arazir kam gɨnɨghnɨgh uari akuv nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 89:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">89:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:5">Onger Akaba 40:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:8">86:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 113:5">113:5</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn Nguibamɨn aven, tav nɨn mɨn itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:6">Nɨn nguibamɨn enseltam nɨ ko magh ghuzir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 89:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7"/>Nɨn Nguibamɨn enselbar gumazir dapaniba, me uari akuva bizibav gɨa nɨn atiatia nɨn apengan iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:7">Enselɨn igharazir nɨ okarigha itiba, me uaghan atiatia nɨrarama apengan iti.<verse eid="PSA 89:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">Gumazitam bar gavgavigha nɨn mɨn itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:8">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ zurara deraghavɨra e gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">egha dughiatamɨn e ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 89:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9"/>Nɨ ongarir ekiar gavgavim gativagha an gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:9">A pamten dɨkavima, nɨ a gami a pura amɨragha irɨghav iti.<verse eid="PSA 89:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10"/>Nɨ Isip, asɨzir atiar ekiamɨn mɨn, an gavgavim abɨragha bar a gasɨghasɨki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:10">Nɨ uan gavgavir ekiar kamɨn, uan apaniba bar me abɨnizɨ me tintinibar are.<verse eid="PSA 89:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">89:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 29:11">1 Eghaghaniba 29:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 24:1-2">Onger Akaba 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:12">50:12</ref></char>
    </note>Overiam ko nguazim, aning nɨna.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:11">Nɨ nguazimɨn ingarizɨma biziba bar an iti.<verse eid="PSA 89:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12"/>Nɨ nguazim bar, an notɨn amadaghan ikegha ghua sautɨn amadaghan biziba vɨrara dar ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:12">Gumazamiziba nɨn ziam fe moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:12">Tabor ko Hermonɨn Mɨghsɨamning, nɨ bagha bar akuegha ighiam banga nɨn ziam fe.<verse eid="PSA 89:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13"/>Nɨ gavgavir bar ekiam iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:13">Ezɨ nɨn gavgavir kam a bar ekefe.<verse eid="PSA 89:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14"/>Nɨ atrivimɨn ikia uan gumazamizibagh ativagha, men akurvagha deravɨra men gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:14">Nɨn kotiar araziba da bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:14">Nɨ gumazamiziba bar men apangkuvigha, zurara deraghavɨra me gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:14">egha dughiatamɨn me ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 89:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamizir ighiabagh amua nɨn ziam feba, me bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:15">Nɨn angazangarim me gisirazɨ moghɨn, nɨ bar me gifuegha men boroghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 89:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16"/>Nɨ bar deravɨra me gamima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:16">me bar akuegha dɨmagariba ko aruebar nɨn ziam fa ighiabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 89:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17"/>Nɨrara, nɨ gavgavim e ganɨdi, ezɨ e nɨ bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:17">Nɨ bar deragha e gamua en akurvazima, e uan apaniba ko mɨsogha me abɨri.<verse eid="PSA 89:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ uabɨ e geghuv en ganamin gumazim, oramɨn mɨn e ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:18">Nɨ Israelian Godɨn Bar Zuezim, nɨ arazir aghuimrama amuava, atrivim e ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 89:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">God Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim Devit koma a gami</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19"/>Nɨ fomɨra irebamɨn mɨn gari bizimɨn aven, uan ingangarir gumazir nɨ ifongezibav gɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:19">“Kɨ mɨdorozir gumazir bar aghuir mam amɨsevegha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">Kɨ gumazamizibar tongɨn anemɨsevegha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:19">an atrivimɨn ikiasa kɨ atrivir dapanir asuam a garu.<verse eid="PSA 89:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">89:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Samuel 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16:12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:22">Aposel 13:22</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uan ingangarir gumazim Devit, an apigha anemɨsevegha uan borem a ginge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:20">A ian atrivimɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 89:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21"/>Nan gavgavim zurarama a ko ikɨ, mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:21">Nan gavgavim zurara a ko ikɨ gavgavighvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 89:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22"/>An apaniba a mɨsogh anebɨraghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:22">Gumazir kuraba anebɨraghtɨ, a irɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 89:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23"/>Kɨ uabɨ an apaniba abɨnigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:23">an aghuazibav sueghtɨ, me arɨmɨghiregham.<verse eid="PSA 89:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24"/>Nan apangkuvim a ko ikɨtɨ, kɨ zurara deraghvɨra a damu, egh dughiatamɨn aneteghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:24">Kɨ uan gavgavim a danightɨ a bar gavgavigham.<verse eid="PSA 89:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25"/>Kɨ Mediterenianɨn Ongarir Ekiamɨn mɨriamɨn itir nguaziba bar a danɨng mangɨ, Yufretisɨn Faner dadarimɨn tugham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:25">Eghtɨ an adagh ativagh dar ganam.<verse eid="PSA 89:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26"/>A kamagh na mɨkɨm suam, Nɨ nan God nan afeziam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:26">Nɨ dagɨamɨn mɨn ikia na moga nan akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 89:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">89:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 1:5">Akar Mogomem 1:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ David amɨsevezɨ a nan otarir ivariamɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:27">A nguazimɨn atriviba bar dagh afiragh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:27">men atrivir dapanimɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 89:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28"/>Kɨ zurara an apangkuv an akurvagh mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:28">Kɨ a ko Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim damightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:28">a gavgavigh ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 89:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29"/>Dughiabar zurara an ovavir boribar aven, men gumazitam atrivimɨn ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:29">Atrivir kaba me Israelia gativagh men gan</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:29">ikɨ mangɨtɨ, overiar kam gɨvagham.<verse eid="PSA 89:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30-32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30-32"/>“An ovavir boriba nan akam batuegh, bizir kɨ damuasa mɨkemezibar gɨn mangan koghɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:30-32">akɨrim ragh arazir kɨ ifongezibagh asaragh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:30-32">nan Akar Gavgavibar gɨn mangan koghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:30-32">kɨ men arazir kurar me amizir kam gɨnɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:30-32">mɨzazir kuram me danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 89:30-32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33"/>Kɨ uan ingangarir gumazim Devit bar an apangkuvigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:33">egh deraghvɨra uan akar dɨkɨrɨzimɨn gɨn mangɨ zurara deraghvɨra a damu egh dughiatamɨn aneteghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 89:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">89:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 23:19">Dɨboboniba 23:19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:9">Godɨn Araziba 7:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:20-21">Jeremaia 33:20-21</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uan Akar Gavgavir a ko dɨkɨrɨzir kam abɨghan kogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:34">uan akatam uamategh a giraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 89:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35"/>“Kɨ Godɨn bar zuegha arazir aghuibara amim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:35">Kɨ uan ziamɨn akam akɨra ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:35">Kɨ Devit gifaran kogham.<verse eid="PSA 89:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36"/>An ovavir boriba ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:36">An adarazi gumazamizibagh ativagh men ganam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:36">mati aruem isiragha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 89:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37"/>Me iakɨnimɨn mɨn isiragh mamaghɨra ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:37">kamagh gumazamizibar akagham, nan akam a bar guizbangɨra.”</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:37">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 89:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etan orazi apaniba atrivim mɨsogha anebɨrazɨ, an a bagha azi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38"/>Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn uan atrivir nɨ ua baghavɨra inabazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:38">nɨ an atara anetegha akɨrim ragha a gasara.<verse eid="PSA 89:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39"/>Nɨ a ko dɨkɨrɨzir akar gavgavir kam abigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:39">Nɨ an atrivir dapanir asuam isa nguazimɨn anekunizɨ a mɨze.<verse eid="PSA 89:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40"/>Nɨ an nguibar ekiamɨn dɨvaziba akaragharɨki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:40">ezɨ dɨpenir ekiaba bar ikufi.<verse eid="PSA 89:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41"/>Ezɨ gumazamizir anebɨgha aruiba an biziba okei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:41">An boroghɨn itir gumaziba dɨbovir akabar a mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 89:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42"/>Nɨ an apanibagh amizɨ me anebɨragha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:42">bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 89:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43"/>Nɨ an mɨdorozir gumazibagh amizɨ, me mɨsoghamin gavgaviba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:43">Ezɨ me a mɨsogha anebɨra.<verse eid="PSA 89:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44"/>Nɨ anebɨrazɨ a uam atrivimɨn itir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:44">ua gumazamizibagh ativagha men garir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 89:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45"/>Nɨ a gamizɨ a zuamɨra ghuri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:45">Egha aghumsɨzir dafam a ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:45">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 89:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Me uarir akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ dughiar ruarimɨn en modogh ikɨ kamaghɨra ikiam, o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">Nɨn anɨngagharim ti avimɨn mɨn isi kamaghɨra ikiam, o?<verse eid="PSA 89:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ e ginɨrɨgh en ikɨrɨmɨrim otefegh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:47">Nɨ en ingarizɨ e iti, e ua bar moghɨrama ovegh pura gevegham.<verse eid="PSA 89:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48"/>Tinara angamɨra ikɨ kamaghɨra ikɨ, ovengan kogham?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:48">Tinara uabɨn gavgavighvɨra ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 89:48">Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn mangan kogham?</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:48">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 89:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49"/>O Ekiam, nɨ en apangkuvighavɨra iti o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:49">Nɨ Devit ko dɨkɨrɨzir akar kam, manmaghɨram a damuam?<verse eid="PSA 89:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50"/>O Ekiam, nɨ na ginɨrɨgh, kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazimɨn iti, gumaziba dɨbovir akabar na mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:50">Gumaziba bar moghɨra na dɨpova akar kurabar na mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 89:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ atrivimɨn ikiasa na ginabazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:51">nan apaniba nan ingarava aka akar kurabar na mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 89:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52"/>E zurara Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ kamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:52">Bar guizbangɨra.<verse eid="PSA 89:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89"/>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90"/>
  <para style="ms">Akɨnafarir namba 4</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 90-106">Onger Akaba 90--106</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Godɨn mɨgɨrɨgɨaba ko gumazimɨn mɨgɨrɨgɨaba</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Moses God ko mɨgeir onger akam. Moses a guizbangɨra God baghavɨra itir gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">90:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 33:27">Godɨn Araziba 33:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ekiam, nɨ bar guizbangɨra en dɨpenir, e aven itimɨn mɨn itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:1">en inazir afeziaba fomɨra nɨn aven ikia iza, datɨrɨghɨn e iti.<verse eid="PSA 90:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">90:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 8:25-26">Aghuzir Akaba 8:25-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ tɨghar mɨghsɨaba ko nguazir kamɨn ingaram, nɨ Godɨn ikia kamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">Nɨ uaghan gɨn ikɨ kamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 90:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3"/>Nɨ nguazimɨn gumazamizibagh amima, me arɨmɨghira ua ghua nguazim gava.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:3">Nɨ ghaze, “Ia nguazimɨn gumazamiziba, ia arɨmɨghirɨ ua nguazim gavagh.”<verse eid="PSA 90:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">90:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2PE 3:8">2 Pita 3:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨn nɨghnɨzim 1,000plan azeniba, da mati aruer vamɨra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:4">Dughiar kam, boghɨnaron aruemɨn mɨn zuamɨra gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 90:4">Mati dɨmagarim dughiar otevimɨn ghua gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 90:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5-6"/>Nɨ aperiamɨn mɨn otogha gumaziba inigha zuima, me bar ariaghiregha ireghav iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:5-6">Me irebamɨn mɨn bar dughiar otevimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 90:5-6">Me mati dadar moniba, aruem anadi me aghua ruari.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 90:5-6">Ezɨ aruem uaghirima me mɨdɨa uaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 90:5-6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7"/>Nɨ adarim en ikia, e gasɨghasɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:7">Nɨ adarim en iti, ezɨ e bar nɨn atiatingi.<verse eid="PSA 90:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8"/>Nɨ en arazir kuraba bar adar gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:8">En arazir kurar e mogava amiba, nɨ bar ada isa azenim garigha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 90:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9"/>Nɨn adarim, e nguazimɨn itir ikɨrɨmɨrir kamɨn dughiam otefe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:9">Bar guizbangɨra, e zuamɨra gɨvagham, mati e ghuariaba sue moghɨn ami.<verse eid="PSA 90:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10"/>E 70plan azenibar iti, e gavgavigh 80plan azenibar ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">Azenir e itir kabar dughiaba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 90:10">e zurara ingangarir ekiabagh amua osɨmtɨzibarama ateri.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 90:10">Azenir kaba zuamɨra geveghtɨ, e uaghan mangegham.<verse eid="PSA 90:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11"/>Tinara nɨn adarir ekiamɨn gavgavim gɨfo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:11">Nɨ atarima gumazamiziba nɨn atiati,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 90:11">tinara men atiatir kam gɨfo?<verse eid="PSA 90:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">90:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 39:4">Onger Akaba 39:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ deragh en sure damutɨ, e uan ikɨrɨmɨrimɨn dughiam gɨfogham, an otefe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:12">E fofozir aghuim ikɨva, dughiaba vaghvagh deraghvɨra bizibar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 90:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn anɨngagharir kam ti dughiar ruarimɨn ikɨvɨra ikiam, o?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:13">E nɨn ingangarir gumaziba, nɨ en apangkuv.<verse eid="PSA 90:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14"/>Nɨ zurarama en apangkufi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">Nɨn apangkuvir kam mɨzarazibar e gizɨvɨra ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 90:14">E dughiabar ikɨ zurara onger akabar amuva, naviba deragh ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 90:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15"/>Nɨ faragha azenir avɨribar osɨmtɨzim e ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:15">Nɨ osɨmtɨzir e ganɨngizir kabar arueba mengegh, dar mɨrara datɨrɨghɨn e damightɨ e bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 90:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16"/>E nɨn ingangarir gumaziba, nɨ uan ingangarir gavgaviba en akagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:16">Nɨ uaghan en ovavir boriba, nɨ uan ingangarir gavgavir aghuiba men akagh.<verse eid="PSA 90:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">90:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 26:12">Aisaia 26:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ekiam, nɨ en God, e kamaghɨn ifonge, nɨ en apangkuvigh deraghvɨra e damu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">Bizir e amiba mar deraghvɨrama otiv.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 90:17">Nɨ guizbangɨra bizir e amiba, nɨ gavgavim dar anɨngightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 90:17">da gavgavigh mamaghɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 90:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90"/>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91"/>
  <para style="s">God e geghuvir gumazim</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:20">Onger Akaba 31:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 121:5">121:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:4">Aisaia 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 32:2">32:2</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazim, Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim, deragh an gansɨ an a bagh mangɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:1">God deragh an ganam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:1">A Godɨn Gavgaviba Bar Itimɨn boroghɨn ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:1">God dughuazimɨn mɨn anevaragham.<verse eid="PSA 91:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 14:6">Onger Akaba 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:2">18:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 56:4">56:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 16:19">Jeremaia 16:19</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir kam Ikiavɨra Godɨn mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:2">“Nɨ nan dɨvazir gavgavimɨn mɨn itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">kɨ nɨn aven uabɨ moga deravɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:2">Nɨ nan God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨrara iti.”<verse eid="PSA 91:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:37">1 Atriviba 8:37</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 124:7">Onger Akaba 124:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 6:5">Aghuzir Akaba 6:5</ref></char>
    </note>Bar guizbangɨra, God bar deragh nɨ geghuv nɨn gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:3">Bizir kuratam azuazimɨn mɨn modogh ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 91:3">nɨn suiragh nɨ gasɨghasighan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:3">Nɨ an dafarimɨn aven ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:3">arɨmariar kuratam nɨ inightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 91:3">nɨ aremeghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 91:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 36:7">Onger Akaba 36:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:11">40:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 63:7">63:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:16">Aisaia 51:16</ref></char>
    </note>A tuarir amebam uan nguziba ave moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">uan avɨzimningɨn nɨ avaraghtɨ nɨ aven ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:4">Kamaghɨra, nɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God, an apengan ikɨtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">a deravɨra nɨ modogh nɨ geghuv nɨn ganam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:4">A ifarir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">A zurara uan akar a mɨkemezibar gɨn mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 91:4">nɨn oramɨn mɨn ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 91:4">deravɨra nɨn ganam.<verse eid="PSA 91:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:19-23">Jop 5:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 23:4">Onger Akaba 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 27:1">27:1</ref></char>
    </note>Dɨmagaribar aruir duar kuraba, nɨ dar atiatingan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:5">Nɨ aruemɨn, bizir zuamɨra nɨ gasɨghasɨzi tamɨn atiatingan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 91:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:35">2 Atriviba 19:35</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 5:22">Jop 5:22</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ arɨmariar ekiar dɨmangan nɨ bativamiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:6">ko bizir kurar aruemɨn nɨ gasɨghasɨghamibar</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 91:6">atiatingan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 91:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 14:10">Josua 14:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazir 1,000pla nɨn boroghɨn arɨmɨghireghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">10,000pla nɨn agharir guvimɨn arɨghiregham, eghtɨ nɨ deragham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 91:7">Bizir kuratam nɨn boroghɨn izan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 91:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 37:34">Onger Akaba 37:34</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 58:10">58:10</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ gantɨ arazir kurar gumaziba nɨ gamiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:8">God uam ada ikarvagham.<verse eid="PSA 91:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9"/>Nɨ bizir kurabar atiatia Ikiavɨra Itir God bagha zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:9">Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim, a nɨn dɨvazimɨn mɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 91:9">guizbangɨra nɨ geghuva nɨn gari.<verse eid="PSA 91:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10"/>Kamaghɨn, bizir kuratam nɨ bagh izan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:10">Arɨmariar ekiatam nɨn dɨpenimɨn boroghɨn mangan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 91:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:7">Onger Akaba 34:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:6">Matyu 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:10">Luk 4:10</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ daruamin dughiabar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:11">Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ bagh uan enselba Akar Gavgavim me mɨkɨmtɨma,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 91:11">me deraghvɨra nɨn ganam.<verse eid="PSA 91:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:6">Matyu 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:11">Luk 4:11</ref></char>
    </note>Egh me uan dafaribar nɨ fueghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:12">nɨ uan dagarim dagɨatamɨn aneseghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 91:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 14:6">Gumazir Dapaniba 14:6</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 6:22">Daniel 6:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:19">Luk 10:19</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ laionba ko, kuruziba ko, laionɨn igiaba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:13">kuruzir kurar ekiaba dɨkabɨnam.<verse eid="PSA 91:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:10">Onger Akaba 9:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 59:1">59:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 145:20">145:20</ref></char>
    </note>God kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:14">“Gumazir nan ziam gɨfogha na gifongegha nan poroziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:14">kɨ ua me inigh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 91:14">deragh me geghuv men ganam.<verse eid="PSA 91:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">91:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 2:30">1 Samuel 2:30</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 12:4">Jop 12:4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:26">Jon 12:26</ref></char>
    </note>Eghtɨ me na ko mɨkɨmtɨ, kɨ me baragham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">Egh osɨmtɨzim me batoghtɨ kɨ me ko ikɨva,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 91:15">ua me inigh ziar ekiam me danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 91:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16"/>Egh kɨ men ikɨrɨmɨrim men ivezimɨn mɨn a damightɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:16">a mangɨ ruaragham, egh kɨ uamategh me inigh me ko ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 91:16">Egh kɨ ua me inigh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:16">men Akurvazir Gumazimɨn ikiam.”<verse eid="PSA 91:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91"/>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn ziam fer onger akam</para>
  <para style="d">Ighiar kam, a Godɨn ziam fer ighiam. <optbreak/>Me Sabatɨn dughiabar ighiar kam gami.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:1">arazir nɨ mɨnaba ighiabagh amua nɨn ziam fer kam, a dera.<verse eid="PSA 92:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2"/>Nɨ nan apangkuvir araziba, kɨ mɨzarazibar dar gun mɨkɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:2">Kɨ dɨmagaribar zurara, nɨ deraghavɨra na gamir arazir kamɨn gun mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 92:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3"/>Kɨ gita ko kulele ko boam mɨsoghtɨ da ararer aghuim damu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:3">nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 92:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4"/>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir aghuim gɨnɨghnɨgha ighiam gamua bar akongezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:4">nan navim dera.<verse eid="PSA 92:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">92:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 139:17">Onger Akaba 139:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:29">Aisaia 28:29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:8-9">55:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:33-34">Rom 11:33-34</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn nɨghnɨzim bar ekevezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:5">nɨ ingangarir bar ekiabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 92:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6"/>Gumazir nɨghnɨzir aghuiba puvatɨgha onganiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:6">me bizir kabagh foghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 92:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7"/>Gumazir kuraba dadabar mɨn zuamɨram otivam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:7">Eghtɨ gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba, me bizir avɨriba inigh deraghvɨra ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 92:7">nɨ bar me gasɨghasigham.<verse eid="PSA 92:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8"/>Kamaghɨn, Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:8">nɨ uabɨ atrivimɨn ikɨ kamaghɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 92:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9"/>E fo, gumazir nɨn apanimɨn itiba me arɨmɨghiregham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:9">Gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba, nɨ me abɨnightɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 92:9">me tintinibar arɨ mangam.<verse eid="PSA 92:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10"/>Nɨ na amɨsevegha gavgavir ekiam na ganɨngizɨ, kɨ bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:10">Gavgavir kam bulmakaun gavgavim ko magh ghu.<verse eid="PSA 92:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11"/>Kɨ uan apanibar gari me ikuvigha gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:11">ezɨ kɨ gumazir kurabar ararem barasi.<verse eid="PSA 92:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">92:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 1:3">Onger Akaba 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 52:8">52:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:22">Aisaia 65:22</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 14:5-6">Hosea 14:5-6</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazir Godɨn damazimɨn deraziba, me deragh otivigham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:12">Me mati iruem dagher aghuiba bata,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 92:12">egha uaghan Lebanonɨn kantrin itir sidan temer ekiabar mɨn aghungi.<verse eid="PSA 92:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">92:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 100:4">Onger Akaba 100:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:2">135:2</ref></char>
    </note>Me mati, temer me Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn oparigha gɨvaziba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:13">Da en Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven aghua egha deragha gara iti.<verse eid="PSA 92:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">92:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 1:3">Onger Akaba 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:2">Jon 15:2</ref></char>
    </note>Da ghurizir dughiamɨn, dar dagheba ikiavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:14">Dar dafaribagh arɨghavɨra itima, da gavgavigha mɨdir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 92:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15"/>Da kamagh amua gumazamizibav gɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:15">“Ikiavɨra Itir God a bar guizbangɨra, a ifarir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 92:15">A dagɨamɨn mɨn itima, kɨ an aven modima a nan akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:15">Arazir kuratam an itir pu.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 92:15">Bar puvatɨ.”<verse eid="PSA 92:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92"/>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93"/>
  <para style="s">God atrivimɨn iti</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1a" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1a"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, an atrivimɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1a">ziar bar ekiam ikia, gavgavir ekiam iti.<verse eid="PSA 93:1a"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="1b" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1b"/>A nguazir kam gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1b">a uan danganimra ikia</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 93:1b">bar gavgavigha kamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 93:1b"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">93:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 45:6">Onger Akaba 45:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:2">90:2</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:19">Azir Akam 5:19</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, biziba tɨghar otivam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:2">nɨ fomɨra ikia kamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 93:2">Nɨ atrivimɨn ikia zurara ikia kamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 93:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, ongarir konim mɨghɨgha nɨga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">bar pamten dɨpɨra tɨngazi.<verse eid="PSA 93:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn gavgavir ekiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">nɨn Nguibamɨn itir biziba, nɨ bar dagh ativagha dar gari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 93:4">Ongarim dɨpɨra nɨdir nɨgɨnim, a sufi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">Nɨn gavgavim a gafiragha bar ekefe.<verse eid="PSA 93:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">93:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:7">Onger Akaba 19:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 29:2">29:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:9">96:9</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:17">1 Korin 3:17</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn Akar Gavgaviba ikɨ kamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:5">Nɨn Dɨpenim zurara zuegh kamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 93:5">Bar guizbangɨra!<verse eid="PSA 93:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93"/>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94"/>
  <para style="s">God gumazamiziba tuisɨgh, gumazamizir kuraba abɨnigh, gumazamizir aghuibar akuragham</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">94:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:4">Aisaia 35:4</ref>; <ref loc="NAM 1:2">Nahum 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:19">Rom 12:19</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ gumazamizir kurabar araziba ikarvazir God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:1">Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn uan anɨngagharim men akagh.<verse eid="PSA 94:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2"/>Nɨ gumazamizibar amightɨ me nɨn kotiamɨn tuivam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:2">Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn gumazir akaba batozibar arazim ikarvagh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:2">ivezir kuram me danɨng.<verse eid="PSA 94:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">94:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 20:5">Jop 20:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 13:2">Onger Akaba 13:2</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, dughiaba manmaghɨn ikiavɨra iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:3">ezɨ gumazamizir kurar kaba uan arazir kuraba bagha bar akonge?<verse eid="PSA 94:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4"/>Gumazamizir kuraba akaba batogha, uan arazir kuraba bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:4">Me amir arazir kaba bagha uarira uari fe.<verse eid="PSA 94:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:5">me osɨmtɨziba nɨn gumazamizibagh arɨgha me abɨri.<verse eid="PSA 94:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6"/>Me paba ariaghirezir amiziba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:6">borir afeziaba ariaghireziba ko,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:6">Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizir en nguazimɨn itibav sozima,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 94:6">me ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 94:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7"/>Me ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 94:7">“Ikiavɨra Itir God en garir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:7">E amir bizir kaba, Jekopɨn God mɨghɨgha dagh nɨghnɨzir puvatɨgha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:7">dar garir puvatɨ.”<verse eid="PSA 94:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8"/>Ia gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir aghuiba puvatɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:8">ia oregh deragh fogh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 94:8">Ia bar gumazir onganiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:8">ia manadɨzoghɨn fofozitam ikiam?<verse eid="PSA 94:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">94:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 4:11">Ua Me Ini 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 20:12">Aghuzir Akaba 20:12</ref></char>
    </note>God en kuaribar ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:9">God oragham ti, o puvatɨgham?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 94:9">God en damazibar ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:9">God uabɨ ganam ti, o puvatɨgham?<verse eid="PSA 94:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">94:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 35:11">Jop 35:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 44:2">Onger Akaba 44:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:26">Aisaia 28:26</ref></char>
    </note>A uabɨ kantriba bar dar gumazamizibagh ativagha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:10">men gara men sure gami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:10">A me akɨram o, puvatɨgham?<verse eid="PSA 94:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">94:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:11">Jop 11:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:20">1 Korin 3:20</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a bar gumazamizibar nɨghnɨzibagh fo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:11">Bizir me damuasa nɨghnɨziba, an a dagh fogha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:11">Da mɨgharimɨn mɨn zuamɨra mangɨgh, otivan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 94:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">94:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 5:17">Jop 5:17</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 3:11">Aghuzir Akaba 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:32">1 Korin 11:32</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:5">Hibru 12:5</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:12">nɨ uan Akar Gavgavimɨn gumazitamɨn sure damightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:12">gumazir kam bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 94:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13"/>Nɨ kamaghɨn damigh avughsazim a danigham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:13">Eghtɨ osɨmtɨziba a bativan kogh mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:13">gumazamizir kuraba arɨmɨghiregh mozimɨn magɨregham.<verse eid="PSA 94:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">94:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 12:22">1 Samuel 12:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:1-2">Rom 11:1-2</ref></char>
    </note>Bar guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God uan gumazamiziba ateghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:14">An akɨrim ragh me gasaraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 94:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15"/>Gɨn, gumazamiziba kotɨn dughiamɨn guizbangɨra mɨkɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:15">Eghtɨ gumazamizir Godɨn damazimɨn deraziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:15">me kotiamɨn mɨgɨrɨgɨar aghuibar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 94:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16"/>Tinara nan akuragha gumazamizir kuraba dɨkabɨra?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:16">Tinara nan akuragha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:16">arazir kurabagh ami da otivir gumazamiziba batoke?<verse eid="PSA 94:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17"/>God zuamɨra nan akurazir puvatɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:17">kɨ ti fomɨra matmatiam giraghughai.<verse eid="PSA 94:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">94:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 38:16">Onger Akaba 38:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ kamagh nɨghnɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 94:18">“Nan dagarim apɨghsighizɨ, kɨ datɨrɨghɨn irɨgham.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:18">Puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:18">Ikiavɨra Itir God bar nan apangkuvigha nan suirazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 94:18">kɨ arazir kuramɨn irɨzir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 94:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19"/>Kɨ bizir avɨribagh nɨghnɨgha nan navim osemezir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:19">nɨ nan navim gamizɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:19">a bar akongegha amɨragha iti.<verse eid="PSA 94:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20"/>Gumazamizir kurar kaba, gumazamiziba arazir kurabar amuasa, me bagha akar gavgaviba akɨri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:20">Nɨ gumazir kamaghɨn amiba ko ingarir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 94:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21"/>Me uari akuva gumazir aghuibav soghtɨ me arɨmɨghirasa akabav sosi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:21">Me gumazir arazir kurabagh amir puvatɨziba, pura me isa kotiabar arɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:21">me mɨsoghtɨ me arɨmɨghirasa.<verse eid="PSA 94:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">94:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 59:9">Onger Akaba 59:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:2">62:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:6">62:6</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a nan akurvaghasa bar gavgafi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:22">Nan God dagɨamɨn mɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 94:22">ezɨ kɨ an aven modima, a nan akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 94:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23"/>Apaniba arazir kurar bar avɨribagh ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">ezɨ a men arazir kurar kaba ikarvagham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 94:23">Ikiavɨra Itir God, en God, a men arazir kurabagh nɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">me mɨsoghtɨ me arɨmɨghiregham.<verse eid="PSA 94:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94"/>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95"/>
  <para style="s">Ia izɨ, e Godɨn ziam fam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1"/>Ia izɨ, e ighiaba bangɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:1">A en dagɨamɨn mɨn ikia e moga en akurvasi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 95:1">e a gɨnɨghnɨgh onger akabar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 95:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2"/>E an boroghɨra mangɨ a mɨnabɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:2">pamten dɨm ighiabar amu</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 95:2">an ziam fɨ bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 95:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3"/>E fo, Ikiavɨra Itir God, a Godɨn Bar Gavgaviba Itim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:3">An atrivir gavgaviba bar itim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 95:3">egha godɨn ifavariba bar dagh afira.<verse eid="PSA 95:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4"/>A nguazimɨn aven itir danganir koniba, ko mɨghsɨar bar pɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:4">a bar dagh atifa.<verse eid="PSA 95:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5"/>A uabɨ ongarim ko nguazimɨn ingari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:5">ezɨ aning uaghan an bizimningra.<verse eid="PSA 95:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God en ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:6">Ia izɨ, e an boroghɨn mangɨ dapaniba avigh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 95:6">teviba apɨrigh uari a danigh an ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 95:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">95:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 80:1">Onger Akaba 80:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:3">100:3</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">95:7-8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 3:15">Hibru 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:7">4:7</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">95:7-11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 3:7-11">Hibru 3:7-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A uabɨra en God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">E an gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 95:7">E sipsipbar mɨn amima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">a uabɨ e geghuva deragha en gari.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 95:7">Ia bar deragh an akam barakigh!<verse eid="PSA 95:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">95:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:22">Dɨboboniba 14:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Godɨn Araziba 6:16</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">95:8-9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Ua Me Ini 17:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:2-13">Dɨboboniba 20:2-13</ref></char>
    </note>God kamagh ia mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 95:8">“Ian inazir afeziaba fomɨra gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:8">Meriban danganimɨn otogha, nan akam batoke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 95:8">Me gɨn Masan danganimɨn ikia, uam akam batoke.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:8">Ia me amizir arazir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ uan navibar kuman markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 95:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9"/>Me guizbangɨra nan ingangarir gavgavibar gani.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:9">Egha nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nan itir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 95:9">nan gavgavim tuisɨgh fofoghasa nan azai.<verse eid="PSA 95:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10"/>Gumazamizir kabar naviba bar saghon ikia nan gɨn zuir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">Tuavir kɨ me bagh atɨzim, me zurara a gitavɨrasi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 95:10">Kamaghɨn, kɨ 40plan azenibar gumazamizir kabar anɨngaghe.<verse eid="PSA 95:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">95:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:20-23">Dɨboboniba 14:20-23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:34-36">Godɨn Araziba 1:34-36</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:9-10">12:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:3-5">Hibru 4:3-5</ref></char>
    </note>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ anɨngaghegha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:11">kamaghɨn me mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 95:11">‘Me nan aghuvsazir danganimɨn aven mangɨghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:11">Bar puvatɨ!’ ”<verse eid="PSA 95:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95"/>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96"/>
  <para style="s">God nguazimɨn gumazamiziba bar me gativagha men gari</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1"/>Ia bar moghɨra onger akar igiatam, Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh a bangɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:1">Ia nguazimɨn gumazamiziba bar, a bagh ighiabar amu.<verse eid="PSA 96:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2"/>Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ, a bagh onger akabar amu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:2">Dughiabar zurara ia an gun uariv mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 96:2">Ikiavɨra Itir God zurara en akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 96:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3"/>Ia, an gavgavim ko ingangarir aghuir an amibar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:3">gun kantriba bar dar gumazamizibav kɨm.<verse eid="PSA 96:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God a bar faraghavɨra ikia bar gavgafi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">Ezɨ e an ziam fɨ mangɨvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:4">Aseba bar, me Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn mɨn itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">E an apengara ikɨva an atiatingam.<verse eid="PSA 96:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5"/>Nguazimɨn itir gumazamizibar aseba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:5">da pura ifavarir godba.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 96:5">Ikiavɨra Itir God, an overiamɨn ingari.<verse eid="PSA 96:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, atrivimɨn ikia ziar ekiam ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:6">egha uan Dɨpenimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 96:6">A bizir aghuiba ko gavgavimɨn mɨngarim.<verse eid="PSA 96:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">96:7-9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 29:1-2">Onger Akaba 29:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ia nguazimɨn itir ikɨzibar gumazamiziba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:7">ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziar ekiam ko gavgavim bagh, bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 96:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a bar faraghavɨra itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:8">ia an ziar ekiam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 96:8">Ia ofaba inigh an Dɨpenimɨn mangɨ.<verse eid="PSA 96:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">96:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 20:21">2 Eghaghaniba 20:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:8">Onger Akaba 33:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 93:5">93:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 114:7">114:7</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Araziba, da bar deragha bar zue, arazir kaba mati an kurkazir aghuim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:9">Ia gumazamiziba bar moghɨra an arazir kabagh nɨghnɨgh an ziam fɨ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">96:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hibrun akam deragha akar kamɨn mɨngarim abɨghizir puvatɨ. Gumazir maba ghaze, Hibrun mɨngarim kamakɨn, “Ia kurkazir aghuiba ikɨ egha izɨ nan ziam fɨ.”</char></note></para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 96:9">Ia nguazimɨn gumazamiziba, an atiating egh akong.<verse eid="PSA 96:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">96:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 9:8">Onger Akaba 9:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 67:4">67:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 93:1">93:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 98:9">98:9</ref></char>
    </note>Ia Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar tongɨn ikɨ mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">“Ikiavɨra Itir God, an atrivimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:10">A nguazimɨn ingarigha a gamizɨ a gavgavigh ikɨ mamaghɨra ikɨva sɨvaghsɨvaghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">Ikiavɨra Itir God, gɨn uan kotɨn arazir aghuimɨn gɨn mangɨva,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 96:10">gumazamizibar araziba bar da tuisɨgham.”<verse eid="PSA 96:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11"/>Nguazim ko overiam, gua bar akongegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:11">ongarim, nɨ bar akuegh egh nɨgɨnir dafam damu.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 96:11">Ia ongarimɨn aven itir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 96:11">ia uaghan bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 96:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">96:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 98:9">Onger Akaba 98:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ia azeniba, ko azenibar aghuir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:12">ia bar moghɨra bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:12">Ia ruaribar temeba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 96:12">ia uaghan ighiabar amu bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 96:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13"/>Ia bar moghɨra izɨ, Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn damazimɨn ighiam damu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">A izɨ nguazimɨn gumazamiziba bar me gativagh men ganam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:13">Ikiavɨra Itir God, uan arazir aghuimɨn gɨn mangɨ, gumazamiziba bar me gativagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">uan guizɨn akamɨn men araziba tuisɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 96:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96"/>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97"/>
  <para style="s">God an atrivir bar ekiam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, an atrivimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:1">Nguazimɨn itir gumazamiziba, ia bar akueghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 97:1">arighatɨzibar itir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 97:1">ia dɨmɨva bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 97:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2"/>Overiar mɨgharir pɨziba an okarizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:2">an arazir aghuimɨn gumazamizibagh ativagha men gari.<verse eid="PSA 97:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3"/>Apanir a gasɨghasɨghasava amiba, avim an faragha ghua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:3">men isia me gasɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 97:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4"/>An onɨmaribar angazangaribagh ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:4">da nguazimɨn taghtazima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 97:4">nguazim nɨghava agoi.<verse eid="PSA 97:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a nguazir kamɨn God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:5">A izima, mɨghsɨaba pura amera uaghira dɨpabar mɨn otifi.<verse eid="PSA 97:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6"/>Overiam uabɨ, kamaghɨn akam akura ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 97:6">“God arazir aghuibaram ami.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:6">Ezɨ gumazamiziba bar an angazangarim ko gavgavimɨn gari.<verse eid="PSA 97:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">97:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:4">Ua Me Ini 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:8">Godɨn Araziba 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:15">27:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:14">Jeremaia 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:19">Jems 2:19</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir marvir guabar ziaba feba bar aghumsɨki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">Aseba teviba apɨrigh Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 97:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8"/>Saionɨn nguibamɨn itir gumazamiziba, bizir kam barasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 97:8">Judan nguibabar itir gumazamiziba, nɨn kotiar arazir aghuir kam bagh</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 97:8">bar akuegh, men naviba deragham.<verse eid="PSA 97:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">97:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 18:11">Ua Me Ini 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 83:18">Onger Akaba 83:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 95:3">95:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:4">96:4</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, Nɨ Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:9">nɨ nguazimɨn gumazamiziba bar me gativagha men gari.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 97:9">Nɨ ziar ekiam ikia, bar asebagh afira.<verse eid="PSA 97:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10"/>Arazir kurabar aghuazir gumazamiziba, Ikiavɨra Itir God bar me gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">Gumazamizir a baghavɨra itiba, a men apaniba da ua me inigha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 97:10">me geghuva deragha men gari.<verse eid="PSA 97:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11"/>God angazangarim isa gumazamizir aghuibagh anɨga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:11">me gamizɨ men naviba bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 97:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12"/>Gumazamizir aghuiba, ia bizir Ikiavɨra Itir God amiba bagh, bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:12">Ia bizir kabagh nɨghnɨgh a mɨnabagh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 97:12">Ia an ziar zuezir aghuim gɨnɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 97:12">a pɨrafɨ.<verse eid="PSA 97:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97"/>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98"/>
  <para style="s">God gumazamiziba bar men Atrivim</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Godɨn ziam fer onger akam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">98:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:6">Ua Me Ini 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:3">Onger Akaba 33:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:5">40:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:10">Aisaia 52:10</ref></char>
    </note>Ia onger akar igiatam Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh, a bangɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">A uan agharimɨn bizir aghuir igharagha garibagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:1">A uan gavgavir ekiamɨn amodoghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">mɨdorozir kam gamua apaniba abɨra.<verse eid="PSA 98:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, apaniba ko mɨsogha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:2">me abɨrazir bizimɨn gun mɨkeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:2">a uan akurvazir arazim isa</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 98:2">gumazamizibar akazɨ me bar an gari.<verse eid="PSA 98:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">98:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:27">Onger Akaba 22:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:54">Luk 1:54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:72">1:72</ref></char>
    </note>A Israelian apangkuvigha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">men akuraghasa dɨkɨrɨzir akar kam gɨnɨghnɨghavɨra ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 98:3">me ataghizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:3">Kantribar gumazamiziba Godɨn gari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">an apaniba ko mɨsogha me abɨragha, uam e ini.<verse eid="PSA 98:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4"/>Nguazimɨn gumazamiziba, ia Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh bar akongezir ighiabar amu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:4">Ia onger akaba pamten dar amuva bar akuegh an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 98:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5"/>Ia gitabav sogh, Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh ighiabar amu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:5">Ia boabav soghtɨ, dar arareba bar deragh.<verse eid="PSA 98:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6"/>Ia sɨghaba ko itabagh iviva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:6">pamten dɨmɨva Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 98:6">a en atrivim.<verse eid="PSA 98:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7"/>Nɨ ongarim, nɨ ko nɨn itir osiriba, ko bizir nɨn aven itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:7">ia bar pamten dɨm mɨkɨm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:7">Nɨ nguazim, nɨ ko nɨn itir gumazamiziba ko bizir nɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:7">ia bar onger akabar amu.<verse eid="PSA 98:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8"/>Ia faner ekiaba, ia dafaribav sogh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:8">Ia mɨghsɨaba, ia ighiabar amuva bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 98:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God izɨ nguazim gativagh an ganam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">An atrivimɨn ikɨ, guizɨn arazimɨn gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 98:9">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, ia a bagh bar akuegh onger akabar amu.<verse eid="PSA 98:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98"/>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99"/>
  <para style="s">God an atrivir bar ekiam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">99:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:22">Ua Me Ini 25:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, an atrivimɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">Kamaghɨn gumazamiziba an atiatiava agoi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:1">A uan atrivir dabirabim enselɨn bar gavgavibar torimɨn a gapera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">kamaghɨn amizɨ, nguazim agoi.<verse eid="PSA 99:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2"/>Saionɨn nguibamɨn aven,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 99:2">Ikiavɨra Itir God bar ziar ekiam ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 99:2">gumazamizibagh ativagha men gari.<verse eid="PSA 99:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3"/>Gumazamiziba bar anarɨra nɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:3">ana atrivim, egha gavgavim ko ziar ekiam itima, an ziam bar zue.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 99:3">Me an ziar ekiam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 99:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4"/>Atrivir gavgavim, nɨ arazir aghuiba bagha ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">Nɨ arazir aghuimra Israelia e gamizɨ e an gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:4">Nɨ e gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">e kotɨn aven deragha gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 99:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5"/>Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ, a en God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">An arazir aghuiba, ko an damazimɨn zuezir arazibara amir God.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 99:5">Kamaghɨn, ia an boroghɨn mangɨ teviba apɨrigh,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 99:5">an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 99:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6"/>Moses ko Aron, aning Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ofa gamir gumazimningɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">Samuel uaghan God ko mɨgeir gumazir mam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:6">Me bar Ikiavɨra Itir God ko mɨgeima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">a me baragha me ikarvasi.<verse eid="PSA 99:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">99:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 33:9">Ua Me Ini 33:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>God ghuariar ruarir ekiamɨn tongɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:7">Akar Gavgaviba ko arazir a ifongeziba me ganɨngizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 99:7">me dar gɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 99:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">99:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:20">Dɨboboniba 14:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:20">Godɨn Araziba 9:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:28">Jeremaia 46:28</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:7">Sefanaia 3:7</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ en God, nɨ uan gumazamizibar azangsɨziba barasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">Nɨ men arazir kuraba ikarvagha mɨzazim me gasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:8">Nɨ uabɨ men akazɨ me fogha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 99:8">nɨ Godɨn men arazir kuraba gɨn amadim.<verse eid="PSA 99:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9"/>E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">a en God, e an mɨghsɨamɨn an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 99:9">Ikiavɨra Itir God, a en God,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 99:9">a Godɨn arazir aghuibaram amim.<verse eid="PSA 99:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99"/>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100"/>
  <para style="s">God mɨnabir ighiam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1"/>Ia nguazimɨn itir gumazamiziba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:1">ia Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh pamtem dɨmɨva,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 100:1">bar akongegh an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 100:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2"/>Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ingangarim damu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:2">an ziam fɨ bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 100:2">Ia an boroghɨn izɨva</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:2">bar akongezir ighiaba bangɨ.<verse eid="PSA 100:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">100:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 79:13">Onger Akaba 79:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 95:7">95:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:30-31">Esekiel 34:30-31</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:10">Efesus 2:10</ref></char>
    </note>Ia kamaghɨn fogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">Ikiavɨra Itir God a guizbangɨra God.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 100:3">A uabɨ en ingarizɨma e an adarazira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">E an gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 100:3">egha an sipsipbar mɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 100:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4"/>E an Dɨpenimɨn aven mangɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">an ziam fɨva a mɨnamam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 100:4">E a mɨnabagh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">an ziar ekiam bar a pɨrafam.<verse eid="PSA 100:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">100:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Eghaghaniba 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Eghaghaniba 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Esra 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">Onger Akaba 106:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jeremaia 33:11</ref></char>
    </note>E fo, Ikiavɨra Itir God arazir aghuibaram amua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">egha zurara bar en apangkuvighavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 100:5">A damuasa mɨkemegha gɨvazir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">a zurara dagh amua kamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 100:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100"/>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101"/>
  <para style="s">Atrivimɨn akar dɨkɨrɨzim</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:1">kɨ arazir aghuim ko apangkuvir arazim gɨnɨghnɨghɨva ighiam bangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:1">Bar guizbangɨra, kɨ nɨ baghvɨra ighiar kam bangam.<verse eid="PSA 101:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2"/>Kɨ nɨn damazimɨn deraghvɨra tuavir aghuimra mangɨtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">gumazitam nan gan akatam na gasan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:2">O God, nɨ manadɨzoghɨn izɨ nan akuragham?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">Guizbangɨra, kɨ uan dɨpenimɨn aven ikɨ gumazamizibagh ativagh men ganɨva,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 101:2">uan navir averiamɨn aven deraghvɨra nɨghnɨgh biziba bar dar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 101:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">101:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 15:9">Godɨn Araziba 15:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 5:5">Onger Akaba 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:4">40:4</ref></char>
    </note>Egh kɨ iti naghɨn, arazir kuratam bar ikian kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">Gumazamizir akɨrim ragha nɨ gasiba kɨ men aghua.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 101:3">Kɨ me ko daruan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 101:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4"/>Kɨ ifavarir arazimɨn gɨn mangan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:4">Egha kɨ arazir kurabagh nɨghnɨghan aghua.<verse eid="PSA 101:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">101:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:27">Onger Akaba 18:27</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 50:20">50:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 9:4">Jeremaia 9:4</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir moga gɨrakɨrangɨn igharaz daraziv geiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">kɨ bar me gasɨghasɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:5">Egh kɨ gumazamizir ifaghata uari uan ziaba feba ateghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">me ikian kogham.<verse eid="PSA 101:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">101:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:1">Onger Akaba 119:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ezɨ gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn ikiavɨra itiba, kɨ me gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">Merara na ko nan dɨpenimɨn ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:6">Eghtɨ gumazamizir Godɨn damazimɨn deravɨra tuavir aghuimɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">merara nan ingangaribar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 101:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">101:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 52:2-5">Onger Akaba 52:2-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Eghtɨ gumazir akar ifavaribagh amitam nan dɨpenimɨn aven ikian kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:7">Gumazamizir ifariba na ko ikian kogham. Bar puvatɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 101:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8"/>Eghtɨ dughiaba vaghvagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">en kantrin aven itir gumazamizir kuraba, kɨ me asɨghasɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:8">Egh gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba, kɨ me batueghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">me ua Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn nguibar ekiamɨn ikian kogham.<verse eid="PSA 101:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101"/>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim osɨmtɨzim ikia God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:1">kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa nɨn dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:1">nɨ nan dɨmdiam barakigh.<verse eid="PSA 102:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2"/>Kɨ osɨmtɨzim ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">nɨ nan modogh akɨrim ragh na gasan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:2">Kɨ nɨn dɨmamin dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">nɨ zuamɨra na ikaragh nan akuragh!<verse eid="PSA 102:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3"/>Guizbangɨra, nan ikɨrɨmɨrim mɨgharimɨn mɨn dughiar otevimɨn ikegha ua ghugha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:3">Ezɨ nan mɨkarzim mati avir ekiam nan isi moghɨn puvɨra nan fei.<verse eid="PSA 102:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4"/>Ezɨ nan navir averiam mati, me dadar mɨdiaribar mɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:4">na dɨkaragha na abɨrazɨ, kɨ iraghu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:4">Ezɨ kɨ bar osemegha daghebar aghuagha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:4">damasa nɨghnɨzir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 102:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5"/>Kɨ mɨzazim baragha pamten arai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:5">Ezɨ nan mɨkarzim ikuvizɨ, kɨ agharim gura.<verse eid="PSA 102:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6"/>Kɨ kuarazir bagabar mɨn gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn uabɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:6">Egha kuarazir mɨghɨamɨn mɨn danganir kurar gumaziba ikian aghuazibar iti.<verse eid="PSA 102:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7"/>Kɨ mɨsiamɨn akuima, nan damazimning kuiaghirɨghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:7">Kɨ uabɨn apangkufi. Kɨ kuarazir dɨpenir siriabagh apiavtimɨn mɨn uabɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 102:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8"/>Ezɨ dughiabar zurara, nan apaniba mɨgɨrɨgɨabagh amua na dɨpova na gasɨghasɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:8">Egha me gumazamizir igharazibagh asɨghasɨghasa nan ziam dɨbora ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 102:8">osɨmtɨzir kɨ inizibar mɨn me uaghan da iniam.<verse eid="PSA 102:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9-10"/>Nɨ adarir ekiam ko anɨngagharim nan iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:9-10">egha nɨ na inigha mati gumazamiziba bizir mɨzɨrɨziba makurir danganimɨn da makuri moghɨn nɨ na makuni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:9-10">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ bar osemegha dagheba api moghɨn api moghɨn, avir sirim api</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:9-10">ezɨ nan damazimningɨn teriba dɨpamɨn mɨn itarim girima, kɨ anepi.<verse eid="PSA 102:9-10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11"/>Nan ikɨrɨmɨrimɨn dughiam mati nedazim zuamɨra ghua guaratɨzimɨn gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:11">Ezɨ kɨ angamɨra itir ikɨrɨmɨrimɨn dughiam bar otefe.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 102:11">Kɨ mati dadam aghua ghua mɨsigha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 102:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨrara gumazamizibagh ativagh men ganvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">Eghtɨ gumazamizir gɨn otivamiba nɨn ziar ekiam gɨfogham.<verse eid="PSA 102:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13"/>Eghtɨ nɨ dɨkavigh izɨ Saionɨn nguibamɨn apangkuvigham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">Ezɨ datɨrɨghɨn dughiar apangkuvamim oto.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 102:13">Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn an uabɨn torogh, egh an akurvagham.<verse eid="PSA 102:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14"/>Saionɨn nguibam ikufi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:14">Ezɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazamiziba bar a gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:14">A datɨrɨghɨn ikuvigha mati nguazir mɨnemniamɨn otozɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:14">me bar an apangkufi.<verse eid="PSA 102:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15"/>Eghtɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba, Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziar ekiam ko gavgavimɨn atiating,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:15">an apengan ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 102:15">Eghtɨ nguazimɨn atriviba an gavgavim ko angazangarir gavgavimɨn atiatingam.<verse eid="PSA 102:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, gɨn ua Saionɨn nguibamɨn ingarigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:16">egh uan gavgavim ko angazangarim sara gumazamizibar akagham.<verse eid="PSA 102:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17"/>Egh a uan gumazamizir fomɨra pura taghiziba, a men azangsɨziba baragham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:17">Egh men azangsɨzibar aghuaghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 102:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18"/>Bizir Ikiavɨra Itir God amir kam, tav akɨnafarimɨn an osirigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:18">eghtɨ en ovavir borir gɨn otivamiba a gɨfogh, egh uaghan an ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 102:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19"/>Gumazir osiramin kam kamaghɨn osiram:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:19">“Ikiavɨra Itir God uan Nguibamɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 102:19">egha nguazir kamɨn vangɨnan gari.<verse eid="PSA 102:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20"/>A gara orazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:20">kalabuziar gumazamiziba uan osɨmtɨziba aterava arai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:20">A gari, me marazi isa kotiam garɨgha egha ghaze, me arɨghregham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:20">God men akuraghasa ifonge,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 102:20">eghtɨ me fɨrighregh, egh ovengan kogham.”<verse eid="PSA 102:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21-22"/>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, ikɨzir avɨribar gumazamiziba ko kantribar gumazamiziba Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨsɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:21-22">uari akuvagh Saionɨn nguibamɨn ikɨva, an ziam pɨrafam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 102:21-22">Guizbangɨra, me Jerusalemɨn nguibamɨn ikɨva ziar ekiam a danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 102:21-22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23"/>Guizbangɨra, kɨ igiamra itima, God nan gavgavim gasɨghasɨki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:23">Egha na gamizɨ, nan ikɨrɨmɨrimɨn dughiam otefe.<verse eid="PSA 102:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">102:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:26">Jop 36:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 90:2">Onger Akaba 90:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:10">Aisaia 38:10</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 1:12">Habakuk 1:12</ref></char>
    </note>Kamaghɨn, kɨ ghaze, O nan God, nɨ ikia mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">Kɨ igiamɨn ikiavɨra iti, kɨ ghurizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 102:24">Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn na inigh mangan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 102:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">102:25-27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 1:10-12">Hibru 1:10-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ bar faraghavɨra nguazir kamɨn ingari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:25">ezɨ a gavgavigha ikiavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:25">Nɨ uan dafarimningɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:25">overiam ko bizir pɨn itibar ingari.<verse eid="PSA 102:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26"/>Overiam ko nguazim bar ikuvigh gɨvagham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">eghtɨ nɨ zurara ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:26">Guizbangɨra, aning bar ikuvigham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">mati inim ghurigha bar bɨaghire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:26">Nɨ aning damightɨ aning gɨvagham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">mati gumazim korotiar ghurim suegha a makuni.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 102:26">Eghtɨ aning bar gɨvagh</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 102:26">ua ikian kogham.<verse eid="PSA 102:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">102:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:10">Aisaia 43:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:6">Malakai 3:6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:17">Jems 1:17</ref></char>
    </note>Ezɨ nɨ ikia kamaghɨra iti, egha gevir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 102:27">Eghtɨ nɨn azeniba gɨvaghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 102:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28"/>E nɨn ingangarir gumazamiziba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:28">Nɨ deraghvɨra en boribar gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 102:28">me deraghvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:28">Egh nɨ men ovavir borir gɨn otivamibar akuraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:28">me deraghvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 102:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102"/>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103"/>
  <para style="s">God bar en apangkuvigha bar e gifonge</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1"/>Kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:1">Kɨ uan duam ko, navir averiam ko, namnam sara</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:1">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziar aghuim pɨrafam!<verse eid="PSA 103:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2"/>Kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:2">bizir aghuir a na gamiba da bakɨnɨghnighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 103:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">103:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 33:24">Aisaia 33:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:14">Jeremaia 17:14</ref></char>
    </note>A nan arazir kuraba bar da gɨn amaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:3">nan arɨmariabagh amizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:3">da ua dera.<verse eid="PSA 103:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">103:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:22">Onger Akaba 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 56:13">56:13</ref></char>
    </note>A nan akuragha ua na inizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:4">kɨ ovengezir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:4">A bar na gifongegha nan apangkufi.<verse eid="PSA 103:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">103:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:31">Aisaia 40:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ nguazimɨn itir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:5">God bar nan deragha bizir bar aghuir avɨribar na ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:5">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ gumazir igiamɨn mɨn gavgavigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:5">kuarazir bagamɨn mɨn igiamra iti.<verse eid="PSA 103:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God ingangarir aghuim gumazamizibar akurvaghasava a gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:6">Men marazi faragha gumazir arazir kurabagh amibar apengan ikia gavgaviba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:6">Ezɨ a bar men akuragha deragha me gamizɨ me deravɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 103:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7"/>Bar fomɨra, a uan araziba isa Mosesɨn aka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:7">Egha Israelia, a ingangarir gavgavir kaba men tongɨn dagh amizɨ me dar gani.<verse eid="PSA 103:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">103:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JAS 5:11">Jems 5:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God en kuarkuva</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:8">an apangkuvim en iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:8">A bar en apangkuvigha</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 103:8">zuamɨram en atarir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 103:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9"/>An atara ghuavɨra itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:9">An atara egha adarimɨn suirazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:9">a dughiar ruarimɨn itir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 103:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">103:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 9:13">Esra 9:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E arazir kurar bar avɨribagh ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:10">ezɨ an en arazir kuraba ikarvagh e danɨngamin bizim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:10">an a gamir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 103:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">103:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 57:10">Onger Akaba 57:10</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:18">Efesus 3:18</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir an atiatia an apengan itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:11">a bar men apangkufi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:11">A men apangkuvir ababanim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:11">a bar ekefe,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:11">mati an overiamɨn pɨn ikegha</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 103:11">izaghira nguazimɨn tu.<verse eid="PSA 103:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">103:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 43:25">Aisaia 43:25</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:18">Maika 7:18</ref></char>
    </note>E fo, aruem anadi naghɨn ikegha ghua aruem uaghiri naghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:12">kar tizir bar ruarim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:12">Kamaghɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God en arazir kuraba batoghezɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:12">da bar en saghon mar iti.<verse eid="PSA 103:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">103:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:17">Malakai 3:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E fo, afeziaba uan boribar apangkuvi moghɨra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:13">Ikiavɨra Itir God uan gumazamizir an atiatia</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:13">an apengan itibar apangkufi.<verse eid="PSA 103:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">103:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:19">Jenesis 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:39">Onger Akaba 78:39</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 12:7">Fofozir Gumazim 12:7</ref></char>
    </note>A kamaghɨn fogha gɨfa, a uabɨ nguazim inigha en ingarizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:14">e mati pura nguazir mɨnemniaba.<verse eid="PSA 103:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">103:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 14:1-2">Jop 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:10-11">Jems 1:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:24">1 Pita 1:24</ref></char>
    </note>E gumazamiziba, en angamɨra itir ikɨrɨmɨrim grazibar mɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:15">dughiar ruarimɨn itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:15">E dughiar bar otevimra</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 103:15">ruarimɨn akɨmarimɨn mɨn ikegha ariaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 103:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16"/>Ezɨ amɨnim akɨmarir kam giverazɨ a irɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:16">gumazamiziba uam an garir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 103:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">103:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:50">Luk 1:50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ezɨ gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn apengan ikia an atiatiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">a zurazurara men apangkufi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:17">Egh men ovavir borir gɨn otivamiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">a uaghan deragh me damuvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 103:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18"/>Gumazamizir kaba, Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavimɨn gɨn zui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:18">egha an Akar Gavgaviba barasi.<verse eid="PSA 103:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, uan Nguibamɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:19">uan atrivir dabirabim gaperaghav ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:19">bizibagh ativagha bar adar gari.<verse eid="PSA 103:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20"/>Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn mɨdorozir enselba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">ia gavgaviba iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:20">Ia kuariba arigha an akaba baragha dar gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 103:20">Ia an ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 103:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21"/>Ia Godɨn Nguibamɨn itir mɨdorozir enselba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">ia an ingangarir enselɨn an ifongiamɨn gɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:21">ia bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 103:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22"/>Ia danganiba bar dar itir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:22">a ian ingarigha ia gativagha ian gari,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 103:22">ia bar moghɨra Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 103:22"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:22">Eghtɨ kɨ uabɨ uaghan Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 103:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103"/>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104"/>
  <para style="s">Ikiavɨra Itir God biziba bar <optbreak/>dar ingari, ezɨ e an ziam fam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1"/>Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:1">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan God, nɨ bar pɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">Nɨn ziam bar pɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:1">egha nɨ atrivir bar ekiam.<verse eid="PSA 104:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">104:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:22">Aisaia 40:22</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:9">Daniel 7:9</ref></char>
    </note>Angazangarim nɨ avara, mati gumazim inim avara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:2">Nɨ overiam atɨzɨma mɨkoveziba bar iti,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:2">mati gumazim purirpenim asaragha benimɨn a ikezɨma a iti.<verse eid="PSA 104:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">104:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:10">Onger Akaba 18:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ uan dɨpenim dɨpar pɨn itibagh isɨn an ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:3">Ezɨ overiamɨn mɨghariba, da mati nɨn karis,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:3">ezɨ amɨnim nɨ atera zui.<verse eid="PSA 104:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">104:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 1:7">Hibru 1:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ amɨnim amadima, a nɨn akaba atera zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:4">Ezɨ nɨ overiamɨn onɨmariba ko avir mɨzariaba dagh amima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:4">da nɨn ingangarir gumazibar iti.<verse eid="PSA 104:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5"/>Nɨ fomɨra nguazir kam atɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:5">a bar deraghavɨrama aperagha gavgafi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:5">Egha bar mozorozir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 104:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6"/>Nɨ ongarim atɨzɨ a ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:6">inimɨn mɨn nguazim avara.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:6">Ezɨ dɨpar kam mɨghsɨaba bar ada avara.<verse eid="PSA 104:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7"/>Nɨ gɨn ongarim pamten a mɨkemezɨ an arav ghu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:7">Nɨn tiarim ararimɨn mɨn dagarvazima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:7">ongarim a baragha a foregha ghugha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 104:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8"/>Ongarim mɨghsɨaba bar da ategha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">afora danganir zaribar uaghire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:8">Egha danganir ongarim ikiasa nɨ inabazir kamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">a datɨrɨghɨn an ikia kamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 104:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">104:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:22">Jeremaia 5:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ongarim ikiamin danganim, nɨrara an abaragha gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:9">eghtɨ ongarim nɨ atɨzir danganir kam gitavɨraghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:9">Gɨn ongarim ua nguazir kam bar an evaraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 104:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10"/>Nɨ nguazimɨn aven ivemarir dɨpabagh amima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:10">da nguazir averiamɨn otivigha danganir zaribar afora,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:10">egha mɨghsɨabar tongɨn ivemara uaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 104:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11"/>Asɨzir atiaba dɨpar kam api,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:11">ezɨ donkin atiaba dɨpar kamram api.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:11">Ezɨ kuariba ua men pɨrir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 104:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12"/>Overiamɨn pɨn mɨghagha aruir kuaraziba iza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:12">temer dɨpar mɨriamɨn tuivighav itibar uan mɨkonibar ingari.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:12">Egha ter aguabar apiaghirava arai.<verse eid="PSA 104:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13"/>Nɨ uan Nguibamɨn ikia egha amozim amadi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:13">a mɨghsɨabagh isɨn izi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:13">Nɨ ingangarir aghuim gamua nguazir kamɨn akurazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:13">bizir aghuiba nguazir kam bar a gizɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 104:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14"/>Nɨ bulmakauba apir dadabagh ami da otifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:14">Ezɨ e gumazamiziba oparir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:14">nɨ uaghan dagh amizɨ da otivizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 104:14">e dar dagheba isi.<verse eid="PSA 104:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15"/>Nɨ en akurazɨma, e wainɨn ikarɨziba opara dar ovɨziba mɨrmɨra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">dar dɨpaba apa en naviba bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:15">Egha en guaba taghtaghasa, e olivɨn temebar borem isa uan guabagh azui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">Egha e dagheba opara, da apava, en mɨkarziba gavgafi.<verse eid="PSA 104:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16"/>Amozim izima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:16">Lebanonɨn temeba dɨpar avɨrim isi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:16">Sidan temer kabanang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:16">Ikiavɨra Itir God fomɨra da opari.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:16">Ezɨ kar an temeba.<verse eid="PSA 104:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17"/>Sidan temer kaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:17">kuaraziba iza dar uan mɨkonibar ingari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:17">Ezɨ kuarazir fɨrir ruariba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:17">temer painbar uan mɨkonibar ingari.<verse eid="PSA 104:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18"/>Memen atiaba mɨghsɨaba itir danganibagh arui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:18">ezɨ iriaba mɨghsɨabar itir dagɨar toribar modi.<verse eid="PSA 104:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19"/>Nɨ iakɨnimɨn ingarigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:19">azenir vamɨran iakɨniba vaghvagh dar dughiabar ada arɨki.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:19">Ezɨ aruem magɨramin dughiam gɨfo.<verse eid="PSA 104:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20"/>Nɨ mɨtatem gami, a dɨmagaribar otifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:20">Ezɨ dɨmagaribar asɨzir atiaba arui.<verse eid="PSA 104:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21"/>Laionba asɨziba buria pamten dei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:21">Egha asɨzir nɨ me ganɨdiba buri.<verse eid="PSA 104:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22"/>Aruem anadima me uamategha ghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:22">uan mogomer danganibar zui.<verse eid="PSA 104:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23"/>Gumaziba uan ingangaribagh amua ghua garima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:23">aruem uaghiri me gefi.<verse eid="PSA 104:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ bizir bar avɨrimɨn ingari!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">Nɨ bar fofozir ekiam ikia</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:24">bizir avɨrir kaba bar dar ingari.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:24">Ezɨ bizir nɨ ingarizir kaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">nguazim bar a gizɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 104:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25"/>Ongarim bar ekefe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:25">ezɨ angamɨra itir bizir avɨriba iti,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:25">osirir ekiaba ko doziba, ko bizir igharaziba an iti.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 104:25">Ezɨ e da mengan ibura.<verse eid="PSA 104:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">104:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:1">Jop 41:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 74:14">Onger Akaba 74:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 27:1">Aisaia 27:1</ref></char>
    </note>E gari, kuriba ongarim gisɨn ivemara zui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:26">ezɨ maburan osirir ekiar nɨ faragha ingariziba</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:26">ongarimɨn ikarara uari akura uanaga izaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 104:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27"/>Angamɨra itir biziba bar nɨrara gari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:27">mɨtiriam men azir dughiam</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:27">nɨ dagheba me danɨngasa me nɨrara mɨzuai.<verse eid="PSA 104:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28"/>Nɨ dagheba me ganɨdima me api.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">Nɨrara dagher aghuiba me ganɨdi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:28">men naviba izevegha tughatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 104:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29"/>Guizbangɨra, nɨ akɨrim ragha me gasarazɨ me atiati.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">Men angamɨra itir ikɨrɨmɨrim, nɨ me dama a inizɨ me ariaghire,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:29">egha men mɨkarziba ua nguazir mɨnemniamɨn oto.<verse eid="PSA 104:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30"/>Nɨ ikɨrɨmɨrir angamɨra itim anɨdir amɨnim me ganɨngizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">me angamɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:30">Nɨ nguazimɨn bizir igiabagh amima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">da otifi.<verse eid="PSA 104:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31"/>E ghaze, Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn gavgavim ko angazangarir ekiam zurara ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:31">Eghtɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God, bizir a ingariziba bagh bar akongegham.<verse eid="PSA 104:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32"/>A nguazimɨn garima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:32">mɨkɨmkɨzim puram a batifi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:32">A dafarim mɨghsɨabagh arɨzima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:32">mɨghariba pura dar otifi.<verse eid="PSA 104:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33"/>Kɨ angamɨra itir dughiar kam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:33">kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:33">Kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh ighiabar amu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:33">egh an ziam pɨrafegh gɨn ovengam.<verse eid="PSA 104:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34"/>A na gamima, kɨ bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:34">Kɨ kamaghsua ifonge,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 104:34">a nan onger akabagh ifuegham.<verse eid="PSA 104:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35"/>Nan ifongiam kamakɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">nɨ arazir kurabagh amir gumazamiziba bar me gasɨghasɨkigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:35">Gumazamizir kuraba bar moghɨra gevegh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">ua ikian kogham.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:35">Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:35">Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 104:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104"/>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105"/>
  <para style="s">God uan gumazamiziba ko, men onger akam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1"/>E bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam dɨponɨva a mɨnabaka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">Egh ingangarir ekiar an amizibar gun Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba bar me mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 105:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2"/>E Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh ighiaba bangɨ egh an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:2">Egh bizir aghuir an amizibar gun mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 105:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3"/>Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn boroghɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:3">uan navir averiabar a bagh bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:3">E an ziar aghuim gɨnɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:3">an ziar ekiam bar a pɨrafɨ bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 105:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4"/>E zurara Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn boroghɨra mangɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:4">uarir akurvaghsɨ an gavgavim bagh an azangsɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 105:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5-6"/>Ia Abrahamɨn ovavir boriba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5-6">Abraham an Ekiamɨn ingangarir gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:5-6">Ia Jekopɨn boriba,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 105:5-6">ia Ikiavɨra Itir God ua baghavɨra inabazir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:5-6">ia arazarazir ekiaba ko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5-6">ingangarir gavgavir an amiziba ko</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:5-6">akar a en apanibagh asɨghasɨgha mɨkemeziba,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 105:5-6">ia uam adagh nɨghnɨghvɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 105:5-6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a en God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:7">A nguazir kamɨn gumazamiziba bar me gativagha men gari.<verse eid="PSA 105:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God e koma Akar Gavgavir mam gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:8">egh zurazurara Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavir kam gɨnɨghnɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:8">An Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavir kam gɨnɨghnɨgh mangɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 105:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:7">Jenesis 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17:8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26:3</ref></char>
    </note>An Abraham ko Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavir kam gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:9">Egha Aisak koma Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavir kam akɨri.<verse eid="PSA 105:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:10-11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 28:13">Jenesis 28:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavir kam Jekop koma a gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:10">a Israelian ovavim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:10">egha Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavir kam gavgavim a ganɨngi,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 105:10">eghtɨ a zurara ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 105:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:11">“Kɨ Kenanɨn nguazim nɨ danɨngam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:11">eghtɨ nguazir kam</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 105:11">kar nɨn ovavir boribar nguazim.”<verse eid="PSA 105:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12"/>Fomɨra Israelia bar avɨrasemezir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:12">egha Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar mɨn pura Kenanɨn nguazimɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 105:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13"/>Egha Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar mɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:13">pura tintinibar dagh aruavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 105:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:14-15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 20:3-7">Jenesis 20:3-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ezɨ God tarazi ataghizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:14">me me mɨsogha me abɨnizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:14">A men akurvagha me bagha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:14">Akar Gavgaviba atrivibagh anɨga me dɨkabɨra ghaze,<verse eid="PSA 105:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15"/>“Kɨ ua bagha mɨsevezir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:15">ia me gasɨghasɨghan markɨ!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:15">Ia nan akam inigha izir gumaziba pazɨ me damuan markɨ!”<verse eid="PSA 105:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:53-57">Jenesis 41:53-57</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨtiriar aghazir ekiam amadazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:16">a nguazimɨn oto.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:16">A men daghebagh amizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 105:16">da bar gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 105:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:28">Jenesis 37:28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 45:5">45:5</ref></char>
    </note>E fo, a Josep amadazɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:17">a uan adarazir faragha ghua Isipɨn kantrin iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:17">Me dagɨaba bagha Josep amadazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:17">a Isipɨn kantrin aven ingangarir gumazir kɨnimɨn mɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 105:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:18-19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 39:20-40:23">Jenesis 39:20--40:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ezɨ Isipia paza a gamua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:18">senɨn gavgavimɨn an suemning gike.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:18">Egha ain ring an fɨrim dafa.<verse eid="PSA 105:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19"/>Ezɨ Josep ikia ghuavɨra itima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:19">bizir a mɨkemeziba guizbangɨram otifi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:19">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn akam kamaghɨn aka,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 105:19">Josepɨn akaba da guizbangɨra.<verse eid="PSA 105:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:14">Jenesis 41:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ezɨ gɨn Isipɨn atrivim gumazir mam amadazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:20">a ghua kalabusɨn Josep inigha azenim gatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:20">Guizbangɨra, gumazamizir avɨribar garir atrivir kam Josep ataghizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:20">a fɨriaghɨrɨ.<verse eid="PSA 105:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:39-41">Jenesis 41:39-41</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Atrivir kam Josep inigha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:21">uan bizibar ganasa gumazir dapanimɨn anetɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:21">Ezɨ Josep Isipɨn gavmanɨn gumazir dapanimɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 105:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22"/>Josep atrivimɨn dɨpenimɨn ingarir gumaziba ko, gumazir nɨghnɨzir aghuiba a ganɨdiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:22">a me gativagha men sure gami.<verse eid="PSA 105:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 46:6">Jenesis 46:6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 47:11">47:11</ref></char>
    </note>Jekop gɨn ghua Isipɨn kantrin otogha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:23">nguibar igharazimɨn gumazimɨn mɨn puram an guraghav ikia iti.<verse eid="PSA 105:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:24-25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:7-14">Ua Me Ini 1:7-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God uan adarazir akurazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:24">me borir avɨriba bate.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:24">A me gamizɨ, men dɨbobonim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:24">men apanibar dɨbobonim gafira.<verse eid="PSA 105:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25"/>God Isipia gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:25">me an gumazamizibar apanim gamua,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:25">egha pazɨ me damuasa tuaviba buri.<verse eid="PSA 105:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:1-4:17">Ua Me Ini 3:1--4:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gɨn, God uan ingangarir gumazim Moses ko Aron, a mɨsevezir gumazim, an aning amada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:26">ezɨ aning Isipɨn kantrin zui.<verse eid="PSA 105:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27"/>Aning Isipɨn kantrin ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:27">Godɨn mirakelba ko dɨgavir kuram gamir arazarazibagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 105:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 10:21-23">Ua Me Ini 10:21-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Isipia Godɨn akam batoghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:28">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, God mɨtarmer bar ekiam gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:28">a men nguazim avara.<verse eid="PSA 105:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 7:17-21">Ua Me Ini 7:17-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A men dɨpabagh amizɨ, da bar ghuzibar otivizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:29">men osiriba bar ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 105:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 8:1-6">Ua Me Ini 8:1-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mɨtiviba otiva bar avɨrasemegha men nguaziba bar adagh izɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:30">egha uaghan atrivimɨn dɨpenir ekiam gizɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 105:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 8:16-17">Ua Me Ini 8:16-17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 8:20-24">8:20-24</ref></char>
    </note>God mɨkemezɨ, bereziba ko itiba otiva bar avɨrasemegha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:31">men nguazim bar a gizɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 105:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:32-33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 9:22-25">Ua Me Ini 9:22-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Amozimɨn danganimɨn, God amozir ofɨzir ekiar dagɨabar mɨn gariba amadazɨ da nguazimɨn izaghirɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:32">Ezɨ onɨmarim taghtagha nguazimɨn izaghira men nguazim gasava amadi.<verse eid="PSA 105:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33"/>God tuavir kamɨn men wainɨn ikarɨziba ko men fighɨn temebagh asɨghasɨki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:33">egha men nguazimɨn temeba bar ada apɨragharɨki.<verse eid="PSA 105:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:34-35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 10:12-15">Ua Me Ini 10:12-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A mɨgeima, odeziba otifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:34">Ezɨ dar dɨbobonim bar ghuavanabozɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:34">gumazitam dar ponan iburagham.<verse eid="PSA 105:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35"/>Odezir kaba, bizir dafariba itiba, bar ada ame.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:35">Dagher me opariziba, uaghan odezir kaba bar ada ame.<verse eid="PSA 105:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:29">Ua Me Ini 12:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>God Isipian adarazi bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:36">men otarir ivariaba bar me mɨsoghezɨ me ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 105:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:37-38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:33-36">Ua Me Ini 12:33-36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A gɨn Israelia inigha Isipɨn kantri ategha azenan ghu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:37">Me gol ko silvan avɨriba inigha da sara ghue.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:37">Egha me bar moghɨra mɨkarziba deragha gavgavigha azenan izi.<verse eid="PSA 105:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38"/>Dughiar kamɨn Isipia Israelian atiatingi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:38">Me zuima, datɨrɨghɨn Isipia bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 105:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 13:21-22">Ua Me Ini 13:21-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>God ghuariar ekiar mam isa overiamɨn pɨn anetɨzɨ, a me avara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:39">Ezɨ a dɨmagaribar ghuariam gamizɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:39">an avimɨn mɨn isia isiragha angazangarim me ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 105:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 16:2-15">Ua Me Ini 16:2-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Me dagheba bagha an azangsɨsi, ezɨ a kuaraziba amadazɨ da izi me da ame.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:40">Egha a uan Nguibamɨn bretba isa</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:40">me bagha da amadazɨ, me da apa bar izefe.<verse eid="PSA 105:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Ua Me Ini 17:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:2-13">Dɨboboniba 20:2-13</ref></char>
    </note>A dagɨam gamizɨ, a kuiaghirɨzɨma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:41">dɨpam otogha ivemara ghua</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:41">dɨpaba puvatɨzir danganimɨn Faner ekiamɨn mɨn oto.<verse eid="PSA 105:41"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42"/>Guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God uan ingangarir gumazim Abraham koma Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:42">egha an a gɨnɨghnɨghavɨra ikia, bizir kabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 105:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43"/>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, a uan gumazamiziba inigha zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:43">Gumazamizir kaba, a ua baghavɨra me amɨsefe,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:43">ezɨ me bar akuegha ighiabagh amua zui.<verse eid="PSA 105:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">105:44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 11:16-23">Josua 11:16-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A gumazamizir igharazibar nguaziba isa me ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:44">Egha uan adarazir amamangatɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:44">me gumazamizir kabar azeniba ko nguibaba ini.<verse eid="PSA 105:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45"/>God kamaghɨn ifonge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:45">Israelia zurara an arazir a ifongeziba ko an Arazibar gɨn mangam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 105:45">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, a me bagha bizir aghuir kabagh ami.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 105:45"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:45">Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:45">E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam pɨrafam!<verse eid="PSA 105:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105"/>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106"/>
  <para style="s">God uan gumazamiziba arazir aghuibar me gami, ezɨ me arazir kurabagh ami</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Eghaghaniba 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Eghaghaniba 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Esra 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Onger Akaba 100:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jeremaia 33:11</ref></char>
    </note>E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:1">An araziba bar dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:1">ezɨ a zurara en apangkuva ikia mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:1">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, e bizir kam bagh a mɨnabagham.<verse eid="PSA 106:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2"/>Tina an ingangarir ekiar an amiziba bar, dagh eghanam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:2">Tina an arazir aghuir an amiba bar da bagh an ziam fam?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:2">Gumazamiziba puvatɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 106:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3"/>Gumazamizir an Akar Gavgavimɨn gɨn ghua arazir aghuibagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:3">me bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 106:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ uan gumazamizibar akurvaghsɨ izɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">egh na ginɨrɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:4">Nɨ men akurvagh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">egh uaghan nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 106:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5"/>Nɨ ua bagha mɨsevezir gumazamiziba kɨ men gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">men dabirabim deraghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:5">me bizir aghuiba iniam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:5">Eghtɨ kɨ uaghan me ko bar akuegham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">E nɨn gumazamizibara,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:5">kamaghɨn e bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 106:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6"/>E, en ovaviba fomɨra arazir kuram gamizɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:6">arazir kuram gamigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:6">E arazir mɨzɨrɨzir guar avɨribagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 106:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:10-12">Ua Me Ini 14:10-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fomɨra, en ovaviba Isipɨn kantrin aven ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">nɨ amizir bizir ekiar kaba deragha dagh nɨghnɨzir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:7">Nɨ bar men apangkuvigha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">dughiar avɨribar men akurvasi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:7">ezɨ me nɨn apangkuvir ekiar kam bakɨnɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:7">Egha me ghua Ongarir Aghevimɨn otivigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itimɨn akam batoke.<verse eid="PSA 106:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8"/>God uan ziar ekiam bangɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:8">uan gavgavir ekiam akakaghasa ua men akura.<verse eid="PSA 106:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:9-12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Ua Me Ini 14:21-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An Akar Gavgavim Ongarir Aghevim ganɨngi, ezɨ a dakegha mɨsɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">Ezɨ a gumazamiziba inigha ongarir torir kamɨn apengan itir nguazimɨn tuavir dakɨrtɨzimɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 106:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10"/>A gumazamizir kabar apanibar dafaribar ua me ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:10">A men akuragha men apanibar gavgavim dɨkabɨra,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:10">ezɨ me me gasɨghasɨghizir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 106:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11"/>Ongarim bar men apaniba avezɨ, me bar ariaghire.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:11">Men tav uam angamɨra iti puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 106:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:1-21">Ua Me Ini 15:1-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Dughiar kamɨn Israelia an akam nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:12">an ziam fava ighiabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 106:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13"/>Egha me bar zuamɨra an amizir bizir kam gɨn amada.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:13">Egha me uan nɨghnɨzibar gɨn ghua bizibar amuasa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:13">egha faragha Godɨn akam bagha an azangsɨzir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 106:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:14-15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:4-34">Dɨboboniba 11:4-34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Me gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:14">daghem bagha naviba puvɨra dɨkava,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:14">God ko itir arazim ategha an araziba tuisɨgh foghasa</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 106:14">an gavgavim bagha azai.<verse eid="PSA 106:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15"/>God, me an azangsɨzir bizimɨn ganigha a ikara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:15">egha uam arɨmariar bar ekiam gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:15">a me bato.<verse eid="PSA 106:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:16-18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 16:1-35">Dɨboboniba 16:1-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gɨn me gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:16">egha men marazi Moses ko Aron navim aningɨn ikufi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:16">aning Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ingangarir gumazimning.<verse eid="PSA 106:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17"/>Ezɨ nguazim akam akarizɨ Datan ko Abiram uan adarazi ko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:17">me torir kam giraghuezɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:17">nguazim iza ua dukuagha me ave.<verse eid="PSA 106:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18"/>Ezɨ avim izaghira men gɨn zui darazir isia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:18">egha gumazir kuraba bar men isi.<verse eid="PSA 106:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:19-23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 32:1-14">Ua Me Ini 32:1-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Me Horepɨn Mɨghsɨamɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:19">gol isa bulmakaun mamɨn ingarigha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:19">an ziam fe.<verse eid="PSA 106:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20"/>Me Godɨn ziar ekiam akɨrim ragha agasaragha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:20">dadaba apir bulmakaun nedazimɨn ingarigha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:20">Godɨn danganimɨn anetɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 106:20">egha an ziam pɨrafi.<verse eid="PSA 106:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21-22"/>Godra, Isipɨn kantrin ingangarir ekiabagh amigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:21-22">Israelia ua me ini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:21-22">Egha a Isipɨn kantrin ingangarir bar ekiar aghuibagh ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:21-22">egha Ongarir Aghevimɨn bizir igharagha garibagh ami, ezɨ gumazamiziba dɨgavir kuram gami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:21-22">Ezɨ Israelia ua Godɨn men akurazir kam a bakɨnɨghnɨki.<verse eid="PSA 106:21-22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23"/>Kamaghɨn, God ghaze, a uan gumazamizibagh asɨghasɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">Ezɨ God inabazir ingangarir gumazim Moses dɨkavigha abuir gumazimɨn mɨn Godɨn damazimɨn tu,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:23">egha Israelian akurazɨ Godɨn anɨngagharir kam iraghuzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 106:23">God me gasɨghasɨghizir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 106:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:24-26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Dɨboboniba 14:1-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>God akar dɨkɨrɨzim me ganɨga ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:24">a nguazir aghuim me danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:24">Ezɨ me akar kam nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an itir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:24">nguazir kam gifongezir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:24">an aven mangan aghua.<verse eid="PSA 106:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25"/>Egha me uan purirpenibar aven ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:25">atara mɨgɨrɨgɨar avɨribar God gimoba ghuavɨra ikiava,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:25">egha Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn akamɨn gɨn zuir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 106:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26"/>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, God akar dɨkɨrɨzim me danɨngasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:26">uan ziam dɨbora ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:26">bar guizbangɨra, a me damutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 106:26">me gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ikɨva arɨmɨghiram.<verse eid="PSA 106:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:33">Ofa Gami 26:33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A men gɨn otivamin ovavir boribar amutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:27">me mangɨ gumazamizir igharazibar tongɨn ikiam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:27">egh kantrin me itir kabar ikɨ oveng mangam.<verse eid="PSA 106:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:28-31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 25:1-13">Dɨboboniba 25:1-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Me gɨn aser mam, an ziam Bal,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:28">me Peorɨn nguibamɨn an gɨn ghua a ko poroghav ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:28">egha ofan me aser angamɨra itir puvatɨzir kabagh anɨngiziba ame.<verse eid="PSA 106:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29"/>Ezɨ me amizir arazir kurar kam bangɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:29">Ikiavɨra Itir God atara,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:29">arɨmariar ekiam me bagh anemadazɨma a ize.<verse eid="PSA 106:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30"/>Finias dɨkavigha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:30">gumazamizibar arazir kurar kam ikara,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:30">ezɨ arɨmariar kam me ataki.<verse eid="PSA 106:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31"/>God bizir Finias amizir kam gɨnɨghnɨgha egha a dɨbora ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:31">a nan damazimɨn dera.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:31">A deragh ikɨ mangɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 106:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:32-33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 20:2-13">Dɨboboniba 20:2-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Israelia gɨn Meriban dɨpamɨn ikia amir araziba God gamizɨ an atari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:32">ezɨ Moses me bangɨn osɨmtɨzir ekiam ini.<verse eid="PSA 106:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33"/>Guizbangɨra, men arazir kam Moses gamizɨ an atarava bar osemegha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:33">deragha nɨghnɨzir puvatɨgha paza mɨkeme.<verse eid="PSA 106:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:34-36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:1-3">Gumazir Dapaniba 2:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 3:5-6">3:5-6</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God ghaze, ia Kenanɨn gumazamiziba bar me mɨsueghtɨ me arɨmɨghiregh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:34">Ezɨ me me mɨsoghezɨ me ariaghirezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 106:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35"/>Israelia kantrin igharaziba ko ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:35">men guiviba ko otariba uarir iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:35">Egha me amir arazir kuraba uaghan me ko dagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 106:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36"/>Me men asebar marvir guabar ziaba fe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:36">ezɨ kamaghɨn men arazir kurar kam azuazimɨn mɨn men suiragha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:36">me gasɨghasɨki.<verse eid="PSA 106:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 17:17">2 Atriviba 17:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Me uari uan otariba ko guiviba isa aseba bagha me mɨsozi me ariaghɨrima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:37">me men ofa gami.<verse eid="PSA 106:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 35:33">Dɨboboniba 35:33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Me uari uan otariba ko guivibav sozi me ariaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">Men boriba osɨmtɨzitaba puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:38">ezɨ me me isa pura me mɨsozi me ariaghiri,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 106:38">ezɨ me me isa Kenanian aseba bagha ofa gami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:38">Men arazir kamɨn, men boribar ghuziba ira egha men nguazim gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">a Godɨn damazim mɨze.<verse eid="PSA 106:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39"/>Me arazir kam gamua uari uari gami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:39">me Godɨn damazimɨn mɨze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:39">Arazir kam Godɨn damazimɨn mati, gumazamiziba uari isa uari ko tintinibar akuir arazim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:39">Me arazir kam gamua egh Godɨn akam deragha an gɨn zuir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 106:39"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">106:40-46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 2:14-18">Gumazir Dapaniba 2:14-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God uan gumazamizibar atara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:40">egha ua me gifongezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 106:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41"/>Egha me isa Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar dafaribagh arɨki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:41">ezɨ men apaniba me gativagha men gari.<verse eid="PSA 106:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42"/>Men apanir kaba me gativagha men gara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:42">me dɨkabɨragha paza me gami,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:42">ezɨ me pura uan apanibar gavgavibar apengan iti.<verse eid="PSA 106:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43"/>Dughiar avɨribar God uan gumazamizibar akurvasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">ezɨ me akam batogha uari uan nɨghnɨzibar gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:43">Me kamagh amua arazir kuram bar an aven ghugha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 106:43"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44"/>Me Ikiavɨra Itir God ko mɨgeir dughiabar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:44">a men arareba barasi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:44">egha men osɨmtɨzimɨn gara</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 106:44">men apangkufi.<verse eid="PSA 106:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45"/>A ua uan Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavim ginɨrɨgha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:45">ua bar men apangkufi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:45">Egha ua uan nɨghnɨzim gɨra.<verse eid="PSA 106:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46"/>A ua men apanir men suirazibar nɨghnɨzibagh irazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:46">me Israelian apangkufi.<verse eid="PSA 106:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, en God, nɨ datɨrɨghɨn en akuragh!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">E gumazamizir bar igharazibar torimɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:47">nɨ uam e akuvagh uam e inigh en nguazimɨn izɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:47">Eghtɨ e nɨn ziar ekiam gɨnɨghnɨgh nɨn ziar ekiam mɨnabagham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">E nɨn ziam fɨsɨ bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 106:47"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48"/>E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam feka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">a Israelian God.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:48">E datɨrɨghɨn ko, gɨn izamin dughiabar zurara an ziam feka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">Gumazamiziba bar mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 106:48">“Bar guizbangɨra!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:48"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:48">E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">Aleluia!<verse eid="PSA 106:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106"/>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107"/>
  <para style="ms">Akɨnafarir namba 5</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="PSA 107-150">Onger Akaba 107--150</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Gumazamiziba osɨmtɨzibar aven ikia Godɨn deima, a men apangkuvigha men akura</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">107:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Eghaghaniba 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Eghaghaniba 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Esra 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Onger Akaba 100:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jeremaia 33:11</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God a dughiabar zurara en dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:1">a zurara en apangkuva ikia mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:1">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, e a mɨnamam!<verse eid="PSA 107:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2"/>Ia, Ikiavɨra Itir God ua inizir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:2">ia bar a mɨnabɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:2">Guizbangɨra, a ian akuragha en apanibar dafariba da ia inis.<verse eid="PSA 107:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3"/>An aruem anadi naghɨn ko aruem uaghiri naghɨn ko not ko sautɨn itir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">bar ia akuvagha ia inigha ize.<verse eid="PSA 107:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4"/>Ezɨ ian marazi gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:4">tintinibar arua deragha fozir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:4">me nguibatamɨn boroghɨn iti o puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 107:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5"/>Ezɨ mɨtiriaba ko kuariba men pɨra men azi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:5">ezɨ me ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:5">me gɨvagham.<verse eid="PSA 107:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6"/>Me osɨmtɨzir kamɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:6">egha Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn diava an azangsɨzima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:6">a men osɨmtɨzir kamɨn aven men akura.<verse eid="PSA 107:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7"/>A me inigha biaghatɨgha ghua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:7">nguibar ekiar me an aven dapiamin mamɨn me atɨ.<verse eid="PSA 107:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8"/>Kamaghɨn, Ikiavɨra Itir God zurara men apangkuvigha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:8">arazir aghuimɨn me gamizir bizim bagha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:8">me a mɨnabɨ.<verse eid="PSA 107:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">107:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:10">Onger Akaba 34:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:53">Luk 1:53</ref></char>
    </note>Guizbangɨra, a kuariba pɨrir adarasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:9">dɨpaba me ganɨdima, me apa bar izefi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:9">Ezɨ mɨtiriaba azi darasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:9">a dagheba me ganɨdima, me apa bar izefi.<verse eid="PSA 107:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10-11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">107:10-11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 36:8">Jop 36:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Aisaia 9:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:79">Luk 1:79</ref></char>
    </note>Ezɨ ian marazi Godɨn Bar Pɨn Itimɨn akam batuegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:10-11">egha an akam baraghizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:10-11">Kamaghɨn, me kalabusɨn dɨpenimɨn ikia egha mɨtater kuramɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:10-11">Men apaniba ainɨn senba isa me ikezɨma</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:10-11">me osɨmtɨzir ekiamɨn aven iti.<verse eid="PSA 107:10-11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12"/>Ezɨ God me dɨkabɨrazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:12">me asaghpora ira ingangarir ekiam gamua</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:12">men gavgaviba bar gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 107:12">ezɨ men akurvaghamin gumaziba puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 107:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13"/>Me osɨmtɨzir kamɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:13">egha Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn diava an azangsɨzima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:13">a men osɨmtɨzir kamɨn aven men akura.<verse eid="PSA 107:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">107:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 68:6">Onger Akaba 68:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:7">146:7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:7">Aposel 12:7</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God me inigha men senba fɨrigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:14">danganir mɨtater kurar kamɨn me inigha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:14">azenan ize.<verse eid="PSA 107:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15"/>Kamaghɨn, me Ikiavɨra Itir God zurara men apangkuvigha arazir aghuimɨn me gamizir bizim bagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:15">a mɨnamam.<verse eid="PSA 107:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16"/>Me fo, a gumaziba brasɨn gavgavimɨn ingarizir tiaba abɨagharɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:16">kalabuziar dɨpenimɨn ain baba akaragharɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 107:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17"/>Guizbangɨra, ian marazi bar arazir kurabagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:17">Egha arazir kurar me amir kaba bangɨn</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:17">me arɨmariar kuraba ini.<verse eid="PSA 107:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18"/>Me dagheba inian aghuagha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:18">ovengasava ami.<verse eid="PSA 107:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19"/>Men ikɨrɨmɨrim ikuvizɨ me pazavɨra ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:19">egha Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn dei.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:19">Ezɨ a men akuragha men osɨmtɨzir kam agɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 107:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20"/>A uabɨ mɨgeima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:20">an akar kam men mɨkarzibagh amizɨ da ua dera.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:20">Ezɨ a matmatiamɨn ua me ini.<verse eid="PSA 107:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21"/>Kamaghɨn, me Ikiavɨra Itir God zurara men apangkuvigha arazir aghuimɨn me gamizir bizim bagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:21">a mɨnamam.<verse eid="PSA 107:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22"/>Me a mɨnamamin ofabar amuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:22">an amizir bizir aghuibar gun gumazamizibav kɨmsɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:22">bar akongegh onger akabar amu.<verse eid="PSA 107:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23"/>Ezɨ ian marazi kuribar aven ingara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:23">ongarir ekiaba bar dagh arua</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:23">egha biziba amaga dagh ivesi.<verse eid="PSA 107:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24"/>Kurimɨn ingarir gumazir kaba, me Ikiavɨra Itir God amizir bizir kabar gani.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:24">An ongarir ekiamɨn bizir aghuir kabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 107:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25"/>A mɨkemezɨ, amɨnir ekiam ongarir konimɨn oto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:25">egha ongarim fema, a dɨkafi.<verse eid="PSA 107:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26"/>Ezɨ kuriba a gisɨn bar pɨn uavanaga egha bar vɨn mar uaghiri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:26">Ezɨ kurimɨn ingarir gumaziba bar atiatingi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:26">me fo me bar moghɨra bar ikuvigham.<verse eid="PSA 107:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27"/>Me gumazir dɨpar onganiba amegha onganigha purama aruibar mɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:27">kurim gisɨn arui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:27">egha kurimɨn akurvaghamin nɨghnɨziba bar puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 107:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28"/>Me osɨmtɨzir kamɨn aven ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:28">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn deima</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:28">a men akuragha men osɨmtɨzim agɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 107:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29"/>An amɨnir ekiam gamizɨ an amɨra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:29">ezɨ ongarim amɨragha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:29">uaghirɨgha ua dɨkavir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 107:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30"/>Me ongarimɨn gari an amɨragha irɨghav itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:30">me bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:30">Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God me inigha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:30">nguibar me mangɨ ikiamin ongarir mɨkebamɨn ghu.<verse eid="PSA 107:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31"/>Kamaghɨn, me Ikiavɨra Itir God zurara gumazamizibar apangkuvigha arazir aghuimɨn me gamizir bizim bagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:31">a mɨnamam.<verse eid="PSA 107:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32"/>Me gumaziba uari akuvir danganibar Godɨn gumazamiziba ko uari akuv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:32">egh me an ziar ekiamɨn gun mɨkɨm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:32">Me gumazir aruaba ko dapi bizibav kɨm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:32">dughiar kamɨn me Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 107:32"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God faner ekiaba ko dɨpar atuibagh ami,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:33">da dati.<verse eid="PSA 107:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34"/>Egha nguazir dagheba deragha aghuim gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:34">a ragha otogha amangsɨzir nguazimɨn otozɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:34">bizitam bar an otogha aghuir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:34">Nguazir kamɨn itir gumazamiziba arazir kurabagh ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:34">kamaghɨn, Ikiavɨra Itir God osɨmtɨzir kaba me ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 107:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35"/>Egha gɨn Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganir mɨdiariba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:35">dɨpar akareba dagh arɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:35">Egha nguazir dɨpaba puvatɨzibar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:35">a faneba arɨghizɨma da afora ivemari.<verse eid="PSA 107:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36"/>Me nguazir kabar mɨtiriaba azir gumazamiziba arɨki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:36">ezɨ me nguibar ekiamɨn ingarigha an aven iti.<verse eid="PSA 107:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37"/>Ezɨ me dagheba opara, egha wainɨn beniba opari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:37">egha dagher avɨriba ikia, wainɨn ovɨzir avɨriba iti.<verse eid="PSA 107:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God uan gumazamiziba bar deragha me gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:38">ezɨ me borir avɨriba bate.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:38">Ezɨ a bulmakaun avɨriba me bagha dagh amizɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:38">da otifi.<verse eid="PSA 107:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39"/>Men apaniba me ko mɨsogha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:39">bar me dɨkabɨragha osɨmtɨzir bar ekiam me ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 107:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40"/>Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God men apanibar gumazir dapanibagh amizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:40">me pura bizir kɨnibar mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:40">A me gamizɨ me tintinibar arua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:40">danganir mɨsɨngizir tuaviba puvatɨziba, pura dagh arui.<verse eid="PSA 107:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41"/>Gumazir biziba puvatɨziba, osɨmtɨzir avɨribar aven iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:41">ezɨ a men akurazɨ, me deragha iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:41">A men amizibagh amizɨ, me borir avɨriba bati.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:41">Ezɨ men adarazi avɨrasemegha mati sipsipɨn bɨzibar mɨn bar avɨraseme.<verse eid="PSA 107:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42"/>Ezɨ gumazamizir Godɨn damazimɨn deraziba, bizir kamɨn ganigha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:42">men naviba bar men dera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:42">Ezɨ gumazamizir kuraba mɨkɨman asagha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:42">purama akabar kumigha nɨmɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 107:42"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43"/>Eghtɨ ia gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir aghuiba itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:43">ia deraghvɨra bizir kabagh bar dagh nɨghnɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:43">Egh kamagh akam akarigh suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:43">Ikiavɨra Itir God bar en apangkuvigha ikia</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 107:43">mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 107:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107"/>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim apaniba dɨkabɨnasa Godɨn azangsɨsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 57:7-11">Onger Akaba 57:7-11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 60:5-12">60:5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn ziam fer ighiar kam, Devit an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1"/>O God, kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven nɨghnɨzir gavgavimra nɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:1">egha ua nɨghnɨzir igharaziba nan puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 108:1">Datɨrɨghɨn nan navim dɨkavtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:1">kɨ gitabav sogh</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 108:1">nɨn ziam famin ighiabar amuasa.<verse eid="PSA 108:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2"/>Amɨnim tiraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:2">kɨ daguim ategh dɨkavigh uan gita ko kulele mɨsogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 108:2">Kɨ dagh ikararangtɨ, dar ararer aghuim otivtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:2">aruem bigh anangam.<verse eid="PSA 108:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar tongɨn nɨ mɨnamam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:3">Gumazamiziba bar moghɨra oraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 108:3">kɨ nɨn ziam fɨ ighiam bangam.<verse eid="PSA 108:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4"/>Kɨ fo, nɨ en apangkuvir arazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:4">a bar ekefe, egha overiamɨn ababanimɨn tu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 108:4">Nɨ zurara amir arazir aghuir kaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:4">e da meng mangɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 108:4">da mangɨ overiamɨn ghuariabar suiragham.<verse eid="PSA 108:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5"/>O God, nɨ overiamɨn uan gavgavim akaghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:5">nguazimɨn gumazamiziba ganigh fogh suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 108:5">nɨn gavgavim bar ekevegha</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 108:5">me gafiragha pɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 108:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6"/>Nɨ bar ifongezir darazi bar deravɨra ikiasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:6">nɨ uan agharir guvir gavgavimɨn en suiragh en akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 108:6">Nɨ nan azangsɨzim baragh!<verse eid="PSA 108:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7"/>God uan Dɨpenimra ikia ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 108:7">“Kɨ apaniba ko mɨsogha me abɨragha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn Sekemɨn nguibamɨn nguazim ko Sukotɨn danganir zarim abɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 108:7">egh uan gumazamizibar anɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 108:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8"/>Guizbangɨra, Gileatɨn nguazim ko Manasen nguazim, aning nana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">Ezɨ Efraimɨn nguazim a kon mɨdorozir dapanir asuamɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 108:8">Ezɨ Judan nguazim, mati nan atrivir fidizim.<verse eid="PSA 108:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9"/>Moapɨn kantri, a nan itarir dɨpar kɨ ruemɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">Idomɨn kantri, a nan danganir kɨ uan dagarir asuaba arɨzimɨn mɨn iti, egha nana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 108:9">Ezɨ Filistiaba kɨ mɨdorozimɨn me abɨragha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">bar akuegha pamten dei.”<verse eid="PSA 108:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10"/>O God, tinara na inigh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:10">egh nguibar gavgavim itir kamɨn aven mangam?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 108:10">Tina nan faragh mangɨtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:10">kɨ Idomɨn kantrin ekiamɨn aven mangam?<verse eid="PSA 108:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11"/>O God, nɨ akɨrim ragha e gasaras ti?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:11">Nɨ ti en mɨdorozir gumazibar akurvaghan aghua?<verse eid="PSA 108:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12"/>Gumazibar gavgavibar akurvazim, a pura bizim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:12">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ en akuraghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 108:12">e uan apaniba ko mɨsogham.<verse eid="PSA 108:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13"/>E fo, Godɨn akurvazimra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:13">e uan apanibav sogh me abɨnigham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 108:13">A uabɨ en apanibav sogh</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 108:13">me agɨvagham.<verse eid="PSA 108:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108"/>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir osɨmtɨzim itimɨn dɨmdiam</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn ziam fer onger akar kam, Devit an osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1"/>O God, kɨ nɨn ziam a pɨrafa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:1">Nɨ nɨmɨra ikian markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 109:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2"/>Gumazamizir kuraba ko gumazamizir ifavariba na gasɨghasɨghasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">Me nan gara ifara akar kurabar na mɨgɨa</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 109:2">nan apanim gami.<verse eid="PSA 109:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3"/>Me na ekɨarugha nan aghuazir akabar na mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:3">Guizbangɨra, me mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba, mɨngariba puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 109:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4"/>Kɨ me gifuegha me bagha God ko mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:4">Ezɨ me nan atara akaba na gasi.<verse eid="PSA 109:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5"/>Kɨ arazir aghuibar me gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:5">ezɨ me arazir kuraba nan arazir aghuiba ikarvasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:5">Kɨ bar me gifonge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:5">ezɨ me kɨ me gifongezir arazir kam ikarvagha na gifongezir puvatɨgha bar nan aghua.<verse eid="PSA 109:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6"/>Kɨ ghaze, nɨ jasɨn kuratam a mɨseveghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:6">a nan apanim kotiamɨn a baragh egh a tuisɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 109:6">An apanitamrama,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 109:6">an kotiam baragh.<verse eid="PSA 109:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7"/>Jasɨn kotiam barazir kam oraghtɨ, mɨgɨrɨgɨaba mangɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:7">a mɨkɨm suam, gumazir kam guizbangɨra arazir kuram gami,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 109:7">a isɨ kalabus datɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:7">Nan apanim, God ko mɨkɨmtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:7">jasɨn kurar kam an akar kam gɨfogh egh mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 109:7">a God ko mɨgeir arazir kam, an arazir kuram.<verse eid="PSA 109:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">109:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:20">Aposel 1:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan ifongiam, a bar zuamɨram aremegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:8">eghtɨ gumazir igharazitam an danganim inigh.<verse eid="PSA 109:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9"/>An aremeghtɨ an boriba afeziaba puvatɨghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:9">an amuim uaghan paba puvatɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 109:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10"/>An boriba dɨpeniba puvatɨgh egh onganarazibar amu ikiasa kɨ ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:10">Eghtɨ gumaziba me itir dɨpenir kuramɨn me batuegham.<verse eid="PSA 109:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11"/>Nan apanir kam gumazitabar bizitaba inigh egh da ikaraghan koghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:11">kɨ kamaghsua, me izɨ uan biziba ikarvagh an nguazim inigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:11">Eghtɨ nguibar igharazibar gumaziba izɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:11">bizir a ingangarim gamua ivezeziba bar ada da inigham.<verse eid="PSA 109:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12"/>Kɨ kamaghsua, gumazitam bar an apangkuvan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:12">Gumazitam kamaghɨn an boribagh nɨghnigh suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 109:12">me afeziaba puvatɨ egh men apangkuvan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 109:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13"/>Kɨ kamaghsua, an ovavir boriba uaghan bar arɨmɨghiregham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:13">eghtɨ gɨn otivamin adarazi ua gumazir kamɨn ziam gɨnɨghnɨgh a dɨponan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 109:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14"/>An inazir afeziaba amizir arazir kuraba, Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ adagh nɨghnɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:14">Egh an amebamɨn arazir kuraba gɨn amangan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 109:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God me amizir arazir kurar kam gɨnɨghnɨghvɨra ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:15">eghtɨ gumazamiziba gumazir kamɨn adarazi nɨghnɨzitam ua men ikian bar markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 109:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16"/>Gumazir kam tong apangkuvir nɨghnɨzitam igharaz darazir itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">A gumazir biziba oteveziba ko, biziba puvatɨziba ko, naviba osemegha itiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 109:16">a paza me gamua ghua me mɨsozi me ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 109:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17"/>A faragha gumazamizibagh asɨghasɨghasa ifuegha akar kurabar me mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">egh a datɨrɨghɨn uabɨ bar moghɨra ikufigh!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:17">A God deragh gumazamizir igharazibar amuasa a me bagha Godɨn azangsɨghan aghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">eghtɨ uaghan gumazitam God deragh a damusɨ an a bagh Godɨn azangsɨghan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 109:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18"/>Dughiabar a mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">a gumazir igharazibagh asɨghasɨghasa mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 109:18">ezɨ an mɨgɨrɨgɨar kam mati an adiarir a uan mɨkarzimɨn kurkezim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:18">Kamaghɨn dera, an akar kurar kam dɨpar an apimɨn mɨn an namnamɨn aven ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">Egh boremɨn mɨn an agharibar aven magɨrɨ.<verse eid="PSA 109:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19"/>An akar kurar kam, a korotiam aruzɨ moghɨn anevaragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:19">egh letiamɨn mɨn uan ivariam gighuigh ikɨ kamaghɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 109:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨzazir kamra gumazir na isa kot garɨzibar arɨghasa, kɨ ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">Guizbangɨra, gumazir kaba akar bar kuraba na mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 109:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan Ekiam, nɨ uan ziar ekiam bangɨn, nɨ Akar Gavgavim akɨrizɨ moghɨn nɨ nan akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">Nɨ bar deragha egha zurara nan apangkufi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 109:21">kamaghɨn nɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 109:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22"/>Kɨ biziba bar puvatɨgha purama aperaghav ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:22">uan navir averiamɨn aven mɨzazir kuram barasi.<verse eid="PSA 109:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23"/>Aruem anaga bizibagh isirazɨ dar nedaziba ghua guaratɨghɨn gevi moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:23">kɨ mangɨgh gɨvaghasa ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:23">Amɨnim odezibagh ivai da mɨgha ghua gevi moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:23">kɨ uaghan dar mɨn mɨghegh mangɨgh gɨvagham.<verse eid="PSA 109:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24"/>Kɨ dagheba ategha egha nan tevir akuriba gavgaviba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:24">Kɨ bar agharim gurazɨ, agharir suiaba bar nan amɨra.<verse eid="PSA 109:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">109:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:39">Matyu 27:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">Mak 15:29</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamiziba nan gara egha na dɨpofi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:25">egha me uan dapaniba roa egha nan ingaravati.<verse eid="PSA 109:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:26">nɨ zurara bar nan apangkufi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 109:26">Kamaghɨn, nɨ nan akuragh egh uam na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 109:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27"/>Nɨ nan apaniba kamagh men akaghtɨ, me fogh suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:27">nɨrara nan akuragha egha uam nan ini.<verse eid="PSA 109:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28"/>Me, nɨ na gasɨghasɨghsɨ me nɨ mɨkɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">Eghtɨ puvatɨgham. Nɨ deravɨra na damuvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:28">Gumazir na gasɨghasɨghasava amiba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">nɨ me abɨnasa kɨ ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:28">Eghtɨ, kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">nan navim nan deragham.<verse eid="PSA 109:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29"/>Nan apaniba aghumsɨzir dafam iniasa, kɨ ifonge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:29">eghtɨ gumazamiziba men aghumsɨzir arazir kam bar an ganam.<verse eid="PSA 109:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30"/>Gumazamiziba Godɨn ziam fasa uari akuvir dughiabar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:30">kɨ an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 109:30">Egh akar ekiamɨn Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨnamam.<verse eid="PSA 109:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31"/>Guizbangɨra, apaniba gumazamizir onganaraziba isɨ kot datɨgh kamagh mɨkɨm suam, me arɨmɨghiram.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:31">Ezɨ, God gumazamizir onganarazibar gara men akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 109:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109"/>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110"/>
  <para style="s">Ikiavɨra Itir God gavgavim isa atrivim ganɨdir ighiam</para>
  <para style="d">Kar Godɨn ziam fer onger akam. Devit an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">110:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:44">Matyu 22:44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:36">Mak 12:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:42-43">Luk 20:42-43</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:34-35">Aposel 2:34-35</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:25">1 Korin 15:25</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:20-22">Efesus 1:20-22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:1">Kolosi 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:13">Hibru 1:13</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 8:1">8:1</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:12-13">10:12-13</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan Ekiam mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:1">“Nɨ nan agharir guvimɨn daperagh ikɨ mangɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">kɨ nɨn apaniba dɨkabɨragh me isɨ nɨn dafarim datɨghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 110:1">me nɨn dagarimningɨn apengan ikiam.”<verse eid="PSA 110:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God nɨ damightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">nɨ Saionɨn nguibamɨn ikɨ gavgavir ekiam ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 110:2">nguibar avɨribagh ativagh dar ganam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">God ghaze, nɨ uan apanibagh ativagham.<verse eid="PSA 110:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3"/>Nɨ uan apanibav soghamin dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">nɨn gumazamiziba uaghan nɨ ko mangɨ nɨn akurvagham,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 110:3">egh ia Godɨn mɨghsɨamɨn ghuavanangam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:3">E gari ghuariabar amariba dɨmagaribar ira azenibagh iri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">da aghua dagher avɨriba iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:3">Kamaghɨra, nɨ dughiabar zurara gavgavim ini mamaghɨra ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">egh gumazir igiamɨn mɨn otogham.<verse eid="PSA 110:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">110:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 5:6">Hibru 5:6</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 6:20">6:20</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:17">7:17</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:21">7:21</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God Akar Gavgavim nɨ koma anekɨrigha gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">egh uan nɨghnɨzim giraghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:4">A ghaze, “Nɨ ofa gamir gumazimɨn ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">Nɨ Melkisedeghɨn mɨn ofa gamir gumazimɨn ikiam.”<verse eid="PSA 110:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5"/>Ekiam gavgavim nɨ danɨngasa nɨ ko iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:5">Eghtɨ an anɨngagharir dughiam otoghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 110:5">an atriviba tintinimɨn me mɨsogh me gasɨghasɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 110:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6"/>A nguazimɨn gumazamizibar arazir kuraba ikarvagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:6">egh mɨdorozir danganibar a gumazir avɨribav soghtɨ me arɨmɨghiram.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 110:6">An atrivir avɨriba ko mɨsogh me abɨnam.<verse eid="PSA 110:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7"/>Atrivim tuavir mɨriamɨn ivemarir daghurir dɨpabar amɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:7">egh a gavgavim inigh, uan apaniba dɨkabɨragham.<verse eid="PSA 110:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110"/>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn ziam fer ighiam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">111:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hibrun akamɨn onger akar kam, me uan alpabetɨn letabar vaghvagha dar gɨn ghua ighiar kamɨn vesba osira bar ghuava vezɨn abuananamɨn oto.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1"/>E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 111:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:1">Gumazamizir God baghavɨra itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">me uari akuvamin dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:1">kɨ men tongɨn ikɨva, uan navir averiamɨn aven nɨghnɨzir vamɨra ikɨva</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨnamam.<verse eid="PSA 111:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God amir biziba, da bar bizir bar aghuiba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:2">Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir God, bar a gɨfofoghasa ifongeziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 111:2">me an ingangariba bar deragh dagh fogham.<verse eid="PSA 111:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3"/>Bizir an amiba, e dar gara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:3">an ziar ekiam fa egha fo,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 111:3">an atrivir gavgavir ekiam a bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:3">An arazir aghuir kam zurara ikɨvɨra ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 111:3">mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 111:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God zurara gumazamizibar nɨghnɨzibagh amima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:4">me zuraram an amir dɨgavir kuram gamir arazibagh nɨghnɨghvɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 111:4">Ikiavɨra Itir God en apangkuva en akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 111:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5"/>A gumazamizir an atiatiba, a dagheba me ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:5">Egha a uan Akar Gavgavir a gumazamiziba ko dɨkɨrɨzir kam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 111:5">a zuraram a gɨnɨghnɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 111:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6"/>A uan gavgavim uan gumazamizibar akagha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:6">Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar nguaziba isa</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 111:6">uan gumazamizibagh anɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 111:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7"/>An araziba, da bar guizbangɨra egha bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:7">E an Akar Gavgaviba nɨghnɨzir gavgavim adar ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 111:7">egh dar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 111:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8"/>God Akar Gavgavir kaba e ganɨga ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:8">da gavgavigh ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:8">Guizbangɨra, God guizɨn arazir aghuimɨn gɨn ghua</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 111:8">Akar Gavgavir kaba e ganɨngizɨ da bar dera.<verse eid="PSA 111:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9"/>A ua uan gumazamizibagh ivezegha ua me ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">Egha Akar Gavgavim me koma anekɨra ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 111:9">Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavir kam zurara ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:9">Ikiavɨra Itir God, an arazir aghuibaram amua bar derazir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">ezɨ gumazamiziba an ziar ekiam gɨnɨghnɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 111:9">a bar pɨn kozɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 111:9">me an atiatia an apengan iti.<verse eid="PSA 111:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">111:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 28:28">Jop 28:28</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:7">Aghuzir Akaba 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 9:10">9:10</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazitam nɨghnɨzir aghuim inisɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">a faragh Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiating an apengan ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:10">Gumazamizir an Akar Gavgavibar gɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">me fofozir aghuiba ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 111:10">Eghtɨ e an ziam fɨ ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 111:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111"/>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir aghuiba me bar akongegham<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">112:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hibrun akamɨn onger akar kam, me uan alpabetɨn letabar vaghvagha dar gɨn ghua ighiar kamɨn vesba osira bar ghuava vezɨn abuananamɨn oto.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1"/>E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 112:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 112:1">Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatia an Akar Gavgavimɨn gɨn mangasa bar ifongeziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">me bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 112:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2"/>Gumazir aghuibar boriba, nguazir kamɨn ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:2">ziar ekiaba ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 112:2">Men ovavir boriba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:2">Ikiavɨra Itir God deravɨra me damuam.<verse eid="PSA 112:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3"/>Men adarazi dagɨar avɨriba initɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:3">men biziba bar avɨrasemegham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 112:3">Me deraghvɨra arazir aghuimɨn gɨn mangɨva ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:3">mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 112:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">112:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 11:17">Jop 11:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 97:11">Onger Akaba 97:11</ref></char>
    </note>E fo, mɨtarmem iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:4">ezɨ gumazir aghuim, gumazir aghuir igharazibar akurvaghasa angazangarimɨn mɨn anagava otogha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 112:4">men apangkuvigha, amɨnirbɨrim gisira.<verse eid="PSA 112:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5"/>Gumazir guizbangɨra mɨgɨa pura uan biziba anɨdim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:5">an ingangariba a guizbangɨra dagh amutɨ, an dagɨaba isir tuaviba deravɨra mangɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 112:5">a bar akongegham.<verse eid="PSA 112:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6"/>Gumazir aghuim irɨghan kogh egh tugh gavgavigh mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:6">Eghtɨ gumazamiziba a gɨnɨghnɨghvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 112:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">112:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 57:7">Onger Akaba 57:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 64:10">64:10</ref></char>
    </note>An osɨmtɨzir otivibar mɨgɨrɨgɨaba baragh atiatingan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:7">Puvatɨgham, a tugha gavgavigh nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 112:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8"/>A nɨghnɨzir avɨribagh amua atiatir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:8">A fo, God gɨn an apaniba dɨkabɨragham.<verse eid="PSA 112:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">112:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 9:9">2 Korin 9:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A bizir bar avɨriba gumazir onganarazibagh amibagh anɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">Ezɨ an arazir aghuir kam gɨvaghan kogham, a ikɨvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 112:9">Egh a nguibamɨn aven ziar ekiam ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 112:9">gumazamiziba an ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 112:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10"/>Gumazir kuraba, gumazir aghuimɨn dabirabimɨn ganɨva puvɨram ataram.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">Egh men naviba men ikuvightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 112:10">men gavgavim me ateghtɨ me puram amɨragh magɨrɨ gɨvagham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 112:10">Guizbangɨra, bizir aghuir me iniasa mɨzua itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">me da inighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 112:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112"/>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn Araziba bar dera, kamaghɨn e ziar ekiam a danɨngam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1"/>E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:1">O Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ingangarir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:1">ia Godɨn ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 113:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2"/>E bar moghɨra an ziam datɨrɨghɨn ko, gɨn sara a fɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:2">mangɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 113:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3"/>E Godɨn gumazamizir aruem anadi naghɨn ikegh ghua aruem uaghiri naghɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:3">e bar moghɨra Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 113:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, kantribar gumazamiziba bar me gativagha men garima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:4">me an ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:4">An gavgavim ko ziar ekiam bar ekevegha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:4">overiam gafiragha bar pɨn mar iti.<verse eid="PSA 113:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5-6"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a en God, gumazitam an mɨraram amir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:5-6">An atrivir bar ekiamɨn ikia bar pɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 113:5-6">Egha bar pɨn ikia overiam ko nguazim vɨrara vɨn beragha aningɨn gari.<verse eid="PSA 113:5-6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7"/>A gumazamizir onganarazir nguazir mɨnemniabar tongɨn itiba, men akura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:7">A gumazamizir biziba puvatɨgha averenimɨn tongɨn itir kaba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 113:7">a iza me fe.<verse eid="PSA 113:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8"/>A gumazamizir kaba isa uan gumazamizibar gumazir dapaniba ko me atɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:8">me me ko apiaghav iti.<verse eid="PSA 113:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9"/>An amizir boriba batir puvatɨziba deragha me akɨrizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:9">me borir avɨriba bata bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:9">E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 113:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113"/>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn gumazamiziba Isipɨn kantrin azenan izezir ighiam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">114:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Ua Me Ini 12:51</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Israelia me Jekopɨn ovavir boriba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:1">me Isipɨn kantri ategha azenan ize.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 114:1">Kar akar igharazibav geir gumazamiziba, men kantri.<verse eid="PSA 114:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2"/>Dughiar kam, Judaba, Ikiavɨra Itir God baghavɨra itir gumazamizibar mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:2">Guizbangɨra, Israelia God me gativagha men gari, ezɨ me an gumazamizibar mɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 114:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">114:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21">Ua Me Ini 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 3:16">Josua 3:16</ref></char>
    </note>Dughiar kam, Ongarir Aghevim Godɨn gavgavimɨn garava egha arav ghu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:3">Ezɨ Jordanɨn Fanem pura mɨtɨghav ikia ua ivemarir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 114:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4"/>Ezɨ mɨghsɨar ekiaba memebar mɨn uari akuri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:4">Ezɨ mɨghsɨar muziariba sipsipɨn nguzibar mɨn uari akuri.<verse eid="PSA 114:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5"/>O Ongarim, nɨ manmaghsuava arav ghu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:5">O Jordanɨn Fanem, nɨ manmaghsua ua ivemari puvatɨ?<verse eid="PSA 114:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6"/>O mɨghsɨar ekiaba, ia manmaghsua memebar mɨn uari akuri?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:6">O mɨghsɨar doziba ia manmaghsua sipsipɨn nguzibar mɨn uari akuri?<verse eid="PSA 114:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7"/>O nguazim, datɨrɨghɨn Ekiam a izɨ, nɨ nɨghɨva akong.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:7">A Jekopɨn God a izegha gɨfa,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 114:7">ezɨ nɨ an damazimɨn nɨghɨva akong.<verse eid="PSA 114:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">114:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Ua Me Ini 17:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:2-13">Dɨboboniba 20:2-13</ref></char>
    </note>Godɨn kam, a dagɨam gamizɨ, a mozir dɨpamɨn mɨn oto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:8">Guizbangɨra, a mɨghsɨar gavgavim gamizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 114:8">a dɨpar nguazimɨn aven afora azenan izimɨn mɨn oto.<verse eid="PSA 114:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114"/>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115"/>
  <para style="s">God uabɨra a guizbangɨra God</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ zurara bar en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">egha e ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 115:1">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, e zurara nɨn ziamra fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">E uari uan ziaba fan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 115:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2"/>Manmaghɨrama amizɨ, Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba kamaghɨn en azangsɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:2">“Ian God managh iti?”<verse eid="PSA 115:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3"/>Me kamagh fozir puvatɨ, en God uan Nguibamɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:3">egha a bizir tizim uan ifongiamɨn a damusɨ ifuegh, ana damuam.<verse eid="PSA 115:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">115:4-8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 135:15-18">Onger Akaba 135:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:4-5">Jeremaia 10:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:20">Akar Mogomem 9:20</ref></char>
    </note>Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba, silva ko gol isa uan marvir guabar ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:4">Me uari uan dafaribar dar ingari.<verse eid="PSA 115:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5"/>Ezɨ marvir guar kaba, da akatoriba ikia egha mɨgeir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:5">Da damaziba ikia bizibar garir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 115:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6"/>Da kuariba ikia, egha orazir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:6">egha atiniba ikia bizibav ghuriabagh amir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 115:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7"/>Da dafariba ikia, bizibar suizir pu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">Da sueba ikia, egha aruir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 115:7">Da akaba akartɨ tiariba puvatɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 115:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8"/>Guizbangɨra, gumazir marvir guar kabar ingariba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:8">me uari marvir guar me ingarir kabar mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 115:8">Gumazir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim marvir guabar itiba, me uaghan dar mɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 115:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9"/>O ia Israelian gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:9">ia nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 115:9">A deragha ia gamua egha ian akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 115:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10"/>O ia Aronɨn adarasi, ia ofa gamir gumaziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:10">ia Ikiavɨra Itir God nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:10">A deragha ia gamua ian akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 115:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11"/>O ia gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:11">ia nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 115:11">A uabɨra deragha ia gamua ian akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 115:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God zurara e gɨnɨghnɨgha mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">Egh a deravɨra e damuam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 115:12">A, e Israelia deravɨra e damuam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">Egh uaghan Aronɨn adarasi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 115:12">me ofa gamir gumaziba, a deravɨra me damuam.<verse eid="PSA 115:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">115:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 11:18">Akar Mogomem 11:18</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:5">19:5</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:13">a deragh me damuam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 115:13">gumazamizir ziaba itiba ko ziaba puvatɨziba uaghara,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 115:13">a deragh me damuam.<verse eid="PSA 115:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14"/>Kɨ ghaze, Ikiavɨra Itir God borir bar avɨriba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:14">ia ko ian gɨn otivamin ovavir boribar anɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 115:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15"/>Guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn overiam ko nguazimɨn ingarizim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:15">a bar deravɨra ia damu.<verse eid="PSA 115:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16"/>Nguibar bar pɨn itim, kar Ikiavɨra Godɨn bizimra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:16">A nguazir kam isa gumazamizibagh anɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 115:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17"/>E fo, gumazamizir ariaghɨriba me uan nguibamɨn iraghue.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:17">Egha Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fer puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 115:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18"/>Ezɨ e datɨrɨghɨn angamɨra itir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:18">e Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam mɨnabɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 115:18">mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 115:18"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 115:18">Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:18">E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 115:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115"/>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116"/>
  <para style="s">God gumazir mamɨn akurazɨ, an a mɨnabi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God nan dɨmdiaba ko azangsɨziba barasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:1">Kamaghɨn kɨ bar a gifonge.<verse eid="PSA 116:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">116:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:6">Onger Akaba 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:1">40:1</ref></char>
    </note>Dughiaba bar a nan azangsɨziba baraghavɨra iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:2">kamaghɨn dughiar kɨ angamɨra itir kam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 116:2">kɨ a ko mɨkɨmvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 116:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">116:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:4-6">Onger Akaba 18:4-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ faragha aremeghasava amima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">ovevem benimɨn mɨn na ikezɨ kɨ iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:3">Kɨ Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibam gɨnɨghnɨgha atiatia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">egha navim bar osemeghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 116:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4"/>Kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam dɨbora a mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:4">“O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨ gaghori,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:4">nɨ nan akuragh ua na inigh, puvatɨghtɨ kɨ ovegham!”<verse eid="PSA 116:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5"/>Guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God zuraram en kuarkuva en akurvasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:5">egha a bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 116:5">En God, an apangkuvim itir God.<verse eid="PSA 116:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6"/>Gumazamizir uarira uarir akurvaghamin gavgaviba puvatɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:6">Ikiavɨra Itir God men akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:6">Kamaghɨra kɨ faragha gavgaviba bar puvatɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:6">osɨmtɨziba na gasɨghasɨghasava amima, a nan akura.<verse eid="PSA 116:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7"/>Kɨ fo, Ikiavɨra Itir God bar deragha na gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:7">Kamaghɨn, kɨ datɨrɨghɨn navir amɨrizimɨn ikɨva avughsɨ ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 116:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan akurazɨ, kɨ aremezir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">Nɨ nan temeriba adɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 116:8">Egha na geghuvima kɨ irɨzir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 116:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9"/>Kɨ angamɨra itir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:9">kɨ zurara Ikiavɨra Itir God ko daruam.<verse eid="PSA 116:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">116:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 4:13">2 Korin 4:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ faragha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:10">“Osɨmtɨzir ekiam na avaragha na dɨkabɨraghasava ami.”</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 116:10">Ezɨ dughiar kamɨn kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ikiavɨra ikia kamaghɨn mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 116:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11"/>Kɨ dughiar kamɨn puv atiatia bar osemegha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:11">“Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim gumazitamɨn ikian kogham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 116:11">Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godra ikiam.”<verse eid="PSA 116:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God bar deravɨra na gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:12">Eghtɨ kɨ ua bizir tizimrama a danɨngam?<verse eid="PSA 116:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13"/>Kɨ ti wainɨn kavɨn tam a danigham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:13">eghtɨ ofan kam kamaghɨn akagh suam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 116:13">Ikiavɨra Itir God ua na ini.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:13">A ua na inizir bizir kam bagh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:13">kɨ an ziamɨn dɨmɨva a mɨnamam.<verse eid="PSA 116:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14"/>An gumazamiziba izɨ uari akuvamin dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:14">kɨ a koma amizir Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavir kam, kɨ a damuam.<verse eid="PSA 116:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">116:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:14">Onger Akaba 72:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God ua bagha inabagha bar ifongezir gumazitam aremegham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:15">eghtɨ an damazimɨn gumazir kamɨn ovevem, bar bizir ekiamɨn mɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 116:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">Nan amebam faragha nɨn ingangarir amizimɨn ike,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 116:16">ezɨ datɨrɨghɨn kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazimɨn ikia</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 116:16">egha nɨn ingangarim gami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:16">Ezɨ nɨ benir na ikeziba fɨrizɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">kɨ datɨrɨghɨn fɨriaghɨrɨ.<verse eid="PSA 116:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17"/>Kɨ nɨ mɨnabɨsɨ nɨ bagh ofa damuam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:17">egh nɨn ziamɨn dɨmɨva a fam.<verse eid="PSA 116:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18"/>Kɨ faragha nɨ koma akar dɨkɨrɨzim gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:18">Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 116:18">nɨn gumazamizibar damazibar anekagham.<verse eid="PSA 116:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ Jerusalemɨn nguibamɨn mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:19">nɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven ofa damuam.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:19">Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:19">E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 116:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116"/>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117"/>
  <para style="s">E bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">117:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:11">Rom 15:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ia Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:1">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 117:1">Ia ikɨziba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:1">an ziamɨn onger akabar amu.<verse eid="PSA 117:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2"/>Guizbangɨra, an apangkuvim e bagha zurara ekeveghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:2">Egha a zurara uan akamɨn gɨn ghua</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 117:2">e ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 117:2"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 117:2">Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 117:2">E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 117:2"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117"/>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118"/>
  <para style="s">Me God men akuragha apaniba abɨrazir bizim bagha a mɨnabi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">118:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Eghaghaniba 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Eghaghaniba 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Esra 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Onger Akaba 100:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jeremaia 33:11</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God a dughiabar zurara en dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:1">egha a zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:1">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, e a mɨnamam!<verse eid="PSA 118:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2"/>E Israelian gumazamiziba, e kamaghɨn mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:2">“A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.”<verse eid="PSA 118:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3"/>Aronɨn adarazi uaghan kamaghɨn mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:3">“A zurara en apangkuvigha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:3">mamaghɨra iti.”<verse eid="PSA 118:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4"/>Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatiba e bar moghɨra uaghan kamaghɨn mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:4">“A zurara en apangkuvigha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:4">mamaghɨra iti.”<verse eid="PSA 118:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">118:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:19">Onger Akaba 18:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 120:1">120:1</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ faragha bar osɨmtɨzir ekiam ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:5">Ikiavɨra Itir God ko mɨgɨa an deima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:5">a na baregha</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 118:5">nan osɨmtɨzir kam agɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 118:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">118:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 56:4">Onger Akaba 56:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 56:11">56:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:12">Aisaia 51:12</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:6">Hibru 13:6</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God na ko itima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:6">kɨ atiatir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:6">Kɨ fo, gumazamiziba arazitamɨn na damighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 118:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ nan akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:7">Kɨ Ekiamra gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:7">a nan apaniba abɨnigh me gasɨghasigham.<verse eid="PSA 118:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8"/>Kamaghɨn deragham, e Ikiavɨra Itir Godra nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:8">an e geghuv e avaragh en gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:8">gumazamizir kuraba e gasɨghasighan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:8">Eghtɨ e nɨghnɨzir gavgavim gumazamizibar ikian kogham.<verse eid="PSA 118:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9"/>Kamaghɨn deragham, e Ikiavɨra Itir Godra nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:9">an e geghuv e avaragh en gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:9">gumazamizir kuraba e gasɨghasighan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:9">Eghtɨ e nɨghnɨzir gavgavim gumazir dapaniba ko atrivibar ikian kogham.<verse eid="PSA 118:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10"/>Apanir avɨriba faragha na ekɨaru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:10">ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziamɨn gavgavimra, kɨ me dɨkabɨra.<verse eid="PSA 118:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11"/>Guizbangɨra, me danganiba bar na ekɨaruzɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:11">kɨ tongɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:11">Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziamɨn gavgavimra, kɨ bar me agɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 118:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12"/>Me aparibar mɨn bar na ekɨaru.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">Egha me dadabar avimɨn mɨn zuamɨra isigha munge.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:12">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziamɨn gavgavimra, kɨ me gasɨghasɨki!<verse eid="PSA 118:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13"/>Nan apaniba faragha na ko mɨdorozim pamten a gamua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:13">na abɨnasava ami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:13">Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God nan akura.<verse eid="PSA 118:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">118:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 15:2">Ua Me Ini 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 12:2">Aisaia 12:2</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ na gamizɨma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:14">kɨ gavgavigha onger akam bangava an ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:14">A zurara ua na ini,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 118:14">ezɨ kɨ an ziam fasa.<verse eid="PSA 118:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15"/>Ia oragh! Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn gumazamiziba uan purirpenibar aven ikia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:15">bar akongegha dɨa kamaghɨn mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:15">“Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn gavgavimra,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 118:15">e uan apaniba dɨkabɨra.<verse eid="PSA 118:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16"/>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn gavgavimra en akura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:16">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn gavgavimra,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:16">e uan apaniba dɨkabɨra.”<verse eid="PSA 118:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17"/>Kɨ fo, kɨ aremeghan kogham. Puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:17">Kɨ angamɨra ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:17">egh bizir Ikiavɨra Itir God amizibagh eghanam.<verse eid="PSA 118:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18"/>Kɨ fo, Ikiavɨra Itir God nan arazir kuraba akɨrasa mɨzazir ekiam na gase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:18">egha na ataghizɨ kɨ aremezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 118:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19"/>Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn na bagh tiar akaba kuightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:19">kɨ aven mangɨ egh a mɨnamam.<verse eid="PSA 118:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20"/>Kar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn tiar akam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:20">eghtɨ gumazamizir an damazimɨn derazibara an aven mangam.<verse eid="PSA 118:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ kɨ nɨ ko mɨkemezir mɨgɨrɨgɨam baraki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:21">egha nan akurazɨ, kɨ deragha iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:21">Kamaghɨn kɨ nɨ mɨnabi.<verse eid="PSA 118:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">118:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 20:17">Luk 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:11">Aposel 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:7">1 Pita 2:7</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">118:22-23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:42">Matyu 21:42</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:10-11">Mak 12:10-11</ref></char>
    </note>Kar dɨpenir akɨnir ingangarir gumaziba aghuazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:22">a datɨrɨghɨn dɨpenim aterir guarim gava.<verse eid="PSA 118:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ bizir kam gamizɨma an oto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:23">Ezɨ e an garima, a bar dera.<verse eid="PSA 118:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ, dughiar aghuir kam e ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:24">Kamaghɨn en naviba deraghtɨ, e bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 118:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">118:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:9">Matyu 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:9">Mak 11:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:13">Jon 12:13</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ en akurvaghasa e nɨn azangsɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:25">Nɨ en akuraghtɨ, bizir e amiba, da bar deragham.<verse eid="PSA 118:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">118:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:9">Matyu 21:9</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:39">23:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:9">Mak 11:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:35">Luk 13:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:38">19:38</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:13">Jon 12:13</ref></char>
    </note>E ghaze, gumazir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam ko gavgavimɨn izim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:26">God deragh a damu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:26">E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:26">gumazir kamɨn ziam fe.<verse eid="PSA 118:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a uabɨra guizbangɨra God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">A bar deravɨram e gamua an angazangarim e gisira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:27">Kamaghɨn, e bar akongegh temer aguabar suigh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">ofa gamir dakozimɨn mɨkebabar itir bulmakaun kombar mɨn garir bizibagh ighuraruam.<verse eid="PSA 118:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28"/>O God, nɨ nan God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:28">ezɨ kɨ nɨ mɨnabaghasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:28">Nɨ nan God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:28">kɨ ziar ekiam nɨ danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 118:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God a dughiabar zurara en dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:29">egha a zurara en apangkuvigha ikia mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 118:29">Kamaghɨn amizɨ e a mɨnamam!<verse eid="PSA 118:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118"/>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn Akamɨn Osiziriba, da bar dera</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 128:1">Onger Akaba 128:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazamizir, men daroriba Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn damazimɨn osɨmtɨziba puvatɨziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:1">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Arazibar gɨn zui, me bar akongegham!<verse eid="PSA 119:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2"/>Gumazamizir kaba uan navir averiabar aven nɨghnɨzir vamɨran ikiava,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:2">an akabar gɨn ghua bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3"/>Bar guizbangɨra, gumazir kaba arazir kurabar gɨn zuir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:3">Me Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Arazibara gɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 119:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4"/>Nɨ uan akaba e ganigha gɨvagha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:4">e deraghvɨra dar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 119:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5"/>Kɨ kamaghsua ifonge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:5">kɨ nɨn arazir nɨ ifongezibar gɨn mangɨsɨ bar gavgavigham.<verse eid="PSA 119:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6"/>Kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgavibagh nɨghnɨghvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:6">Kamaghɨn kɨ aghumsɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7"/>Kɨ deragh bizir nɨ damuasa e mɨkemeziba bagh nɨghnɨghɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:7">bar uan navim sara nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 119:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8"/>Arazir nɨ ifongeziba, kɨ dar gɨn mangasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:8">Nɨ na ataghɨraghan markɨ!<verse eid="PSA 119:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn Akar Gavgavimɨn gɨn zui</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9"/>Gumazir igiam, a tuavir manamɨn Godɨn damazimɨn zuegham?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:9">A nɨn akamɨn suiragh gavgavigh an gɨn mangɨ, egh zuegham.<verse eid="PSA 119:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:2">Onger Akaba 119:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:21">119:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:118">119:118</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:145">119:145</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven nɨghnɨzir vamɨran ikɨva, nɨn ingangarim damuasa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:10">Nɨ nan akuraghtɨ kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgaviba ataghɨraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11"/>Kɨ nɨn akam uan navim ko nɨghnɨzimɨn aning gatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:11">Kamaghɨn, kɨ arazir kuratam nɨn damazimɨn a damighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God kɨ nɨn ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:12">Nɨ uan arazir ifongezibar nan sure damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13"/>Bizir nɨ damuasa e mɨkemeziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:13">kɨ dar gun gumazamizibav gei.<verse eid="PSA 119:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14"/>Dagɨar avɨriba ko bizir avɨriba, kɨ dagh ifonge, ezɨ God gifongezir arazim, bar bizir kabagh afira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:14">Ezɨ kɨ nɨn akaba bagha bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15"/>Nɨn akaba, kɨ deravɨra dagh nɨghnɨgha dagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:15">Egha deragha dar gara da tuisɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 119:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:35">Onger Akaba 119:35</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:70">119:70</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:92-93">119:92-93</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:174">119:174</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ ifongezir araziba, kɨ dar gɨn mangasa bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:16">Egh da gɨn amangan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn Akar Gavgaviba uan navir averiamɨn dar gɨn zui</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17"/>Nan ifongiamra kara, kɨ angamɨra ikɨ, egh nɨn akamɨn gɨn mangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:17">Kamaghɨn kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, nɨ bar deraghvɨra na damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18"/>Nɨ nan damaziba kuightɨ kɨ bizir bar aghuiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:18">nɨn Arazibar aven dar ganam.<verse eid="PSA 119:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19"/>Kɨ dughiar ruarimɨn nguazir kamɨn ikeghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:19">Nɨ uan Akar Gavgaviba nan mongan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20"/>Nan navir averiam bizir God damuasa mɨkemezibar gɨn mangasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:20">dughiabar zurara na dɨkafi.<verse eid="PSA 119:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21"/>Gumazamizir nɨn Akar Gavgaviba batogha akɨrim ragha nɨn akabagh asiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:21">nɨ men atarɨva me gasɨghasigham.<verse eid="PSA 119:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22"/>Ezɨ kɨrara, kɨ nɨn akabar gɨn zui, ezɨ gumazamizir kaba akar kurabar na mɨgɨa na dɨpofi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:22">Me uam akar kabar na mɨkɨman kɨ aghua. Nɨ men anogorokegh.<verse eid="PSA 119:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23"/>Gumazir dapaniba uari akuvagha, na mɨsoghasa akam mɨsosi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">Ezɨ kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, kɨ zurara nɨn akabar suiragh dagh nɨghnɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 119:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24"/>Nɨn akaba bar deravɨra nan sure gamizɨma, kɨ da bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:24">Da deravɨra nan akurvazi, kɨ deravɨram arui.<verse eid="PSA 119:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn Akar Gavgavimɨn gɨn mangasa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25"/>Kɨ aremeghasava amua nguazir mɨnemeniabagh iraghu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:25">Eghtɨ nɨn akam mɨkemezɨ moghɨn, nɨ na fegh gavgavim ua na danɨngigh.<verse eid="PSA 119:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26"/>Kɨ uan araziba bar dar gun nɨ mɨkemezɨ, nɨ nan akam ikara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:26">Nɨ uan arazir nɨ ifongezibar nan sure damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27"/>Nɨ nan akuraghtɨ kɨ nɨn akabar aven itir akar mɨngaribagh fogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:27">Kɨ nɨn akar aghuiba zurara dar gan dagh nɨghnɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 119:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28"/>Nan navim bar na basemezɨ nan temeriba iri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:28">Nɨn akam mɨkemezɨ moghɨn, nɨ gavgavim nan navim danɨngigh.<verse eid="PSA 119:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29"/>Nɨ nan akuraghtɨ kɨ ifavarir tuavim ategham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:29">Nɨ ifongezir arazir aghuimɨn na damu, egh uan Arazibar nan sure damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30"/>Kɨ nɨn gɨn mangasa akam akɨrigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:30">egha bizir nɨ damuasa na mɨkemezibagh nɨghnɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 119:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">kɨ akar nɨ na ganɨngizimɨn suiragha an gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">Nɨ na ateghtɨ aghumsɨzir arazitam na bativan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 6:11-13">2 Korin 6:11-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ fofozir arazir aghuir avɨriba na danɨngtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:32">kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgaviba atamra dar gɨn mangɨsɨ nɨghnɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 119:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim fofozim uabɨ danɨngasa Godɨn azangsɨsi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:33-34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:73">Onger Akaba 119:73</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 2:6">Aghuzir Akaba 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:5">Jems 1:5</ref></char>
    </note>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ uan arazir ifongeziba zurara nan sure damu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:33">eghtɨ kɨ dughiaba bar adar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 119:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34"/>Nɨ uan Arazibar mɨngaribar amightɨ da azenara ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:34">kɨ bar moghɨra uan navimɨn dar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 119:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35"/>Kɨ nɨn akar kam bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:35">Tuavir kɨ mangamim nɨ nan akaghtɨ, kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgavibar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 119:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 7:21-22">Mak 7:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:10-11">1 Timoti 6:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:5">Hibru 13:5</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nan navim damightɨ a nɨn akabar gɨn mangɨsɨvɨra dɨkav.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:36">Nan navim bizir igharaziba bagh dɨkavan kɨ aghua.<verse eid="PSA 119:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37"/>Nan akuraghtɨ kɨ mɨngariba puvatɨzir arazir kuraba akɨrim ragh dagh asaragham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:37">Nɨn akam mɨkemezɨ moghɨn nɨ deraghvɨra na damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38"/>Gumazir nɨn atiatiava nɨn apengan itiba, nɨ gavgavim me ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:38">Kamaghɨra, kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, nɨ uan akar dɨkɨrɨzir kamɨn gɨn mangɨ deragh na damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39"/>Kɨ aghumsɨzir akaba baraghan aghua, nɨ nan akuraghtɨ akar kaba na abɨnan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:39">Guizbangɨra, bizir nɨ damuasa mɨkemeziba da bar dera.<verse eid="PSA 119:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40"/>Kɨ nɨn akabar gɨn mangasa bar ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:40">Nɨn Araziba da bar dera, kamaghɨn nɨ ikiavɨra itir ikɨrɨmɨrim na danɨng.<verse eid="PSA 119:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn Akar Gavgavim, nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an iti</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ faragha akar dɨkɨrɨzim gamizɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">nɨ uan apangkuvim, azenara nan akagh egh ua na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 119:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:8">Onger Akaba 102:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:39">119:39</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 27:11">Aghuzir Akaba 27:11</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨn akam nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:42">Kamaghɨn, nɨ nan akuraghtɨ akar kurar gumazamiziba na mɨgeiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:42">kɨ da ikarvagham.<verse eid="PSA 119:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43"/>Bizir nɨ damuasa na mɨkemeziba, kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim dar iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:43">Kamaghɨn, nɨ gavgavim na danightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:43">kɨ nɨn guizɨn akam dughiabar anekunvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44"/>Kɨ nɨn Arazibar suiragh dar gɨn mangɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45"/>Kɨ nɨn akabar gɨn mangasa ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:45">Kamaghɨn, arazir kuratam nan mɨkarzimɨn itir puvatɨzɨ kɨ fɨriaghɨrɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46"/>Kɨ aghumsɨghan kogh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:46">nɨn akabar gun atrivibav kɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 119:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:47 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:16">Onger Akaba 119:16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:97">119:97</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:127">119:127</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:159">119:159</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgavir kaba guizbangɨra bar dagh ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:47">Kamaghɨn kɨ da bagha bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48"/>Kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgavibagh nɨghnɨzi da derazɨ, kɨ bar dagh ifuegha nɨ mɨnabi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:48">Kɨ zurara nɨn arazir nɨ ifongezir kabagh nɨghnɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 119:48"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim ghaze, Godɨn akam a guizɨn bizim</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49"/>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, nɨ faragha na koma akam akɨrizir bizim gɨnɨghnɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:49">Nɨn akar kam na gamizɨ kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50"/>Nɨn akar dɨkɨrɨzim ikɨrɨmɨrir aghuim na ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:50">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, osɨmtɨziba na bativir dughiamɨn, kɨ navir amɨrizimɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51"/>Gumazir akaba batoziba dɨbovir akabar na mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:51">ezɨ kɨ nɨn Araziba ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, bizir nɨ damuasa e mɨkemeziba, nɨ fomɨra e ganɨngizɨ kɨ dagh nɨghnɨsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:52">ezɨ da gavgavim na ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 119:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53"/>Gumazir kuraba nɨn Araziba abɨgha arazir kurabagh ami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:53">ezɨ nan navim bar men ikuvigha men atari.<verse eid="PSA 119:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54"/>Kɨ uan nguibam ategha saghon itir danganibar ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:54">nɨn arazir nɨ ifongezibar ighiabagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 119:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ dɨmagaribar nɨn ziam gɨnɨghnɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:55">egha nɨn Arazibar gɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 119:55"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56"/>Nan arazir ekiamra kara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:56">kɨ dughiabar zurara nɨn akabar gɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 119:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn Akar Gavgavibar gɨn mangasa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:57 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:5">Onger Akaba 16:5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨ koma akar dɨkɨrɨzim gamigha ghaze, kɨ nɨn akamra gɨn mangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:57">Nan nɨghnɨzim ua bizitamɨn itir puvatɨ. Nɨ bar uabɨra kɨ nɨn ganam.<verse eid="PSA 119:57"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58"/>Nɨ faragha na ko akam akɨrizɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:58">kɨ datɨrɨghɨn uan navir averiamɨn pamten nɨn azangsɨgha ghaze, nɨ nan apangkufigh.<verse eid="PSA 119:58"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59"/>Kɨ uan daroribagh nɨghnigha gɨvagha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:59">nɨn akabar gɨn mangasa nɨ koma akam akɨri.<verse eid="PSA 119:59"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60"/>Nɨn Akar Gavgavir kaba kɨ zuamɨra dar gɨn mangasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:60">kɨ suighsuighan aghua.<verse eid="PSA 119:60"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61"/>Gumazir kuraba na gekuigh na inigh uan arazir kuraba bagh mangasava ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:61">Ezɨ puvatɨ, kɨ nɨn Arazibagh nɨghnɨghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:61"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62"/>Kɨ dɨmagarir arɨzibar dɨkava apiav ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:62">bizir nɨ damuasa e mɨkemeziba bagha nɨn ziam fe.<verse eid="PSA 119:62"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63"/>Gumazamizir nɨn akabar gɨn ghua nɨn atiatia nɨn apengan ikia ingangarim gamiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:63">kɨ men namakam.<verse eid="PSA 119:63"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn apangkuvim nguazir kamɨn gumazamiziba bar me gizɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:64">Nɨ uan arazir ifongezibar nan sure damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:64"/></para>
  <para style="s">Godɨn Akar Gavgaviba deragha en akurvasi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:65">nɨ uan akamɨn mɨkemezɨ moghɨn arazir aghuimɨn na gami.<verse eid="PSA 119:65"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66"/>Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn Akar Gavgavibar iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:66">Kamaghɨn, nɨ nɨghnɨzir aghuiba ko fofozir aghuiba na danɨng.<verse eid="PSA 119:66"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:67 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:71">Onger Akaba 119:71</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:18">Jeremaia 31:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:10-11">Hibru 12:10-11</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ fomɨra tɨghar mɨzaziba iniamin dughiam, kɨ nɨn gɨn zuir tuavim ataki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:67">Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn nɨn akaba baragha dar gɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 119:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68"/>Nɨ bar deragha nɨn apangkuvim bar ekefe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:68">Kamaghɨn, nɨ uan arazir ifongezibar nan sure damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69"/>Gumazir uari feba ifavarir akar avɨribar na mɨkeme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:69">Ezɨ kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven nɨghnɨzir vamɨra ikia, nɨn akabar gɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 119:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70"/>Gumazir kaba uan navibar kumigha nɨghnɨzir aghuiba men puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:70">Ezɨ kɨ nɨn Araziba bar dagh ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71"/>Nɨ bar deragha mɨzazim na gase.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:71">Nɨ mɨzazim na gasezir bizir kamɨn, nɨ arazir nɨ ifongeziba nan aka.<verse eid="PSA 119:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72"/>Kɨ dagɨar avɨriba ikɨva bar akueghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:72">Nɨn Arazimra kɨ bar a gifonge. A dagɨaba bar dagh afira.<verse eid="PSA 119:72"/></para>
  <para style="s">Godɨn Akar Gavgavim a bar dera</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73"/>Nɨ uabɨ nan ingarigha deragha nan gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn nɨghnɨzir aghuiba na danɨng, uan Akar Gavgavibar nan sure damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74"/>Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn akamɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:74">Kamaghɨn, gumazamizir nɨn atiatiba me nan gan egh bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 119:74"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ fo bizir nɨ damuasa mɨkemeziba da bar guizbangɨra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:75">Nɨ bar na gifuegha, nan araziba akɨrmɨghasa osɨmtɨzim na ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 119:75"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76"/>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, nɨ faragha akar dɨkɨrɨzimɨn gɨn mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:76">nan apangkuvigh gavgavim nan navim danɨng.<verse eid="PSA 119:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77"/>Kɨ nɨn Araziba bar a dagh ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:77">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ nan apangkuvightɨ, kɨ ikɨrɨmɨrir aghuim iniam.<verse eid="PSA 119:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78"/>Gumazir uari feba akar ifavaribar na mɨgɨa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">pura na isɨ kotiam darɨghasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:78">Kɨ ghaze, gumazir kamagh amiba nɨ aghumsɨzim me danɨngigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">Eghtɨ ko, kɨ nɨn akaba zurara dagh nɨghnɨghvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79"/>Nɨn atiatia, egha nɨn akabar gɨn zuir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:79">me na bagh izɨ na ko ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:79"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80"/>Nan akuraghtɨ kɨ bar uan navir averiamɨn arazir nɨ ifongezibar gɨn mangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:80">Egh arazir kamɨn kɨ aghumsɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:80"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81"/>Kɨ fomɨra uabɨn akurvaghasa, nɨ mɨzua ghuava amɨra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:81">Ezɨ nan gavgavim bar gɨfa. Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn akamɨn ikiavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:81"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82"/>Nɨ faragha akam akɨrizɨ moghɨn kɨ nɨn ganasa, ikia ghua nan gavgaviba bar gɨvazɨ, kɨ amɨra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:82">Kɨ kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze, “Nɨ manadɨzoghɨn nan akuragham?”<verse eid="PSA 119:82"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83"/>Kɨ memen nir me dɨpaba tuasa isamizir ghurimɨn mɨn ikuvizɨ, me a makuni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:83">Ezɨ arazir nɨ ifongeziba, kɨ dar suiraghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:83"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84"/>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, manmaghɨn dughiabar kɨ zurara nɨ mɨzuam ikiam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:84">Nɨ man dughiamɨn nan apaniba mɨzazim me gasam?<verse eid="PSA 119:84"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85"/>Gumazir uari feba nɨn Arazibar gɨn zuir puvatɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:85">nan suighasa na bagha modogha azuazim agura.<verse eid="PSA 119:85"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86"/>Kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgaviba nɨghnɨzir gavgavim dar iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:86">Ezɨ gumazir kuraba uan akar ifavaribagh amua arazir kurabar na gami, kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 119:86"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87"/>Gumazir kurar kaba bar atam na mɨsoghezɨ kɨ aremeghai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:87">Kɨ kamaghɨn aghuagha nɨn akaba ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:87"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88"/>Nɨ zurara nan apangkuf, egh deragh nan akurvagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:88">Kamaghɨn, kɨ nɨn akabar gɨn mangɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:88"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Godɨn Akar Gavgavimɨn iti</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:89 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:8">Aisaia 40:8</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:25">1 Pita 1:25</ref></char>
    </note>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn akam ikɨvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:89">A nɨn Nguibamɨn ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:89"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90"/>Nɨn akam mɨkemezɨ moghɨn nɨ zuraram an gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:90">Nɨ nguazim an danganimram anetɨzɨma a ua mozorozir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:90"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91"/>Biziba bar nɨn ingangarim gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:91">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ uabɨ mɨkemezɨ, biziba uan danganibara ikia, iza datɨrɨghɨn ikia kamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:91"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92"/>Kɨ nɨn Arazibagh ifongezir puvatɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:92">nɨ mɨzazim na gasegha na mɨsoghezɨ kɨ aremeghai.<verse eid="PSA 119:92"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93"/>Kɨ nɨn akabar gɨn ghua egha angamɨra iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:93">kamaghɨn, kɨ da ataghɨraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:93"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94"/>Kɨ zurara nɨn akabar gɨn zui, egha kɨ nɨ baghavɨra itir gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:94">Nɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 119:94"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95"/>Gumazir kuraba na mɨsueghtɨ kɨ aremeghasa na bagha mɨzua mueghav iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:95">Ezɨ kɨ uabɨ, kɨ zurara nɨn akabagh nɨghnɨghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:95"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96"/>Kɨ kamaghɨn fo, biziba bar gɨvamin oteviba iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:96">Ezɨ nɨn Akar Gavgavim bar dera, egh dughiabar vaghvagh zurara ikɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:96"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn Akar Gavgavim bagha bar ifonge</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97"/>Kɨ nɨn Arazim bagha bar ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:97">Egha arueba ko dɨmagaribar a gɨnɨghnɨghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:97"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98"/>Nɨn Akar Gavgavir kam na ko zurara ikia, egha fofozir aghuim na ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:98">Akar Gavgavir kam, nan fofozim gamizɨ a nan apanibar fofozibagh afira.<verse eid="PSA 119:98"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99"/>Kɨ zurara nɨn guizɨn akabagh nɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:99">Kamaghɨn kɨ fofozir aghuim ikia uan tisabagh afira.<verse eid="PSA 119:99"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100"/>Kɨ nɨn akabar gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:100">Kamaghɨn, nan fofozim gumazir aruabar fofozibagh afira.<verse eid="PSA 119:100"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:101 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 1:15">Aghuzir Akaba 1:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨn akamɨn gɨn mangasa ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:101">Kamaghɨn, kɨ arazir kuramɨn gɨn mangan aghua.<verse eid="PSA 119:101"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102"/>Nɨ uabɨ uan akabar nan sure gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:102">kamaghɨn bizir nɨ damuasa e mɨkemeziba, kɨ dar suiraghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:102"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:103 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:10">Onger Akaba 19:10</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 8:11">Aghuzir Akaba 8:11</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨn akaba da bar isɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:103">Nɨn akar kabar isɨngtɨzim bar hanin isɨngtɨzim gafira.<verse eid="PSA 119:103"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104"/>Nɨn akaba nɨghnɨzir bar aghuim na ganɨngi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:104">kamaghɨn kɨ arazir kuraba bar dar aghua.<verse eid="PSA 119:104"/></para>
  <para style="s">Godɨn akam an angazangarimɨn mɨn iti</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:105 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 6:23">Aghuzir Akaba 6:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨn akam a lamɨn angazangarimɨn mɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:105">tuavim nan akaghagha angazangarim na ganɨdima kɨ zui.<verse eid="PSA 119:105"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106"/>Kɨ nɨ ko akam akɨra ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:106">kɨ guizbangɨra bizir nɨ damuasa e mɨkemezibar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 119:106"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, osɨmtɨzir bar ekiam na avara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:107">Nɨn akam mɨkemezɨ moghɨn, nan akuraghtɨ kɨ angamɨra ikɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:107"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨ ko mɨgɨa egha nɨ mɨnabi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:108">Kɨ nɨ mɨnabir mɨgɨrɨgɨar kaba mati, kɨ uan ifongiamɨn gɨn zuir ofan mɨn da nɨ ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:108">Nɨ da inigh, egh bizir nɨ damuasa e mɨkemeziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:108">nɨ deraghvɨra nan sure damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:108"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109"/>Kɨ uabɨ zurara atam ovia taghɨrasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:109">Ezɨ nɨn Arazim, kɨ a bakɨnɨghnighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:109"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110"/>Gumazir kuraba mati azuazim asɨzimɨn suighasa, na bagha mongegha ikia azuaziba gui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:110">Ezɨ kɨ nɨn akaba ataghɨrazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:110"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111"/>Nɨn akaba, kɨ dar suirazɨ da nan ikia kamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:111">Akar kaba nan navim gami a bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:111"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:112 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:33">Onger Akaba 119:33</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:36">119:36</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ mɨkemegha gɨfa, kɨ nɨn arazir nɨ ifongezibar suiragh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:112">dar gɨn mangɨvɨra ikɨ mangɨ ovegham.<verse eid="PSA 119:112"/></para>
  <para style="s">Godɨn Akar Gavgaviba e gamizɨ e deravɨra iti</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113"/>Gumazir maba nɨghnɨzir vamɨra itir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:113">men nɨghnɨziba bɨaghire.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:113">Gumazir kamaghɨn amiba kɨ bar men aghua.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:113">Kɨ uabɨ, nɨn Araziba bar dagh ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:113"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:114 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:7">Onger Akaba 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:1">91:1</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨrara nan mogomer danganim, egha oramɨn mɨn na apazagha na modozɨ kɨ deravɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:114">Ezɨ kɨ nɨn akam nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:114"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115"/>Ia gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba ia na gitagh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:115">Eghtɨ kɨ uan Godɨn Akar Gavgavibar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 119:115"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116"/>Nɨ gavgavim na danɨngasa na koma akam akɨrigha gɨfa, eghtɨ kɨ angamɨra ikɨvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">Nɨn akar dɨkɨrɨzir kam, kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:116">Kɨ akar kam bagh aghumsɨghan aghua.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">Kamaghɨn, nɨ uan akar dɨkɨrɨzimɨn gɨn mangɨ gavgavim na danɨng.<verse eid="PSA 119:116"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117"/>Nɨ nan suiraghtɨ kɨ deraghvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:117">Eghtɨ, kɨ zurara nɨn arazir nɨ ifongeziba baragh dar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 119:117"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118"/>Gumazamizir nɨn arazir nɨ ifongezibar aghuaziba, nɨ akɨrim gigha me gasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:118">Men ifavarir akabar daghetam otoghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:118"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119"/>Nɨ kamaghɨn nɨghnɨsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:119">nguazir kamɨn itir gumazamizir kuraba bar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:119">mati bizir kurar gumazamiziba makunasava amiba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:119">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ bar nɨn akabagh ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:119"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120"/>Kɨ bizir nɨ damuasa e mɨkemezibagh nɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:120">Egha kamaghɨn, kɨ bar nɨn atiatima, nan mɨkarzim nɨghava agoi.<verse eid="PSA 119:120"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn Akar Gavgavibar gɨn zui</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121"/>Arazir aghuir kɨ nɨ ko gumazamizibagh amiba, da nɨn damazimɨn bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:121">Nɨ na ateghtɨ nan apaniba arazir kuramɨn na damuan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:121"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122"/>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, nɨ nan akurvaghsɨ na ko akam akɨram.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:122">Egh gumazir uari febar amamangatɨghtɨ me osɨmtɨzim na danɨngan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:122"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123"/>Kɨ nɨn akurvazim bagha mɨzua ghuava amɨra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:123">Nɨn akar dɨkɨrɨzir aghuim, kɨ a iniasa dughiar bar ruarimɨn mɨzua ghuava amɨra.<verse eid="PSA 119:123"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124"/>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, nɨ uan apangkuvir arazimɨn gɨn mangɨ deravɨra na damu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:124">Egh deraghvɨra uan arazir nɨ ifongezibar nan sure damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:124"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125"/>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:125">kamaghɨn nɨ nɨghnɨzir aghuim na danightɨ, kɨ nɨn akabagh fogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:125"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamiziba nɨn Araziba zurara da abɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:126">Nɨ datɨrɨghɨn mɨzazim me gasɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:126"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127"/>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgaviba bar adagh ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:127">Kɨ nɨn akam gifongezir arazir kam, a gol gifongezir arazim bar a gafira.<verse eid="PSA 119:127"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128"/>Kamaghɨn amizɨ, Kɨ nɨn akaba bar dar gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:128">Egha tuavir kurar igharaziba, kɨ bar dar aghua.<verse eid="PSA 119:128"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn Akar Gavgavimɨn gɨn mangasa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129"/>Nɨn akaba bar moghɨra dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:129">kamaghɨn, kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven bar dar gɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 119:129"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:130 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:7">Onger Akaba 19:7</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:4">Aghuzir Akaba 1:4</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazim igharazitavɨn akuragh nɨn akabar mɨngaribar an sure damightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:130">nɨn akamɨn angazangarim an navir averiamɨn ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:130">Akar kam nɨghnɨzir aghuiba puvatɨzir gumazamizibar amutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:130">me nɨghnɨzir aghuiba ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:130"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131"/>Kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgaviba uan navir averiamɨn dagh ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:131">Mati gumazim dɨpam bagha kuarim an pɨrima, a dɨpam apima an an kuarmɨzimɨn uaghiri.<verse eid="PSA 119:131"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132"/>Nɨ gumazamizir nɨn ziam gifongeziba, nɨ me gifongezɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:132">nɨ na bagh izɨ nan apangkufigh.<verse eid="PSA 119:132"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133"/>Nɨ faragha na ko akar dɨkɨrɨzim gamizɨ moghɨn deragh na gativagh nan gan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:133">Eghtɨ arazir kuram na damightɨ kɨ irɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:133"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134"/>Nɨ uam na inightɨ, gumazir akaba na gasiba na gasɨghasɨghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:134">Eghtɨ kɨ nɨn akabar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 119:134"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:135 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 4:6">Onger Akaba 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:12">119:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:26">119:26</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, nɨ nan boroghɨn ikɨtɨ, nɨn angazangarim na gisiraghtɨ, nɨ deragh na damu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:135">Egh arazir nɨ ifongezibar nan sure damu.<verse eid="PSA 119:135"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136"/>Gumazamiziba nɨn Arazibar gɨn zuir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:136">Kamaghɨn kɨ puvɨram azima nan temeriba dɨpamɨn mɨn ivemari.<verse eid="PSA 119:136"/></para>
  <para style="s">Godɨn Akar Gavgaviba da bar guizbangɨra</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ guizbangɨra bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:137">Ezɨ bizir nɨ damuasa mɨkemeziba da bar dera.<verse eid="PSA 119:137"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138"/>Akar nɨ e ganɨngiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:138">da bar deragha bar guizbangɨra.<verse eid="PSA 119:138"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139"/>Nan apaniba nɨn akabagh nɨghnɨzir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:139">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, nan navim avimɨn mɨn nan isi.<verse eid="PSA 119:139"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140"/>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, kɨ nɨn akar dɨkɨrɨzimɨn ganigha a tuisigha fo, a bar guizbangɨra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:140">Egha akar dɨkɨrɨzir kam kɨ bar a gifonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:140"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141"/>Kɨ gumazir kɨnim ezɨ gumazamiziba na dɨpofi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:141">ezɨ kɨ nɨn akabagh nɨghnɨghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:141"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142"/>Nɨn arazir aghuim a zurara ikiavɨra iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:142">ezɨ nɨn Araziba da bar guizbangɨra.<verse eid="PSA 119:142"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143"/>Osɨmtɨzir ekiaba na batifi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:143">ezɨ kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgaviba bagha bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:143"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144"/>Nɨn akaba da bar deragh ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:144">Nɨ nɨghnɨzir aghuim na danightɨ kɨ angamɨra ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:144"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven nɨghnɨzir vamɨra ikiava</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">nɨ ko mɨkɨmasa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:145">Nɨ nan mɨgɨrɨgɨam barakigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">Kɨ nɨn arazir nɨ ifongezibar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 119:145"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146"/>Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn nɨn dɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:146">nɨ ua na inightɨ kɨ nɨn akabar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 119:146"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147"/>Amɨnim tiasava amima nɨ nan akurvaghasa kɨ nɨn dei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:147">Kɨ nɨn akaba nɨghnɨzir gavgavim dar iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:147"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148"/>Kɨ dɨmagaribar akuir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:148">Kɨ nɨn akar dɨkɨrɨzim gɨnɨghnɨghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:148"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ bar nan apangkufi, kamaghɨn nɨ nan mɨgɨrɨgɨaba barakigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">Nɨ bar moghɨra dera, kamaghɨn nɨ na akumakum nan gantɨ, kɨ deraghvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:149"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150"/>Gumazir nɨghnɨzir kuraba nan itiba, na gasɨghasɨghasa nan boroghɨra izi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:150">Gumazir kaba nɨn Arazibar saghon ikia, dar gɨn zuir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:150"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151"/>Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn Akar Gavgaviba da bar guizbangɨra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:151">Ezɨ nɨ uabɨ, nɨ bar nan boroghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:151"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152"/>Bar fomɨra kɨ nɨn akabagh fo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:152">Nɨ uan akar kam gamizɨ a ikia mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:152"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa Godɨn dei</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153"/>Kɨ nɨn Araziba bakɨnɨghnɨzir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:153">Kamaghɨn, nɨ nan osɨmtɨzibar gan nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 119:153"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154"/>Nɨ faragha na ko akam akɨrizɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:154">nɨ nan akuragh ua na inigh ikɨrɨmɨrir aghuim na danɨng.<verse eid="PSA 119:154"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155"/>Gumazir kuraba arazir nɨ ifongezibar gɨn zuir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:155">ezɨ nɨ ua me inian kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:155"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn apangkuvim bar ekefe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:156">Nɨ faragha mɨkemezɨ moghɨn, nɨ nan akuraghtɨ kɨ angamɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:156"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157"/>Gumazir avɨriba arazir kurabar na gamua egha na gasɨghasɨghasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:157">ezɨ kɨ nɨn akaba ataghizir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:157"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158"/>Gumazir akaba batoziba, me nɨn Akar Gavgavibar gɨn zuir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:158">Gumazir kaba, kɨ men gara nan navim bar ikuvizɨ, kɨ bar men amɨra.<verse eid="PSA 119:158"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan gari, kɨ nɨn akaba bar dagh ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">Ezɨ nɨ bar nan apangkufi, kamaghɨn nɨ uam na inightɨ kɨ angamɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 119:159"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:160 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:89">Onger Akaba 119:89</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:142">119:142</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:152">119:152</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨn akar kam a guizɨn akamra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:160">Bizir nɨ damuasa mɨkemeziba da zurara ikia mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:160"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn Arazibar gɨn mangasa bar akonge</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161"/>Gumazir dapaniba arazir kurabar na gami, ezɨ men arazir kurar kaba, mɨngarir aghuitam itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:161">Ezɨ kɨ zurara nɨn akabagh nɨghnɨghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 119:161"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162"/>Kɨ nɨn akaba bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:162">Mati gumazim dagɨar avɨribar apigha da isa bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:162"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163"/>Kɨ guizbangɨra ifavarir arazim bar an aghua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:163">egha nɨn Araziba kɨ bar dagh ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:163"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164"/>Dughiaba bar, a dar 7plan dughiabar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:164">kɨ bizir aghuir nɨ damuasa mɨkemezibagh nɨghnɨgha nɨn ziam fe.<verse eid="PSA 119:164"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:165 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 32:17">Aisaia 32:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazamizir nɨn Arazibagh ifongeziba, me navir amɨrizimɨn ikia bar deraghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:165">Eghtɨ bizitam me damightɨ me asaghporegh ireghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 119:165"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨn akurvazim bagha nɨ mɨzua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:166">nɨn Akar Gavgavibar gɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 119:166"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167"/>Kɨ nɨn akaba bar uan navir averiamɨn dagh ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:167">Egha zurara dar gɨn zui.<verse eid="PSA 119:167"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168"/>Kɨ nɨn akaba, ko nɨn arazir aghuiba bar dar gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:168">Ezɨ nɨ bar nan arazibagh fogha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 119:168"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan azangsɨzim baragh nan akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:169">Nɨ faragha mɨkemezɨ moghɨn, nan akuragh fofozir aghuim na danɨngigh.<verse eid="PSA 119:169"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170"/>Nɨ faragha na mɨkemezɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:170">nan azangsɨzim baragh nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 119:170"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171"/>Arazir nɨ ifongeziba, nɨ zurara nan sure gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:171">Kamaghɨn kɨ zurara nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 119:171"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:172 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 119:138">Onger Akaba 119:138</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨn Akar Gavgaviba da bar guizbangɨra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:172">kamaghɨn kɨ dagh nɨghnɨgh, egh ighiabar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 119:172"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173"/>Kɨ nɨn akaba zurara dar gɨn zui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:173">Kamaghɨn, nɨ zurara nan akurvaghsɨ gan ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 119:173"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨn akurvazim bagha ara nɨ mɨzuai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:174">Ezɨ nɨn Araziba na gami kɨ bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 119:174"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175"/>Nɨ na damightɨ kɨ angamɨra ikɨ, egh nɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:175">Eghtɨ bizir nɨ damuasa e mɨkemeziba en akuragham.<verse eid="PSA 119:175"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">119:176 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:6">Aisaia 53:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:6">Jeremaia 50:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:12">Matyu 18:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:4">Luk 15:4</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">Kɨ sipsipɨn ovengezimɨn mɨn tuavir aghuim ataki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 119:176">Kɨ nɨn Akar Gavgaviba gɨn amadir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">kamaghɨn amizɨ, nɨ na bagh izɨ na buri.<verse eid="PSA 119:176"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119"/>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">120:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Godɨn gumazamiziba an ziam fasa Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga ighiaba banga zui.</char></note></para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">120:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:5">Onger Akaba 118:5</ref>; <ref loc="JON 2:2">Jona 2:2</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ osɨmtɨzim itir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:1">kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn diava araima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 120:1">a nan dɨmdiam barasi.<verse eid="PSA 120:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2"/>Kɨ ghaze, “O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazir ifariba na gasɨghasɨghasava ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:2">Nɨ men akar ifavaribar ua nan akuragh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 120:2">men dafaribar ua na inigh.”<verse eid="PSA 120:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3"/>Ia gumazir ifariba, God mɨzazir manmaghɨra garim ia danɨngam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:3">Egh a manmaghɨra garir arazim ian arazir kuraba ikaragham?<verse eid="PSA 120:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4"/>God ti afuzir ghumtɨzim inigh ia ginivam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:4">A ti avir bar puvɨra isim inigh ia dapongam.<verse eid="PSA 120:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5"/>Maia! Kɨ uabɨn apangkufi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:5">Kɨ Mesekia ko Kedarian tongɨn pazava aperazɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 120:5">ian tongɨn datɨrɨghɨn pazava apera.<verse eid="PSA 120:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6"/>Gumazir igharaziba ko deragh dapian aghuaziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:6">kɨ dughiar ruarimɨn ian tongɨn ikegha, bar amɨra.<verse eid="PSA 120:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7"/>Kɨ uabɨ dabirabir aghuim baghavɨra mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:7">ezɨ me mɨdorozim baghavɨra mɨgei!<verse eid="PSA 120:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120"/>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121"/>
  <para style="s">Ikiavɨra Itir God, a gumazir deravɨram e geghuva en garim</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">121:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 123:1">Onger Akaba 123:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ uan akurvazim bagha mɨghsɨaba kozorogha dar gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:1">Eghtɨ gumazir nan akurvaghamim managhɨra ikegh otogh izam.<verse eid="PSA 121:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">121:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:15">Onger Akaba 115:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 124:8">124:8</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn overiam ko nguazimɨn ingarizim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:2">a bar uabɨra nan akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 121:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">121:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:2">Onger Akaba 41:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 66:9">66:9</ref></char>
    </note>A Godɨn akuir puvatɨzim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:3">A nɨ akumakum deragh nɨn gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 121:3">nɨ irɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 121:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4"/>A Israelia akumakua deragha men gari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:4">egha dughiatamɨn bar akuizir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 121:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨn boroghɨra ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:5">mati dughuazim nɨ avara.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 121:5">Egha nɨ geghuva deragha nɨn gari.<verse eid="PSA 121:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">121:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:10">Aisaia 49:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:16">Akar Mogomem 7:16</ref></char>
    </note>Aruem isiragh nɨ dapongeghan kogham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:6">eghtɨ dɨmangan iakɨnim nɨ gasɨghasɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 121:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">121:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 91:10-12">Onger Akaba 91:10-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God nɨ geghuv deragh nɨn gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:7">bizir kuratam nɨ gasɨghasighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 121:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8"/>Nɨ uan dɨpenim ataghɨraghamin dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:8">a nɨ geghuv deragh nɨn ganam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 121:8">Egh nɨ ua izamin dughiam, a kamaghɨra damuam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:8">a datɨrɨghɨn ko, dughiar gɨn izamibar,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 121:8">kamaghɨra damuam.<verse eid="PSA 121:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121"/>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122"/>
  <para style="s">Me Jerusalemɨn nguibam gɨnɨghnɨgha ighiam gamua bar akonge</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">122:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:3">Aisaia 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:21">Sekaraia 8:21</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ orazi, me kamagh na mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:1">“Ia dɨkavigh e mangɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn mangam.”</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 122:1">Kɨ kamaghɨn oregha bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 122:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2"/>E datɨrɨghɨn otivigha gɨvagha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:2">Jerusalemɨn nguibam avɨnizir dɨvazimɨn aven tuivighav iti.<verse eid="PSA 122:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3"/>Me Jerusalemɨn nguibamɨn ingarizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:3">a gavgavigha ganganim datɨrɨghɨn bar dera.<verse eid="PSA 122:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4"/>God faragh Israelian anababav kemezɨ me iza kagh Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨnabazɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">me datɨrɨghɨn izava ami.<verse eid="PSA 122:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5"/>Danganir kam, atrivim kotiaba barazir dɨpenim iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:5">Kar Atrivim Devitɨn ovavir boriba kotiaba baragha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 122:5">da tuisɨzir danganim.<verse eid="PSA 122:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6"/>Ia Jerusalem bagh Ikiavɨra Itir God ko mɨkɨm.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:6">Eghtɨ a navir amɨrizim Jerusalemɨn iti darazir anightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 122:6">me navir amɨrizimɨn ikɨva deragh ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 122:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7"/>Gumazamizir Jerusalemɨn dɨvazimɨn aven itiba deragh ikɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:7">ua mɨdorozim damuan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 122:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8"/>Kɨ uan adarazi ko, uan namakabagh nɨghnɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:8">kamaghɨn Jerusalem mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 122:8">“Nɨ amɨragh nɨmɨra ikɨtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:8">mɨdoroziba nɨn aven otivan markɨ.”<verse eid="PSA 122:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9"/>Kɨ, Ikiavɨra Itir God, en God, an Dɨpenim gɨnɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:9">Egha Jerusalem bar deraghvɨra ikiasa kɨ a bagha God ko mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 122:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122"/>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim Godɨn apangkuvim iniasa a ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">123:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 121:1">Onger Akaba 121:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ uan Nguibamɨn atrivimɨn itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:1">kɨ kogha nɨn akurvazim bagha gari.<verse eid="PSA 123:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">123:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 25:15">Onger Akaba 25:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:6">Malakai 1:6</ref></char>
    </note>Ingangarir gumazim, a uan gumazir dapanimɨn gantɨ, an an akurvagham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">Ingangarir amizim, a uan amizir dapanimɨn gantɨ, an an akurvagham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 123:2">Kamaghɨra, e Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ganvɨra ikɨ mangɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">a uan apangkuvim en akakagham.<verse eid="PSA 123:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamiziba arazir kurabar e gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:3">kamagh nɨ en apangkufigh.<verse eid="PSA 123:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4"/>Dughiar bar ruarimɨn dagɨaba itir gumazamiziba dɨbovir akabar e mɨgɨa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:4">uari fa pazava e gami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 123:4">Ezɨ e bar amɨra.<verse eid="PSA 123:4"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123"/>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn gumazamiziba, a uabɨ men akurvazim</para>
  <para style="d">Ighiar kam, Devit an osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God en akuraghan koghtɨ, e manmaghɨra damuam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:1">Ia Israelia azangsɨzir kam ikaragh mɨkɨm suam:<verse eid="PSA 124:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2-3"/>En apaniba faragha naviba en ikuvigha e mɨsoke.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:2-3">Ikiavɨra Itir God en akurazir puvatɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 124:2-3">apaniba pazavɨra en atara bar e gasɨghasighai.<verse eid="PSA 124:2-3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4"/>Puvatɨzɨ apaniba aperiamɨn mɨn e inigha ghuzɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:4">dɨpam e avarazɨ moghɨn e oveghai.<verse eid="PSA 124:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5"/>Mati aperiar ekiam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:5">bar e adugha ghueghai.<verse eid="PSA 124:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6"/>E datɨrɨghɨn Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨnabagham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:6">A itima en apaniba asɨzir atiamɨn mɨn e givir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 124:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7"/>Mati gumazim kuarazimɨn suighasa azuazim gura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">e kuarazimɨn mɨn mɨghegha a gitagha ghu.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 124:7">Me gurazir azuazir kam dutuaghirɨ,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 124:7">ezɨ e a gitagha ghu.<verse eid="PSA 124:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8"/>Bar guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn overiam ko nguazimɨn ingarizim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:8">a uabɨra en akurvasi.<verse eid="PSA 124:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124"/>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125"/>
  <para style="s">God uan gumazamizibagh amizɨ, me deragha apia</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1"/>Gumazamizir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">me Saionɨn Mɨghsɨamɨn mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:1">Mɨghsɨar kam bar gavgavigha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">mozoroziba puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 125:1">a ikɨ kamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 125:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">125:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 121:8">Onger Akaba 121:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:5">Sekaraia 2:5</ref></char>
    </note>Kamaghɨra, mɨghsɨaba Jerusalemɨn nguibam ekɨaruzɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">datɨrɨghɨn ko gɨn Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 125:2">uan gumazamiziba ekɨarugh men ganam.<verse eid="PSA 125:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3"/>Gumazir arazir kurabagh amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">Godɨn gumazamizibar nguazim gativagh zurara men ganan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:3">Me kamagh damutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">Godɨn gumazamiziba uaghan arazir kurabar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 125:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamizir nɨ baghavɨra ikia nɨn akamɨn gɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:4">nɨ deraghvɨra me damu.<verse eid="PSA 125:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5"/>Nɨ gumazir kurabagh asɨghasɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:5">egh gumazir ifara uan nɨghnɨzibar gɨn zuiba sarama asɨghasɨkigh.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:5">Eghtɨ Israelia deraghvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 125:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125"/>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126"/>
  <para style="s">Israelia God men akurvaghasa me a ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God uam e inigha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:1">Saionɨn nguibamɨn ize,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 126:1">ezɨ dughiar kam e ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 126:1">e mati irebamɨn gari.<verse eid="PSA 126:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2"/>Kamaghɨn, e akava ighiabagh amuavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">Ezɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba e mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:2">“Ikiavɨra Itir God, Israelian akurvaghasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">maburan ingangarimram ami.”<verse eid="PSA 126:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3"/>Bar guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God en akurvaghasa bar ingangarir ekiam gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:3">kamaghɨn e datɨrɨghɨn naviba deragha bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 126:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ ua deraghvɨra e damuam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">E mati dɨpaba puvatɨzir danganimɨn itir faneba dɨpaba dake,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 126:4">nɨ amozim damightɨ a ua izɨtɨ da izevegham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">Kamaghɨra, nɨ e damutɨ e izɨvagham.<verse eid="PSA 126:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5"/>Gumazir aravɨra dagheba opariba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:5">me dar dagheba iniva</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 126:5">bar akuegh dɨmɨva arangam.<verse eid="PSA 126:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6"/>Guizbangɨra, gumazir aravɨra dagher ovɨziba atera ghua da opariba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">me dar dagheba inigh</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 126:6">uamategh ighiabar amu da ater izam.<verse eid="PSA 126:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126"/>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127"/>
  <para style="s">God arazir aghuimɨn me gamizɨ me an ziam fe</para>
  <para style="d">Ighiar kam, Solomon an osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">127:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 121:4">Onger Akaba 121:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ dɨpenimɨn ingar.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">Puvatɨghtɨma, dɨpenir kamɨn ingarir gumaziba pura an ingarigham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:1">Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ nguibamɨn gan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">Puvatɨghtɨma, nguibar kamɨn garir gumaziba pura ingarigham.<verse eid="PSA 127:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2"/>E dagheba ko dagɨaba bagha bar mɨzarazibara dɨkava ingara zui amɨniba pɨri.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">E pura ingangarir kabagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:2">Ikiavɨra Itir God uabɨ gumazamizir a ifongeziba biziba me ganɨdima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">me pura ikia avughsi.<verse eid="PSA 127:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3"/>Boriba, kar bizir aghuir Ikiavɨra Itir God anɨdiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:3">da bar dera.<verse eid="PSA 127:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4"/>Gumazir igiamɨn boriba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:4">mati afuziba mɨdorozir gumazir mamɨn dafarimɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 127:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5"/>Gumazir borir avɨriba itim a bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">A uan apaniba ko kotiam damuamim dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 127:5">me kotiar danganimɨn an akurvagham.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 127:5">Eghtɨ an kotiam deragh mangam.<verse eid="PSA 127:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127"/>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128"/>
  <para style="s">God gumazamizir an akam baragha an gɨn zuiba, a deragha me gami</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1"/>Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatia an apengan ikia, an akaba baragha dar gɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:1">me bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 128:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2"/>Ingangarir nɨ amibara nɨ dar dagɨaba inigh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:2">bizir nɨ ifongezibagh ivezam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:2">Eghtɨ bizir nɨ amiba bar deraghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:2">nɨ bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 128:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3"/>Nɨn amuim, wainɨn ikarɨzimɨn mɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">ava ovɨzir avɨriba iti moghɨn, a borir avɨriba batam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:3">Nɨn boriba bar avɨrasemegh nɨn avir mɨriam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">olivɨn temer igiabar mɨn bar an okarigham.<verse eid="PSA 128:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4"/>Bar guizbangɨra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:4">gumazir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatia an apengan itim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 128:4">a kamaghɨrama otogham.<verse eid="PSA 128:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, uan Dɨpenimɨn aven Saionɨn Nguibamɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">a deragh nɨ damu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:5">Nɨ zurara nguazimɨn itir dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">nɨ Jerusalemɨn nguibamɨn itir bizibar gantɨ da deraghvɨrama otiv.<verse eid="PSA 128:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6"/>Kɨ kamaghsua, nɨ dughiar ruarimɨn ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:6">uan igiar boribar gan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:6"/>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:6">Eghtɨ Israelia deraghvɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 128:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128"/>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129"/>
  <para style="s">Israelia uan apanibagh asɨghasɨghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1"/>Israel, nɨ uan igiamɨn ikegha iza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:1">datɨrɨghɨn nɨn apaniba nɨ gamizir arazir kuraba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 129:1">nɨ dagh eghan.<verse eid="PSA 129:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2"/>Nɨ kamaghɨn mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:2">“Kɨ uan igiamɨn ikia iza datɨrɨghɨn, nan apaniba arazir kurabar na gami.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 129:2">Me kamaghɨn na gamua egha na abɨrazir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 129:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3"/>Me nan akɨrim ifozorozima a duar ruariba iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:3">Ezɨ duar kaba mati me azenir ekiam oparasa an nguazim abɨagharɨki.<verse eid="PSA 129:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4"/>Ezɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God an araziba dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:4">a ikia kalabuziar kamɨn ua nan akurazɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 129:4">kɨ fɨriaghɨrɨ.”<verse eid="PSA 129:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5"/>Kɨ ghaze, Saionɨn Nguibamɨn apanimɨn itir darasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:5">e men agɨntɨghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 129:5">me uam arɨ uan nguibabar mangegh</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 129:5">bar aghumsika.<verse eid="PSA 129:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6"/>Me dɨpenir siriabagh isɨn aghuir grazibar mɨn aghungam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:6">Da aghung ua zuamɨra mɨsigham.<verse eid="PSA 129:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7"/>Gumaziba grazir kabar ikɨziba ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:7">egha da atera zuir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 129:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8"/>Gumazamiziba gumazamizir kabar boroghɨn mangɨ kamaghɨn mɨkɨman markɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">“Ikiavɨra Itir God deragh ia damu!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 129:8">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziamɨn</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 129:8">ia deraghvɨra ikɨ.”<verse eid="PSA 129:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129"/>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">130:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LAM 3:55">Azir Akam 3:55</ref>; <ref loc="JON 2:2">Jona 2:2</ref></char>
    </note>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:1">nan navir averiam bar osemezɨ kɨ nɨn dei,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 130:1">nɨ nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 130:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2"/>O Ekiam, nɨ na barakigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:2">Kɨ nɨ mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba ko nan arareba nɨ da baregh</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 130:2">nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 130:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">130:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 143:2">Onger Akaba 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:20">Rom 3:20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:23-24">3:23-24</ref></char>
    </note>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ en arazir kuraba mengegh dar suiragh ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:3">Ekiam, en tinara nɨn damazimɨn tugh gavgavigham?<verse eid="PSA 130:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">130:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 33:8-9">Jeremaia 33:8-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨrara arazir kuraba gɨn amadi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:4">kamaghɨn amizɨ, e nɨrarama atiating nɨn apengan ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 130:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">130:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:20">Onger Akaba 33:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:1">40:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:17">Aisaia 8:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:18">30:18</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa ifongegha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:5">Ikiavɨra Itir God, a mɨzua iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 130:5">Egha nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an akamɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 130:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">130:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 63:6">Onger Akaba 63:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:147">119:147</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">Ekiamɨn akurvazim bagha a mɨzua ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 130:6">Ezɨ nan arazir kam a gumazir dɨmagarimɨn bizibar gara itima amɨnim men itirazir arazim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">a bar a gafira.<verse eid="PSA 130:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7"/>E Israelia, Ikiavɨra Itir God zurara bar en apangkufi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">egha e ikuvighan koghasa an en akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 130:7">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, ia nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 130:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">130:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 1:21">Matyu 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Taitus 2:14</ref></char>
    </note>A uan gumazamiziba Israelia men akuragha ua me ini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:8">egh men arazir kuraba gɨn amangam.<verse eid="PSA 130:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130"/>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim nɨghnɨzir gavgavim ikia God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Ighiar kam, Devit an osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ akaba batogh uabɨ uan ziam fan aghua.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">Kɨ bizir ekiaba ko bizir kɨ damuan iburaziba dagh nɨghnɨzir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 131:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2"/>Kɨ datɨrɨghɨn deragha aperagha navir amɨrizim iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">mati borim uan amebamɨn otem ategha a ko aghumram aperaghav iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 131:2">Kamaghɨra, nan navim purama amɨragha irɨghav iti.<verse eid="PSA 131:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3"/>O Israelia, ia datɨrɨghɨn nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Ikiavɨra Itir God ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:3">kamaghɨra ikɨ mangɨvɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 131:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131"/>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazamiziba Godɨn Dɨpenim bagha bar akonge</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, Devit uabɨ ko, a inizir osɨmtɨzir ekiar kaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:1">nɨ dagh nɨghnɨghvɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 132:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:2">Nɨ Jekopɨn God, Godɨn Bar Gavgavir Ekiam Itim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:2">Devit nɨ ko dɨkɨrɨzir akaba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:2">nɨ dagh nɨghnɨghvɨra ikɨ.<verse eid="PSA 132:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3"/>Devit ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:3">“Kɨ uan dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaboghan kogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3">uan mɨsiam mɨtoghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 132:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4"/>Kɨ dakusɨ uabɨ abɨnan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:4">Eghtɨ nan damazimning komeghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 132:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5"/>Kɨ kamaghɨra deragh dakuan kogh mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:5">kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh Dɨpenimɨn ingarsɨ danganitam batoghvɨra gɨvagham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 132:5">A Jekopɨn God, Godɨn Bar Gavgavir Ekiam Itim.”<verse eid="PSA 132:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">132:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 7:1-2">1 Samuel 7:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:5">1 Eghaghaniba 13:5</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">132:6-10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 6:41-42">2 Eghaghaniba 6:41-42</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E Betlehemɨn nguibamɨn ikia, Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavimɨn Boksiamɨn akam baraki.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:6">Egha ghua Kiriat Jearimɨn nguazimɨn an apigha a inigha ize.<verse eid="PSA 132:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7"/>E ghaze, e Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn mangɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:7">egh an atrivir dabirabimɨn guamɨn teviba apɨrigh an ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 132:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ dɨkavigh izɨ uan avughsir danganimɨn ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">Nɨ uan Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavimɨn Boksiam sara izɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 132:8">Boksiar kam, a nɨn gavgavir bar ekiam aka.<verse eid="PSA 132:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9"/>Nɨn ofa gamir gumaziba me zurara arazir aghuibara damuam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:9">Arazir aghuir kaba men kurkazir aghuimɨn mɨn ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:9">Eghtɨ nɨn gumazamizir nɨ baghavɨra itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:9">bar akuegh pamten kamagh dɨmɨva arang mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 132:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ faragha uan ingangarir gumazim Devit koma akam akɨrizɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:10">nɨ datɨrɨghɨn uan Atrivir nɨ ua bagha inabazim, akɨrim ragh a gasan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 132:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">132:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">2 Samuel 7:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:11-14">1 Eghaghaniba 17:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:4-5">Onger Akaba 89:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:30">Aposel 2:30</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ Devit ko akam akɨrigha gɨfa, egh uan nɨghnɨzim gɨghan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">Nɨ kamaghɨn mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:11">“Kɨ nɨn gɨn otivamin adarazir aven otaritam damightɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">an Atrivimɨn otogham,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 132:11">eghtɨ nɨn gɨn, ana Atrivimɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 132:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12"/>Nɨn otariba, kɨ men sure gamir akaba baregh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">nan Akar Dɨkɨrɨzir Gavgavimɨn gɨn mangɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 132:12">nɨn ovavibar otariba, uaghan Atrivibar ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 132:12">mamaghɨra ikiam.”<verse eid="PSA 132:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, Saion Nguibam ua bagh a ginaba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:13">A nguibar kam bar a gifuegha,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 132:13">zurarama an ikiasa a ginaba.<verse eid="PSA 132:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14"/>A ghaze, “Kɨ nguibar kam bar a gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">A nan avughsɨzir danganim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 132:14">kɨ an aven ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 132:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15"/>Kɨ Saion deragh a damu bizir bar avɨriba isɨva a danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:15">Eghtɨ an itir gumazamizir onganaraziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 132:15">kɨ dagheba me danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 132:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16"/>Kɨ Saionɨn itir ofa gamir gumaziba ingangarim me danightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:16">me kɨ nguazimɨn gumazamizibar akurvagh ua me iniamin akam, me me mɨkɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 132:16">Eghtɨ Saionɨn gumazamiziba bar akuegh tiariba akaram.<verse eid="PSA 132:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">132:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 11:36">1 Atriviba 11:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Kɨ Devitɨn adarazir aven gumazitam damightɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">an otogh Atrivir bar gavgavimɨn ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:17">Kɨ an mɨseveghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">a mati lamɨn angazangarimɨn mɨn isiragh gavgavigh ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 132:17">mangɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 132:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18"/>An apaniba, kɨ me damightɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:18">me aghumsɨzir bar ekiam inigham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:18">Eghtɨ an ativaghamin gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:18">men kantri gavgavigh ikɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 132:18">mamaghɨra ikiam.”<verse eid="PSA 132:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132"/>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn adarazi uari ko ikia, navir vamɨran itir arazim a bar dera</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">133:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 13:8">Jenesis 13:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ia oragh, kamaghɨn bar dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:1">e Godɨn adarazi bar navir vamɨran ikɨva,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 133:1">uari ko dapiagh aveghbuabar mɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 133:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2"/>Arazir kam mati olivɨn tememɨn borer aghuim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">me a isa Aronɨn dapanim ginge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:2">Ezɨ an emɨra uaghira an ghuamasɨzimɨn uaghira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">egha uaghira an evarimɨn itir korotiamɨn tu.<verse eid="PSA 133:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3"/>Arazir kam uaghan mati, ghuariar dɨpam Hermonɨn Mɨghsɨamɨn ira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">izaghira Saionɨn Nguibam gisɨn itir mɨghsɨabagh iri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:3">Danganir kamɨn, Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamizir navir vamɨran itiba bar deragha me gami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">A ikɨrɨmɨrir zurazurara itim me ganɨdi me ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 133:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133"/>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134"/>
  <para style="s">E Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam</para>
  <para style="d">Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn ghuavanaga an ziam fer ighiam.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1"/>Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ingangarir gumaziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">ia izɨva an ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 134:1">Ia dɨmagaribar an Dɨpenimɨn tuivav ikia an ingangarim gami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">ia an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 134:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2"/>Ia Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn aven dafariba fɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:2">a ko mɨkɨm egh an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 134:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, a Godɨn overiam ko nguazimɨn ingarizim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:3">a Saionɨn nguibamɨn ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 134:3">egh bar deragh ia damu.<verse eid="PSA 134:3"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134"/>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn ziam fer onger akam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1"/>Ia bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1">Ia ziar ekiam a danɨng!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:1">Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ingangarir gumaziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1">ia an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 135:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2"/>Ia gumazir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn Dɨpenimɨn tuivighav itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:2">ia an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 135:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God a bar dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">kamaghɨn ia an ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:3">An apangkuvim bar en ekefe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">kamaghɨn ia an ziam fɨ ighiabar amu.<verse eid="PSA 135:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God ua baghvɨra Jekop ginaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:4">kamaghɨn Israelia kar bar Godɨn adarazira.<verse eid="PSA 135:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5"/>Kɨ kamaghɨn fo, Ikiavɨra Itir God gavgavir ekiam iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:5">egha aseba bar dagh afira.<verse eid="PSA 135:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6"/>An overiam ko, nguazim ko, ongarim, ko ongarir konimɨn bizim damuasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">an a gami.<verse eid="PSA 135:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7"/>Ana amozimɨn mɨgharir pɨzibagh ami, da nguazir oteviba bar dar zui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">ana onɨmaribagh ami, da taghtagha amozim sara izi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 135:7">An amɨnim gami, a dɨkava ivava danganiba bar dar zui.<verse eid="PSA 135:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">135:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:29">Ua Me Ini 12:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A Isipian otarir ivariaba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:8">men asɨzir apurir faragha otivizir avɨribav soghezɨ, da ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 135:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">135:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 7:14-10:29">Ua Me Ini 7:14--10:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A Isipɨn atrivim ko, an ingangarir gumaziba, me damightɨ me foghasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:9">a mirakelba ko dɨgavir kuram gamir arazibagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 135:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, kantrin avɨribagh asɨghasigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:10">atrivir gavgavir avɨribav soghezɨ, me ariaghire.<verse eid="PSA 135:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">135:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Dɨboboniba 21:21-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An atrivir gavgavir kabar maraziv soghezɨ me ariaghire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">Sihon Amorian atrivim, ko Ok a Basanian atrivim, ko Kenanian atriviba, bar moghɨra.<verse eid="PSA 135:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12"/>An Atrivir kabar nguaziba, isa uan gumazamiziba Israelia ganɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:12">Eghtɨ da men nguazibara mɨn ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 135:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13"/>O, Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazamiziba zurara kamagh nɨ mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:13">nɨ uabɨ guizbangɨra God.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 135:13">Gumazamizir gɨn otivamin kaba me nɨ gɨfogham.<verse eid="PSA 135:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, uan gumazamizibar araziba tuisɨgh, egh suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:14">me osɨmtɨziba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 135:14">Egh a uan ingangarir gumazibar kuarkuvam.<verse eid="PSA 135:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">135:15-18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:4-8">Onger Akaba 115:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 9:20">Akar Mogomem 9:20</ref></char>
    </note>E fo, Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba me silva ko golba isa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:15">uan dafaribara marvir guaba kɨri.<verse eid="PSA 135:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16"/>Marvir guar kaba, da akatoriba ikia egha mɨgeir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:16">Da damaziba ikia bizibar garir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 135:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17"/>Da kuariba ikia, egha orazir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:17">Me ikɨrɨmɨrir e datɨrɨghɨn ikiava angamɨra itir kam puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 135:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18"/>Guizbangɨra, gumazir marvir guar kabar ingariba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:18">me uari marvir guar me ingarir kabar mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:18">Gumazir nɨghnɨzir gavgavim marvir guabar itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:18">me uari dar mɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 135:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19"/>Ia Israelia, ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:19">Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ofa gamir gumaziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 135:19">ia an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 135:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20"/>Ia Livain adarasi, ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:20">Ia gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn atiatiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 135:20">ia an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 135:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21"/>Saion, an ziar mam Jerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:21">a Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn nguibam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 135:21">Ia an itir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 135:21">an ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:21"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:21">Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:21">Ia bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 135:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135"/>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136"/>
  <para style="s">God mɨnabir ighiam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">136:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 16:34">1 Eghaghaniba 16:34</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 5:13">2 Eghaghaniba 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Esra 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Onger Akaba 100:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jeremaia 33:11</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God, bar arazir aghuibar e gami, kamaghɨn e a mɨnabagham.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:1">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, godɨn ifavaribagh afiragha bar ekefe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:2">Kamaghɨn e a mɨnamam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 136:2">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3"/>Ekiam nguazir kamɨn gumazir ekiaba bar dagh afira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:3">Kamaghɨn e a mɨnamam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 136:3">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4"/>A uabɨra mirakelɨn ekiabagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:4">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">136:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:1">Jenesis 1:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A uan nɨghnɨzir aghuimɨn overiamɨn ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:5">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">136:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:2">Jenesis 1:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A nguazim isa dɨpabagh isɨn an ingarizɨ an aperaghav iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:6">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">136:7-9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:16">Jenesis 1:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An aruem ko iakɨnimɨn ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:7">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8"/>An aruem atɨzɨma an aruemɨn isiragha gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:8">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9"/>A iakɨnim ko mɨkoveziba atɨzɨma me dɨmagarimɨn isira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:9">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">136:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:29">Ua Me Ini 12:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A Isipian otarir ivariabagh soghezɨ me ariaghire.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:10">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">136:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Ua Me Ini 12:51</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A Israelian gumazamiziba inigha Isipɨn kantri ategha azenan ize.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:11">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12"/>A uan gavgavir ekiamɨn, ua me inigha ize.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:12">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">136:13-15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21-29">Ua Me Ini 14:21-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An Ongarir Aghevim gamizɨ a tongɨra biaghɨrɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:13">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14"/>A uan gumazamizibar faragha ghua, ongarir kam biaghirɨzɨ naghɨn, an an tongɨra me inigha azenan ize.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:14">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15"/>A Isipɨn atrivim ko an mɨdorozir gumaziba avigha Ongarir Aghevimɨn me makunizɨ me dɨpam amegha ariaghire.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:15">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">136:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 13:18">Ua Me Ini 13:18</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:22">15:22</ref></char>
    </note>A uan gumazamizibar faragha ghua me inigha gumazamiziba puvatɨzir danganimɨn ghuava otifi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:16">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17"/>An atrivir bar gavgavibav soghezɨ me ariaghire.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:17">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18"/>An atrivir ziaba itibav soghezɨ me ariaghire.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:18">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">136:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:21-30">Dɨboboniba 21:21-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>An Amorian Atrivim Sihon, a mɨsoghezɨ an areme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:19">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">136:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:31-35">Dɨboboniba 21:31-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A Basanian Atrivim Ok, a mɨsoghezɨ an areme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:20">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21"/>An atrivir kabar nguazim isa uan gumazamizibagh anɨngi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:21">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22"/>A nguazir kam isa uan ingangarir gumazim Israel ganɨngizɨ, nguazir kam men nguazimra mɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:22">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23"/>En apaniba e abɨrima an e gɨnɨghnɨghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:23">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24"/>A en apanibar dafaribar uam e ini.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:24">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25"/>A dagheba isa gumazamiziba ko asɨziba bar me ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:25">A zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 136:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26"/>Bizir kabanang bagh, e Godɨn uan Nguibamɨn itim mɨnamam!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 136:26">Bar guizbangɨra, a zurara en apangkuvigha mamaghɨra iti!<verse eid="PSA 136:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136"/>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137"/>
  <para style="s">Israelia Babilonɨn kantrin kalabusɨn ikiavɨra ikia Jerusalemɨn nguibam bagha arai</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">137:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NEH 1:4">Nehemia 1:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>E Babilonɨn Faner mɨriabar apiaghav ikiava,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:1">Saionɨn nguibam gɨnɨghnɨgha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 137:1">a bagha azia iti.<verse eid="PSA 137:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2"/>E uan gitabav sozir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:2">e purama da isa en boroghɨn itir temer aguabar da gui.<verse eid="PSA 137:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3"/>Gumazir e isa kalabus garɨghiziba ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">“Ia ighiabar amu en navibar amutɨ da deraghtɨ e bar akuegham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 137:3">Ia Saionɨn nguibamɨn ziam dɨghor e bagh ighiabar amu.”<verse eid="PSA 137:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4"/>E manmagh suvɨra kantrin igharazimɨn ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:4">egh Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn onger akabar amuam?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:4">Kar en kantri puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:4">e kamaghɨn damuan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 137:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5"/>O Jerusalemɨn Nguibam, kɨ nɨ gɨn amadagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:5">gita inigh uan agharir guvimɨn uam a mɨsoghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 137:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6"/>O Jerusalem, kɨ nɨ isa faraghavɨra uan dɨghorim gamigha nɨ bagha bar akonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">Kɨ ua nɨ bakɨnɨghnɨgh nɨ isɨ uan nɨghnɨzim datɨghan koghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 137:6">nan tiarim ikuvightɨ kɨ ighiabar amuan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 137:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ dughiar gumaziba Jerusalem gasɨghasɨzi, Idomia e gamizir arazim gɨnɨghnɨgh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">Me ivɨvɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 137:7">Jerusalemɨn dɨpeniba bar dɨpɨrighiregh nguazim giregh.<verse eid="PSA 137:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">137:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 18:6">Akar Mogomem 18:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Babilonia, ia orakigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">Ia bar ikuvigham!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 137:8">Ian arazir kurar ia e gamizir kam,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 137:8">gumazir uam a ikarvaghamim, a bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 137:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9"/>Gumazir kam nɨn borir iririviba inigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:9">dagɨabav kɨnightɨ me bar ikuvigham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 137:9">Kamaghɨn, gumazir kam bar akuegham.<verse eid="PSA 137:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137"/>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim God mɨnabi</para>
  <para style="d">Ighiar kam, Devit an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:1">kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven bar nɨ mɨnaba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:1">Egha asebar damazibar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:1">kɨ ighiar nɨn ziam febagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 138:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2"/>Nɨ zurara bar na apangkuvigha bar deragha nan gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">Nɨn akam ko nɨn ziam kamaghɨn en akagha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 138:2">nɨ bar ekevegha bizir igharaziba bar dagh afira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:2">Kamaghɨn, kɨ nɨn Dɨpenim uan guam a mɨsuegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">teviba apɨrigh egh nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 138:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3"/>Kɨ nɨn deima, nɨ dughiar kamɨn nan dɨmdiaba barasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:3">Egha uan gavgavim na ganɨgavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 138:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4"/>Nɨ mɨgei, nguazir kamɨn atriviba uari nɨn akam baraki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:4">kamaghɨn me nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 138:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5"/>Me nɨn ziar ekiam ko gavgavim gɨnɨghnɨgh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:5">nɨ amizir biziba bagh ighiabar amuam.<verse eid="PSA 138:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">138:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 57:15">Aisaia 57:15</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:6">Jems 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:5">1 Pita 5:5</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ bar faraghavɨra ikia egha bar pɨn iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">Gumazir uari abɨra nɨn apengan itiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 138:6">nɨ me gɨnɨghnɨsi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:6">Egh gumazir uari feba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">me nɨn damazimɨn uari mongɨva avegham.<verse eid="PSA 138:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">138:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 23:3-4">Onger Akaba 23:3-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Osɨmtɨzir avɨriba na batifi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">ezɨ nɨ nan gari kɨ deragha iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:7">Nan apaniba nan atari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">ezɨ nɨ me ko mɨsogha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 138:7">uan gavgavimrama ua na ini.<verse eid="PSA 138:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ na ko dɨkɨrɨzir akamɨn gɨn mangɨ biziba bar dar amu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">Nɨ nan apangkuvigha ikia mamaghɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:8">Ingangarir nɨ damuasa nɨghnɨzim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">nɨ a damu bar anegɨfagh.<verse eid="PSA 138:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138"/>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139"/>
  <para style="s">God e gɨfogha gɨvagha bar deraghavɨra en gari</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">139:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:3">Onger Akaba 17:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:3">Jeremaia 12:3</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:1">nɨ nan navim tuisigha gɨvagha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 139:1">na gɨfo.<verse eid="PSA 139:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">139:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:27">2 Atriviba 19:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:4">Matyu 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:24-25">Jon 2:24-25</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nan saghon ikia nan nɨghnɨziba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:2">kɨ amir biziba ko, kɨ apia dɨkavir araziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:2">nɨ bar dagh fo.<verse eid="PSA 139:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">139:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 17:3">Onger Akaba 17:3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:3">Jeremaia 12:3</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nan gari kɨ ingari, o kɨ akui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:3">kɨ amir araziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 139:3">nɨ bar dagh fo.<verse eid="PSA 139:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">139:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 4:13">Hibru 4:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ tɨghar mɨkɨmamin dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:4">nɨ fogha gɨfa kɨ tizim mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 139:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5"/>Nɨ danganibar bar nan mɨriaba ekɨarugha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:5">uan gavgavir ekiamɨn bar deragha nan gari.<verse eid="PSA 139:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6"/>Nɨn fofozir kam bar pɨn ikia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:6">egha nan nɨghnɨzim bar a gafira.<verse eid="PSA 139:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">139:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:24">Jeremaia 23:24</ref>; <ref loc="JON 1:3">Jona 1:3</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ managhɨra mangɨgh, nɨn duam ategham?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:7">Kɨ managhɨra mangɨgh nɨn modogham?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 139:7">Bar puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 139:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8"/>Kɨ nɨn Nguibamɨn mangam, nɨ uaghan iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:8">Kɨ Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn ikiam, nɨ uaghan ti.<verse eid="PSA 139:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9"/>Kɨ nguibar aruem anadi naghɨn ititamɨn ikiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:9">o aruem uaghiri naghɨn itir nguibar saghuiamɨn ikiam,<verse eid="PSA 139:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10"/>nɨ kagh ikɨ tuavim nan akakagh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:10">nan akurvagham.<verse eid="PSA 139:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11-12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">139:11-12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 34:22">Jop 34:22</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 2:22">Daniel 2:22</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:13">Hibru 4:13</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ suam, “Amɨnir bɨrim nɨ na avaraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:11-12">aruer angazangarim nɨ iragh mɨtatemɨn otogh.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:11-12">Nɨn nɨghnɨzim mɨtater kam a guizɨn mɨtatem puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:11-12">Dɨmagarim, a uaghan aruem mɨrara isiragha gari.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 139:11-12">Nɨn damazimɨn, aruem ko dɨmagarim magh gari.<verse eid="PSA 139:11-12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13"/>Guizbangɨra, nɨ nan mɨkarzimɨn ingarir dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:13">nɨ nan amebamɨn navir averiamɨn aven bar nan ingarizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 139:13">nan mɨkarzim bar moghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 139:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14"/>Nɨ nan mɨkarzimɨn ingari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">ezɨ nan mɨkarzim bar deragha igharagha gari.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 139:14">Kamaghɨn kɨ nɨn ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:14">Bizir nɨ ingariziba, da bar dera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">ezɨ kɨ guizbangɨra uan navir averiamɨn aven bizir kabagh nɨghnɨgha dagh fo.<verse eid="PSA 139:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">139:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 10:8-9">Jop 10:8-9</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 11:5">Fofozir Gumazim 11:5</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uan amebamɨn navir averiamɨn aven modoghav ikia nɨmɨram irivima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:15">nɨ nan agharibar garima da ekɨva uari isavsuiki.<verse eid="PSA 139:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16"/>Nan amebam tɨghar na batamin dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">nɨ faragha nan ganigha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:16">Bar fomɨra, kɨ tɨghar nguazimɨn otivam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">kɨ nguazir kamɨn ikiasa nɨ ifongezɨ moghɨn dughiaba nɨ da osirigha gɨfa.<verse eid="PSA 139:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17"/>O God, kɨ manmaghɨra nɨn nɨghnɨzibagh fofogham?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:17">Nɨn nɨghnɨziba bar avɨrasemegha bar pɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 139:17">ezɨ kɨ dagh foghamin tuaviba puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 139:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18"/>Kɨ nɨn nɨghnɨziba mengtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">dar megemem mangɨ ongarimɨn gigibagh afiragham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:18">Kɨ akuigha uam osezir dughiamɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">nɨ na ko ikiavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 139:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19"/>O God, nɨ gumazir kurabav sueghtɨ me arɨmɨghireghasa kɨ ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:19">Gumazir mɨsoziba na atakigh.<verse eid="PSA 139:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20"/>Gumazir kaba, nɨn ziam akar kurabar a mɨgei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:20">Egha pura nɨn ziam dɨborava, a gasɨghasɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 139:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazir nɨ gifongezir puvatɨziba, kɨ bar men aghua.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:21">Gumazir uari fa nɨ gasɨghasɨghasava amiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 139:21">nan navim me bagha bar ikufi.<verse eid="PSA 139:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22"/>Kɨ bar guizbangɨra me gifongezir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:22">Kɨ garima me nɨn apanibar mɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 139:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">139:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 31:6">Jop 31:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 26:2">Onger Akaba 26:2</ref></char>
    </note>O God, nɨ nan navir averiam tuisɨgh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:23">egh deragh nan nɨghnɨzim gɨfogh.<verse eid="PSA 139:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">139:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:8">Onger Akaba 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 143:10">143:10</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ bar deragh na tuisɨgh egh deragh na gɨfogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:24">ifavarir arazitam ti nan nɨghnɨzimɨn ikiama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:24">Nan akuragh nan aku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:24">ikɨrɨmɨrir zurara itimɨn tuavimɨn mangɨ.<verse eid="PSA 139:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139"/>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazim deragh uabɨn ganasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">A gumazir onger akabar faragha zuim gɨnɨghnɨgha an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan akuraghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:1">gumazir kuraba ko mɨdorozibagh amir gumaziba, na gasɨghasɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 140:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2"/>Me zurara uan navir averiabar aven arazir kurabagh nɨghnɨgha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:2">zurara gumazamizibar tongɨn adaribagh amima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 140:2">da otifi.<verse eid="PSA 140:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">140:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 3:13">Rom 3:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Men mɨzebar otivir akaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:3">kuruzir ataribar mɨn bar ghumi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 140:3">Me gumazibagh asɨghasɨghasa mɨgeir akaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:3">men akatoribar ikia mati kuruzim imezir kuram an aven iti.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 140:3">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 140:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ deragh nan gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">gumazir kurabar gavgavim na abɨraghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 140:4">Nɨ uan dafarimɨn na avaraghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">gumazir mɨsoziba na gasɨghasɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 140:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5"/>Gumazir uari uan ziaba feba, nan suighasa na bagh azuazim benir gavgavibar an ingarigha a gura.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">Me asɨzimɨn mɨn nan suighasa a isa nan tuavim gatɨ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 140:5">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 140:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6"/>Kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨgɨa ghaze, Nɨ nan God.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:6">O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan ararem baregh nan akuragh.<verse eid="PSA 140:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan Ekiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:7">nɨ gumazir bar gavgavir ekiam itim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 140:7">nɨ nan akuragh ua na inigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 140:7">Kɨ faragha apaniba ko mɨsozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:7">nɨ na modozɨ kɨ deraghavɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 140:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, gumazir kuraba iniasa mɨgeir biziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">nɨ da me danɨngan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 140:8">Egh arazir kurar me damuasa akabav sogheziba,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 140:8">nɨ dar damightɨ da guizɨn otivan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 140:8">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 140:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9"/>Apanir na ekɨaruzir kaba uari fe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:9">Nɨ me damightɨ me na abɨnan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 140:9">Bizir me na damuasava amiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:9">nɨ da otevkɨnightɨ da meraram otiv.<verse eid="PSA 140:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10"/>Nɨ dagɨar isibar avim amadaghtɨ a me girɨ men isi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">Tarazi nɨ me isɨ torir konimɨn me kunightɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 140:10">me uam anangan tuaviba puvatɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 140:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11"/>Gumazir akaba igharaz darazi gasiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:11">men akatam guizbangɨram otoghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 140:11">Kamaghɨn dera, gumazir mɨsoziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:11">bizir bar kuratam me batogh bar me agɨfagh.<verse eid="PSA 140:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ fo, gumazamizir onganaraziba nɨ men akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:12">Egha osɨmtɨziba itir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 140:12">nɨ deragha men osɨmtɨzibar gara me akɨrmɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 140:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13"/>Guizbangɨra, gumazamizir aghuiba nɨn ziam fɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:13">zurara nɨ ko ikɨ kamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 140:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140"/>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir mam dɨmangan God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit onger akar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ datɨrɨghɨn nɨn azangsɨsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">nɨ zuamɨra nan akuragh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:1">Kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa nɨ ko mɨgei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">nɨ nan azangsɨzim barakigh.<verse eid="PSA 141:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">141:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 5:8">Akar Mogomem 5:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kɨ guaratɨzibar ofa gami, nɨ mɨgharir mughuriar aghuim zuim barazi moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:2">kɨ nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba, nɨ da baragh da iniasa kɨ ifonge.<verse eid="PSA 141:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">141:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 34:13">Onger Akaba 34:13</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:26">Jems 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 3:8">3:8</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ deragh nan akatorimɨn gan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:3">egh kɨ mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba nɨ ifongezɨ moghɨn kɨ me mɨkɨmam.<verse eid="PSA 141:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">141:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 23:6">Aghuzir Akaba 23:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nɨ na ateghtɨ nan navim arazir kuraba bagh dɨkavan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">Kɨ gumazir kuraba ko uari akuva arazir kuratam damuan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:4">Nɨ na ateghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">kɨ me ko men isar kurabar ikian kogham.<verse eid="PSA 141:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5"/>Gumazir aghuim nan apangkuvigh, arazir aghuim damusɨ nan atar fofozim na danɨngtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">kamaghɨn a dera.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 141:5">Kamaghɨn, kɨ gumazir kuraba ko namakabar amuan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:5">Kɨ zurara God ko mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">a men arazir kuraba uam ada ikarvagham.<verse eid="PSA 141:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6"/>Gumazitaba gumazir kurar kaba inigh me gasɨghasightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">me fogh suam, nan akam a bar guizbangɨra.<verse eid="PSA 141:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7"/>Me gumazir kurar kabar aghariba inigh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:7">Gumazamizir Oveaghuezibar Nguibamɨn mozir torim mɨkɨnigham,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 141:7">mati gumazim temer akuam abɨagharɨghizɨ</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 141:7">an muziariba tintinimɨn ire.<verse eid="PSA 141:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">141:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 20:12">2 Eghaghaniba 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:15">Onger Akaba 25:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 123:1-2">123:1-2</ref></char>
    </note>O Ekiam, nɨ Ikiavɨra Itir God,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn ikiavɨra ikia,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 141:8">egha nɨn aven modi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:8">Nɨ deravɨra nan gantɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">kɨ ovengan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 141:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9"/>Nɨ deragh nan gantɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:9">gumazir kuraba na bagha modogha guizir azuazir katam na suiraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 141:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10"/>Nɨ gumazir kurabar amightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:10">me uari uan azuazibar guighɨv ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 141:10">Eghtɨ kɨ puvatɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:10">Kɨ bar deravɨra darutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:10">bizitam na gasɨghasɨghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 141:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141"/>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir mam uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit dagɨar torimɨn aven ikia, ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="d">Me onger akar kam kamagh a dɨbori, Maskil.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">142:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:1">1 Samuel 22:1</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 24:3">24:3</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn dei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:1">Kɨ an apangkuvim bagha pamten a gaghorava a mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 142:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2"/>Na bativir araziba ko osɨmtɨziba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:2">kɨ bar dar gun a mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 142:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">142:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 77:3">Onger Akaba 77:3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 140:5">140:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 143:4">143:4</ref></char>
    </note>Tuavir kɨ mangamim, nan apaniba nan suighasa azuazir mam gura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">ezɨ nan navim osemezɨ, kɨ ghaze, kɨ ikuvigham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:3">Nɨrara, kɨ mangamin tuavim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">nɨ a gɨfo.<verse eid="PSA 142:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">142:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 88:8">Onger Akaba 88:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 88:18">88:18</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ uabɨn boroghɨn gari, gumazir nan akurvaghamiba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">Ezɨ gumazir nan gan na geghuvamiba puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 142:4">Kɨ mongamin danganiba puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 142:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan akurvaghasa kɨ nɨn dei.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">Nɨrara nɨ nan eghuvir gumazim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:5">Kɨ kamaghɨn ifonge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">kɨ angamɨra ikiavɨra itir dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 142:5">nɨrara na ko ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 142:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6"/>Gumaziba arazir kurabar na gamua egha bar gavgafi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">ezɨ kɨ me abɨnasava amuava avenge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:6">Nan navim bar oseme.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">Kamaghɨn, kɨ uabɨn akurvaghasa nɨn dei,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 142:6">nɨ na barakigh.<verse eid="PSA 142:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">142:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 13:6">Onger Akaba 13:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 143:11">143:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:7">146:7</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ osɨmtɨzir kamɨn aven uam na inightɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">kɨ an fɨrighɨrɨgh egh deravɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 142:7">Nɨ bar deravɨra na gami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:7">Kamaghɨn, gumazamiziba uari akuvagh ikɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">kɨ men tongɨn nɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 142:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142"/>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143"/>
  <para style="s">Gumazir mam uabɨn akurvaghasa God ko mɨgei</para>
  <para style="d">Devit ighiar kam osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, kɨ nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba nɨ da baragh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">Nɨ arazir aghuibaram amua, bar guizbangɨra mɨgɨa ifarir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 143:1">Kɨ nɨ ko mɨgeir mɨgɨrɨgɨaba nɨ kuarim atɨgh da baragh.<verse eid="PSA 143:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">143:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 3:20">Rom 3:20</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:16">Galesia 2:16</ref></char>
    </note>Gumazitam bar zuegha nɨn damazimɨn itir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:2">Kamaghɨn, nɨ uan ingangarir gumazim isi kotiam datɨgh a tuisɨghan markɨ.<verse eid="PSA 143:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3"/>Nan apaniba nan agɨntɨgha bar na abɨra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">Egha na isa kalabuziar danganir mɨtatemɨn na atɨzɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 143:3">kɨ fomɨrama oveaghuezibar mɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 143:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4"/>Kamaghɨn nan nɨghnɨzim ikuvizɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:4">nan navim osemegha mamaghɨra iti.<verse eid="PSA 143:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">143:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 77:5">Onger Akaba 77:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 77:10-11">77:10-11</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ fomɨram otivizir biziba uam a dagh nɨrɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">Egha nɨ fomɨra ingarizir bizir aghuiba, kɨ uam adagh nɨghnɨsi.<verse eid="PSA 143:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6"/>Kuarim na mɨsɨngizɨ, kɨ dɨpatamara amasa bar ifongezɨ moghɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:6">nan duam nɨ ko mɨkɨmasa bar ifonge.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 143:6">(Ighiam gamua an suiam <optbreak/>atugha avughsegha ua <optbreak/>ighiam gami.)<verse eid="PSA 143:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nan nɨghnɨzir gavgavim iraghu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">Nɨ nan dɨmdiam baragh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:7">Nɨ uabɨ nan mongan markɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">kɨ ti ovegh mangɨ oveaghuezibar nguibamɨn mangɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 143:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">143:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 5:8">Onger Akaba 5:8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 25:1">25:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 46:5">46:5</ref></char>
    </note>Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim nɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">nɨ mɨzaraziba vaghvagh apangkuvir ekiar nan itir kam bagh, na mɨkɨmvɨra ikɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:8">Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven nɨ baghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">Kamaghɨn kɨ mangamin tuavim nɨ nan sure damu.<verse eid="PSA 143:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ nan akurvaghasa kɨ nɨ bagha zui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:9">nɨ na modogh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 143:9">Nɨ nan apanibar dafaribar uam na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 143:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">143:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:14">Onger Akaba 31:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 119:12">119:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 139:24">139:24</ref></char>
    </note>Nɨ nan God, kɨ kamaghsua, nɨ deravɨra nan sure damutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">kɨ nɨn ifongiamra gɨn mangam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:10">Nɨn duam deravɨra na damutɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">kɨ tuavir aghuimɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 143:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ uan ziar ekiam bangɨn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">nɨ akam akɨrizɨ moghɨn nɨ uam na inigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:11">Nɨ arazir aghuibaram ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">Kamaghɨn, nɨ nan osɨmtɨzir na bativibar aven uam na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 143:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12"/>Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim, ezɨ nɨ bar nan apangkufi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, gumazir nan apanim gamiba ko na gasɨghasɨghasava amiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 143:12">nɨ me mɨsueghtɨ me bar arɨmɨghiregh.<verse eid="PSA 143:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143"/>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144"/>
  <para style="s">God atrivimɨn apaniba abɨrazɨ, an a mɨnabi</para>
  <para style="d">Ighiar kam, Devit an osiri.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ dagɨar ekiamɨn mɨn itima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">kɨ an aven modozɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 144:1">nɨ deragha nan gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">Kamaghɨn kɨ nɨn ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 144:1">A mɨdorozir arazibar nan aka.<verse eid="PSA 144:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2"/>A dagɨar ekiamɨn mɨn itima, kɨ an aven modi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">Egha dɨpenir gavgavimɨn mɨn itima, kɨ an aven iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:2">Egha a nguibar gavgavimɨn mɨn ikia nan akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">Egha nan oramɨn mɨn itima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 144:2">kɨ an uabɨ apazagha deragha iti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:2">Kɨ nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">a na ko ikia nan akurvazi kɨ deravɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 144:2">A gumazamizir igharazibagh amizɨ me nan apengan iti.<verse eid="PSA 144:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">144:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 7:17-18">Jop 7:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 8:4">Onger Akaba 8:4</ref></char>
    </note>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, e gumazamizir kɨniba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">Manmagh amizɨ, nɨ e gɨnɨghnɨgha deragha en gari?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:3">E pura bizir kɨnibar mɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">ezɨ nɨ manmaghsua mɨghɨgha e gɨnɨghnɨsi?<verse eid="PSA 144:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4"/>E mati gumazim, uan akatorimɨn dughiar vamɨran amɨnim givera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:4">E dughiar bar otevimra ikiam,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 144:4">mati aruem isirazɨ nɨn nedazim dughiar otevimra ikegha</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 144:4">ua zuamɨra puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 144:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5"/>O Ikiavɨra Itir God, nɨ overiam abigh izighirɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:5">Egh uan agharim mɨghsɨabar amadaghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 144:5">dar mɨturir ekiaba otiv.<verse eid="PSA 144:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6"/>Nɨ uan onɨmarim damightɨ a taghtagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:6">apanibar agɨraghtɨ me tintinibar aregh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 144:6">Nɨ uan baribar me gasɨtɨ me aregh.<verse eid="PSA 144:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7"/>Nɨ uan dafarim amadaghtɨ a izighirɨ, na gekuightɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">kɨ dɨpar konir kaba ategh uam anaboka.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 144:7">Nɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar dafariba da uam na inigh.<verse eid="PSA 144:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8"/>Gumazamizir kaba guizbangɨra mɨgeir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:8">me akar ifavaribagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:8">Me ifara uari isa pɨn uari arɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:8">me guizbangɨra mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 144:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9"/>O God, kɨ nɨn ziam fɨ egh ighiar igiatam bangam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:9">Kɨ gita mɨsogh nɨ bagh onger akam damuam.<verse eid="PSA 144:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10"/>Nɨ atrivibar akurvazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:10">me mɨsogha uan apaniba abɨri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:10">Kɨ nɨn ingangarir gumazim Devit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:10">nɨ nan akuragha nan apaniba da uam na ini.<verse eid="PSA 144:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11"/>Nɨ nan apanir pazavɨra na gamibar dafaribar, nan akuragh ua na inigh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">Nɨ Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizibar dafariba da uam na inigh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:11">Gumazamizir kaba guizbangɨra mɨgeir puvatɨ, me akar ifavaribagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">Me ifara uari isa pɨn uari arɨgha ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 144:11">me guizbangɨra mɨgei.<verse eid="PSA 144:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12"/>E kamaghɨn ifonge, en otarir igiaba aghung mangɨ ekevegh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">temebar mɨn gavgavigham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:12">Eghtɨ en guivibar ganganiba bar deragham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">mati Atrivimɨn dɨpenir ekiamɨn aven itir dɨpenir akɨnibar itir nedazir bar aghuiba.<verse eid="PSA 144:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13"/>E uaghan kamaghɨn ifonge, en azenibar dagheba bar mɨghɨghvɨra otɨtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">en dagher peniba izɨvagham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:13">Eghtɨ en sipsipba nguzir avɨriba batɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">mangɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 144:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14"/>En bulmakauba otɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">Eghtɨ dar nguzitam ikuvighan kogh, egh tam aremeghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:14">E kamaghɨn aghua, e oraghtɨ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">gumazitam o amizitam, osɨmtɨziba ater tuangɨva arangam.<verse eid="PSA 144:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">144:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:12">Onger Akaba 33:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gumazamizir God kamaghɨn deragha me gamiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:15">me bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:15">Gumazamizir Ikiavɨra Itir God inizɨ, a men Godɨn mɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:15">me bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 144:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144"/>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145"/>
  <para style="s">Ighiar Godɨn ziam fem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">145:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arazir Israelia gɨn ghua akaba osirir maba, da mong ighara. Hibrun akamɨn me 22plan letabar uan akaba osiri. Egha dughiar maba, me osirir akaba 22plan akuabar da bɨsi. Ezɨ dar akuar kaba, vaghvagha dar akar faragha zuibar faragha zuir letaba, letan igharazim iti. Me ikɨzir igharazibar akar, Hibrun akamɨn daghizir dughiamɨn, me Hibrun akamɨn arazir kamɨn gɨn ghua dagh izir puvatɨ. E fo, Aruamɨn akamɨn mɨgɨrɨgɨaba 21plan letaba iti. An letabar dɨbobonim mong Hibrun letabar dɨbobonimɨn mɨn ghu. Ezɨ kamaghɨn Aruamu Baibelɨn Onger Akabar Akɨnafarim sapta 145, e Hibru akamɨn arazir kamɨn gɨn ghua, a gɨra. Eghtɨ nɨ gan fogham, a manmaghɨn mangam. Nɨ ighiar kamɨn gantɨ 21plan letaba ikiam, vezɨn faragha zuim, an mɨgɨrɨgɨar otevir faragha zuim, a leta A an iti. Namba 2 ves, an mɨgɨrɨgɨar otevir faragha zuim, a leta B an iti. Egha ighiar kam kamaghɨra ghua ves 21ɨn oto. Ighiar kamɨn aven ves, 8 ko 9 aning ighiar kamɨn aven itir nɨghnɨzir ekiamɨn gun mɨgei, kamaghɨn amizɨ leta I vezɨn kamning vɨrara aningɨn iti, egha gavgavim nɨghnɨzir ekiar ighiar 145ɨn itim ganɨdi. Hibrun akamɨn arazir kam kaghɨra itir puvatɨ, me uaghan arazir kamra gɨn ghua akɨnafarir kaba uaghan a da osiri. Kar Azir Akam 1-5 ko Onger Akabar Akɨnafarim sapta 9, ko 10, ko 34, ko 37, ko 111, ko 112, ko 119, ko Aghuzir Akabar Akɨnafarim sapta 31.</char></note></para>
  <para style="d">Ighiar kam, Devit an osiri.</para>
  <para style="cp">A</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1"/>Atrivim, nɨ nan God, kɨ nɨn ziar ekiam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:1">Kɨ nɨn ziar ekiam pɨrafɨ mangɨvɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 145:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">B</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2"/>Bar guizbangɨra, dughiaba vaghvagh bar, kɨ zurara nɨ mɨnamam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:2">Egh kɨ zurazurara nɨn ziam pɨrafɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 145:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">D</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3"/>Dughiaba bar, Ikiavɨra Itir God bar ziar ekiam iti, e an ziar ekiam fɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:3">E an gavgavim gɨfoghsɨ damuva avegham.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:3">En nɨghnɨziba otefe.<verse eid="PSA 145:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">E</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4"/>Ekiam, gumazamizir datɨrɨghɨn itiba, me gumazamizir gɨn otivamiba bizir nɨ amibar gun me mɨkɨmɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:4">nɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:4">Me arazarazir bar ekiar nɨ amiziba,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 145:4">me dagh eghanam.<verse eid="PSA 145:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">F</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5"/>Faraghavɨra Itir Atrivir Ekiam, kɨ nɨn gavgavim ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:5">nɨn atrivir araziba ko, ingangarir ekiabagh nɨghnɨgham.<verse eid="PSA 145:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">G</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6"/>Guizbangɨra, kɨ nɨn ziar ekiam itir bizibar gun mɨkɨmam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:6">Gumazamiziba nɨn ingangarir gavgavir ekiar nɨ amizibagh egharavɨra ikia,<verse eid="PSA 145:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">GH</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7"/>ghua nɨn arazir aghuim ko, nɨn apangkuvir arazim, geghara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:7">onger akam bange.<verse eid="PSA 145:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">I</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">145:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:18">Dɨboboniba 14:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:8">Onger Akaba 103:8</ref></char>
    </note>Ikiavɨra Itir God bar en kuarkuva e gifueghavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:8">A bar en apangkuvigha zuamɨram en atarir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:8">Kar bar bizir ekiam.<verse eid="PSA 145:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God gumazamiziba bar men deragha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:9">bizir a ingariziba sarama apangkufi.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:9">Bar guizbangɨra.<verse eid="PSA 145:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">K</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10"/>Kamaghɨn, Ikiavɨra Itir God, bizir angamɨra itir nɨ ingariziba bar moghɨra nɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:10">Eghtɨ nɨ baghavɨra itir gumazamiziba nɨ mɨnamam.<verse eid="PSA 145:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">M</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11"/>Me nɨn gavgavimɨn gun mɨkɨm suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:11">nɨ biziba bar dagh ativagha dar gari, da bar dera.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:11">Ezɨ nɨn ziam bar pɨn iti.<verse eid="PSA 145:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">N</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12"/>Nɨn ingangarir ekiar nɨ amiziba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:12">nɨ biziba bar dagh ativaghamin arazim,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:12">me dar gumazamizibav kɨmtɨ me fogh suam,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 145:12">nɨ ziar ekiam ko gavgavir ekiam iti.<verse eid="PSA 145:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">NG</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13"/>Nguazimɨn itir gumazamiziba ko, biziba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:13">nɨ dagh ativagh dar gan mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:13">Nɨ bizibagh ativaghamin arazir kam, gɨvaghan kogham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 145:13">God uan akar dɨkɨrɨzimɨn gɨn ghua biziba bar dagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:13">Arazir an amir kaba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:13">a bar en apangkufi.<verse eid="PSA 145:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">O</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14"/>Osɨmtɨziba itir gumazamiziba, Ikiavɨra Itir God men akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:14">Gumazamizir, men apaniba me abɨniziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:14">Ikiavɨra Itir God ua me fava gavgavim me ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 145:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">P</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15"/>Pɨn garir angamɨra itir biziba, me nɨrara gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:15">Ezɨ mɨtiriaba men azir dughiaba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:15">nɨ men akurvagha dagheba me ganɨdi.<verse eid="PSA 145:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">R</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16"/>Ruarimɨn itir biziba ko, nguibamɨn itir biziba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:16">nɨ dagheba me ganɨdi me apa izɨvagha kuatɨgha iti.<verse eid="PSA 145:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">S</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17"/>Sɨn itir arazir aghuibara, Ikiavɨra Itir God, dar gɨrara ghua bizibagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:17">Arazir an amir kaba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:17">a bar en apangkufi.<verse eid="PSA 145:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">T</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18"/>Te navir averiaba zuegha Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn dei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:18">a bar men boroghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 145:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">U</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19"/>Uaghan, gumazamizir an atiatia an apengan itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:19">a bizir me ifongeziba bar da isɨ me danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 145:19">A uaghan men arareba baragh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:19">men akurvagh ua me iniam.<verse eid="PSA 145:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">V</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20"/>Vezir kuram, Ikiavɨra Itir God a isɨ gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba, me danɨngɨva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:20">bar me gasɨghasɨgham.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 145:20">Egh gumazamizir bar a gifongeziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:20">a bar me akumakum deragh men ganam.<verse eid="PSA 145:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="cp">Z</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21"/>Zurazurara, kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">Eghtɨ bizir angamɨra itir a ingariziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 145:21">me an ziam fɨ ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.<verse eid="PSA 145:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145"/>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146"/>
  <para style="s">Ikiavɨra Itir God, men akurvazima, me an ziam fe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1"/>E bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam feka!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:1"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:1">Kɨ uan navir averiamɨn aven uabɨra uabɨ mɨgɨa ghaze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:1">kɨ Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 146:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2"/>Nan dughiar kɨ nguazimɨn ikiamimɨn, kɨ an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:2">Kɨ ighiaba bangɨ an ziam fɨ kamaghɨra ikɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 146:2">mangɨ uan ovevem batogham.<verse eid="PSA 146:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3"/>Ia uarir akurvaghsɨ nguazir kamɨn atriviba ko, gumazir dapaniba, me gɨnɨghnɨghan markɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:3">Me pura gumazir kɨniba, me ian akuraghan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 146:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4"/>Me arɨmɨghiregh pura ua nguazim gavagh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:4">bizir me damuasa mɨkemeziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 146:4">me dar amighan kogham.<verse eid="PSA 146:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5"/>Gumazitam nɨghnɨzir gavgavim Jekopɨn Godɨn ikɨ suam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:5">Ikiavɨra Itir God nan akuragham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:5">gumazir kam bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 146:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">146:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 115:15">Onger Akaba 115:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 117:2">117:2</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:24">Aposel 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:15">14:15</ref></char>
    </note>God, overiam ko nguazim, ko ongarimɨn ingarigha, dar itir biziba bar dar ingari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">God dughiabar zurara bizir a gun mɨkemegha gɨvazibar gɨn ghua dagh ami.<verse eid="PSA 146:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7"/>A gumazamizir gavgaviba puvatɨziba, deragha me gamizɨ, me dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">A mɨtiriaba aziba, dagheba isa me ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:7">A kalabuziar gumazamiziba fɨri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">me kalabus ataghɨragha azenibar izi.<verse eid="PSA 146:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8"/>A gumazamizir damazir okavrɨzibagh amima, me datɨrɨghɨn ua gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:8">Gumazamizir, men apaniba me abɨniziba, a ua me fava gavgavim me ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:8">Ikiavɨra Itir God, an damazimɨn derazɨ adarasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:8">a bar me gifonge.<verse eid="PSA 146:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9"/>Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamizir en nguazimɨn itiba, Ikiavɨra Itir God deragha men gari.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">Amizir paba ariaghireziba ko, borir afeziaba ariaghireziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 146:9">a me fava men akurvasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">A gumazamizir arazir kurabagh amiba, a men tuaviba apaghapaki.<verse eid="PSA 146:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, Atrivimɨn ikɨ mamaghɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:10">Ia Saionɨn gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 146:10">ian God, a Atrivimɨn ikɨ, zurara ikɨvɨra ikiam.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:10"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:10">Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:10">E bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 146:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146"/>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147"/>
  <para style="s">En God ziar ekiam ikia gavgaviba bar iti</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1"/>E bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">E ighiabagh amua uan Godɨn ziam fer arazim dera.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 147:1">An ziam fer arazir kam a guizbangɨrama bar dera.<verse eid="PSA 147:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God ua Jerusalemɨn nguibam akɨrigha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:2">Israelian gumazamizir Babilonɨn kalabus itiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 147:2">ua me inigha ize.<verse eid="PSA 147:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">147:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 51:17">Onger Akaba 51:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:15">Aisaia 57:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:18">Luk 4:18</ref></char>
    </note>An osɨmtɨziba aterir gumazamizibagh ami me ua dera.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:3">Egha men duaba nogha dagh ami da uam agui.<verse eid="PSA 147:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">147:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:5">Jenesis 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:26">Aisaia 40:26</ref></char>
    </note>A mɨkovezibar ingarir dughiam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:4">a vaghvagha da mengegha</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 147:4">ziaba dagh arigha dagh fo.<verse eid="PSA 147:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5"/>En Ekiam, a bar gavgavigha, ziar bar ekiam iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:5">an fofozim bar pɨn iti,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 147:5">ezɨ e an fofozim bativsɨ damuva avegham.<verse eid="PSA 147:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6"/>A gumazamizir uarira uan naviba abɨra itiba, a men dafaribar suigha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:6">me fe me dɨkafi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:6">Egha arazir kurabagh amir gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:6">a me dɨkabɨri me nguazim giri.<verse eid="PSA 147:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7"/>Ia Ikiavɨra Itir God bagh ighiaba bangɨ egh a mɨnamang.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:7">E uan God bagh gitabav soghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 147:7">dar ararer aghuiba a bagh mangɨ.<verse eid="PSA 147:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8"/>An overiamɨn ghuariaba arɨghizɨ, amozim nguazimɨn izaghirava,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">mɨghsɨabagh izima graziba dar otifi.<verse eid="PSA 147:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9"/>A dagheba isa asɨziba bar me ganɨdi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:9">ezɨ kuarazir nguziba daghem bagha arai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:9">a men akuaghapi.<verse eid="PSA 147:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">147:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 33:16-18">Onger Akaba 33:16-18</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:7">Hosea 1:7</ref></char>
    </note>A hoziabar gavgavim ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:10">mɨdorozir gumazibar gavgavim bagha bar akongezir puvatɨ.<verse eid="PSA 147:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11"/>A gumazamizir an atiatiava, nɨghnɨzir gavgavim an apangkuvir arazimɨn itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:11">a me baghavɨra bar akonge.<verse eid="PSA 147:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12"/>O Jerusalemia, ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:12">O Saionia, ia uan Godɨn ziam fɨ!<verse eid="PSA 147:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13"/>A nɨn dɨvazimɨn tiar akabagh amizɨ da gavgafi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:13">egha nɨn gumazamiziba arazir aghuimɨn me gami.<verse eid="PSA 147:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14"/>A nɨn nguazir mɨtaghniabar aven, dabirabir aghuim gumazamiziba bar me ganɨga, navir amɨrizim me ganɨdi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:14">Egha ian azenibar daghebagh ami da deragha aghui.<verse eid="PSA 147:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God, nguazimɨn Akar Gavgavitam amadaghtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:15">bizir a mɨkemezir kam zuamɨra nguazimɨn otogham.<verse eid="PSA 147:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16"/>A ghuariaba amadazɨ da iza avivkɨabar mɨn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:16">izaghira, nguazim avara.<verse eid="PSA 147:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17"/>An aisɨn amozir ofɨzir dagɨabar mɨn gariba amadazɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:17">da izaghira ongarimɨn gigibar mɨn nguazim giri.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 147:17">Eghtɨ gumazitam an amadazir orangtɨzir kamɨn ikɨva avegham.<verse eid="PSA 147:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18"/>A gɨn ua mɨkemezɨ aisɨn kam dɨpamɨn oto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">Ezɨ an amɨnim amadazɨ a dɨpam givaima a ivemari.<verse eid="PSA 147:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19"/>A uan arazir a ifongeziba ko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:19">bizir a damuasa e mɨkemeziba isa</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 147:19">Israelia ganɨngi.<verse eid="PSA 147:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20"/>Kantrin Igharazibar Gumazamiziba an Akar Gavgavir kabagh fozir puvatɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:20">kamaghɨn bizir kam, a me bagh a gamizir puvatɨ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:20">Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 147:20">E bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!<verse eid="PSA 147:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147"/>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148"/>
  <para style="s">Overiam ko nguazimɨn itir biziba bar Godɨn ziam fɨ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1"/>Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:1">Ia Godɨn Nguibamɨn bar pɨn iti darasi,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 148:1">ia an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 148:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2"/>Ia enselba, ia bar moghɨrama an ziam fɨ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:2">Godɨn Nguibamɨn itir mɨdorozir enselba uaghan an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 148:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3"/>Aruem ko iakɨnim, gua uaghan an ziam fɨ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:3">Mɨkovezir angazangarir gavgaviba itiba, ia uaghan an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 148:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4"/>Godɨn Nguibar bar pɨn itim, nɨ uaghan an ziam fɨ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:4">Dɨpar overiamɨn pɨn itiba, ia uaghan an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 148:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God mɨkemezɨ bizir kaba otifi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:5">Kamaghɨn me bar an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 148:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">148:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 38:33">Jop 38:33</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:20">Jeremaia 33:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:25">33:25</ref></char>
    </note>A uabɨ mɨkemezɨ me uan danganibarama, otivigha iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:6">Me dar ikɨ kamaghɨra ikɨva,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 148:6">an akabar gɨn mangam.<verse eid="PSA 148:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7"/>Ia nguazimɨn itir biziba bar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:7">ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:7">Ia bizir kabanang.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:7">Ongarir konimɨn aven itir kuruzir ekiaba ko osiriba ko<verse eid="PSA 148:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8"/>onɨmariba ko dagɨabar mɨn garir amozir ofɨzir ekiaba ko amoziba ko mɨgharir pɨziba ko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:8">amɨnir ekiar an Akar Gavgavibar gɨn zuiba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 148:8">ia bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 148:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9"/>Ia mɨghsɨar ekiaba ko mɨghsɨar doziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:9">ko temer ovɨziba itiba ko sidan temeba ko,<verse eid="PSA 148:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10"/>ruarim ko nguibamɨn asɨziba bar moghɨra ko goaba ko kuaraziba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 148:10">ia bar moghɨra Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 148:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11"/>Ia nguazir kamɨn itir atriviba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:11">ko kantriba ko gavmanɨn gumaziba ko gumazir dapaniba ko<verse eid="PSA 148:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12"/>gumazir igiaba ko amizir igiaba ko gumazir ghuriba ko boriba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 148:12">ia bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 148:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13"/>Bar guizbangɨra, Ikiavɨra Itir God, an ziam bar ekevegha gumazamizibar ziaba bar dagh afira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">egha an ziar ekiam bar pɨn ikia nguazim ko overiam gafira.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 148:13">Kamaghɨn amizɨ, biziba bar moghɨra an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 148:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14"/>A bar Israelia gifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">Me bar an gumazamizibara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:14">Me bar an boroghɨra itima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">a me gamima me gavgavighavɨra iti.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 148:14">Egha me bar an ziam fe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:14">Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">Ia Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 148:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148"/>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn gumazamiziba uan apaniba abɨragha, an ziam fe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1"/>Ia bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:1">Ia ighiar igiam, a bagh a bangɨ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:1">Ia gumazamizir a baghavɨra itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:1">ia an ziam fasa mɨsevezir dughiaba,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 149:1">ia uari akuv ziar ekiam a danɨng.<verse eid="PSA 149:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2"/>Ia Israelia, God ian ingari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">ezɨ ia an bizir kam bagh bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:2">Ia Saionɨn nguibamɨn gumazamiziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">ia uan atrivim bagh bar akongegh.<verse eid="PSA 149:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3"/>Ia ighiabar amuva an ziam fɨva ighɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:3">Ia gitaba ko, tambarinbav sogh</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 149:3">an ziam fɨ.<verse eid="PSA 149:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4"/>Ikiavɨra Itir God uan gumazamizibagh ifonge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:4">Gumazir uari abɨra igharaz darazir apengan itiba, a men ziaba fava,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 149:4">me gami me mɨdorozim gamua uan apaniba abɨri.<verse eid="PSA 149:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">149:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 35:10">Jop 35:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godɨn gumazamiziba uan apaniba ko, mɨdorozim gamigha me abɨragha gɨfa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:5">Me datɨrɨghɨn bar akongegh.</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 149:5">Me dɨmagariba sara uari akuvir dughiabar,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="PSA 149:5">me God bagh bar akongezir ighiabar amu.<verse eid="PSA 149:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6"/>Me pamtem dɨmɨva Godɨn ziam fɨ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:6">Me mɨdorozir sabar ghumtɨziba uan dafaribar da suikigh.<verse eid="PSA 149:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7"/>Egh kantrin igharaziba akɨrsɨ mɨsogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:7">mɨzazim me gasɨ me abɨnigh.<verse eid="PSA 149:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8"/>Apanibar gumazir dapaniba ko atriviba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:8">me senɨn ainɨn ingarizibar me ikegham.<verse eid="PSA 149:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9"/>Me God osirizɨ moghɨra me damuam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:9">Godɨn gumazamiziba arazir kamnaghɨra damu, uan apaniba akɨram.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:9">God baghavɨra itir gumazamizir kaba, arazir kamra damu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:9">uan apaniba abɨnigh ziar ekiam iniam.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:9"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:9">Aleluia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:9">Ia bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fɨ!<verse eid="PSA 149:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149"/>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150"/>
  <para style="s">Godɨn ziam fer ighiar abuananam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1"/>God uan Dɨpenimɨn itima, e an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:1">A gavgavir bar ekiam ikia uan Nguibamɨn itima,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="PSA 150:1">e an ziam pɨrafam.<verse eid="PSA 150:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2"/>A bar bizir ekiabagh ami.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:2">E ziar ekiam a danɨngam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:2">A bar faraghavɨra ikia, an ziar ekiam bar pɨn mar iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:2">E an ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 150:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3"/>E sɨghabagh iviva, dɨbɨariba ko gitabav sogh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:3">Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam pɨrafam.<verse eid="PSA 150:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4"/>E tambarinbav soghɨva, ighɨ an ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:4">E gitan avɨrir igharagha garibav soghɨva, itabagh iviva ziar ekiam a danɨngam.<verse eid="PSA 150:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5"/>E brasɨn itaribav soghtɨ da bar puvɨrama arangtɨ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:5">e Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.<verse eid="PSA 150:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6"/>E bizir bar angamɨra itiba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:6">e bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:6"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:6">E bar Ikiavɨra Itir Godɨn ziam fam!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:6">Aleluia!<verse eid="PSA 150:6"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150"/>
</usx>
